      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1352},
        Content = "AvgDialog_15606_Content_32|不，不，听着，艾瑞卡——这个东西，这个小小的东西，能够做到无损耗，无排放，长时间供能，你还不明白吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1352},
        Content = "AvgDialog_15606_Content_33|煤炭、石油，在它面前一无是处。如果能量产，我们将改写人类的能源结构，我们将名垂青史！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1352},
        Content = "AvgDialog_15606_Content_34|你必须告诉我你是怎么做出来的，你必须！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        RoleExit = {1544},
        ExitDirection = {"1544:1"},
        RoleShake = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1352},
        Content = "AvgDialog_15606_Content_35|艾瑞卡，你要去哪里？什么叫你不知道怎么做的，艾瑞卡！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        RoleExit = {1352},
        ExitDirection = {"1352:1"},
        Audio = {
          "Set_Avg_Mus_As_More"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1352},
        Content = "AvgDialog_15606_Content_36|投资人说了，只要看到样品，他愿意为我们提供大量的资金，甚至是专属工作室。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgTransition = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1544,2,angry1)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Recover_Remember"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1544,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_15606_Content_37|你怎么就是不听——我不知道这东西是怎么做的，我做不出来！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1352},
        Content = "AvgDialog_15606_Content_38|我已经过了相信童话故事的年纪了，艾瑞卡。什么<Blue:神秘店主>，搪塞我也该找个好点的理由。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1352},
        Content = "AvgDialog_15606_Content_39|你明明做得出这么厉害的东西，为什么目光不更长远些？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1352},
        Content = "AvgDialog_15606_Content_40|为什么还要把自己困在这种地方，鼓捣这些破铜烂铁？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        Audio = {
          "Set_Avg_Mus_As_More_And_More"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_15606_Content_41|梅伊的声音宛如一个巴掌打在了艾瑞卡脸上，她看着自己的搭档、伙伴，难以相信自己听到的东西。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleShake = {1544},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1544,2,surprised)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1544,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_15606_Content_42|……破铜烂铁，这就是你真实的想法吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1544,
          nil,
          "sad1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_15606_Content_43|我以为我们有着共同的理想。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_15606_Content_44|梅伊咬了咬牙，握紧了手里的圆筒。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1352},
        Content = "AvgDialog_15606_Content_45|看清事实吧，艾瑞卡。现在没有人愿意为自动人偶花钱了，新能源才是我们的出路。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1544,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_15606_Content_46|……把特殊能源放下。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1352},
        Content = "AvgDialog_15606_Content_47|想想我们能拥有的一切，更多的资金，更多的资源。\n有了这些你才可以继续你的梦想，有了这些，你才能——",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1544,
          nil,
          "angry2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_15606_Content_48|我说放下！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_15606_Content_49|艾瑞卡上前抢夺，梅伊闪躲不及，撞到了一旁的柜子上。",
        DialogType = 3,
