        Content = "AvgDialog_18714_Content_19|……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1147,
          nil,
          "Resigned"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18714_Content_20|我还以为，通过在拉伊的相处，我们之间能稍微有点信任感。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1147},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18714_Content_21|猎颅者从我这里拿走了一颗<Yellow:珍贵的头颅>，所以我来做点小小的调查，就是这么简单。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18714_Content_22|珍贵的头颅……是谁的？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1147,
          nil,
          "Smile2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18714_Content_23|……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_18714_Content_24|达芙黛尔笑眯眯地看着你。当她不想回答别人的问题时，总会摆出这样的微笑。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18714_Content_25|如果我没记错的话，你一直有收藏头颅的癖好。瑞尼距离拉伊的直线距离不到15英里，往返也很方便。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1147,
          nil,
          "Smile1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18714_Content_26|不好意思，我只负责接收头颅，不负责生产头颅。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1147,
          nil,
          "Smile2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18714_Content_27|这两者有一些微妙的差别……我想你一定能理解吧，聪明的守密人%sirormadam%？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18714_Content_28|好，我理解。\n那昨晚8点15分，你在什么地方，又在做什么？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1147,
          nil,
          "Resigned"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18714_Content_29|我想想……店里新进了一批浴盐，所以我在浴缸里试用了一下。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1147,
          nil,
          "shy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18714_Content_30|怎么，想听听我的试用细节吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18714_Content_31|是么。可我昨晚见到你的时候，你独自站在路灯下，拎着一个人头。",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Wind_Blowing_Leaves"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18714_Content_32|它看起来可一点都不像浴盐。",
