      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18769_Content_45|我把在迷宫里遇到的那些地方都做了记录，学校、蜡像馆、伦蒂尼恩的大街……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18769_Content_46|唯独没有你经历过的那些地方。一个都没有。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18769_Content_47|为什么，你不是也被困在这里了吗?",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "furious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18769_Content_48|哪来那么多为什么！因为本大王不想回忆啊，不高兴的东西干嘛想它。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18769_Content_49|是的，<Yellow:你不愿意回忆>。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18769_Content_50|有没有一种可能……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18769_Content_51|正是因为你——迷宫之主对共享意识的抗拒，这座由被困者意识组成的迷宫永远都是残缺的。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18769_Content_52|所以我们永远都走不出去。",
