        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_gulu"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Sweat.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23369_Content_4|我还什么都没做呢。",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_emmm"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23369_Content_5|放心，我们不抓你，只是来请你帮个小忙。",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23369_Content_6|我们需要两张《蔷薇之名》邀请函。我猜珈伦小姐手里应该还有存货吧？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1132,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23369_Content_7|蔷薇之名……？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_OMG"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23369_Content_8|珈伦放下挡在胸前的双手，圆圆的大眼睛滴溜溜地转了一圈。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1132,
          nil,
          "Snide"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23369_Content_9|原来警官大人也想要邀请函呀，说清楚不就好了！\n一上来就抓人，怪吓人的……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23369_Content_10|睁大眼看清楚我们身上的水，你给我们说清楚的机会了吗？",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_WaterDrop"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1132},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23369_Content_11|呃……不愉快的误会就让它过去吧！既然大家是来谈生意的，珈伦也要摆出职业的态度以示尊重。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23369_Content_12|说罢她朝你们摊开肉乎乎的手掌心。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Sash"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1132,
          nil,
          "twinkie"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23369_Content_13|一张邀请函十个雷欧坊，两张二十个。不讲价哦。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1132,
          nil,
          "snide"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23369_Content_14|剧目马上就要开始了，你们也不想错过吧，警、官、大、人？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23369_Content_15|你伸手捋了捋早已凝成结的湿发，长长舒了一口气。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Caress"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Angry.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23369_Content_16|拉蒙娜，我的耐心已经耗尽了，不如我们先狠狠揍她一顿？",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        Sequence = "SetRole(1132,3,scared)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cartoon_Angry"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23369_Content_17|……等等。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23369_Content_18|珈伦小姐，这场戏我们不去也没关系。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1132,4,snide)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23369_Content_19|但如果索蕾尔夫人知道她最贴心的侍女在外面倒卖洗澡水，那该作何感想呢？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1132,
          nil,
          "angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23369_Content_20|我、我才不怕呢！以你们的身份根本见不到索蕾尔夫人，骗人精！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Emm"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23369_Content_21|见不到又何妨？我现在就去歌剧院门口，大声把你的所作所为讲出来……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1132,
          nil,
          "scared"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23369_Content_22|<Big:等一下！>",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        RoleShake = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_OMG"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23369_Content_23|珈伦慌忙起身，在围裙里摸了半天，随后将两张皱巴巴的邀请函递给你们。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1132,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23369_Content_24|给你，都给你！\n哼，就知道欺压老百姓，当心夜路走多了撞到鬼！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        RoleShake = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Note"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Happy.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23369_Content_25|托您吉言，珈伦小姐，我们会注意的。",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_cing"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23369_Content_26|你喜滋滋地伸出手。就在触碰到邀请函的瞬间，珈伦又慢悠悠地一抬手，将邀请函收了回去。",
