      }),
      readonly({
        RoleHide = {1},
        Sequence = "PlayVideo(Blade_Flash3.mp4)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Blade_Crossed_02"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Blade_Crossed_01",
          "800"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_13|锋利的小刀毫不犹豫地割断荆棘，连带着华丽的裙摆也被划破，露出内里伤痕累累的肌肤。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pierce_Knife"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_14|索蕾尔手持利刃，面沉如水，连眼睛都不眨一下。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          nil,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise1.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_15|这把刀不是朗贝尔先生的……？",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1137},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_16|是啊。我从一开始就知道他躲在外面，手里拿着这把刀。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Suolei_Father_72BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1137,
          nil,
          "sad2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_17|可惜我等啊，等啊……他最后还是丢下这把刀跑了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1137,
          nil,
          "sad2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_18|呵……我亲爱的父亲，他除了给我添乱还能做什么呢？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1137,
          nil,
          "sad1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_19|他甚至连杀我都做不到。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        RoleHide = {1},
        Sequence = "PlayVideo(Blade_Flash3.mp4)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Blade_Crossed_01"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Blade_Crossed_02",
          "800"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_21|索蕾尔一刀刀划向疯长的藤蔓，那些坏死的血肉也被她全部剜下。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_22|她抬头望向漆黑不见顶的天花板。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1137,3,serious)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1137,
          nil,
          "angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_23|您现在一定很开心吧？见我这副狼狈的模样……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_24|和以往无数次一样，她没能等来任何回应——除了缠绕身体的雾气外。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1137,
          nil,
          "angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_25|这就是打破契约的惩罚么？我不会倒在这里的……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1137},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_26|刚从康斯坦乡下出来的时候，我孤身一人，既没有钱，也没有名。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1137},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_27|谎言是我的外衣，流言是我的武器，芸芸众生是我的向上攀爬的阶梯。\n世间万物，一切皆为我所用。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1137},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_28|我之所以能走到今天，靠的既非我的父亲，也不是N。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1137,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_29|我真正倚赖的东西从来都只有一个——那就是我自己。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1137,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_30|是我选择和祂签订契约，是我选择打破契约，也是我选择……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1137,
          nil,
          "Sad2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_31|永远摆脱我的父亲。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_32|她轻轻握住你的手腕。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thouch_Cloth"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1137},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_33|这个黑影只是祂在现世中的投影，并非没有应对之法。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1137},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_34|只要能<Yellow:拖到密境结束>的那一刻，我还是那个死而复生的索蕾尔，契约也会因此失效。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1137},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_35|帮我渡过这次难关，我会酌情答应你们提出的条件。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_36|<Gray:都这种时候了还只是“酌情”答应……？>",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1137,
          nil,
          "smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_37|我知道你在想什么。\n放心吧，这些条款我能答应个七成，那帮老家伙都应该开香槟庆祝了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_38|可这只是人工密境而已，现实中您不会受到任何伤害，为什么……",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_39|……",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_40|愉悦的叹息声自你们头顶上方传来，似是品尝够了你们的恐惧与无助。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_NFristShow_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_41|黑色的雾气不断逃离她的眼睛、鼻子以及喉咙，随后将整个歌剧院一并吞噬。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Black_Mist_Attack"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_42|黑暗中撕开了一道裂口，仿佛宇宙张开巨嘴，星球在其中漫无目的地滚动着。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_DarkGalaxy"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_BlackHole"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_43|又仿佛诸神从梦中懒洋洋地睁开双眼。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_44|无光亮，无所属，无所感。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_45|轰隆隆——",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Wooden_Building_Collapsed"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_46|伴随剧烈的响动，你们所在的露台成为了漆黑海洋中唯一的孤岛。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"blackSmoke", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_OperaHouseDark"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Slime"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_47|索蕾尔此刻便跪坐于那道裂口前。无数浓雾生成的手臂死死拽住了她，试图将她拖进背后的裂口。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1137,3,null2)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Black_Mist_Attack2"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_48|索蕾尔夫人！！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1137,
          nil,
          "null2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_49|看到了吗……祂是无视法则的存在。\n现实、梦境，对祂而言没有任何区别。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_50|黑雾刺穿了她的身体，再从她的眼睛、鼻子、耳朵疯狂溢出。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "mucus",
          1,
          "redScreen",
          1
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Black_Mist_Attack3"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pierce_Knife",
          "500"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_51|索蕾尔嘴角溢出越来越多的鲜血，她朝你轻轻笑了一下。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 2},
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_RunRunRun_124BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1137,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_52|帮我，我们一起击退祂。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_53|……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1137,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_54|金钱、权势，或者随便别的什么东西。只要能救我出去，我会尽可能满足你的愿望。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_55|她挣扎着离你更近了一些，面上却没有任何哀求之色。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_ClothesFriction_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_56|更多是动物濒死前，不顾一切、不择手段也要活下来的求生欲望。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1137,
          nil,
          "sad1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_57|%player%……你还欠我一杯酒呢，不记得了吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_58|帮，还是不帮？",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_59|明知她随时都有可能撕毁承诺，你还是决定赌一把。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_60|我答应你",
        DialogType = 5
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_61|请不要误会，我只是为了确保谈判顺利进行……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_62|索蕾尔嘴角微微上扬，笑眼如星，在此刻寂静的夜里，点亮了周围的一切。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1137,3,smile)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1137,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23881_Content_63|你不仅是一位骑士，还是一位聪明的骑士。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
