        Content = "AvgDialog_4875_Content_11|萝坦，先别逗她了。",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_OMG"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_4875_Content_12|卡茜亚小姐，你说的办法是……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1156,
          nil,
          "Smile3"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_4875_Content_13|去找水仙夫人，她那里肯定有解决办法。\n那么喜欢看热闹的女人，不可能不对<Yellow:能记录唤醒体>的机器感兴趣。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1124,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_4875_Content_14|啧…又要和那女人打交道啊？",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_4875_Content_15|去向达芙黛尔夫人求助吗？不失为解决办法，只要她想交换的东西不是太过分……",
