          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_50|况且她把我伺候得还算舒服，找到一个称心的人类仆从可不是件容易的事。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_51|总之，我希望你能帮我解决融蚀。别急着拒绝我——价钱之类的都好说，你想要的我一定会尽力满足。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_52|你也不忍心看着这些村民无辜惨死吧，亲爱的“修士大人”？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_53|……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_54|总是把“你们人类”挂在嘴边，再加上那些奇怪的脊刺……旺达夫人，您根本不是人类吧？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_55|来自遥远他乡的存在，却会关心弱小村民的生死。夫人的真实目的是什么？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_56|面对你的诘问，旺达挑了挑眉，忽然大笑起来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleShake = {1151},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1151,3,Laugh)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_57|我刚才说的话很好笑吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Laugh"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_58|不……哈哈哈哈！我只是太高兴了。来这里这么多年，终于遇到和我一样不属于“这里”的人。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_59|你怎么知道——",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_60|旺达伸出食指轻轻点在你的唇上。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Caress"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_61|嘘……跟我走吧，带你看个东西。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_62|你们穿过树林，来到宁静的湖畔边缘。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CG_SD/Video_SD_S_D04_7.mp4"
        },
        BgTransition = 7,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Wangda_Sad_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_City_Of_Silence"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_63|有时我会产生一些美妙的错觉……就好像从这个湖的倒影里，可以看到我以前居住的城市。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_64|黑色巨石组成的庞大城市，它的边界不断膨胀，最后蔓延至看不见的尽头……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_65|幽蓝的湖水几乎深不见底，你听着旺达的描述，眼前也似乎出现了那座城市应有的样貌。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_66|黑色螺旋状尖塔、诡异的钝角墙壁……",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_67|那时候，我有一座很大的宫殿，光服侍我的仆从就有上千人。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_68|就像你说的，我从来不在乎那些仆从的死活。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_69|我总是随心所欲。我的仆从，乃至整座城市，都是我欲望与野心的延伸。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_70|后来我的星球发生了被你们称之为“融蚀”的灾厄，所有人都死了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_71|我独自在大厅坐了很久很久，看着我的宫殿、我的都城、我的一切都变成了废墟。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_72|说实话，这种感觉很糟糕，没人愿意经历第二次。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_73|旺达夫人……很抱歉，这次我没办法帮你。",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_WoodsNight"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1151,3,Sad)",
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Field_Night"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_74|不必担心，告诉我你的顾虑，我会为你提供一切所需的帮助。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_75|你摇摇头。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_76|不仅仅是这个……我们现在的身处的环境，也有一些，呃，特殊之处……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_77|在入梦期间，你是无法关闭融蚀裂隙的。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_78|<Gray:该怎么向旺达夫人解释这件事呢……>",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_79|因为我们现在是在梦里，所以你无法帮助我，对吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_80|？！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_81|您都发现了？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_82|旺达低头望着水中的黑色城市，眼里闪烁着细碎的白色月光。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CG_SD/Video_SD_S_D04_7.mp4"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_City_Of_Silence"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_83|来到这里以后，我做过许多梦。关于战争、灾厄、时间……可我一次都没梦见过我的都城。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_84|就在我快要忘记它的时候，我见到了你，然后又在湖底看见了它。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_85|你知道吗？当一个将死之人见到穿梭在雾中的吹笛人，他不会害怕，也不会好奇。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_86|他只会静静地跟在吹笛人身后，去到属于自己的地方。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_87|旺达轻轻叹了一口气。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_88|我那逝去的都城啊，它美得就像将死之人的梦。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_89|她轻轻抚摸一旁沉默不语的盲眼侍从。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Caress"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1618},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_90|<Change>夫人……",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Harkonnen_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_91|坎布里安是我的第二故乡。我和它相处的时间不长，想不到又到了说再见的时候。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_WoodsNight"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_92|对不起，旺达夫人……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_93|旺达朝你摆了摆手。再抬起头时，她脸上的阴霾早已一扫而空。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Sash"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_94|放心吧。既然做了封地的领主，我就要对大家负责。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_95|不就是一同赴死么？那就一起死得痛痛快快。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_96|你打算做什么？",
        DialogType = 5
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_97|旺达露出神秘的微笑，朝你眨了眨眼。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1151},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25186_Content_98|一场华丽的告别盛宴。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [25191] = {
    ID = 25191,
    CnID = "小型支线_旺达_关卡4_前",
    BaseSortID = 6,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 6,
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_1|死亡、蜜酒与歌之夜",
        Chapter = "The Burning Banquet;Night of Banquet ;Part 4",
        DialogType = 4,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_UI_AVG_Chapter_Pop"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_2|古德里安封地\n猎场",
        DialogType = 6,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1622},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_3|什么？你说旺达熔死了所有门闩，拉着整个坎布里安的村民在城堡里举办舞会？",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Woods"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1623,3)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_AfterWar_Ver4_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Small_Forest"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1623},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_4|千、千真万确！听说没感染的人都离开了，最后参加舞会的都是那些病入膏肓的家伙。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1622},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_5|哈哈哈哈！我还费尽心思在她身旁安插内应，看来有些多余了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1623},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_6|那样可怕的瘟疫，她不仅不打算离开，还把所有人都锁起来等死……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1623},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_7|难道真如传言所说，她已经彻底疯了？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1622},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_8|你这话说得可真有意思。难道她过去是个脑子正常的女人？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1623},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_9|呃……这……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1622},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_10|这女人究竟在想什么，没人能猜到。不过——",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1622},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_11|坎布里安的瘟疫已经无可救药了，如果放任那些感染者出来，鬼知道会发生什么。",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1622},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_12|不管这是不是旺达的本意，她这样做的确拯救了周遭的封地……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_13|坎布里安城堡\n宴会大厅",
        DialogType = 6,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_14|你推开大厅沉重的木门。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "CG_SD/Video_SD_S_D04_4.mp4"
        },
        BgTransition = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Open_Old_Door"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Wangda_Happy_Dance_108BPM",
          "300"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Melodious_Palace"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_15|璀璨的灯光犹如繁星洒落人间，红酒美食的甜美香气在大厅中浮动。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_16|坎布里安的村民们纷纷穿上自己最好的一套衣裳，伴随音乐的节拍快乐起舞。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_17|即使外面早已被融蚀淹没，大厅内依旧充满了快活的气息。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1621},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_18|这就是传说中的苹果布丁吗？咱这辈子都没吃过这么好吃的东西……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1620},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_19|哈哈哈哈，我太开心了！死了也值了！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1620},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_20|跳舞，一起来跳舞！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_21|你拨开熙熙攘攘的人群，见到了坐在尽头的旺达。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Push_Away_The_Crowd"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogAnim = 0,
        RolePos = {0},
        Sequence = "PlayVideo(CG_SD/Video_SD_S_D04_5.mp4)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Make_Brilliant_Debut"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_23|她懒洋洋地斜靠在侍从们身上，杯中的红酒闪烁着宝石般的辉光。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_S_D04_1"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Red_WineGlass"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1151},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_24|晚上好，修士大人。我还以为你不屑参与我们荒唐的狂欢。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {0},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_SD_S_D04_2"
        },
        AnimState = "CG/CG_SD/Prefab/CGDynamic_SD_S_D04_2.prefab"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_25|偶尔我也想满足一下自己的好奇心。",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_S_D04_2"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_26|<Gray:再说了，外面到处都是融蚀浆，我还能去哪里……>",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_27|衣角被人轻轻拉了一下。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thouch_Hand"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise1.png",
          nil
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_28|你是……苏珊娜的弟弟！",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_PalaceHallNight"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1628,3)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Ops"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1628},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_29|我也是有名字的哦，大家都叫我小贝克曼。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_30|晚上好，小贝克曼。你姐姐去哪里了？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1628},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_31|姐姐和其他没有生病的人一起离开了……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_32|小贝克曼沮丧地低下头。他吸了吸鼻子，抬起头用那双圆溜溜的大眼睛望着你。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1628},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_33|修士哥哥，要来一起跳舞吗？小贝克曼没有舞伴，呜呜……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Sweat.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_34|小朋友，修士是不能跳舞的。",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Emm"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Laugh"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_35|现在我宣布你可以跳舞了，别管那些老掉牙的清规戒律。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Laugh"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_36|在坎布里安，我——<Big:就是法律！>",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_37|你望着小贝克曼充满希冀的大眼睛，将拒绝的话悄悄咽下。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_38|抱歉，我从未学过舞蹈，但我可以陪你转两圈。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_39|你牵起小贝克曼的手走入大厅中央。在那里，村民们正随着音乐的旋律翩翩起舞。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CG_SD/Video_SD_S_D04_4.mp4"
        },
        BgTransition = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Sparkling"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Normal_Short",
          "300"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Melodious_Palace"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_40|长长的裙裾随音乐轻盈飞舞，就像无数旋转的缤纷小蛋糕。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_41|你徜徉在灯光和音乐编织的金色海洋中，终于被四周不断涌起的欢乐泡泡彻底淹没。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_42|小贝克曼的舞技显然不比你强多少。他毫无章法地随着音乐节拍扭来扭去，不一会脸就变得红扑扑的。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_PalaceHallNight"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1628,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1628},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_43|哈哈哈，好开心呀！今天是小贝克曼最开心的一天！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1628},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_44|修士哥哥，抓住我的手，我们一起来转圈圈吧！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1628},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_45|快一点！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1628},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_46|<BigShake:再快一点！>",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_47|<Red:再快一点……>",
        DialogType = 6,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thriller_05"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Thriller"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1628,
          nil,
          "null2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_48|快@2……",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_PalaceHallNight"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Wangda_Crazy_Dance_108BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_49|小贝克曼，你的脸怎么……？！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Make_Brilliant_Debut"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1628,
          nil,
          "null2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_50|<Change>跳舞，陪我……",
        DialogType = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Up_Mucus_03"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_51|男孩眼睛里不断淌出漆黑的融蚀浆，他微笑着向你伸出手。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Up_Mucus_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_52|鼻尖忽然感到一阵冰凉。你抬起头，黑色的粘液从水晶灯缓慢滴落。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"mucus", 1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Carcass_blood"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_53|一滴，两滴……",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_54|你惊惶地看向四周，这才发现不少人的衣服、手臂、甚至脸上都已发生不同程度的溃烂。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_55|可他们依然快乐起舞。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1628,
          nil,
          "null1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_56|修士哥哥，你怎么不理我了……你不喜欢小贝克曼了吗……",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Wangda_Crazy_Dance_108BPM_Coda"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_57|男孩伸出黏糊糊的双手抱住你，悲伤从空洞的眼眶中溢出。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Touch_Mucus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1628,
          nil,
          "null1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_25191_Content_58|陪我……陪我……",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
