        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Sunlight"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_36|星光似黑夜中的游萤，若隐若现，最终消失不见。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Sunlight02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1684,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_37|晚安，我的「二十四分之一」。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {4},
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_38|<Yellow:人工密境调查日志 Ⅳ>\n\n■密境编号：M-C06\n■坠落时间：洪积315年12月@1日\n■坠落地点：坎伯韦尔街，东区",
        DialogType = 7,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Typewriter_Newline02"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Typewriter_Tap_01",
          "1000"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_39|<Yellow:■调查结果>\n\n密境以一种平淡的方式划上了句号。\n那以后梅森小姐的病情稳定了不少，这是令所有人都无比开心的一件事。\n\n<Yellow:我们正在逐渐接近真实的梅森小姐。>",
        DialogType = 7,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Typewriter_Tap_03"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_40|弥萨格大学，校办公室\n一天后",
        DialogType = 6,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_41|什么，审查会撤销控诉了？",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolOffice"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_OMG"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Peace_Talk_Ver1_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1121,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_42|你不在的时候，发生了很多有趣的事。他们现在忙着和市环保处的那帮人一起清理蛇患呢。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_43|蛇患……？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_44|朵尔将前几日的《伦蒂尼恩邮报》摊开举在你面前。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        Sequence = "ShowItem(9602)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Paper"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_45|“近日，已故医生伯纳德的诊所忽然涌出海量不明种类的白化蛇，对当地交通住行造成了严重阻塞……”",
        DialogType = 2,
        Sequence = "ShowItem(9602)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_46|“目击证人表示，这是她此生见过最可怕的场景。若读者您也不幸目睹了现场，欢迎致电心理医生@2寻求帮助……”",
        DialogType = 2,
        Sequence = "ShowItem(9602)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_47|“号码@4……”",
        DialogType = 2,
        Sequence = "ShowItem(9602)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_48|新闻旁还附上了照片，你似乎看到了几个来自审查会的熟悉身影。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "ShowItem(9602)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_49|他们手持网兜，正在辛勤地清理着不断涌出的小蛇们，脸上是掩饰不住的疲倦与不耐。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "ShowItem(9602)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1121},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_50|那个所谓的“伯纳德医生”问题很大。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1121},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_51|我们找到了皇家医学会的人，对方提供的照片资料和附近居民的描述完全不同。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Strange_001_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1121,
          nil,
          "Thinking"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_52|换言之，死者盗用了这个伯纳德医生的身份。不过就目前的情况来看，这个冒牌医生是否真的死了还犹未可知。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1121,
          nil,
          "Thinking"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_53|毕竟现场连尸体的痕迹都找不到……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_54|12月17日，案发当日\n伯纳德医生的诊所",
        DialogType = 6,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1644},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_55|今日的诊疗就到此结束了。梅森小姐，你恢复得不错。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SanatoriumAisle"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Important_People"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Mist"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1008},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_56|真的吗？可大家都说我的病情越来越严重了……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1644},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_57|我和其他人类对“严重”的理解恐怕不太一样。\n给你开的几副酊剂都按时吃了吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_58|哗啦！！",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_C_IronSheetFalling"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_59|医生不小心碰倒了手边的文件，泛黄的纸页铺洒满地。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Notebook_Dropped"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1644},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_60|抱歉，最近东区疫病频发，诊所内堆积的资料也越来越多——",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1008,
          nil,
          "Smile1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_61|没关系！您可是日夜辛劳的大医生，捡东西这点小事就交给……",
        DialogType = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1008,
          nil,
          "Surprised1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_62|我吧……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_63|手在距离文件不到2英寸的地方停住了。这是一沓身份档案，梅森费力地从中认出了几个还算熟悉的单词。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Set_Avg_Mus_As_More"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1008,
          nil,
          "Surprised1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_64|实验报告、转运记录……？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1008,
          nil,
          "Insane1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_65|<Shake:这是……济贫院失踪的那些孩子！不，不止这些……>",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_66|就在最下方露出的一角档案里，詹金那张略带倔强的面庞出现在梅森眼前。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1644},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_67|这是你的妹妹吧？我见过她。她一直很担心你，甚至还试图偷溜进来。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_68|他微微笑了笑，神色也温柔起来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Fog"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1644},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_69|我也曾有过许多兄弟姐妹……它们只会害怕我、畏惧我，所以我把它们全都吃掉了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Desolation_Terror_83BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1008,
          nil,
          "Insane1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_70|全都、吃掉了……？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1644,2)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1644},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_71|放心吧，梅森小姐。我没有吃掉你的朋友，只是把他们送到了一个<Red:安全的地方>。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1008,
          nil,
          "Insane1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_72|所以你才是这些失踪案的罪魁祸首……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1008,
          nil,
          "Insane1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_73|<Shake:这个笑话一点也不好笑，伯纳德先生……>",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1644},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_74|伯纳德先生……你是说它吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        RoleHide = {1008},
        ScreenEffect = {"bloodSmoke", 1},
        Sequence = "FadeDarkRole(1644,1)",
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Thriller"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_75|男人说罢，嘴里伸出长长的信子，上面卷着一只血淋淋的断指。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Mucus_Flow"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1644},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_76|他的块头太大，我到现在都没消化干净。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1307},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35996_Content_77|重新认识一下吧，我叫<Yellow:阿尔比诺>，是雕塑家协会的药剂师。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Set_Avg_Mus_As_More"
