      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_6798_Content_92|我不是想要控制你，只是……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_6798_Content_93|她轻轻哼了一声，转过头去，注视着帐篷外的风雪。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_ChainBall_Attack_PickUp_1"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1305,
          nil,
          "Idle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_6798_Content_94|我有自己的事要做。你帮了我，在我离开以前，会帮你一次。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1305,
          nil,
          "laugh"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_6798_Content_95|这座山也是一头野兽，它在狩猎我们……但很快，我就会吞噬它！",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
