          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_8231_Content_55|光？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_8231_Content_56|很刺眼，像是某个东西反射出来的。\n我看到过几次，而每次那道光出现过后，人们的行为都会被激化。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_8231_Content_57|愤怒的人更加愤怒，那些想做第一的人——可以说是嫉妒吧，他们对第一的身份更加执着。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_8231_Content_58|再加上这些突然困倦的人，我怀疑——",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_8231_Content_59|剧痛突然从你的后脑蔓延开来。\n奥吉尔的瞳孔在强光下剧烈收缩，他张开嘴，似乎正要说什么。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgTransition = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Mirror_Evil_Light_01",
