      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1657},
        Content = "AvgDialog_38729_Content_21|索菲亚，我——",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1651,
          nil,
          "angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_38729_Content_22|闭嘴！害死我姐姐和妈妈还不够，你还要来她们坟前耀武扬威吗？！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1657},
        Content = "AvgDialog_38729_Content_23|我是来道歉的，我没想到……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_38729_Content_24|索菲亚尖刻地笑了。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1651,3,insane)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1651,
          nil,
          "insane"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_38729_Content_25|你也是这样和<Blue:汤普森>道歉的吗，在害死他唯一的亲人，害死<Blue:米莉>之后？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1651,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_38729_Content_26|你让我恶心，爱德华·贝利。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1657},
        Content = "AvgDialog_38729_Content_27|我是真的后悔了，索菲亚。我知道我无法获得你的宽恕——",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1651,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_38729_Content_28|如果你真的后悔，汤普森杀你那天你就不该去找萨尔瓦多主教。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1651,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_38729_Content_29|没错，我知道你是怎么活下来的，你这个懦夫。<Yellow:提灯>告诉我了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1651,
          nil,
          "angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_38729_Content_30|给你「<Yellow:赐福>」是主教最愚蠢的决定。你就该死，贝利，受尽折磨而死。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1657},
        Content = "AvgDialog_38729_Content_31|我也不想这样的，我试过控制自己，我试过的！在主教救了我之后我每天都回去圣堂报到，我每周都到你家的济贫院去做义工，你还记得吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1657},
        Content = "AvgDialog_38729_Content_32|我想变好，我真的想。是那个亚格罗的家伙，是他说这是个万无一失的生意，要我引荐一个担保人。我也是受害者啊！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1651,
          nil,
          "null"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_38729_Content_33|到现在你还在推卸责任，到现在……你都没有真正悔过。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_38729_Content_34|她从裙子的内袋里拿出了一个银白的物件，光滑的表面在阳光下微微一闪，将反射的阳光染成了不祥的鲜红。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Mirror_Evil_Light_03",
          "600"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1657},
        Content = "AvgDialog_38729_Content_35|索菲亚……？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1652,
          nil,
          "null"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_38729_Content_36|忏悔吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1652,
          nil,
          "null"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_38729_Content_37|听从正义的持灯者的教诲，将你灵魂中的罪恶净化。\n只有这样，才可能获得宽恕。",
