        RolePos = {4},
        Sequence = "FadeDarkRole(1729,1);SetRole(1168,2,EyeOpen);Quote"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47168_Content_129|这个世界的人变化了。信仰，亲情，尊严……在你们眼里，这一切一文不值。我很清楚，塔利斯。",
        DialogType = 10,
        RolePos = {2},
        Sequence = "Quote"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47168_Content_130|不过没关系，我会带来一个更好的世界。帮助你成为族长，就能让奥恩家族成为我的助力，与我一同参与这神圣伟大的事业。",
        DialogType = 10,
        RolePos = {2},
        Sequence = "Quote"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47168_Content_131|你们有着卑贱的心，本不配做神国的子民。但你们完成了让我重生的使命，这，是我送还给你们的礼物。",
        DialogType = 10,
        RolePos = {2},
        Sequence = "Quote"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1729},
        Content = "AvgDialog_47168_Content_132|你可以……可以和我交易……你不用这样……",
        DialogType = 10,
        RolePos = {4},
        Sequence = "Quote"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_47168_Content_133|猎犬没有交易的资格。所以，我只能成为你的主人。现在，我想我有这个资格了。",
        DialogType = 10,
        RolePos = {2},
        Sequence = "Quote"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47168_Content_134|我要复活一个人。告诉我，我应该怎么做。",
        DialogType = 10,
        RolePos = {2},
        Sequence = "Quote"
      }),
      readonly({
