        Content = "AvgDialog_47166_Content_7|还有其他东西吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1166,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47166_Content_8|零零散散有一些，大部分刚才都给你看过了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1166,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47166_Content_9|我搜遍了整座岛，没有找到什么遗迹，只带走了这些小玩意。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1166,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47166_Content_10|本来打算后面有空了再来看看，还没来得及，就碰上了以格伦叛乱这一堆烂事。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1166,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47166_Content_11|这里就是你的故乡，对吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47166_Content_12|岛的外貌变化很大。或许是利莫里亚，或许是些别的什么，我不确定。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_47166_Content_13|上万年的时间，能改变的东西很多……",
