      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47164_Content_10|我在，黛博拉。我在这里。",
        DialogType = 1,
        PlayEnterAnim = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1721,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47164_Content_11|弥利亚姆？你这是……在做什么？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1721,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47164_Content_12|这个玩笑一点都不好笑，弥利亚姆……快把我放下来……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_47164_Content_13|不，黛博拉，这不是玩笑。这世上没有比这更庄严的事了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1721,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47164_Content_14|你想做什么？弥利亚姆……你不是说我是你最好的朋友吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1721,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47164_Content_15|你……你以前也有一个朋友，也叫黛博拉……我们不是很有缘分吗，弥利亚姆？请……请不要伤害我……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47164_Content_16|怎么会呢，黛博拉？我怎么会忍心伤害你？你是我最好的朋友，你是我唯一的朋友……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_47164_Content_17|她抚摸着黛博拉的脸，拂去她恐惧的泪水。冰冷滑腻的触感，让黛博拉忍不住战栗。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Caress03"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47164_Content_18|我永远、永远也不会伤害你的，黛博拉。我只是要赠予你一件礼物。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Heathen_Theme_Chp4_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1721,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47164_Content_19|礼、礼物？",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_47164_Content_20|我是多么希望自己成为那个孕育圣胎的人。可你看到过我植入圣胎的样子，我没有那个资格。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_47164_Content_21|这份荣耀，不是谁都有资格获得的。无法享受这份荣耀，这是我的遗憾……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47164_Content_22|黛博拉，我是你女儿的教母。我将把这份无上的荣耀，送给我的教女，也送给你，我唯一的挚友。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1721,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47164_Content_23|弥利亚姆，我愿意……我愿意让女儿成为容器，享受这份荣耀……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1721,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47164_Content_24|可是，她还有三个月才出生……我也没办法……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47164_Content_25|来不及了，黛博拉。来不及了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_47164_Content_26|弥利亚姆爱怜地注视着黛博拉，语气变得更加温柔。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47164_Content_27|她是最合适的人选。她必须，出生在今天。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_47164_Content_28|……",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
