          1168,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47164_Content_59|看着我，黛博拉。看着我……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47164_Content_60|我知道，你很害怕。我见过很多的信徒，面对此生的终结，他们都会害怕。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47164_Content_61|但是，不要担心。你是神国至高的子民，你所遭受的一切，都会在神国得到补偿。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_47164_Content_62|来，和我一起祷告吧，黛博拉。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1},
