        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1159,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_49095_Content_16|才从余的梦境中死里逃生，还有胆子立刻入睡？这份胆识，倒让余刮目相看了。",
