      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_4|喂？你听得懂我说话吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_5|头顶传来一声轻笑，你还在思索笑声的主人是何方神圣时，一根脊刺揽住了你的腰。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Sash"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_6|它像一条阴晴不定的巨蟒，愤怒时骨刺会毫不留情地扎穿你的身体，有时又会慵懒地挂在你的肩头。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_7|此时的它游过你的身体，尖端抵在你的喉骨之上，像动物在温存求欢，又像一把危险的尖刀。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_8|旺达……是你吧！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_9|哼…居然这么慢才认出主人，你可真是个不称职的小宠物。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {0},
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_10|旺达粗暴地扯掉了你的蒙眼绸布，她眯了眯眼，一种不同于暴虐的奇异威压在她身上流转。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_WoodsNight"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1151,3,smile)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cloth_Bring_Here"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Wangda_Talk_96BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_11|脊刺从锁骨上擦过，皮肤被粗粝尖锐的骨刺划开。旺达闭着眼，嗅着逸散在空气中的鲜血气味，表情餍足。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_12|我杀掉第四任王夫后不久，我在这颗星球上的国就迎来了灭亡。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_13|说起来，我已经很久、很久没有与新人相会了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_14|脊刺高高举起，粘稠的液体在尖端凝聚，与你裸露的伤口近在咫尺。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Blade_Crossed_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1151},
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_15|现在是个不错的时机，你觉得呢？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Laugh"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_16|远离纷扰与疫病，没有烦恼，没有责任……只有值得信赖的人在身边。这真是最好的年代！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_17|旺达，你真的是这么想的吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_18|什么意思？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_19|没有烦恼，没有责任……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_20|选择与坎布里安一同落幕的你，从来没有把责任视作负担。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_21|你怎么知道坎布里安的——",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_22|异星的女王，在把我变成新的王夫前，请仔细感受自己的内心。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_23|勒姆瓦希圣河的影响，不会把你变成另外的模样。",
        DialogType = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1151,3,serious)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_24|……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_25|你说得对，小宠物。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_26|旖旎氛围烟消云散，脊刺像退潮的海岸线般回缩，在旺达身后摇摆不定。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_27|走吧，今晚还不是时候。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_28|不是时候？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_29|不死奴仆一拥而上，把你推了开来，旺达则发出了一声愉悦的鼻音。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Push",
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Push"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_30|女王不会失去理智，也不会收回说过的话，只不过让你成为我的下一任，确实为时尚早。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          2,
          "AvgHorizontal"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_49880_Content_31|走吧，小宠物。但要做好准备——等时机成熟，我会再找你过来的。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          2,
          "AvgHorizontal"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [56163] = {
    ID = 56163,
    CnID = "繁衍狂欢_弥利亚姆",
    BaseSortID = 38,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 38,
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_1|由于近期唤醒体们频频出现异常状况，校方决定加强对唤醒体状态的监控，定期查房以预防意外。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Corridor"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Thinking_001_118BPM"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_2|为了应对唤醒体暴走的可能，查房的任务由每位空闲的调查员轮值，今天恰好轮到你当宿管。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_3|被多次骚扰过的你提心吊胆地敲开一间间房门，写下一个个状态正常的记录。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Slow_Short"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_4|终于在敲到某间房门时仅剩一片未有回应的寂静，你内心忍不住咯噔一下，发出“还是来了”的预警。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_OldCall_Door"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_5|你抬头看了看房牌上弥利亚姆的名字，面色凝重地打开了房门，谨慎地探出半个身子。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Wood_Door_Pure"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_6|弥利亚姆？你在吗？",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_BedRoom"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Mist"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_7|黑暗的房间中唯有一点摇曳的烛火照亮了昏黄的一角，映在修女虔诚默祷的脸上。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1168,3,EyeOpen)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Small_Flame_Ignites"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Sarewa_Chuch_91BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_8|她的背影安宁祥和，如同往常千百年的苦修一样。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_9|原来你在祷告，打扰了，既然你没什么事我就继续查房了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_10|你心头一松，为不用面对这个疯狂的女人而舒了口气。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_11|然而你调查的经验与直觉忽然感到了异常，你停下脚步，仔细观察着那片烛火。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_12|幢幢的黑影经烛光倒映在墙上，那摇曳的哪里是烛火，分明是一条条盘曲扭动的蛇影。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_13|一条条蛇影包围在烛火四周，仿佛要攫取那房间内唯一的温度。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_BigSnakeSteam_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_14|弥利亚姆转过头来，脸上带着异样的红晕，她的声音轻柔而幸福，如蒙受了神的恩宠。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "Shy2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_15|是您啊，守密人，您是因感应到神国的召唤而来吗。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "VOC_AVG_O07_Rstory01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_16|她苍白瘦癯的四肢缠绕着涌动的蛇影，双手却仍然维持着祷告的姿势，如同被绑缚的修女，被定格在永恒的使命之中。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Snake_Spitting_Letter_03"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Snake_man"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Vocal"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_17|你的大脑叫喊着不妙，但后退的决策已经晚了一步，湿冷的蛇影早已在黑暗中潜行而来，紧紧缠上你的双腿，爬上你的腰背。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Belt_tightened"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "Shy1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_18|您的身体真是温暖啊……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          2,
          "AvgHorizontal"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "VOC_AVG_O07_Rstory02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_19|显然你代替了微弱的烛火，成为了这房间内最大的热源。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Heathen_Theme_Chp4_118BPM"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Vocal"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise1.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_20|不不不，你肯定误会了什么！我没有听见神国的召唤，我只是来查房的！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_OMG"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_21|你焦急的解释没起到任何作用，蛇影裹挟着你来到了祷告的桌台旁，使你与弥利亚姆并坐在那尊触须张扬的雕像前。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "Shy1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_22|我已经很久很久没有体验过这样的喜悦与激动了，是神国，神国它回应了我！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "VOC_AVG_O07_Rstory03"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_23|你很想张口否定，说出真相，但看到她脸上的陶醉又明智地把话咽了回去。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Vocal"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "Shy2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_24|神国在催促我，要我做些什么，我应该顺从这份旨意。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "VOC_AVG_O07_Rstory04"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "Shy2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_25|现在，这份旨意送来了您。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "VOC_AVG_O07_Rstory04_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_26|她侧过头，微微颤栗的指尖抚上你的脸，双手将你的脸颊捧起，如同某种安慰，如同某种邀请。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thouch_Cloth"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Vocal"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "Crazyshy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_27|来吧，与我一同祷告，与我一同……为延续神国献上一切。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "VOC_AVG_O07_Rstory05"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_28|蛇影冰冷的触感令你在失温下发抖，拒绝的力度被强硬的缠缚瓦解，将你的身体摆成虔诚的姿势。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Snake_Spitting_Letter_02"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Vocal"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56163_Content_29|你与这狂热的主祭一起，开始了悦神的祈祷。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [56308] = {
    ID = 56308,
    CnID = "繁衍狂欢_奥尔拉",
    BaseSortID = 39,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 39,
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_1|好热……",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_2|一股不知从何而来的燥意让你睁开眼。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "awake",
          1,
          1
        },
        BgID = {
          "SScene_PoetryGarden"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Early_Morning_Woods"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise1.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_3|！！！",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"awake", 2},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_OMG"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Aoerla_Poem_World_120BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_4|我不是在寝室睡觉吗……这是什么地方？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1153,
          nil,
          "Shy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_5|对、对不起……守密人……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_6|原来是你……难怪。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_7|传播情绪的能力，碰上圣河的影响……真是个让人意想不到的组合。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_8|在奥尔拉的影响之下，你终于也体验到了被圣河影响的感觉。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_9|这次的诗中世界，似乎和以前有些不一样？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_10|很难说是为了转移自己的注意力，还是真的好奇。你打量着四周。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_zuoyou_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_11|更加繁盛的花朵，更加炎热的天气，更加让人心旌摇曳的建筑与音乐。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"redFlower", 1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Starlight_Escape_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_12|由文字所幻化的世界，每一个地方都是隐喻与暗示。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1153,
          nil,
          "Shy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_13|抱歉，守密人……我也不知道为什么……今天写下的诗句，总是……总是……",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"redFlower", 2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_14|情绪如同涟漪般在这个空间中散开。你的喉咙微微动了动。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_15|你伸出手，摘下了少女头上的羊皮纸。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pick_UpPaper02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1153,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_16|啊！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_17|少女像是只受惊的兔子，隐去的大部分身形坐立不安，露出的脸红到了耳根。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_18|奥尔拉，我喜欢这首诗。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1153,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_19|可是……可是这首诗还没有写完……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_20|那，让我们一起写完它。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        NextChatID = {"1", "2"},
        TalkRole = {
          1153,
          nil,
          "Shy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_21|下、下一句……应该写什么呢……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "1",
        NextChatID = {"3"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_22|天黑了，所有的目光都已消散……",
        DialogType = 5
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "2",
        NextChatID = {"3"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_23|太阳与星星都已落下……",
        DialogType = 5
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "3",
        TalkRole = {
          1153,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_24|……只剩玫瑰，秘密地依偎在她的花园……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_25|无形的文字在她身周浮现，诗中的花园暗淡下去。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_26|奥尔拉轻柔的声音离你越来越近。你听见她温柔的喘息。你感受到她颤抖的余温。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_56308_Content_27|——黑暗的花园里，你得知了一朵玫瑰的秘密。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [57563] = {
    ID = 57563,
    CnID = "繁衍狂欢_本源希洛",
    BaseSortID = 40,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 40,
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_1|刚刚结束一个外勤任务的你在回程路上遭遇了瓢泼大雨，被困在远离市区的郊外。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_WoodsNight"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Thunderstorm"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_2|不幸中的万幸，你还记得周围一处废弃工厂的地址，足够给你这样倒霉的旅人暂时遮风挡雨。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_WastelandDay"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_AfterWarVer2_58BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_3|聆听着大雨狠狠敲打工厂顶棚的声音，你百无聊赖地靠坐在墙角。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_AbandonedFactories"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Mist"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_4|好想躺在宿舍的大床上啊……",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"blinkEye", 1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_5|刚刚要闭眼小憩一会，你忽然听到了一阵令人牙酸的吱呀声。\n那是工厂腐锈的大门打开的声音。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"blinkEye", 2},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Iron_Door_Open_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_6|不明来者的身份，你谨慎地收敛呼吸，缓缓起身。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_7|没等你展开探查，突然一道凌厉的破空声在四周空旷的寂静中呼啸而至。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_Broadsword_Whoosh"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Pressure_80BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_8|你连忙向旁边一滚，原本站立的地方轰然被巨大的链球砸出深坑。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Sound_Giant_Nlade_Waving",
          "Play_A_SFX_Giant_Whoosh_Overhead"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_9|还没等你看清来人，一股巨力带着杀意瞬间扼住了你的咽喉。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1244,3,Serious)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Joint_Twist_one"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_10|你看着眼前熟悉的面孔，在挣扎中惊讶而嘶哑地呼唤她的名字。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Twitching_Struggling_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_11|咳……希……洛！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_12|面前的少女微微挑起了眉毛，然而她猩红的眼中并没有流露出老友重逢的神色，只有一片深潭般的冰冷。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_13|在你以为自己就要命丧当场的时候，少女的嘴角微微挑起，那只手终于松开了你的喉咙。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Fall_Down"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1244,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_14|原来是你啊，我好像说过，再见到你的时候会把你撕碎吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_15|你趴跪在地，差点把肺管给咳了出来，半晌才艰难地翻过身来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Turn_Jump"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_16|你不会的，咳咳，因为我们是，朋友……",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Xiluo_Sad_90BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_17|看清了眼前少女的全貌，你愣在原地。\n她浑身衣服贴在身上，不断滴着雨水。潮湿的水气中混杂着血腥味，苍白的脸上还带有一丝病态的潮红。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1244,3,Laugh)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_18|巨大的枷锁与她的身体嵌合在了一起，连接着铁链的四肢充满了不祥的黑与红。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_IronChain"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_19|你回忆起雪山上的相遇，下意识咽了咽口水。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1244,
          nil,
          "Scorn"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_20|看来你对我有什么误解，别把我和那个软弱的家伙混为一谈。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_21|眼看着她眼里的杀气再度燃起，你连忙展示出朋友的关心。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise2.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_22|不不不，只要是你，就都是我的朋友！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Ops"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_23|先不说这个，你受伤了？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_24|她的脸上忽然出现了奇异又复杂的神情，冷漠、厌烦和一丝不知所措。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1244,
          nil,
          "Idle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_25|伤势不重，但好像中了毒，身体……很奇怪。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_26|随即疑惑和脆弱一闪而逝，暴戾重新占满了她的双眼。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1244,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_27|要是让我抓到下毒的人，我会把他的内脏一点一点，全部捏碎。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_28|刚想解释一下圣河影响的你立刻装作无事发生，附和地点了点头。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Sweat.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_29|嗯嗯……",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_PullOut"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1244,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_30|不过，我没有朋友那种东西。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_31|你的头皮立刻紧绷了起来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Heart_Beat"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1244,
          nil,
          "Idle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_32|但你的气息很干净，没有恶意，没有谎言的味道。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_33|少女再次打量了你一番，似乎是勉强信任了你。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Dreamy_Memories_109BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_34|她靠在墙边坐了下来，占据了你原来的位置。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1244,
          nil,
          "Scorn"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_35|看在你之前帮忙的份上，我要休息一会，你替我守着。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1244,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_36|如果被我发现你有什么动作……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_37|你立刻摇了摇头，一脸忠心耿耿。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Emm"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_38|少女的眼睛缓缓闭上，湿漉漉的身体下意识蜷缩着，如同雨夜里无家的野兽。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1244,3,ShutEye)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_39|等一下！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_40|那双凶狠的红瞳不耐地瞪视向你。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1244,3,Serious)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_41|你脱下外套，轻轻地披在了少女身上。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_42|她低头看了看，没有拒绝。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1244,3,Idle)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_43|疲惫的少女在睡梦中攥着你的衣角，眉间那深刻的仇恨与杀意也短暂地消散了。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1244,3,ShutEye)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_44|外面的雨势渐小，淅淅沥沥地响在屋顶。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Rain_Smalle"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_45|安静的工厂里，只剩下你们重叠的呼吸声。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57563_Content_46|漫长的雨夜中，歇息着两个孤独的旅人。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [57592] = {
    ID = 57592,
    CnID = "繁衍狂欢_莱克",
    BaseSortID = 41,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 41,
        Content = "AvgDialog_57592_Content_1|当莱克今天在赌桌上把第17个学生的裤子都赢光的时候，终于有人哭着告状到了守密人这里。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Corridor"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Laike_Talk_Fun_100BPM"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Angry.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57592_Content_2|莱克！赶紧停止你的违法赌博行为！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Emm"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57592_Content_3|你嘭地推开房门，如同正义警察般大喝。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_OfficeNight"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Iron_Gate_Open"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57592_Content_4|屋子中央硕大的赌桌旁边挤满了一脸呆滞、瑟瑟发抖的学生，甚至有几个脸上挂着痛心的泪水，仿佛被魔爪夺走了最重要的东西。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Fun_Fear"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1125,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57592_Content_5|没意思，没意思！如此保守的筹码可对不起各位的气概！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57592_Content_6|嚣张的野兽拍打着桌子，身后堆着小山一样奇奇怪怪的战利品，显然毫无悔改的意思。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pat_Cloth"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1125,
          nil,
          "Shy1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57592_Content_7|呀，是你啊，我的华生。你也是来玩一把的吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57592_Content_8|平时懒散悠闲的兽人眼中是一反常态的狂热，看到是你，他眼前一亮凑了上来，一对毛茸茸的耳朵兴奋地朝前立着。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_57592_Content_9|在校方赶来把这里查封之前，我劝你赶快收手。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1125,
          nil,
          "Laugh"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57592_Content_10|别这么绝情嘛，收手没问题，只要你和我赌最后一场，就一场，赌上最珍贵的东西……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57592_Content_11|莱克犬科的尾巴此刻愉悦地摇摆着，湿漉漉的鼻子贴着你不停嗅闻，仿佛在寻找猎物最美味的部位，甚至无意间刮蹭到了你的耳廓。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1125,3,Shy1)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thouch_Hand"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_57592_Content_12|赌什么？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57592_Content_13|你绷成一块不近人情的钢板，警惕地看着眼前过于兴奋的兽人。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57592_Content_14|学校里目前还没有人能在赌桌上赢过莱克，所谓赌约和明抢也没什么区别了，你开始构思谈判话术，预备讨价还价。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1125,
          nil,
          "Shy1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57592_Content_15|赌什么？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57592_Content_16|这好像是一个很值得思考的问题，莱克绕着你转着圈，口中絮絮地呢喃着什么，让人难以听清。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1125,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57592_Content_17|果然，你是特别的，我闻得到，你的身上很香，如果能咬一口，如果能尝一尝……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_57592_Content_18|什么？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57592_Content_19|很快，温热的气息停在你的耳畔，贪婪的野兽咧出犬齿，吐露出他内心深处的渴望。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1125,
          nil,
          "Shy1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57592_Content_20|就赌……你的一个吻。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [57723] = {
    ID = 57723,
    CnID = "繁衍狂欢_哈姆林",
    BaseSortID = 42,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 42,
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_1|近日校园中忽然流传起了灵异事件的传闻，夜半无人的音乐教室中频频传出凭空奏响的乐声。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolNight"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Soft_Thinking_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_London_Night"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_2|在反复调查后不仅没能找到任何人影，进入音乐教室聆听乐曲的人还都出现了不同程度的疯狂倾向。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_3|眼看已经没有师生敢在夜里留守教学楼，背负着最后希望的你终于在深夜中来到了这间神秘的音乐教室。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_4|厚重的隔音大门内一片寂静，如同夜晚本来该有的样子，只有你自己的脚步声悄然回荡。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_MusicRoom"
        },
        BgTransition = 5,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Bad_Long"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Private_Room"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_5|奇怪，也没有任何融蚀的痕迹……",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_AfterWarVer2_58BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_6|在一圈无果的探查后，你来到了教室中央的钢琴旁，鬼使神差地拿起了谱架上摆放的几张乐谱。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Paper"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_7|有人落下了谱子吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_8|这似乎是一份未完成的乐谱，但上面已有的旋律就已经足够成为惊艳历史的传世佳作。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_9|你的双眼紧紧盯着一个个音符，近乎痴迷地坐了下来。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_10|钢琴黑白的琴键漩涡一般吸引着你。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 1},
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_NO_Thinking"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_11|好美……",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_12|你将双手放在了琴键上，顺从着本能的渴望，凭半吊子的音乐成绩弹奏起来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_School_Life_2_125BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_13|从磕磕绊绊，慢慢的旋律成型，音乐从涓滴汇聚成顺滑的水流，流淌在空旷无人的音乐大厅内。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1811,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_14|……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_15|空气中似乎有什么存在逐渐凝滞，你维持着清醒，不动声色地继续弹奏着，神情肃穆，如同音乐的朝圣者。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_16|终于不知从哪里传来了一声叹息，仿佛在天边，又仿佛在耳畔。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1811,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_17|你弹错了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_18|一双无形的手覆盖在了你的手上，好像亲密的抓握，却保持在堪堪贴合的距离。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1796,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_19|你感到一股力量温柔地引导着你的手指，修正着一个个唐突的错音。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_20|一阵令人头晕目眩的战栗从耳膜传遍全身，近乎完美的演奏立刻发挥出了这份乐谱完整的美。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_IllusionWhite"
        },
        BgTransition = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Starlight_Escape_01"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Starlight"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_21|你的呼吸下意识停滞，仿佛沉溺在音乐的乱流中，在忽而激昂如钢铁、忽而轻柔如棉絮的浪潮中逐渐下沉。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_22|有点……看不清了……",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Heart_Beat"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_23|你注视着那份曲谱，余光里的琴键令人眩目地舞动着，上半身不自觉逐渐前倾。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_24|曲谱上缓缓透出斑驳的血迹，你发自内心的想要更加看清那份曲谱，将它铭刻在脑海。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_25|你的头颅离曲谱越来越近，越来越近。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_26|那声叹息再一次出现了，一股不容抗拒的力量攥住了你的双手。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1796,3,ShutEye)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thouch_Cloth"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1811,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_27|停下。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_28|当的一声乱音砸在琴键，所有音乐戛然而止。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_MusicRoom"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Wrong_Note"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Private_Room"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_29|你汗如雨下，气喘不止。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_30|不知什么时候，覆盖在你手上的那双手显露出了形体。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Dreamy_Memories_109BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_31|那是一双被洁白手套包裹的手，修长而优雅。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_32|你回过头去，看见了身后那双手的主人——哈姆林冷淡的脸上一闪而过的无奈。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1796,3,Sad)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise2.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_33|是你！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        Sequence = "SetRole(1796,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_34|你想要站起，一阵令人天旋地转的头晕阻止了你。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_35|那双戴着洁白手套的手轻轻按住了你的肩膀，从虚空中取出了一支长笛。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_36|那长笛的形貌虚幻难辨，却莫名让你感到安心。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1796,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_37|请休息吧，我会守候在您左右。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Hamulin_Love_120BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_38|哈姆林将长笛凑在唇边，飘渺的笛声环绕在你耳畔，如同温柔环抱的双手。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_39|难以抑制的困倦席卷了你，你趴在了钢琴上，沉沉地进入了香甜的梦乡。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"closeEye"}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_40|哈姆林的目光落在你安眠的睡颜，一声模糊的呢喃飘散在静谧的夜晚，无人听闻。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1796,3,Smile)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1796,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57723_Content_41|永远，永远……",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [61921] = {
    ID = 61921,
    CnID = "繁衍狂欢_塔薇",
    BaseSortID = 43,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 43,
        Content = "AvgDialog_61921_Content_1|你被不定形的噩梦缠绕，古怪的情思攫住你的意识，令梦境变得颠倒而浑浊。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_IllusionSpace"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Starlight_Escape_01"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_White_Tawei_79BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Floodlight"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_61921_Content_2|一滴清凉的液体如轻柔的吻落在你的额角，随之而来的是漫天银雨。\n你被雨丝唤醒。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"rain", 1},
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Rain_Smalle"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_61921_Content_3|呼、呼……",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"rain", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_BedRoom"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Heart_Beat"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Bedroom"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_61921_Content_4|宿舍的夜晚像是笼罩着一层纱幔，朦胧的声音在你的耳畔回荡。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1054,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_61921_Content_5|我在黑池等你。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Sequence = "FadeDarkRole(1054,1)",
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_SFX_VoiceOfTawii01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_61921_Content_6|……",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 5
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_61921_Content_7|洁白的轻纱掩住她的侧脸，萦绕黑池的水气仿佛她的延伸，将你拢入幻觉般的梦境。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"smoke", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_EmptyBlackPool"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1054,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_61921_Content_8|在万千梦境之中，她站在穷极之扉前，询问你无声的问题。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1054,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_61921_Content_9|来，到我身边来。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_SFX_VoiceOfTawii03"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_61921_Content_10|她回眸，目光平静淡漠，但你却无法抗拒她的言语。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Water_One_Walking_Slowly_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1054,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_61921_Content_11|再近一些。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_61921_Content_12|她倚靠在你的胸膛，你感觉到自己的呼吸变得急促。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Heart_Beat_Loop_01"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_61921_Content_13|塔薇拉住你的手，轻触黑池的水面。一圈圈涟漪向外荡开去。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Small_Water_Drop"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1054,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_61921_Content_14|你听见了吗？这是你心跳的鼓动。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_SFX_VoiceOfTawii02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1054,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_61921_Content_15|无论我在什么时代、哪个空间……你的呼吸和心跳都会通过这片池水传递给我。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1054,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_61921_Content_16|这还是第一次，我这样聆听你的心跳。\n和我日日夜夜听闻的同频共振，震耳欲聋。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_61921_Content_17|她抬眸望向你，灰绿色的瞳孔中弥散不明的思绪。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_61921_Content_18|你觉得四周好像又下雨了。\n黑池也会有雨吗？",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {
          "rain",
          1,
          "smoke",
          2
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Rain_Smalle"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_61921_Content_19|银色的雨丝，将你们二人细细密密地裹缠起来。\n这是只属于你和她的时间与空间。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1054,
          nil,
          "Shy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_61921_Content_20|你知道吗？她会后悔散布这样的欲念的……",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_SFX_VoiceOfTawii04"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1054,
          nil,
          "Shy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_61921_Content_21|你我之间的链接，远比她试图侵染你的，更深，更远……",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [57813] = {
    ID = 57813,
    CnID = "繁衍狂欢_本源朵尔",
    BaseSortID = 44,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 44,
        TalkRole = {1181},
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_1|守密人……滋滋……发现「朵尔」挣脱……黑池……你……危险……滋滋……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          2,
          "AvgVertical"
        },
        BgID = {
          "SScene_BedRoom"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_No_Signal"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Pressure_80BPM",
          "300"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_2|突然传来的银芯通讯断断续续熄灭了最后的声响，只言片语中透露出令你汗毛树立的危机。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise1.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_3|「朵尔」挣脱了黑池的禁锢？",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_4|你想起那双凝视着你的疯狂的眼睛，在直觉的驱使下立刻准备推门而出，抓紧时间与其他唤醒体会合。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_5|在你的手握上门把手的那一刻，浑身汗毛在本能预警下几乎刺痛地炸起，你在心悸中猛然蹲下。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Door_Handle"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "PlayVideo(Blade_Flash4.mp4)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Blade_Crossed_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_7|同一瞬间，一道锐利的风划过你的头顶，削断了几根飞扬的头发，宿舍的门板这才后知后觉地轰然倒地。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Paws_Snap_Ground"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_Wooden_Damaged",
          "800"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1246},
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_8|真可惜啊，没想到小狗狗居然趴在地上，来，握个手吧？",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Bad_Duoer_Stand_70BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_9|你抬起头，那双眼睛就这样从记忆中与现实重叠，在你面前居高临下地俯视着你，带着一如既往愉悦的笑意。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_10|你一面站起身缓缓后退着，一面艰难地开口询问。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Slow_Short"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_11|你忽然来找我，是看到了新的未来吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_12|「朵尔」就这样看着你，跟随着你的脚步一步步走近，仿佛你们一同跳着某种默契的舞蹈。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Two_Guys_Slow"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1246,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_13|未来是不会改变的，不过我最近忽然思绪丰富，福至心灵，终于想通了最快到达终点的办法。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_14|……什么办法？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_15|你配合地对她未完的陈述发问，背后却忽然碰到了坚实的墙壁。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_ClothesFriction_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1246,
          nil,
          "Threat"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_16|当然是……解决掉我们弥萨格里，这世界上最大的变数。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_17|在她话音未落的那一刻，你毫不犹豫地向侧方一滚，双臂护在头上，猛地扑向了墙上的窗户。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Fall_Down",
          "800"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Something_Flash"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Bad_Duoer_Crazy_108BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_18|玻璃哗啦应声碎裂，无数晶莹的碎片中倒映着你和「朵尔」的面庞，你以标准的缓冲姿势摔落在地，顾不得皮肤上划破的伤口，迈开双腿拼命奔跑起来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolDust"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Break_Glass"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_19|校园。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "continueShake",
          1
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Hurry001_Mid"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_20|走廊。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolCorridor"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Hurry001_Mid"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_21|地下通道。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolPassageway"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Hurry001_Mid"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_22|多少次你与那对死神的镰刀擦身而过，踉跄地撞在墙上，摔在拐角，却丝毫不敢停歇，只能在粗重的喘息中夺命奔逃。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "continueShake",
          2
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Fall_Down"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Cave_Peace_72BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1246},
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_23|真是我的好学生，就让老师给你上一节最好的实战训练课吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_24|毫不掩饰的疯狂笑声幽魂一样追在你身后，杀意几乎刺透你的后背，你再一次险而又险地扑在地上，背后是镰刀“锵”地插进金属管道的声音。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_SharpBlade"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_25|不明成分的烟雾蒸汽从管道里泄露出来，滚烫地弥漫在狭窄的空间中，遮挡了你们的视线。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"smoke", 1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Break_ironDoor"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Gas_Bang",
          "500"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_26|你敏锐地意识到了什么，立刻顺着管道的方向躲进了一间实验室。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Something_Flash"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_27|很快实验室紧闭的门就在几声巨响中破开，熟悉的声音一点点靠近。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"smoke", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SubLab"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Break_ironDoor"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1246},
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_28|躲猫猫的游戏就到此结束吧，能走到现在足够给你的期末成绩上加十分了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Step_Duoer"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_29|「朵尔」的镰刀划在地面上，发出尖锐的声响。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GunScratches_Ground"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1246,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_30|别害怕，等亲手毁了你，我会把你的尸体放在冰棺里好好珍藏的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1246},
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_31|你会是我最珍贵、最杰出的研究，我们还有很多很多时间在一起……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_32|朦胧的烟雾中她瞥到了屋子中央巨大仪器旁边的一片衣角，嘴角微微翘起。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1246},
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_33|在哪里呢？小狗狗，叫两声来听听。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_34|刺痛耳膜的金属摩擦忽然消失了，实验室中是死一般的寂静。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_35|时间在煎熬的等待中近乎凝固，她的声音终于再次出现，悄然如耳语。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1246,
          nil,
          "Threat"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_36|找到你了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thriller_01"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Hard_Crisis_124BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        Sequence = "PlayVideo(Blade_Flash2.mp4)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_SharpBlade"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_38|镰刀带着一击毙命的力度击向仪器，然而那颓然倒下的，只是一件轻飘飘的校服。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Blade_Crossed_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_39|趁镰刀卡在仪器上的一刻，你按下了手中紧攥的红色按钮，仪器熔炉的填料门灵敏地向两边开启，露出里面炼狱般的熔浆景象。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Mech_Door_Open"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_40|你出现在「朵尔」背后，用尽全力将她向熔炉中一推。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"flame", 1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_LightThe_Flame"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Be_Hit_Normal",
          "600"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Flame_Burning"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_41|火舌将她席卷吞没，「朵尔」讶异地回过头，眼中似乎还有几分模糊的欣赏，以及几分诡异的笑意。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1246,3,Surprised1)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_LightThe_Flame"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_42|你在不好的预感中低下头，看见人偶的另一只手抓住了你仅剩的上衣。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1246,3)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cloth_tear"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_43|双手下意识撑住了仪器的门框，高温的余韵立刻烫熟了你掌心的皮肤，在滋啦声中带来剧痛，你咬紧牙关与那股向内的巨力对抗着。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cloth_Bring_Here"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Burnt_Flesh_And_Blood_02",
          "600"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_44|人偶身躯的轮廓已经模糊在耀眼的火光中，只剩下那双眼睛，那双比火焰还要明亮的眼睛依然凝视着你。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_45|弥萨格的师生终于在接到你的定位求救信号后姗姗来迟，将你从熔炉前匆忙拉开。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_46|你们隔着火焰相望，在那张面孔化为灰烬前的那瞬间，你读到了她唇间最后的留言。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1246,
          nil,
          "Surprised2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_57813_Content_47|我们在终极再见。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [76411] = {
    ID = 76411,
    CnID = "繁衍狂欢_克莱门汀",
    BaseSortID = 45,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 45,
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_1|克莱门汀，你的脸……",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_ExamineRoom"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_AfterWar_Ver4_118BPM"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_2|你望着坐在对面，正准备为你做心理咨询的克莱门汀，只觉得对方的脸越来越红。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1913,3,Shy)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_3|难道是感冒了？可唤醒体也会感冒吗……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_4|你忍不住伸手碰触克莱门汀的额头，而随着这个动作，克莱门汀看向了你，神色比往常更加温柔。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Caress"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_5|她的眼眸不知何时染上了水光，双颊绯红，正微微喘息。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1913,3,Shy)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_6|等等，这不是感冒，而是圣河的影响……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1913,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_7|你的意思是，我这样是因为受到了圣河的影响？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_8|是的，在圣河地脉的影响下，唤醒体会……咳咳，会出现一些异常。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_9|但不必担心，这些异常很快就会消失。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1913,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_10|消失……呵。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_11|克莱门汀轻笑一声。\n她的脸颊红如滴血，正用力捂住心脏，整个身体轻微颤抖。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Dreamy_Memories_109BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1913,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_12|不，我不希望它消失。这种……这种……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_13|似乎不知该如何形容这种感觉，她向你靠近一步——却因无力软倒在你怀里。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Long_Skirt_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise1.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_14|……我看这次的心理咨询不如先暂时取消。",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Emm"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_15|克莱门汀，你好好休息，我下次再来……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_16|你急忙将克莱门汀扶到椅子上，准备离开，她却用力握住了你的手。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_17|那只手是热的，比平常更炽热，似火种点燃你的皮肤，又似囚笼牢牢将你抓住。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1913,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_18|我以为只有痛苦和绝望才会如此甘美，但原来，欲望本身也会带来甜蜜。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1913,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_19|而你，就是这甜蜜的源头，%player%。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_20|克莱门汀的笑容加深，专注地凝视着你，而你，无法动弹。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_21|周围的景色变得迷离起来，不知何处而来的花瓣飘落纷飞，落在你和克莱门汀的面前。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {
          "redFlower",
          1,
          "disturb",
          1
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Roses_Flying_01"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Starlight_Escape_01",
          "500"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Starlight"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise2.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_22|……我又被你拉进了心灵世界？",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_OMG"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1913,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_23|当然。躯壳所能带来的感官终究有限，心灵的世界才是感受的终极。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1913,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_24|来，凑近些——心理咨询可不能半途而废。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1913,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_76411_Content_25|在这个没有任何阻碍，超脱任何规则的心灵世界，让我好好地、好好地品尝这罕见的美味。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
