  [122697] = {
    ID = 122697,
    CnID = "繁衍狂欢_茉夏",
    BaseSortID = 53,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 53,
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_1|今日的天比平时暗得更快，且阴沉沉的，显然要下雨。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolDaytime"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Peace_School_Life_114BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Campus_Corner"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_2|为了避免淋湿的命运，你急匆匆跑向宿舍，却被一个人影拦住了去路。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2222,3,Serious)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Something_Flash"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_3|茉夏？有什么事吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_4|茉夏低着头，没有回答，你也只能从她用力握紧斧头而发白的手指上，察觉到少女并不平静的心情。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2222,3);DarkRole(2222,1)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          nil,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise2.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_5|<Shake:茉夏！？>",
        DialogType = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2222,3);DarkRole(2222,1)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_6|终于，少女开口了，声音却带着一丝迟疑和不确定。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        Sequence = "SetRole(2222,3);DarkRole(2222,1)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2222},
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_7|%player%，我、我需要你的帮助……",
        DialogType = 1,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2222,3);DarkRole(2222,1)",
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_8|帮助？没问题。你需要什么？",
        DialogType = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2222,3);DarkRole(2222,1)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Shy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_9|<Shake:我需要你……>",
        DialogType = 1,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2222,3);DarkRole(2222,1)",
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_10|茉夏抬起了头，染着不正常红晕的脸上，露出一种混杂着困惑和狂热的笑容。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2222,3,Crazy);DarkRole(2222,0)",
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Pressure_80BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Crazy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_11|和我战斗，立刻，马上！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Turn_Jump"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        RoleHide = {1},
        Sequence = "PlayVideo(Blade_Flash3.mp4)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Metal_Axe_Whoosh_Light_A"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Metal_Axe_Whoosh_Light_B",
          "650"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_13|未等你回答，茉夏的斧子就已经袭来，轻巧且有分寸地擦过你的脸颊，掀起一阵冰冷的风。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"speedLine", 1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Blade_Crossed_01",
          "Play_A_SFX_Zoom_In"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_14|那风未经允许就擅自闯入你的衣领，再灌入你的胸膛，令你的身体本能地泛起鸡皮疙瘩。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_ShyWind"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          nil,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise1.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_15|怎么一言不合就打起来了！？",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"speedLine", 2},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_16|你的质问被斧子和斧子的主人忽略了。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2222,3,Crazy)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_17|<Shake:茉夏？>",
        DialogType = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2222,3,Crazy)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_18|茉夏！？",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        Sequence = "SetRole(2222,3,Crazy)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_19|在你的连续追问下，斧子终于停了。它贴着你的肩膀，深深揳入墙壁。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Knife_Block02"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_ShatterStone"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_20|而斧子的主人，就站在你眼前，面色潮红，握紧拳头，用力拽住了你的衣领。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        Sequence = "SetRole(2222,3,Crazy)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_ClothesFriction_02"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Peaceful_Life_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Crazy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_21|<Shake:别吵……我现在很难受，只有和你战斗才能好受一些……>",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_22|抓住你衣领的手指继续用力，从肉色变为苍白，昭示着主人的倔强与不甘。",
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_23|我最讨厌别人将想法强加在他人身上……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Crazy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_24|区区圣河而已，就想影响我？<Shake:未免……太小瞧我了。>",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_25|茉夏说着用力吐气，以此平复圣河对她的影响，但你能感觉到她体内奔涌的热度，流窜的渴望，和挣扎的冲突。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Heart_Beat_Loop_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_26|察觉到茉夏的情绪，你不由得叹了口气，拉住她的手，引导少女重新握住了斧柄。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_27|<Shake:你做什么？>",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_28|不是想要战斗吗？那就战斗。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_29|无论你想要以什么方式战斗，无论你想要战斗到什么时候，我都奉陪到底。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_30|……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_31|少女的眼睛骤然瞪大，意外地看着你。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_32|这时候，那场预谋已久的雨终于落下，有雨滴落在茉夏的脸上，从她的下巴滑落，再没入你的衣领，顺着你的胸膛流淌而下。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"rain", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolGround"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Rain_Smalle"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Dreamy_Memories_109BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_33|随后，是更多的雨滴，狂野地敲击着地面，拍打着你和少女的脸颊，带来一些痒意。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_34|<Shake:哈哈哈哈，我喜欢你的回答。>",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Crazy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_35|事情开始变得意思起来了，不是吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_36|茉夏握住斧柄，将斧头从墙壁抽回来，但她并没有再挥动斧头，而是望向你，直视你。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Knife_Friction"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2220,
          nil,
          "Shy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_37|通常，我不会和人空手格斗，但有时候也要尝试一下新事物，对不对？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2220,
          nil,
          "Crazy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_38|人生这么长，一些有趣的事情，可要亲自、慢慢地体会。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_122697_Content_39|茉夏说着，慢慢走向你。而那柄斧头，也静静倚在墙壁，接受着世界湿漉漉的洗礼。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Bad_Misty_2"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [125040] = {
    ID = 125040,
    CnID = "繁衍狂欢_徐",
    BaseSortID = 54,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 54,
        Content = "AvgDialog_125040_Content_1|圣河泛滥给弥萨格带来了空前的麻烦，意外地，徐的房间居然成为了你少有的能用来避难的地方。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_BedRoom"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Flirt_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Mist"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_125040_Content_2|圣河完全没有给你带来影响吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2225, "Smile"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_125040_Content_3|不知是因为力量来源同为三大质体，还是太过擅长欢场之道，妾身似乎并没有什么杂念。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "VOC_AVG_B14_Rstory01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_125040_Content_4|那双美丽的眼睛笑意盈盈，数枚白色棋子轻巧地磕打着棋盘，它们的主人很热衷于用这种来自东方的古老游戏打发时间。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Go_Put_Board_A"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Go_Put_Board_B",
          "1500"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Go_Put_Board_C",
          "3000"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Vocal"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2225, "ShutEye"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_125040_Content_5|人类是种很奇怪的东西，会为一时的欢愉形貌失仪，得到以后，又立刻露出意兴索然的样子。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "VOC_AVG_B14_Rstory02"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2225},
        Content = "AvgDialog_125040_Content_6|年年岁岁都得见，岁岁年年两相厌。唯有替他们编织幻象，引他们舍生忘死，剖心挖肝，他们才永不能忘。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "VOC_AVG_B14_Rstory03"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_125040_Content_7|摇曳的烛光勾勒出女人端坐在床，影绰晦暗的轮廓。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Vocal"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_125040_Content_8|天不知何时已经完全暗了，她发出一声轻笑。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2225,3,Smile)",
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Peaceful_Life_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2225, "Smile"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_125040_Content_9|逼良家下海，劝@2从良。妾身很擅长这种戏码呢，编一个真真假假的故事，再让他们看见扇下这张或是心有亏欠，或是爱而不得的脸。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "VOC_AVG_B14_Rstory04"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2225, "Shy"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_125040_Content_10|妾身可以是一个谎言，一丝旖念，唯独是妾身自己时……无趣至极。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "VOC_AVG_B14_Rstory05"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise2.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_125040_Content_11|呃……徐？",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Vocal"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_125040_Content_12|雾。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"smoke", 1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_Play_A_SFX_SteamFly"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Fog"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_125040_Content_13|轻薄的，如丝如缕的雾，层层叠叠地将你萦绕其中。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Angry.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_125040_Content_14|<LightGray:不是没有影响吗？不是聊天下棋吗！你们唤醒体，为什么都，说一套做一套啊！>",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Emm"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_125040_Content_15|如闪烁鎏金般的虚影从余光划过，绸缎似的触感绑缚住你的手臂和脊背，指引你掀起雾组成的帷幕。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Caress02"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Qianshan_finish_00BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2225},
        Content = "AvgDialog_125040_Content_16|啊呀，因为妾身真的、真的很好奇。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        Sequence = "FadeDarkRole(2225,1)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "VOC_AVG_B14_Rstory06"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2225, "ShutEye"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_125040_Content_17|他们触碰妾身时，触碰的是幻影。看向妾身时，是透过妾身，看着他们「认为」的所爱之人。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "VOC_AVG_B14_Rstory07"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2225},
        Content = "AvgDialog_125040_Content_18|但您是不一样的，您有代入谁的影子吗，若您一探究竟，会在妾身的扇下，看到谁的面容呢……？",
