        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_8|期间没人去过厨房，也就是说，艾瑞卡小姐同样没有不在场证明……",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pencil_Writing"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1156,
          nil,
          "Smile3"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_9|很遗憾，侦探小姐。站在我们的角度来看，你、守密人以及莱克先生也很可疑哦~",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1179,
          nil,
          "Scared"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_10|可、可我和莱克先生一直在一起，对吧老大？",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_11|无人回应汉娜略带心虚的呼唤。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_12|就在房屋的另一头，侦探先生和他的临时助理已经开启了现场调查。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1182,3);FadeDarkRole(1182,1)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_13|两只鞋子都不见了。颈部的勒痕也有两道，真奇怪。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_14|你用放大镜细细观察德克斯特先生脖颈上的两条勒痕。它们的走向几乎一致，只不过有些许倾斜角度的差异。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AnimState = "avg_dialog_Amplification",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_15|两道勒痕的纹路也不一致。里面是很规整的菱形结构，外面的更加粗糙……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1125},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_16|或许是中途绳子断了，或许是沾上了血迹，于是凶手又更换了一条绳子。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1125},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_17|不论如何，两道勒痕都从颈部前面经过下颚，再蔓延至耳部后侧，朝着后头顶逐渐消失……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_18|这是上吊自杀才会出现的勒痕。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1125,
          nil,
          "Sharp"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_19|不，不对……勒痕附近有抓伤痕迹，说明死者经历过剧烈的挣扎。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_20|也可能是上吊后又开始后悔了？我听说过类似的案例。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1125,
          nil,
          "Sharp"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_21|如果没有那盘黑胶唱片的话，十个警察有九个到这里就要按照自杀结案了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1125},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_22|而我就是那仅存的、目光如炬的十分之一！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_23|黑胶唱片？",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Fog_001_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1179,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_24|守密人%sirormadam%当时不在现场吧！有一盘黑胶唱片不断循环播放德克斯特先生的声音，像幽灵一样……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1125,4)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Whisper"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_25|突然挤入你们中间的汉娜绘声绘色地描述着，又忍不住打了个寒战。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1179,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_26|老大，刚才我们找了一圈都没看到索蕾尔夫人的踪影。难道她已经……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_27|莱克自信地摆了摆手。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1125},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_28|很快你们就会知道她在哪里了。这案子和我当年侦办过的第一起凶杀案几乎一模一样。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1179,
          nil,
          "Scared"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_29|这就是老大刚才所谓“直觉”的由来么……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1125,
          nil,
          "Laugh"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_30|咳咳，真不好意思。的确如此。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1179,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_31|黑胶唱片、荒芜宅邸、神秘上吊的男主人……汉娜也想起来了！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1179,
          nil,
          "Smart1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_32|《神秘狗头男子破获豪门惊情》，我到现在都还能记得当年的新闻头条！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1125,
          nil,
          "Wonder"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_33|狗头？这是你自己胡诌的标题吧，在外我一直都以翩翩君子的形象示人。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_34|一提及莱克的过去，你立刻来了兴趣，将汉娜拽了过来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1125},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1179,3,Serious)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cloth_Bring_Here"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_35|<Small:说起来，我一直觉得这家伙的侦探身份很可疑。>",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_36|<Small:要知道在伦蒂尼恩，破获一起案件能获得的酬劳远不如待在赌桌上十分钟的收益。>",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_37|<Small:或许所谓的侦探身份只是个幌子……>",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1125,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_38|请收回你对我的人身攻击，守密人%player%。赌徒也是可以有自己的爱好和事业的。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_ExamineRoom"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1125},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_39|咦，这里怎么还放了个棺材？德克斯特的品味可真不敢恭维。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_40|！！！",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_41|别碰它！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_42|话音未落，侦探已经漫不经心地朝棺材踢了两脚。回应他的，是死一般的寂静。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Chest"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Strange_001_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_43|奇怪……它对你的触碰似乎毫无反应？",
        DialogType = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1125,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1125},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_44|哦？那你倒是说说看，它应该有什么样的反应呢？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_45|你将先前遭遇的种种告诉了莱克。",
        DialogType = 7
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1125,
          nil,
          "Sharp"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_46|原来如此……我明白了！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1125,
          nil,
          "Twinkie"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_47|这里面一定装着一具神秘的、魔法高强的至尊木乃伊！",
        DialogType = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_kawayi"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_48|莱克忽然蹲下身子，嘴里说着你完全听不懂的“外语”。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1125,
          nil,
          "Laugh"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_49|泥蒿！珩篙緈 见稲泥@3！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_50|……你在说什么？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1125,
          nil,
          "Laugh"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_51|勒姆瓦西语啊。蜗晈萊壳，泥晈森嚒闵缁？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_52|面对外界友善却稍显难懂的问候，黑棺依旧肃穆，不发一语。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Set_Avg_Mus_As_More"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_53|好了，别玩了。我听过亚兰的古语，发音和你没有一丁点相似之处。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1125,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_54|啧，真没意思。接着干正事吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_55|莱克起身悠闲地伸了个懒腰，朝空中打了两个响指。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Snap_Fingers"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Snap_Fingers",
          "500"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1125,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_56|好了各位，我已经知道凶手是谁了。为了节约时间，我就省略推理过程，直接带你们抓人吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1039},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_57|……？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1156},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_58|噗嗤。要是有小说家敢像莱克先生这样推动剧情，恐怕早就被愤怒的读者悬吊在路灯下了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1156,
          nil,
          "Smile1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_59|连一点小小的提示也不愿意分享吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_60|莱克有些烦躁地抓了抓头发。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Purr"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1125,
          nil,
          "Sharp"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_61|黑胶唱片。它的存在很可能是凶手想制造不在场证据，将案发时间延后。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1125},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_62|也就是说，就在黑胶唱片播放死者声音的同时，凶手事实上正在案发现场。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1125},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_63|巧妙的诡计，但很不幸，我并未按照凶手设想的套路行动。听到声音后，我没有选择离开，而是把门踹开了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1125,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_64|合格的侦探拆解罪犯的不在场证明，卓越的侦探从根源上掐断罪犯的不在场证明！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "avg_dialog_Amplification",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Zoom_In"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1125},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_65|记下这句至理名言了吗，汉娜？",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Set_Avg_Mus_As_More_And_More"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1179,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_66|啊？记、记下了，老大！",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pencil_Writing"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1179,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_67|不过老大，你刚才说凶手就在案发现场……那……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_68|莱克掏出手枪，迈着悠闲的步伐向前走去。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pistol_loaded_01"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Old_Wooden_Floor",
          "500"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1125},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_69|接下来请出我们从案发到现在都未曾出现，只能慌乱地缩在暗处的凶手小姐。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_70|侦探在衣柜前停下脚步，在门上轻轻敲了两声。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_OldCall_Door",
          "500"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1125},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_71|还想躲到最后一刻吗？那我可就不客气了——",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_72|侦探有些苦恼地用枪管在太阳穴蹭了蹭，随后一把拉开衣柜门。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Wood_Door_Pure"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1125,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_73|索蕾尔……",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"bloodSmoke", 1},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1137,3,Death)",
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Surrounded_66BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1125,
          nil,
          "Wonder"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_74|？！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_75|索蕾尔夫人！！！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_76|没有拙劣的辩解，没有狼狈的躲藏，也没有痛哭流涕的忏悔。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_77|只有索蕾尔的尸体安静地靠在角落，眉心的弹孔显得分外刺眼，仿佛在嘲笑侦探那自以为是的卖弄。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_WaterDrop"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1125,
          nil,
          "Wonder"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_78|不……这不可能……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1797},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_79|锵锵锵！",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"bloodSmoke", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Stage"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Ghost_ChildSmile_01"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Psychedelic_Mist"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1797},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_80|我好像听到有人给出了错误推理哦！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1797,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_81|诬陷一个清白无辜的人类可是无法被饶恕的重罪，接下来就是惩罚时间了！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_82|N有些苦恼地托着圆圆的下巴。每当祂思索的时候，面部雾气涌动的速度也会慢下来。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1797,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_58292_Content_83|惩罚，惩罚……该杀掉谁好呢？",
