      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1920},
        Content = "AvgDialog_81527_Content_64|（保护她么……)",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_81527_Content_65|虽然他对泰旖丝口中含糊的解释一概不信，但他也能看出，泰旖丝的身体确实十分虚弱。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_81527_Content_66|即便有着无尽的疑问，此刻也不是猜忌的时候，只因有一个对沙漠了如指掌的向导，实在过于令人安心了。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_81527_Content_67|那是沙蝎，去除毒囊之后可以烤着吃，味道出人意料的好呢。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_DesertDust"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_WastelandDaytime"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_81527_Content_68|为什么找不到仙人掌？靠人的感官的确难以寻找，但，跟随动物的脚步，你就很容易发现惊喜。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_81527_Content_69|会换着脚站立的蜥蜴，扭动斜行的沙蛇，能高高跳起的小鼠，还有迅猛凶狠的红鹰……",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_81527_Content_70|卡斯托尔一路都睁大着眼睛，听泰旖丝娓娓道来着沙漠中奇特的生灵、多变的气候，以及种种生存的技巧。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_81527_Content_71|小家伙，我发现你不是不了解沙漠的外乡人。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_DesertNight"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_AfterWar_Ver4_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_WastelandNight"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_81527_Content_72|泰旖丝拄着下巴，看卡斯托尔笨拙地串起沙蝎，又将干枯的树枝直接伸进了篝火中，最后手忙脚乱地把烧起的树枝直接丢进了火堆。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleShake = {1920},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1134,2,Smile);SetRole(1920,4,Sad)",
        AudioTalk = {"、"},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_RoomFire02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_81527_Content_73|你是根本不了解任何生存的常识，就像一个刚刚学会走路的幼儿。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_81527_Content_74|卡斯托尔沉默着，半晌才忽然回话。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1920,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_81527_Content_75|也可以这么说。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_81527_Content_76|泰旖丝看了看抱着膝盖垂头丧气的卡斯托尔，熟练地重新串好一串沙蝎，悠然靠近了火上翻烤。",
