      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1920},
        Content = "AvgDialog_81527_Content_83|为什么？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_81527_Content_84|亚兰盛行以繁衍为核心的种族文化，我们相信同日而生的孩子们享有共通的命运。至于相互依偎着诞生的双生子……更是注定一生命运纠缠。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_81527_Content_85|所以，在下一片生命的绿洲，你们一定会重新相聚的。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1920},
        Content = "AvgDialog_81527_Content_86|又是传说么……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        Audio = {
          "Set_Avg_Mus_As_More"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_81527_Content_87|卡斯托尔摇了摇头，转念他又浮起一丝希冀。",
