        ChatID = "51",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_51|这位女士，你是否认错人了？我既不知道什么卡牌大师，也不知道什么是万象牌。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "52",
        TalkRole = {8002},
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_52|万象牌就是你在这里跟其他人对战用的东西啊。这些卡牌都是我设计的，化成灰我都认得出来！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "53",
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_53|伊格娜蒂丝女士，守密人在这里进行的是由弥萨格大学独立研发并进行优化改造的相位对弈，并非什么万象牌。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "54",
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_54|或许从底层框架及运行逻辑上看，这两者之间存在某种因泛用规则而导致的相似之处，但这不意味着你是原初的缔造者。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "55",
        TalkRole = {
          8002,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_55|什么！你说这些不是万象牌……\n嘶，好像……虽然大部分规则都一样，但细微之处的确有所不同……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        RoleShake = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_OMG"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "56",
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_56|既然这样，能否请你解除空间叠加现象呢？这里并不存在你要找的卡牌大师。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "57",
        TalkRole = {8002},
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_57|<Small:……好，就这么办。>",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "58",
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_58|你说什么？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Nizhuan_Stand_120BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "59",
        TalkRole = {
          8002,
          nil,
          "Laugh"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_59|既然如此，就来收集橡果吧！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "60",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_60|橡果？",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "61",
        TalkRole = {8002},
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_61|没错，橡果！橡果是实力的证明，也是所有传奇的开始！收集最多的橡果成为最强的卡牌大师吧！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        RoleHide = {1118},
        Sequence = "SetRole(8002,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "62",
        TalkRole = {8002},
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_62|既然都是卡牌决斗者，争端当然要通过决斗来解决！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "63",
        TalkRole = {
          8002,
          nil,
          "Smile2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_63|我能感觉到，曾经有无数来自不同时空的你在这里进行对决，那么就请决出你们中的佼佼者，与我来一场酣畅淋漓的决斗吧！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "64",
        TalkRole = {
          8002,
          nil,
          "Smile3"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_64|从现在开始，每场对局中，都会根据对局的战况和结果产生魔法橡果，尽情地进行决斗，获得更多的橡果吧！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "65",
        TalkRole = {
          8002,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_65|当你收集到一定数量的橡果的时候，我就会同意跟你决斗！如果我输了，那我就不再纠缠你们，并且将整个空间还原！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "66",
        TalkRole = {8002},
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_66|但如果没收集到或者我赢了的话……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "67",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_67|我们要付出什么？",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "68",
        TalkRole = {
          8002,
          nil,
          "Laugh"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_68|这里就要变成万象酒馆的分店，你也要来当服务生！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        RoleShake = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cute_Cartoon"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "69",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_69|很遗憾，这个代价太大了，我不能接受，拉蒙娜……",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "70",
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_70|<Small:（通讯声）……是这样么，好，我知道了。守密人，我们可以接受这个条件(小声)>",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_No_Signal"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "71",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_71|<Small:什么？但是万一我输了的话……>",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_emmm"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "72",
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_72|<Small:别担心，这就是我说的第二种方法，通过对方主观的意识控制，来逆向整体空间的侵蚀状态，从而解除叠加现象。>",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "73",
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_73|<Small:这种可沟通的知性对象属于极其罕见的个例，如果我们成功让其主动解除影响，所获得的实验数据将极大地推进项目进度。>",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "74",
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_74|<Small:即使<Yellow:%player%>输了也不要紧，到时候我会启动另外的计划。>",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "75",
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_75|<Small:而且……我相信我的守密人。>",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "76",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_76|<Small:拉蒙娜……>\n……好，我们接受这个条件。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "77",
        TalkRole = {
          8002,
          nil,
          "Smile2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_77|很好！那么就这么说定了！让我们开始传奇的序幕吧！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "78",
        TalkRole = {8002},
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_78|（哼哼，虽然这些卡牌确实跟万象牌不同，但不管怎么看，他们的底层逻辑都是一样的！）",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "79",
        TalkRole = {8002},
        Content = "AvgDialog_75907_Content_79|（这种情况下，作为万象牌的创造者，我绝对不可能输！这片空间和服务生我就笑纳啦！终于可以把分店开起来啦！）",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
