      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89875_Content_8|是的，塞勒菲斯的所有生命……都回归了父神的怀抱。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1874},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89875_Content_9|「时光凝固的村庄」？这下它的时光真的凝固了。不过原因是什么？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89875_Content_10|根据我的研究，一个地方不会无缘无故发生这种<Yellow:灵性异常>现象。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89875_Content_11|灵性异常……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89875_Content_12|萨尔瓦多的神色变得严肃起来，向你们倾吐来龙去脉。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89875_Content_13|几天前，我接到基金会的求救，来这里进行调查。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89875_Content_14|当时，还有两个人幸存。我亲眼……看着他们遭受苦难，变成怪物，却无能为力。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Sarewa_Comfort_66BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89875_Content_15|怪物？所以塞勒菲斯才没有人，因为所有人都变成了怪物！？",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89875_Content_16|是的。根据他们生前的描述，我认为这些异常都与一个叫做「奥瑞塔」的孩子有关。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise1.png"
        },
        Chapter = "奥瑞塔？",
        DialogAnim = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89875_Content_18|你想到那个总是天真快乐的身影，摇了摇头。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1165,3)",
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89875_Content_19|不，奥瑞塔绝不会做这样的事情……",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89875_Content_20|但如果这些是她无意中引起的呢？身为守密人，你清楚唤醒体的危险性。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89875_Content_21|……",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89875_Content_22|你沉默，无法说出心中的反驳，只能无声凝视萨尔瓦多和熔毁·朵尔。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1874,2,Serious);SetRole(1135,4)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89875_Content_23|这时，打斗声出现，替你打破了有些微妙的氛围。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Blade_Crossed_01"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Monster_Roar_Die",
          "250"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_PressureTop_80BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89875_Content_24|难道是幸存者？",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89875_Content_25|愿父神怜悯，哪怕只能拯救一个人，也是有意义的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89875_Content_26|你们开始向着打斗声的来源移动。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"speedLine", 1},
