        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89882_Content_4|似乎和那位姐妹的……很像。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1169},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89882_Content_5|不是很像，是一模一样。只是这个，是完整的。",
