      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1169,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89882_Content_6|看来那个可爱的女孩不只交了我一个「朋友」。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89882_Content_7|交朋友？呵，恐怕是<Yellow:被利用，成为了邪恶祭祀的一部分>吧。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Thriller"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89882_Content_8|一瞬间，你的心情沉重万分。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "avg_dialog_Lessen",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Zoom_Out"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89882_Content_9|无论如何，奥瑞塔都造成了无法挽回的伤害。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1165,3)",
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89882_Content_10|……这就是我必须找到奥瑞塔的原因。",
        DialogType = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1165,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89882_Content_11|她是个沉浸于自己世界里的孩子，不会知道也无法理解自己的行为……会造成多么恐怖的后果。",
        DialogType = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1165,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89882_Content_12|我明白了，苍白的使者。你在尝试拯救那个孩子，免除她无意间施加于他人的痛苦。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1165}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89882_Content_13|这亦是善举。我愿秉承父神的旨意，竭尽全力相助。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1169},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89882_Content_14|我当然也愿意。除了被我雕塑完成，卓越的材料不应该以其他方式浪费。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "CH1",
        NextChatID = {"A1", "A2"},
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "ShutEye2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89882_Content_15|啧……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "A1",
        Content = "AvgDialog_89882_Content_16|碰触象牙雕像",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "A1_TO",
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89882_Content_17|你确定要接触这个古怪的祭祀雕像？我们对它一无所知。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        NextChatID = {"CH1_END"},
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89882_Content_18|所以我才要这么做。碰触真相，接近真相，揭开真相。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "A2",
        Content = "AvgDialog_89882_Content_19|看向熔毁·朵尔",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "A2_TO",
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "ShutEye2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89882_Content_20|好吧。不过是卷入麻烦里而已。过去我们已经无数次这么做过了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        NextChatID = {"CH1_END"},
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89882_Content_21|去吧，我的小狗。我就在这里，保证你的安全。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "CH1_END",
        Content = "AvgDialog_89882_Content_22|你深呼吸，然后伸手，碰触那完整的象牙头雕。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89882_Content_23|一瞬间，强烈的冲击自你的灵魂深处扩散，你看到无数的光与影。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_IllusionWhite"
        },
