        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_5|守密人，抱歉打扰你的休息，但我……突然想来见见你。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_6|是因为那个关于诺第留斯号的梦吗？",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_7|梦？这么说梦中的那个人，确实是你。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise1.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_8|……你是怎么认出我的？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_9|从你说不会放手的那一刻开始。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_10|守密人，作为一个经验丰富的领航员，我分得清一个乘客跟随我行动的真正目的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1171},
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_11|而且你的眼神，我见过太多次。合格的领航员，会记住船上的每个船员。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Sweat.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_12|……但我不是船员。算了，这不重要。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_emmm"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_13|诺第留斯号最终怎么样了？我这算是中途掉线，想知道结局。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_14|结局……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_15|克珀珊特说着，脸上露出掺杂着骄傲的微笑。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_16|我履行了领航员的职责，成功引领诺第留斯号抢滩登陆。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_17|那海怪呢？",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_18|离开了。融蚀浆燃烧释放的光芒照亮了整片海域，又不惧风雨，它不得不离开。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Kebo_BeLove_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_19|等等，融蚀浆燃烧？难道你——",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_20|这是那个情况下我能想到的唯一办法。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_21|甲板进水，帆布和其他可燃物都被暴雨和海水浸湿，再加上海怪，我必须迅速做出选择。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_22|……那后来呢？",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_23|你在……之后，应该已经无法再指引航线了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_24|……是的，我无法行动，无法言语，无法看见，处于死亡状态，但我仍能听到一些微弱的声音。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_25|我听到舵手的呼喊，重复“右满舵”“跟随光线，保持当前航向”，也听到许多人的哭声和尖叫。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_DeckNight"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_26|最重要的是，我听到了岸防炮空包弹的声音，那是海港在抢救诺第留斯号幸存者。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Dock"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_27|再之后的事情，我想你身为守密人，应该比我更加清楚。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_BedRoomDay"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_28|是的，相关档案里记载了诺第留斯号成为幽灵船的始末，并且将它那次回港称为奇迹。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_29|那是你创造的奇迹，是生命的奇迹。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_30|不，我只是做了自己应该做的事情。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_31|……事实上，这已经超出了“职责”的范畴。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_32|克珀珊特的脸上露出困惑的神色，似乎无法理解这句话。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1171,3,Surprised)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_33|那我换种说法，在做这些事情时，你在想些什么？",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_34|履行自己身为领航员的职责。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Speechless.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_35|……除了这个呢？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_36|应该是在回忆《领航员挽歌》。这是在领航员间口口相传的歌谣，如果我没有死亡，我也会将它教给我的学徒。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Sweat.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_37|……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_38|你陷入沉默，不知该说些什么，但克珀珊特的表情始终平静。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_39|那首歌谣是这样的——",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Unknown_Universe"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_40|六分仪闪亮，海图清晰铺展，我们解读南十字星的暗语，测算汪洋大海的秘密。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Meteor"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_41|我们用凡俗的铜与铁，丈量星辰的轨迹，但无尽的深渊有自己的算法，阴晴不定。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_42|年轻的领航员啊，你终将被咸水拥入怀中，化为引路的磷火。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SeaRuins"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Coral_Inthe_Sea"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_43|但不必害怕，潮汐黑册将记载你的名讳，令咆哮的怒涛为你奏响永恒的安魂曲。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "sacrifice"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_44|所以，在我成为领航员的时候，就已经预见了死亡的那一日。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_BedRoomDay"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Bedroom"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_45|……",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_46|你再次沉默，许久之后才叹了一口气。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_47|我明白了，做出这一切牺牲，都是你心甘情愿的选择。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_48|是的。所以之后，我也会尽职尽责地领航，在你们需要我的时候。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_49|那现在，我就有一个非常重要的任务交给你。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_50|克珀珊特瞬间站直身体，端正神色。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1171,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_51|领航员克珀珊特已就位，请守密人指示。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_52|现在，和我出去，放松放松自己。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_53|在我看来，唤醒体有义务听从指挥，相应的，我也有责任照顾唤醒体。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_54|就从伦敦的海事博物馆开始吧，反正没有任务，让我们出去玩一天。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_55|说完，你拉着克珀珊特离开房间。你有预感，今天会成为克珀珊特人生中最轻松的一天。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_78942_Content_56|9月14日，旅店\n在守密人的陪同下，我度过了人生最轻松的一日。\n然而前一日梦中的记忆如影随形，肌肉痉挛、骨骼裂解、血肉燃烧，每一口呼吸都痛苦万分。\n但我并不后悔自己的选择。只要船只还在，我就必须完成自己的职责，过去是这样，现在也是这样。\n因为从成为领航员的那一刻，我就已经决定了自己的终局。\n——克珀珊特",
        DialogType = 11,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Sequence = "SlowCaption",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pencil_Writing"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [91726] = {
    ID = 91726,
    CnID = "罗马特别活动_关卡1_前",
    BaseSortID = 1,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 1,
        Content = "AvgDialog_91726_Content_1|奴隶与奴隶主",
        Chapter = "Culinary Dominion;Slave and Master;Part 1",
        DialogType = 4,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_UI_AVG_Chapter_Pop"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        },
        BanSpeedUp = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Angry2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91726_Content_2|由于银芯的物理特性，调查员在使用银芯制品时应注意……以下几个……",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_StudentDorm"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Agelipa_Fun2_84BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Bedroom"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Null"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91726_Content_3|及格……几……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91726_Content_4|砰的一声，阿格里帕一点一点的脑袋一下砸到了宿舍的书桌上，撞出了一块清晰的红印。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleShake = {1140},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Be_Hit_Normal"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Angry1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91726_Content_5|好痛！@2，我为什么要在这里抄这些愚蠢的烂书！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cartoon_Angry3"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91726_Content_6|阿格里帕捂着额头惊醒，呲牙咧嘴地瞪着本子上自己歪七扭八的错字。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91726_Content_7|那写错的及格两个字又让她想起了朵尔轻蔑的眼神和这些可恶的罚抄作业——没错，她又一次在考试中取得了个位数的好成绩。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1140},
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolOffice"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1120,3)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_White_Ocean"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Furious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91726_Content_8|及格，及格，又是及格，不及格能怎么样？老娘不伺候了！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1120},
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_StudentDorm"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cartoon_Angry4"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Bedroom"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91726_Content_9|阿格里帕恼怒地抓起本子想要撕掉，一想起朵尔那些折磨人的手段，最终又悻悻地停下了手，愤恨地将书角塞进了嘴里狠狠咬着。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hemp_rope_friction2"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Angry2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91726_Content_10|去死吧，去死吧，什么作业，什么大学都去死吧！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cartoon_Angry"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hemp_rope_friction",
          "500"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91726_Content_11|然而无能的啃咬并不能让未完成的作业减少半分，甚至还让被关在宿舍许久的她感到了一丝饥饿。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91726_Content_12|因为又一次将宿舍的生活用品都用坏了，阿格里帕于昨日对艾继丝进行了入室抢劫，并与闻声赶来的詹金大打出手。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_StudentDorm"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1140,5,Angry2);SetRole(1154,3,Angry);SetRole(1136,1)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Big_Memory_Confusion"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_White_Ocean"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91726_Content_13|最终荣获了罚抄翻倍和禁足三天的惩罚。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91726_Content_14|烤肉、鸡翅、薯条、罗宋汤，还有脆脆的黄油面包……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1154, 1136},
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_StudentDorm"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_emmm"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Bedroom"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91726_Content_15|阿格里帕回想起这所学校里唯一令她喜爱的部分——那些餐厅里任取任吃的美味菜肴，终于甩了甩头，一拍桌子站了起来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Turn_Jump",
          "500"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_hit_table_angry"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Furious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91726_Content_16|去他的禁闭，凭什么关着我，老娘想去哪就去哪！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cartoon_Angry4"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91726_Content_17|趁着夜深人静，她鬼鬼祟祟地撬开了房门，发觉四下无人后，气势汹汹地向厨房潜行而去。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleExit = {1140},
        ExitDirection = {"1140:1"},
