          "Angry2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_9|然后我们的名字就会被挂在通告板上，被整个弥萨格嘲笑，笑话我们是两只愚蠢的老鼠。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Angry2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_10|我的荣誉，我的尊严，一切都毁了！说不定我还要被罚更久的禁闭和更多的抄写……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Furious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_11|可我还什么都没有吃！连一片菜叶都没有吃到！！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_12|在阿格里帕喋喋不休的抱怨中，尤乌哈希尝试了各种攻击的手段。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1140},
        RoleShake = {1141},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1141,3,Angry2)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Fist_fight"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Knife_Block",
          "2000"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_13|然而刚刚合上的那两块地板就像是被重新浇筑过，连一道缝隙都找不到了。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_14|阿格里帕回想起自己来到弥萨格以来的种种生活，想起那些天书一样的课本，写满了她不明白的知识。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolOffice"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1140,3,Sad)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Emo_89BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_White_Ocean"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_15|还有那些完全变了样的建筑、习俗、发明用品，消失的奴隶制和被迫独立的生活。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1140},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolDaytime"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_16|从前理所应当的生活变成了闯祸、被罚、再次闯祸的轮回，期间充满了其他人的叹息、嫌弃，甚至敌意。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1154,4,Angry);SetRole(1120,2,ShutEye)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_17|世界的法则一夕颠覆，她勉强维持着身为奴隶主的尊严，却只感到一次又一次的不适应。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1154, 1120},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_StudentDorm"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1140,3,Sad)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Big_Memory_Confusion"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_18|就像一条搁浅在过去的沙滩上，无法追赶上新的浪潮的鱼。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_19|此刻，许久未曾进食的、那种虚幻的饥饿感再次笼罩了她。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Recover_Remember"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_20|那种空虚带给她的并不是出于生存必需的痛苦，而是失去了一切的、莫大的委屈。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_21|我只是想吃一块肉……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_22|放出去探索的子嗣也无功而返，阿格里帕崩溃地抱住膝盖，绝望地蜷缩成了一团。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Turn_Over"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_23|罗马完蛋了，我的人生也完蛋了。我们的世界连一粒灰都没有剩下，一切都被这个该死的新时代吞没了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_24|我受够了！我受够了这样的生活，受够了这个鬼地方，这里不属于我，也不属于你。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_25|尤乌哈希！我们再也回不去罗马了！那个金色的，充满火焰、鲜花和欢呼的地方，再也回不去了！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_26|尤乌哈希原本已经无所谓地坐在角落里，准备就这样等到天亮，却被阿格里帕吵得耳朵生疼。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1140},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1141,3,Serious)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_27|他用力地挖了挖耳朵，皱着眉打断了阿格里帕。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1141,3,Angry2)",
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1141,
          nil,
          "Angry2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_28|吵死了，那又怎么样？",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Peace_Talk_Ver1_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Surprised2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_29|……什么？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1141,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_30|回不去那又怎样？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_31|阿格里帕不可置信地抬起头，冲尤乌哈希破口大骂起来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1140,3,Angry1)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Furious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_32|亏我还一直以为你是个战士，尤乌哈希，你的血性呢？你那杀戮的誓言呢？",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Furious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_33|你竟然已经爱上这样每天被人管教的生活，彻底变成一个懦夫了吗！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1141,
          nil,
          "Smile1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_34|嗤……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Furious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_35|你笑什么？你承认了，说不出话了么！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1141,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_36|不，我依然喜欢杀戮，但我已经明白了这里最大的好处，罗马也不能带给我的好处。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Angry1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_37|？！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_38|阿格里帕瞪着眼睛，用一种看叛徒的眼神怒视着他。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1141,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_39|在罗马，人们总是放纵自己，听从欲望，无论是你、我、国王甚至奴隶。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1140},
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Sad_Crazy_Comf_Agelipa_80BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1141,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_40|我可以为贪婪的国王一夜杀光所有敌人，但那之后，我被关在了地下一千年。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1141,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_41|整整一千年后，我又迎来了新的盛宴，而后我死去，同样因为那放纵的饥渴。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1141,
          nil,
          "Smile1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_42|这里的人不一样，他们崇拜那种叫理性的东西，他们纠结、克制、缺乏男子气概。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1141,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_43|我和你一样讨厌那些乱七八糟的规矩——我都不知道他们为什么要自己给自己定下那么多条条框框？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1141},
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_44|要知道他们根本控制不了我，只要我想，我随时可以出去大闹一场，杀个痛快。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1141},
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_45|弥萨格……这些家伙给我的，是源源不断的血、永远不缺敌手的杀戮……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1141},
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_46|就算我们现在被关在这里，等到明天清晨第一缕阳光照进那帮贪睡鬼的宿舍的时候，他们就会发现我不见了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1141},
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_47|然后他们会大惊失色，像热锅上的蚂蚁一样团团转圈，直到乖乖地把这破门打开。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1141,
          nil,
          "Smile1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_48|这所谓的新时代奈何不了我们，不是吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_49|阿格里帕原本愤怒的表情渐渐愣住，她看着叉着腿放松地靠在角落的尤乌哈希，突然明白了这里为她带来的、那宝贵的「安心」。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1141},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1140,3,Surprised2)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_50|她想起每当夜晚到来时，她早就可以安心地闭上眼睛，不必再担心任何背叛。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_51|那曾在迷宫中将她牢牢困住的、噩梦般的过去，她已经很久很久没有再想起了。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_52|然而看着那个奴隶狂妄又自以为是的样子，她还是感到一阵牙根痒痒。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1140,3,Angry1)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Angry1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_53|什么叽里呱啦的，不就是你背叛了罗马，爱上了给新主子当奴隶的生活吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1141},
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_54|奴隶，武器……谁在乎？他们给我血，给我取之不尽用之不竭的血！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1140,4,Angry1)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1141,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_55|至于你的规矩……早就已经和罗马一样，埋了很多年了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1141,
          nil,
          "Smile1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_56|哪怕现在回到罗马，像你这样的怪物也会立刻被征讨，这样一看，你还要感谢这个地方啊。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Angry1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_57|你！我听明白了，你的的确确是变成了一个懦夫！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Furious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_58|你就是害怕了被人随用随丢的生活，想要当一条被人呵护的宠物狗罢了！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1141,
          nil,
          "Smile1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_59|害怕？我从来没有害怕，更没有后悔。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1141},
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_60|我只是不像某个蠢货，非要维护自己那可怜的破布一样的尊严、拼命埋着头抗拒新生活罢了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Angry1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_61|你说谁是蠢货？！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        RoleShake = {0},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_62|阿格里帕气到发丝炸起，一团又一团苍白的肉卵钻出身体，那些节肢疯狂地跺着地面，最终忍无可忍地向尤乌哈希扑去。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Holy_ChildExpansion"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Fun_Chao_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Furious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_63|下贱的奴隶，你要为你的无礼付出代价！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        Sequence = "SetRole(1141,2)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1141},
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_64|怎么，你想再一次被我吸干鲜血吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Angry1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_65|尤乌哈希！！！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        RoleShake = {0},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_BIG_WhooshCloth"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_66|狭小的空间里，毒汁与血刺飞舞，节肢与双手碰撞，两个人毫无形象地扭打成一团，谁也不愿意服输。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {
          "redScreen",
          1,
          "continueShake",
          1
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Fist_fight",
          "Play_A_SFX_Fight_Collision"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_67|就在他们大动干戈的时候，不知道是哪道攻击起了作用，头顶那扇亮着微弱银光的门板忽然闪烁了一下。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "redScreen",
          2,
          "continueShake",
          2
        },
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Runes_Steam"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Surprised2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_68|等等……刚刚这个门板是不是闪了一下？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_69|阿格里帕忽然停了手抬头看去，来不及刹住的尤乌哈希一头撞了出去，咚地撞上了仍然岿然不动的门板。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleShake = {1141},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        Sequence = "SetRole(1141,2,Angry2);SetRole(1140,4,Surprised2)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_hit_table_angry",
          "500"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cloth_Bring_Here"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1141,
          nil,
          "Angry2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_70|哈？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_71|阿格里帕推开碍事的尤乌哈希，扒在门板上仔细研究着，忽然从那流淌着银光的纹路中看到了某些熟悉的东西。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "keyWorkEffect",
          1
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1141,1,Angry2);SetRole(1140,3,Surprised2)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thouch_Cloth_02"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Floodlight"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_72|这些纹路……好像是我刚刚抄过的银芯驱动机关回路？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        ScreenEffect = {
          "keyWorkEffect",
          2
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Thinking_001_118BPM"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1141,
          nil,
          "Angry2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_73|什么鸡什么鹿？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_74|刚刚罚抄的内容一下子涌入脑袋，在更差的差生面前，阿格里帕那贫瘠的知识终于有了炫耀的机会。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_75|说了你也听不懂，总之这种机关以银芯为核心，因为银芯的……什么什么特性，它的核心通常都离机关的位置不远。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_76|而且这些核心构造十分精密，刚刚一定是恰巧打中了核心所在的位置，这破门才会有反应。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_77|只要我们针对核心的位置造成足够的震荡，就能够破坏掉门上的机关！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1141,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_78|听不懂，总之就是要狠狠打那个什么东西吧，它在哪？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Surprised2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_79|我看看……按照这个机关的功能，这里回路的走向应该是这边……不对不对，这边？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Sash"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_80|呃……应该藏在这面墙的这里？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Stand"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1140,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_81|算了，这些考试我从来就没有及格过，这次一定又错了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_82|阿格里帕颓然地垂下脑袋，让她意外的是，眼前的奴隶竟然没有趁机嘲笑她，只是认真地点了点头。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1141,
          nil,
          "Smile1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_83|看来你也在这里改变了很多啊。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1140,4,Surprised2)",
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_84|尤乌哈希回过头，像是面对最强大的对手一般凝视着墙上那个虚幻的点。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1140},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1141,3,Serious)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Hero_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_85|如同昔日战场上的杀神归来，一根又一根鲜血凝聚的长矛拱卫在他的身旁，在黑暗中散发着猩红的光。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1141},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1993,3)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Runes_Steam"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Infect_Face"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1141},
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_86|那就让这间厨房的人看一看，罗马最强大的战士的力量吧！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1141},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1993,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_91727_Content_87|伴随着张狂的笑声，灌注了战士全力的一击精准轰上了那一点，在一声微弱的咔哒声中，头顶那扇坚不可摧的门板终于黯淡了下来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1141},
