      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_36|卢修斯，你知道我们今晚的目标在哪么？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_37|虽然这里完全比不上你房间中松软的大床，但温暖的床铺还是可以让你舒服地瘫在上面。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_38|听着你有气无力的问题，卢修斯在床上翻了个身。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Turn_Over"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2009},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_39|当然不知道啊，大姐又没给我们说。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2009},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_40|不过无所谓在哪，只要知道是那帮畜生的基地就行了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2009},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_41|西奥多和艾米的仇……我们一定会让他们付出代价。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_42|……没错，我们一定会让他们付出代价。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_43|内心深处强烈的情感让你将这句话脱口而出。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_44|你能感受到附身对象内心的悲伤，以及无法平息的愤怒。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_45|啊！差点忘了大姐让我干完活给她说一声。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_46|我先去找大姐了！",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Desert_Footsteps_Run"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2009},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_47|切，你居然想起来了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2009},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_48|路上慢点，我先休息了！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_49|没工夫回卢修斯的话，你向他摆了摆手，示意自己知道了。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_50|大姐！检修完了，要来看看么？",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_InTent"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Long_Skirt_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_51|你来到一个同样内饰的帐篷内，凯蒂古拉正静静检查地图。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2046},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_52|比预想中要快嘛，等会我去看。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_53|大姐，这个是？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_54|凯蒂古拉看了眼你指向的物体，顺手递了过来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Sash"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2046},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_55|我们今晚的目的地和内部结构，你要看么？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_56|你大致扫了一眼，上面的名字立刻吸引了你的注意。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_57|（提灯教会……为什么这里会有提灯教会？）",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_AfterWarVer2_58BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_58|（我们今晚的目的地跟提灯教会有关么？有种不好的预感……）",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2046,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_59|嗯？怎么了？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_60|看到你有些愣神，凯蒂古拉狐疑地看着你。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2046,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_61|怎么感觉你今天心不在焉的？有什么心事？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_62|提灯……教会？我们今天的目标就是他们么？",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Thinking_001_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2046},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_63|你听过他们？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_64|没，只是感觉有些阴森森的……而且大姐，这次行动会不会太顺利了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_65|西奥多和艾米遇害的第二天，大姐你就拿到了对方的情报。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_66|并且我们出发的三天里，不仅情报本身毫无问题，一路上也畅通无阻，我怕……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2046,
          nil,
          "Satire"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_67|怎么，你是想劝我放弃这次行动？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_68|不，不是，只是说……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_69|没等你说完，凯蒂古拉站起身，轻轻拍了拍你的肩膀。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pat_Cloth"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2046,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_70|我知道你想说什么，把话收回去吧，杰拉德。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2046},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_71|我明白这样做的风险，但……我有必须这样做的理由。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2046,
          nil,
          "Angry2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_72|在这个【哔——】的世界上，你必须对外展示出一定的疯狂。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2046},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_73|只有这样，别人才会在恐惧中，忌惮你歇斯底里的反击。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2046,
          nil,
          "Satire"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_74|只要妥协一次，其他家伙就会像闻到血腥气味的鬣狗一样蜂拥而上。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2046},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_75|不断地从我们身上撕咬可以妥协的部分，直到我们……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2046,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_76|一无所有。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_77|……我明白了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_78|看到你满脸的担忧和不安，凯蒂古拉轻轻一笑，重重地拍了你一下。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_impact_hand"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_79|吓！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_OMG"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Yalan_Night_Peace_2_92BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2046},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_80|放轻松点，别那么紧张。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2046},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_81|之前卡塔斯乱战、血手之哀，哪次不比这个危险？我们不还是挺过来了？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2046},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_82|要是实在不想去……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_83|看着凯蒂古拉的眼神，你急忙摆了摆手。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_84|怎么会！我怎么可能临阵脱逃！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2046},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_85|可以，这才是好样的！别想那么多，有我在，大家一定会没事的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2046,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_86|虽然我已经食言了……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2046},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_87|但剩下的人，我绝对……会一个不少的全带回家。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_88|大姐……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_89|现场气氛突然变得有些凝重，失去同伴的悲伤感在你心底弥漫。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_90|大姐说得对！只要听大姐的，就肯定没问题！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_91|为了让凯蒂古拉尽可能摆脱这种自责感，你强行露出一个笑容，试图把气氛再次活跃起来。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2046},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_92|不说这些了，先去休息吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_93|好嘞，那我就不打扰大姐了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_94|你借机离开凯蒂古拉的住所，帐篷内重新归于寂静。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Desert_Footsteps_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2046,
          nil,
          "Think"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_95|风险么……杰拉德说得对，这次的行动过于顺利了……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_96|……这些就是我知道的全部信息，想必您已经明白是怎么一回事了吧。",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_DesertTown"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Big_Memory_Confusion"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Yalan_Soft_Strange_110BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_White_Ocean"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2046},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_97|你是说，有一帮叫做「提灯教会」的家伙，为了一个小东西，就杀了我的人？致我的人于死地？",
        DialogType = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Gun_Shake"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_98|当然，或许您对他们不够了解，但从任何角度上讲，他们都称得上是一帮坏事做尽的禽兽呢。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_99|只要为了自己的目的，无论是什么事情都做得出来呢。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_100|这其中，自然包括杀死您手下这种，在他们眼里一文不值的小老鼠。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2046,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_101|……",
        DialogType = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pistol_loaded_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2046,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_102|趁着我还没丧失理智，闭上你那张嘴。然后拿着你的钱滚蛋。",
        DialogType = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Gun_Hammer_Click_A"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_103|哈哈，是我失言了，那我在这里祝您复仇愉快。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_104|但请允许我再多嘴最后一句……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_105|我期待您，发现一切后的表情。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2046,
          nil,
          "Think"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_106|或许这次确实应该再多准备一下么……但……",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_InTent"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Recover_Remember"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_AfterWarVer2_58BPM"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2046,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_107|算了，现在想这些也没用。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2046,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_108|希望这次，我还能带大家回来吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_109|午夜，沙丘之上。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_DesertNight"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Yang_Oasis_Peace_Day_2_110BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_CalmDesert"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_110|似乎是为了配合你们的行动，平日里肆虐的风沙今夜出奇的平静。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_111|这片沙漠久违地陷入沉睡，似乎是知晓一场大战即将到来，已无需它来填充世界缺少的混乱和喧闹。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_A_Gust_Of_Wind_Blows"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2046},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_112|你还是建议我带上那些人吗，杰拉德？",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_113|既然大姐你这么问了……从理性的角度来讲，我觉得是的。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_114|尽管已经从记忆中得知，但当你真的看到这个场面时还是感到十分诧异。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_115|虽然不管是卢修斯、蒂卡还是路易斯，都可以以一敌百，但……",
        DialogType = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2009,1);SetRole(2008,3);SetRole(1998,5)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_116|没有想象中的大军压境，只有零星几人跟在凯蒂古拉身后。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_117|简直像是追随神明的使徒，以一种近乎自杀的方式，去跟随着他们的圣人践行神意。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2046,
          nil,
          "Satire"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_118|但无论如何，还是人多更保险对吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_119|是的，虽然他们中有些人并没有那么……值得信任……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1996},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_120|你这不是知道嘛，杰拉德。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Desert_Footsteps_01"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_121|蒂卡……",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Strange_001_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2008},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_122|大姐的意思也是，那些人里有一些本就是因为利益和力量才跟我们在一起的。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2008},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_123|如果发现对方比想象的要强，当场反水也不无可能。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2008},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_124|至于剩下那些不会反水的孩子们……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2046},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_125|我没有理由让他们为了我的私心付出生命。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2046,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_126|正如你所说，这次很危险。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2046},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_127|我不可能顾及到那么大的战场，到时候他们中必定有人丧生。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2046,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_128|如果只有我们几个，实在不行还可以撤嘛。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2009},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_129|大姐说的没错，实在不行就先行撤退，反正对面那么大的家业，咱们就这几个人。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2009},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_130|真打不过也不丢人！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_131|哎，好吧，撤退路线准备好了吗？",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_132|凯蒂古拉偏头一笑，随后望向目标，摆出射击架势。你只得无奈地叹了口气，默默地站在她身后。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Gun_Shake"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2046},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_133|等到打不过的时候再说吧！现在，对提灯教会复仇作战——",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2046},
        Content = "AvgDialog_95476_Content_134|正式开始！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
