      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98097_Content_28|也不是不行，但鞭子就不用了……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2050, "Shy"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98097_Content_29|啊，那就让这场令人浑身炙热的比赛快点开始吧♡",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Surprise"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98097_Content_30|潘狄娅兴奋地摇了摇手中的皮鞭，完全没有听进你说的话。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Whip_Whoosh_Chaos_A"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2050},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98097_Content_31|现在，好孩子们，去寻找你们的队友吧。让我想想……一共需要8个队伍♡",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98097_Content_32|8个队伍，会不会有点太多了？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2050, "Smile"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98097_Content_33|哎呀，你不懂啦，人多才好玩，挫折可是调教中最甜蜜的情趣。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2050, "Dream"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98097_Content_34|你就不想看到他们在争斗中落败，流出痛苦不甘的泪水，再哭着渴求你的怜爱吗♡",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_cing"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Speechless.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_98097_Content_35|……",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_emmm"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98097_Content_36|看见潘狄娅已经陶醉在自己的艺术之中，你忍不住捂住了额头，后悔刚刚轻易答应潘狄娅成为主持人的请求。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98097_Content_37|好吧，那就8个队伍，考虑到我们人数可能不足，每个队伍只需要4个人。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
