      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1127},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_11|%player%，你刚才说了什么吗？啊，也可能是我记错了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1132},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_12|不是哦，我也听到了哦，但是主人的声音太小了，珈伦没有听清。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_13|呃，我是说……",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_14|面对大家的困惑，你不知该如何开口——这个梦境太过美好，你不愿醒来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2047, "Serious"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_15|或许，%player%你是想永远保留这一刻的记忆？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_16|是啊，我想把你们永远记在心里，永远。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1126, "Smile1"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_17|永远啊……听起来真的很漫长，但或许有个办法能实现这个愿望。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_18|24拿起相机，静静望着你。",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Lock"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1126, "ShutEye"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_19|也许这只是我分裂的错觉，或者她们的胡话，但有时候，我觉得你和我们并不在同一个世界。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1126},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_20|我是说，你好像并不是来度假的，而是背负了许多东西，不、不是这个意思、让我来……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_21|因为无法准确表达出内心的想法，24的语气变化不定。环行·拉蒙娜忍不住拍了拍她的肩膀。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pat_Cloth"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2047, "Serious"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_22|你的想法我明白。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2047, "Serious"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_23|虽然守密人总是背负了许多，但这次……你看起来格外的悲伤，并且不想让我们知道这悲伤的缘由。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2047, "Smile"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_24|但是没有关系，无论你在想什么，在做什么，我们都支持着你。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1126, "Smile1"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_25|是的，我想说的就是这样。无论我们在不在同一个世界，我们都会支持着你。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_26|24将相机放在你的手中，缓缓微笑。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thouch_Cloth"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1126, "Smile1"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_27|将这一刻照下来吧，%player%。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1126, "Shy"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_28|因为就像你想将这一刻永远记在心里，我们也希望能够永远牢记住你。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_29|……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_30|你静静望着24，望着环行·拉蒙娜、莉莉、珈伦、诺缔拉、墨菲、索蕾尔、潘狄娅，还有更远处正在嬉闹打架的唤醒体，感觉眼眶发热。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CG_SD_L_FarewellNeverland_1"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_zuoyou_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_31|为了掩饰这点，你赶忙拿起了相机，调好焦距举在眼前。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Camera_Focus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_32|就像你说的，你永远都不会忘记他们，忘记这一刻的欢乐。\n它将成为你回到现实后最深的寄托。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_33|谢谢大家，谢谢……你们所有人。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_34|随着快门按下，相机闪烁出一片炫目的白光。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_White"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_Play_A_SFX_Memory_Confusion"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Camera_Shutter_01"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Tinnitus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_35|一切美好定格在这一瞬间，所有人开心的笑容在夏日的阳光下镀上了一层温暖的光辉。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "CG_SD_L_FarewellNeverland_2"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Meteor_Passing_By_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_36|镜头外，唤醒体们活力的动作也缓缓放慢、静止。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_37|在停滞的画面中，你忽然感到灵魂正在缓缓升起。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Bizarre_GOD"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_Play_A_SFX_Memory_Confusion"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Tinnitus"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_38|天上的太阳正在快速坠落，在淹没一切的漆黑光晕中，你最后看了一眼所有唤醒体，缓缓闭上了眼睛。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 7,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_BlackHole"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_39|这里果然不是「现实」啊……但是……",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98107_Content_40|但是我又多么希望这一切，成为「现实」。",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [98284] = {
    ID = 98284,
    CnID = "小型支线_皮克曼_关卡1_前",
    BaseSortID = 1,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 1,
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_1|野兽主义酒馆",
        Chapter = "Ghastly Canvas;Fauvist Pub;Part 1",
        DialogType = 4,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_UI_AVG_Chapter_Pop"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        },
        BanSpeedUp = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_2|硬鞋底落在墓园的石砖路面，清晰的脚步声越过密密麻麻的坟墓，传到雾色的尽头。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_GraveyardNight"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Bad_Misty_2"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Strange_001_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_WastelandNight"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_3|脚步声停下。你抬起头，一栋崎岖的别墅矗立在墓园之中，如同一座造型奇特的巨大墓碑。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_zuoyou_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Bad_Misty_Once_01"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Bad_Misty_Once_02",
          "450"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_4|各色的暗淡颜料被涂抹在漆黑、古老的墙面。一场废弃舞池中的漫长狂欢。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_5|这场梦境的开场倒是别开生面。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_6|埃弗，美术学院绘画系大一的学生，革新派画法的拥护者……",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 6,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_7|你闭上眼睛，仔细回忆着自己的身份。一个熟悉的名字窜入你的脑海。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_8|大门被敲响。你望向别墅的左侧，那里没有门牌，只有一个粗犷的墓碑，上面用血污般的颜料涂抹出一个丑陋的名字。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"awake", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_GraveyardNight"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_OldCall_Door",
          "500"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Recover_Remember"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1962,
          nil,
          "Puzzled"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_9|咦？埃弗？！你是怎么找到我这里的？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Push_WoodenDoor"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_AfterWar_Ver4_118BPM"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_10|与你同班的年轻画家兴奋地打开门，乱糟糟的头发与衣服上沾染着各色的颜料。这栋别墅毫无争议的主人。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_11|之前你给我说过你家的住址，只是没想到富顿街116号居然是个……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_12|……你的手和脚是怎么回事？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_13|皮克曼疑惑地低下头，仿佛第一次发现自己那些野兽般的肢体。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1962,
          nil,
          "Shy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_14|手和脚？哦，那个……我正在研究一些兽化的人体创作，所以、所以给自己做了些特别的装扮。没错，装扮！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1962,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_15|别站在门口了，快请进！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_16|这里或许曾是个富丽的宅邸，但那些名贵的器具与装潢，全部都被狂乱的画作与雕塑模型取代。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_ExhibitionSp_Normal"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Open_Old_Door"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Mist"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_17|嗯，这房间真是有你的风格……",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_zuoyou_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Heavy_Leaves"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_pikeman_first_meeting_100BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1962,
          nil,
          "Shy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_18|啊，抱歉抱歉，我平时没有时间收拾，那些佣人也不太愿意来我这里，所以稍稍有些乱……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_19|你给我说过家里的地址，但我从没想过，你竟然会是住在一座墓园里。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1962,
          nil,
          "Excited"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_20|我喜欢这个地方，既安静，又能找到许多的模特。你知道，我想找个人来当模特实在是困难……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_21|模特？在墓园里找？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1962},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_22|啊，不说那个……我邀请了你那么多次，怎么今天突然想起到我家来做客啦！你今天不是要参加画廊的画展吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1962},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_23|也没提前和我说下，我都没时间好好准备……",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_24|画展我已经去过了。那里离这里不远，我就顺便来看看。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_25|你还好吧，皮克曼？前几天的审核会上，马修先生对你说的那些批评的话，实在是有些过分……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_26|我和你接触不算很多，不过我知道，你在绘画上的天赋是有多么的惊人。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_27|你全身心热爱艺术，又是一个十分敏感的人，我担心你会因为马修先生的评价……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_28|皮克曼瞪大眼睛，浑身颤抖起来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleShake = {0},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thouch_Cloth_01"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_29|皮克曼？你怎么了……",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Fun_Afraid_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1962,
          nil,
          "Excited"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_30|埃弗先生！你是这个世界上最懂我的人！能遇到你是我作为人类以来最幸福的事！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Turn_Jump"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_31|作为人类？……啊！皮克曼先生……我有点……喘不过气……",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Joint_Twist_one"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_32|皮克曼松开了差点被勒死的你，重重拍了拍你的肩膀。你似乎听见了骨头碎裂的声音。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pat_Cloth"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1962},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_33|请放心，埃弗先生！我已经走出来了，我好得很！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1962},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_34|埃弗先生……我决定了！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cloth_Bring_Here"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_35|皮克曼突然从原地跳了起来，吓了你一大跳。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Zoom_In"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1962,
          nil,
          "Excited"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_36|我有一个天大的秘密，本来不打算让任何人知道。但是，埃弗先生，你和别人不一样！放心，我一定不会让你白来一趟！请跟我来！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Sash"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_37|皮克曼将你请到沙发上坐下，神秘地走到房间中央的画布前。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_ClothesFriction_02"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Normal_Short_Leave",
          "500"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_pikeman_mysterious_94BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1962},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_38|准备好了吗，埃弗先生？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_39|是想给我看你最新的画作吗？这我的确很有兴趣。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_40|明天的艺术研讨会，我也准备再次向评审会举荐你的作品，对于革新派来说，你的画作至关重要……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1962,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_41|嘘……埃弗。谢谢你的好意，不过，现在不是聊这个时候。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1962},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_42|你猜对了一半……我要给你看的，不只是我的画作。我要带你，去看看真正的艺术，真正的世界……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_43|真正的……世界？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_44|皮克曼克制着自己的兴奋，神秘地扯下黑色的画布。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Long_Skirt_01"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember",
          "350"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_98284_Content_45|画布之下，你看到一座城市模糊的轮廓。你想要仔细观赏它，却发现自己的眼睛无论如何也无法在它上面聚焦。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_IllusionWhite"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
