        Content = "AvgDialog_123121_Content_78|这些雾中的怪物不会死亡。就算被打散，也会很快再次出现。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Moxia_eerie2_80"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123121_Content_79|恐怕只要这些雾气还存在，这些怪物就会永生。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123121_Content_80|萨尔瓦多神父，请问你觉得，茉夏刚才说的……是真的吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123121_Content_81|从相遇开始，茉夏女士的灵魂之火便恒定如一。于我所见，她既没有说谎的表现，也没有说谎的动机。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123121_Content_82|那么，我有一些猜想。不过，得先找到茉夏才行。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123121_Content_83|我尊重你的决定，苍白的使者。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123121_Content_84|不必担心这些雾中的怪物，我必会保证你的安全。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123121_Content_85|你感激地看着萨尔瓦多，随后将手移向银钥匙。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {
          "keyWorkVideo",
          1,
          "keyWorkEffect",
          1
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Brooches_Launch_CG"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Floodlight"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123121_Content_86|血液再次从你的脸颊落下，但你无动于衷，刚才晕眩时的恐怖猜想占据了你全部的神志。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RolePos = {0},
        ScreenEffect = {
          "keyWorkVideo",
          2,
          "smoke",
          2
        },
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_LowBlood"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2206},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123121_Content_87|@2我……救@2……",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_No_Signal",
          "250"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2206},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123121_Content_88|救@2……@2我……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123121_Content_89|终于，在通讯器再次传来噪音时，你穿越无数冰冷的死去星辰，触摸到了茉夏的精神体。",
        DialogType = 3,
