  [123122] = {
    ID = 123122,
    CnID = "小型支线_茉夏_关卡3_前",
    BaseSortID = 3,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 3,
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_1|透过你的双眸",
        Chapter = "Baptism of Silver and Blood;Through Thy Gaze;Part 3",
        DialogType = 4,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_UI_AVG_Chapter_Pop"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_2|你们、你们是怎么找到我的？！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        ScreenEffect = {"smoke", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_WastelandNight"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Strange_001_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Secret_Room"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_3|难道刚才的雾出了什么纰漏？还是说……你们也和调查官一样，有看清迷雾的能力？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_4|茉夏的惊愕没有持续太久，转瞬之间，她的神色便冷静下来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_5|能够摆脱雾中的古物，你们确实有些手段。但是——",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Crazy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_6|<Big:<Shake:别妨碍我干正事！>>",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Turn_Jump"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_7|茉夏说着，握紧了斧头，目光中充满警惕和敌意。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Metal_Axe_Shake_Grab_A"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_8|茉夏，你不必这样，我们不是敌人。至少现在不是。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_9|但在你做出决定之前，我有句叮嘱一定要传达给你。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_10|我正忙着呢，没时间玩无聊的过家家游戏，更没兴趣扮演被教育的女儿角色。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_11|你不了解这个世界，也不知道繁星黎明会仪式真正的代价和效果。",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Moxia_eerie_55"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_12|换句话说，刚才与你关在一处的囚徒，都是下一次仪式必不可缺的祭品。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_13|何况，就算仪式再度举行，你也不知道两个世界的门扉是否会再度开启，你又是否能通过它返回自己的世界。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_14|茉夏的动作顿住了，随后紧紧咬住嘴唇。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2222,3,Surprised)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_15|……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_16|孩子，我知道你并非自愿来到这个残酷的世界，也理解你想要回去的心情。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_17|我们只是希望能够帮助你，避免你踏入歧途。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_18|你是说，我想要通过繁星黎明会的仪式，回到自己的世界，是歧途？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_19|茉夏刚刚松动的态度似乎又变得强硬起来，语气中满是锋利的嘲讽。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_20|周围的浓雾开始翻腾，涌动。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Black_Mist_Surges_02"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_21|那什么是正途？谁规定什么是正途？你，还是你的神？",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Moxia_fog_nervous_70"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_22|伪装已经卸下，茉夏毫不掩饰地展露出她对萨尔瓦多这类信仰者的不屑与轻蔑。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_23|就算判断了对错又怎么样？我看这个世界比泰穆兰还要贫瘠和不堪。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_24|那些人牲受苦时，你口中的「父神」又在哪里？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_25|浓雾翻涌得越发剧烈，遮掩住茉夏的脸，也遮掩住萨尔瓦多的神情。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Psychedelic_Mist",
          "300"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_Play_A_SFX_SteamFly"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Black_Mist_Surges_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_26|你唯一能在这迷雾里听到的，就是萨尔瓦多的叹息，和预示着危险逼近的诡异声响。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1135,3);DarkRole(1135,1)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_27|我……",
        DialogType = 1,
        Sequence = "DarkRole(1135,0)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_28|畅所欲言，神父，反正闲着也是闲着。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_29|茉夏话音刚落，周围的迷雾里就破出无数人形的雾气，向着你们而来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "avg_dialog_Amplification",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_DevilWhisper",
          "Play_A_SFX_Zoom_In"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Black_Mist_Surges_02",
          "Play_A_SFX_Female_Monster_Roar_2"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_30|但茉夏的动作比那些人形的雾气更快。眼见她又想溜之大吉，你不由得喊出了声。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Something_Flash"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123122_Content_31|萨尔瓦多，拦住她！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Sash"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
