        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_112|而你，不停操作着测量仪器，尝试捕捉不同维度的振波。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Measuring_Brooches_Launch_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_113|一分钟，悄然过去。\n两分钟，悄然过去。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_114|然后是三分钟，五分钟，十分钟……",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_115|汗水从你的额头滴落，你从未觉得时间如此漫长。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_116|还要多久？我总觉得这些怪物似乎变强了，劈好几下才能打散……",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "CG_SD_S_C17_02_2"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Metal_Axe_Whoosh_Light_A"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Metal_Axe_Whoosh_Light_C",
          "450"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_117|那是另一个维度在尝试入侵和吞噬我们世界的表现，对吗，苍白的使者？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_118|又一滴汗水从你的额头滴落，精神紧绷下，你连点头都忘了。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          nil,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Sweat.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_119|振波……在不停变化……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_120|可能是浓雾自身的原因，也可能是被困在雾中的灵魂干扰……我需要时间去排查。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_121|你抬头看了眼天空，此时你再也看不见什么「群星」了。\n整个世界似乎只剩下浓雾，以及持续不断喷吐浓雾的维度之门。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "smoke",
          2,
          "whiteSmoke",
          1
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_Play_A_SFX_SteamFly"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_122|可我们没有时间了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_123|……你说得对。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_124|你收起测量仪器，抬手握住了银钥匙。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Abstract_Finger_Touch_Silvery"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_125|看来，只能赌一把了……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_126|苍白的使者，你是想要连接……？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_127|萨尔瓦多皱着眉，不赞同地看着你。而你，只是沉默。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_128|喂喂，这里还有一个「异世界来客」呢，说点我听得懂的可以吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_129|%player%的意思是……连接那扇未知的「门」，以确定维度的振波。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_130|什么？那东西古怪得很，谁知道会有什么结果，你可别做傻事。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_131|你紧紧握住银钥匙，神色沉重地走向那无形的光门。此时此刻，行动胜过语言。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "avg_dialog_Amplification",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Bad_Misty",
          "400"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Sash"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_132|真是服了你们这些认为这个无聊世界还有拯救价值的人了……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_133|出人意料地，茉夏伸手拦住了你。她表情复杂地望着你，似乎在看着你，又似乎在透过你，看着另外一个人。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2222,3,Serious)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Xinshijie_lonely_0"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_134|最终，所有的纠结都化为了脸上的微笑，茉夏努力让自己的声音听起来显得轻松。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2222,3,Smile)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_135|算了，谁让我是调查团备受瞩目的前锋呢，冲在最前面也是理所当然的——",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_136|所以，让我去。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_137|茉夏望着你，神情严肃而坚定。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123120_Content_138|从囚笼一角开始，这是她第一次露出这样认真的表情。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [123119] = {
