        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_23|可是……如果……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_24|如果有不对的情况，我就会发动银钥匙，将连接转移到我身上。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_25|萨尔瓦多望着你强装镇定的眼睛，又见到你紧紧攥住银钥匙，最终叹了口气。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1135,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_26|若是那时，请务必让我分担。",
