      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_44|我这是阵亡了？原来阵亡是这种感觉啊……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2212},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_45|不，你还活着。你只是被我带到了这里。你身上有「我」的气息。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2212},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_46|若是我不这么做，你会因失败的维度跨越遭受@4，因为你已经被@3。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightning_Ball_03"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_47|茉夏没有听到光斑最后的话语，因为那混沌的音节响起的刹那，她的头就剧烈疼痛起来，几欲裂开。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Flute_OverBlow_Abstract_A"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Tinnitus"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_NO_Thinking"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Pain"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_48|<Shake:停！停！说点我能听的……再这样下去，我的头要炸了。>",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Sash"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_49|她似乎听到了光斑的叹息，又或许没有，因为无数奇怪的信息灌入了茉夏的脑海，吸引了她全部的注意力。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_50|这是什么？",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 2},
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2212},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_51|你们此刻需要的。展示给「我」，%heorshe%会明白的。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_52|什么我、你的，听不懂——",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_53|等等，你是……%player%？",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_54|这不可能，我刚刚才看到你活蹦乱跳的，看起来再活100年完全没问题。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_55|光斑嗡鸣着，发出一声轻笑，茉夏不知道这是否能被称为「笑」，因为它没有喜悦。准确来说，没有任何情绪。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightning_Ball_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2213},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_56|你可以理解为那是另一个维度的「我」，而我，真正的我——",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_57|随着光斑的话语，又有无数信息涌入了茉夏的脑海。这些信息不断分裂、聚合，形成了不稳定的画面。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 1},
        BgID = {
          "Sscene_Bigwhirlpool"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Bizarre_GOD"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_58|起初，这些画面抽象斑驳，模糊不定，但很快——",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_59|那些古怪的光影就凝聚成了一个身影，一个她熟悉的身影。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1001,3);",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Meteor_Passing_By_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_60|那熟悉的身影在一片爆炸中醒来，懵懂地注视着这个世界。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_WeeklyRuins02"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1001,3);",
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Moxia_desolate_00"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_61|许多年后，人们将这次爆炸，称为「阿库特爆炸」。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_62|随后，%heorshe%进入了弥萨格，获得银钥匙，成为了「守密人」，开始与称为「唤醒体」的同伴们出任务，调查这个诡异而恐怖的世界。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolGround"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1001,3);"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_63|就像她和调查官、雾境调查团那样。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_64|……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_65|回忆到那些熟悉的人和过去，茉夏怀念地叹息。而关于%player%的一生，仍在继续——",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_66|她看到%player%穿行过冰天雪地的小镇，在满是秘密的疗养院里，直面穿越时空的猎犬，见证亲情的永恒。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SanatoriumAisleInvaded"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_67|也追随%player%游览过开满诗与花的西岱，聆听烈火的叹息，哀痛于玫瑰的凋零。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_PoetryStreet2"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_68|还有飘零在海上的幽灵船。信仰、神明、献祭，她同%player%一起，认知了这世界的扭曲、残酷与疯狂。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C06_008"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_69|但无论是怎样危险的地方，都没有打倒%player%，和%heorshe%的同伴。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_70|就像在那个世界，雾灾、灰骸、古物也打不倒她和调查官，打不倒雾境调查团一样。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_71|这还差不多！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_72|也不知道那些雾里的小家伙们现在怎么样了？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_73|唉，真的好想喝杯热腾腾的榛果卡瓦茶啊！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_74|茉夏笑起来。\n她以为%player%会和唤醒体们永远战斗下去——",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_75|理所当然是这样的，因为她从未想过要离开雾境调查团，那些唤醒体，自然也不会想离开守密人。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_76|他们会战斗、战斗，直到解决世界的麻烦，或者被世界所解决。\n就像所有故事里演的那样。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_77|但这个世界，远比茉夏所想象的，远比茉夏所在的那个世界，更加残酷。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C09_011_F"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "ReplaceBg(Gender_Boy,SScene_CG_C09_011_M)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_78|<Shake:怎么会这样！！>",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_79|所以你……！？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        BgID = {
          "Sscene_Bigwhirlpool"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_New_World_Save_Sad_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_80|你这家伙，我就不该指望你会放弃拯救这个无聊的世界。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_81|为了拯救别人牺牲这种事……这种事……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_82|茉夏无法再说下去了，因为无论是生气、愤怒，都已经无济于事。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2222,3,Sad);"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_83|%player%固然是她茉夏的朋友，但她茉夏，却只是这个世界的过客。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_84|两人之间相隔的，不仅仅是「维度」，还有两个全然不同的「世界」。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2213},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_85|其实，我的梦想是和我爱的人，一起围坐在舒适的火炉旁，浪费我们一文不值的生命。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "Sscene_Bigwhirlpool"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2213},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_86|窗外的雪慢慢地飘着，年复一年，直到我们寿终正寝。然后，我的墓碑上会写着：%heorshe%是一个长寿又幸福的废物。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2213},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_87|直到如今，我的梦想也从未变过。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_88|那就去实现这个梦想啊，世界毁灭又怎么样？这样无聊的世界，就算毁灭了又怎么样！？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_89|总比留下永恒的遗憾，一个人永远孤独地被困在这个鬼地方强吧！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_90|光斑再次一声轻笑，茉夏却已经无法分辨这声音里有没有笑意了。\n因为她心中充满了苦涩。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightning_Ball_03"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2213},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_91|我也想实现这个梦想，很想很想，但是……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2213},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_92|这个残酷的世界下，我们总会做出一些「选择」，一些可能连自己都无法理解的选择。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2213},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_93|或许，也不算无法理解。我虽然没有喝过热腾腾的榛果卡瓦茶，但我也有自己喜欢的东西。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2213},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_94|墨菲的小蛋糕，莉兹的舞蹈，就连朵尔每次额外布置的作业，现在想起来也充满了趣味……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_95|够了，别再说了。你这家伙简直就是个无药可救的……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_96|茉夏！茉夏！",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_97|骤然间，一道声音乍响在茉夏的脑海。而她，第一时间就认出了对方。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_98|看过「%heorshe%」为了拯救世界所进行的挣扎和牺牲后，她想，她很难再忘记这个声音，这个人。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_99|坚持住，我和萨尔瓦多很快就会将你救出来！我保证过的。",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_100|不，%player%，等一下……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        BgID = {
          "Sscene_Bigwhirlpool"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_101|茉夏想要阻止你的救援。在了解过关于「你」的经历后，她心中充满了疑惑和问题。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_102|但没有时间了。一种来自灵魂的拉扯感牵引着她，固执地带领她离开这个满是光斑的奇怪世界。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AnimState = "avg_dialog_Lessen",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_LoJeiSi_Plaster_Ocean"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_103|而那给予她启迪的光斑就在那里，不远不近，散发着柔和而温暖的善意，向她做着最后的告别。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Soul_Twinkling"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2213},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_104|将@4信息，展示给@3「我」，你就能@2回家@1。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2213},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_105|@2，再见，茉夏，@2……另一个「我」。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Recover_Remember"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_106|很快，那无形的嗡鸣声扭曲，消散，最后彻底消失，一同消失的还有茉夏的视觉、听觉和各种感官。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_BlackHole"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_107|当茉夏再次恢复视听，回到现实时，她又看到了那个熟悉的身影，那个她无法理解的人。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "smoke",
          1,
          "disturb",
          2
        },
        BgID = {
          "CG_SD_S_C17_02_2"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_New_World_Farewell_130BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_108|茉夏，离开这里，我和萨尔瓦多会善后。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_109|「门」的侵蚀在不断加深，我和苍白的使者不得不做好最坏的打算……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_110|……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_111|茉夏？发什么呆？快离开这里。",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_112|望着你，生气、愤怒、怜悯等诸多情绪相互交织在茉夏的胸口，令她根本说不出话。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_113|最终，她恶狠狠吐了口气，握紧拳头，不情不愿地开口：",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_114|从第一次见面我就该知道的，你这家伙就是那种热心又爱管闲事的「主角」，是我永远都无法理解的那一类人。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_115|哪怕再过100年，我也无法理解你的大脑回路。所以，我放弃了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_116|什么？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_117|我知道你说的那个振波值，这是另@4@3……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_118|熟悉的刺痛袭来，令茉夏说出的话语扭曲变异。在尝试几次都无法说出那光斑的真实后，茉夏放弃了。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_Play_A_SFX_Memory_Confusion"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Tinnitus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_119|少女以行动代替了话语，紧紧握住了你的手，脸上的神色坚定无比。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 2},
        AnimState = "avg_dialog_Amplification",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thouch_Cloth"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_123119_Content_120|我会和你一起解决这个大麻烦。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2222,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
