        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2140},
        Content = "AvgDialog_120296_Content_7|嘁，什么夫人不夫人的，一个书场里出来的长三，怕伊做撒，伊还能把侬吃掉不成。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        RoleShake = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2133,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_120296_Content_8|看看你们几位，和猫儿炸毛了似的，真是可爱。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {
          2140,
          2141,
          2142
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2133},
        Content = "AvgDialog_120296_Content_9|别担心呀，妾身不过是初来乍到，看你们聊得兴起，也想过来说说悄悄话儿罢了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2140},
        Content = "AvgDialog_120296_Content_10|行了，收起你那些小心思吧，别说我吓唬你，这宅子不太平。老爷太喜欢的女人，到最后全都不见了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        RoleHide = {2133}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2140},
        Content = "AvgDialog_120296_Content_11|就连和他青梅竹马的前任夫人，说是病逝，谁知道是……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2140},
        Content = "AvgDialog_120296_Content_12|哎呀！侬搡我做撒！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        RoleShake = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        Sequence = "SetRole(2141,3);",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_ClothesFriction_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2141},
        Content = "AvgDialog_120296_Content_13|夫人，实在……实在抱歉。我姐姐爱乱讲话，您别听她瞎讲，我们绝对无意跟您争，我求求您，千万不要告诉老爷。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        RoleShake = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_120296_Content_14|被妹妹猛地扯回来，这名细细画了眉眼，打扮精致的姨娘回过神，脸色瞬间吓得煞白，急忙捂住嘴收了声。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2133},
        Content = "AvgDialog_120296_Content_15|既然这宅子不太平，你们怎么没想着另外寻个去处呢？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2142},
        Content = "AvgDialog_120296_Content_16|……哪还有什么去处呀，我们若是能跟您一样，被贵人们捧得如珠如宝，才真是哪都去得。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2133,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_120296_Content_17|嘻嘻，捧得如珠如宝？",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_120296_Content_18|徐突然笑出了声，那一瞬间，回廊中的几个姨娘都听见了某种更飘忽无定的窃笑。",
        DialogType = 3,
