        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_02"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Strange_001_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_12|<LightGray:感觉脑子里像绞着一团浆糊，忘记了什么关键的事情……>",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"awake", 2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_13|<LightGray:<Shake:不管了，借着祈岁节必须休假的名义，先回宿舍装尸体，就算朵尔再催作业拉蒙娜再催报告我也要顽抗到底……>>",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1134},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_14|哎呀，真是贪睡的小树苗。在列车抵达终点之前，你都可以靠在我的肩膀上噢？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_15|呜哇？！",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Surprise02"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Qisui_sneaking_86"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_16|你环顾四周，清点乘客的人数。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_zuoyou_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_17|旺达摇着半杯红酒，低头在欣赏自己精心打磨的尖翘指甲。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1151,3)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Red_WineGlass_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_18|汀克特安静地捧着一本乐谱，薄唇翕动，似在脑内轻声练习。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1149,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_19|温柯尔靠在昏暗的小灯旁，目光仿佛怕那一缕灯光逃跑般死死黏在灯芯上。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1152,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_20|弥利亚姆仰头合眼，似乎对周遭的变化浑然不觉。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1168,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_21|<LightGray:大家，互不打扰的氛围，好安逸啊……>",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_22|……",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_train_run"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_23|…………",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_24|<LightGray:不过，这趟列车的时间是不是有点久？>",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_AfterWar_Ver4_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_25|弥萨格的专列为穿过校园外的迷雾屏障而设置，是一辆短线列车。但自你睡去又醒来，少说也已经过去了一个小时。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_26|你思虑了片刻，来到车内唯一的教师组成员身边。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_27|温柯尔……为什么今天的<Yellow:弥萨格专列>这么慢？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_28|温柯尔如同受惊的野兔一般跳了起来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleShake = {1152},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1152,3)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cartoon_Angry4"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1152},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_29|什、什么弥萨格专列？这班列车不是开往@1母星的吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Ops"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_30|所有目光聚光灯一样打向温柯尔。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Welcome_Bell"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_31|别说笑了，小丫头，这不是开往亚兰的列车吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Fun_Afraid_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1152,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_32|咦，可是亚兰位于沙海深处，根本不可能通列车呀……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {1152},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_OMG"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_33|据我所知，这辆列车的终点应该是伊萨拉乌。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1152,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_34|那更荒诞了，伊萨拉乌不是早就已经毁灭了吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_35|口说无凭，我有票据为证。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_36|旺达掏出一枚金属制的车票，展示在众人面前。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        Sequence = "Showitem(128552)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Sash"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_37|在车票的下车站处，赫然写着伊萨拉乌的字样。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_38|弥利亚姆、汀克特，你们二位……",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Emm"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_39|无需多言，祂的意志将引领我回归利莫里亚的道路。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1149,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_40|我……我要趁着祈岁节的假期，回荒星陪陪姐姐……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_41|<LightGray:荒星……汀克特经过不可计数的时光，才流浪至卡达斯。这距离，对一辆列车来说根本遥不可及……>",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_42|利莫里亚，千年前就已经沉没在海底。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1152},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_43|而伊萨拉乌……早就已经毁灭了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1168, 1149},
        RoleShake = {1152},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_44|小朋友，你指点了半天江山。你要回去的那个母星，又叫什么名字，在哪里呢？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1152,4)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_45|温柯尔面色大变。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1152,
          nil,
          "Nervous"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_46|<Shake:母星……就是母星！母星的名字……是……<Small:@1……>>",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Fun_Fear_02"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Qisui_reasoning_86"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1151,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_47|嗯？我没听错吧，你连你的母星的名字都记不起来了？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_48|大家冷静一下，听我说。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_49|大家的目的地，听起来都非常不现实。但每个人手中，确实都持有一枚通往自己故乡的车票。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_50|所以，我们最需要找到的，是车上的<Yellow:乘务员>，了解关于这班列车的信息，而非在此徒劳争执。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2224},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_51|咳、咳。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Bad_Misty_3",
          "700"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_ruuu"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_52|角落里传来一个有点滑稽的怪声。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_N_funny_00"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2224},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_53|这就热闹完了吗？我还想多看一会儿戏呢~",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Emm"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_54|小N？！",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2224,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_55|怎么啦？不欢迎我吗？亏我还给各位准备了这么一份祈岁节的大礼呢！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cute_Cartoon02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_56|原应隐于黑暗的幕后主使自己踏上了舞台中央，险恶的居心昭然若揭——他一定还筹划着更大的阴谋。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Angry.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_57|你在这里做什么？",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cartoon_Angry3"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2224,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_58|这不是显而易见吗？体贴、无私、乐善好施的我，值此祈岁节之际，启动了这辆返乡特快，让思念故土的各位能够享受节日的温暖呀。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_cing"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Angry.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_59|你可没那么好心。说，你到底还隐瞒了什么？",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cartoon_Angry4"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2224,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_60|哎呀，别催，等我一点点说完嘛。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2224,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_61|想要返乡的人有很多，但列车只有一班。所以，只有一个人能回到自己心心念念的家乡哦？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2224,
          nil,
          "Shy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_62|唉呀，身为体贴、无私、乐善好施的N，我肯定要使用最公平的手段来决定谁能取得这个资格吧？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Snap_Fingers"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126909_Content_63|所以……",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
