        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Safe_Peaceful_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_21|我记得你被称为全弥萨格交谊舞跳得最优雅的教授，德克斯特勋爵。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_22|你搜肠刮肚，尝试着表演德克斯特勋爵油腔滑调的回复。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2230},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_23|我想，如果能举办一场「和艾尔莎共舞」大赛，我依然会是胜出者。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_24|拉蒙娜移开了目光，轻轻晃动着手中的高脚杯。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Red_WineGlass_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Sad3"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_25|艾尔莎很崇拜你。即便这支舞蹈并不完美，也算是实现了她的祈岁节愿望吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_26|可惜和她共舞的人并非真正的德克斯特勋爵。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_27|更地狱的是，即使没有你来鬼上身这一出戏码，她所认识的那个人，也并非真正的德克斯特勋爵。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_28|但这不是你想要开展的话题。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2230},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_29|拉蒙娜，你有什么祈岁节愿望吗？",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_PalaceHallNight"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Peace_Talk_Ver2_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_30|角色扮演换方向了？不去问候你的这个夫人那个女士，跑来关心自己的养女了吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2230},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_31|我看你一直没有去跳舞，是没有心仪的舞伴吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_32|不劳您费心了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2230},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_33|要不要赏脸和孤寡老父亲跳一支？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_34|拉蒙娜沉默。你知道她在思维殿堂搜罗着理由。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2230},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_35|你等待的那个人，也希望你能答应这支舞约。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_36|你怎么知道？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2230},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_37|我就是知道。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_38|更加漫长的沉默。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Sad3"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_39|算了，信你一次。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_40|她轻盈地迈入舞池，纤细的手指搭上你的掌心。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Caress02"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Lamengna_moonlight_00"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_41|来吧，我还没有和你跳过舞呢。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_42|……",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Boot_Dance_B"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_43|拉蒙娜的舞步犹如她的为人——理性、克制、精准、一丝不苟。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_PalaceHallNight"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2230},
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_44|可以放轻松点，你好像在把舞池当成战场。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_45|而你可以认真一点，高贵的勋爵。从开始跳舞到现在，你有三次差点踩到我的脚了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        RoleShake = {0},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Bad_Misty_Once_01",
          "300"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Bad_Misty_Once_02",
          "800"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_126907_Content_46|这可不像是浸淫社交场数十年的德克斯特勋爵啊。",
