        },
        BanSpeedUp = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_2|卡达斯世界\n守密人葬礼之前",
        DialogType = 6,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_3|随着一声检测完毕的嗡鸣，众多仪器上又一次显示了毫无反应的结果，朵尔沉默着挥了挥手，研究员们互相对视一眼，默契地开始拆卸仪器。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_RestrictedArea"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Precision_mechanical_gears_02"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Deep_Sad_90BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_School_Base"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_4|为什么要收起仪器？再试一次，一定还有没想到的测试方法……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1121},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_5|检测次数与频段已经足够多了，你的银芯仪器使用课程是满分，不要再自欺欺人了，拉蒙娜。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1121,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_6|{Male=他,Female=她}留在这里的只是一具躯壳，没有任何生命波动，守密人的意识……可能已经消散了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_7|残忍的宣判终于从人偶口中落下，看着拉蒙娜怔愣的眼中流下的泪水，见惯牺牲的教授也不忍地闭上了眼。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1121},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_8|准备为<Yellow:%player%>举行葬礼吧，那封遗书……就由你来为{Male=他,Female=她}读吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_9|卡达斯世界\n守密人葬礼后三个月",
        DialogType = 6,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_10|雾气凝聚又消散，一位弥萨格的常客出现在黑池的入口，静静站在了人偶身旁，一同遥望「门」前枯坐的身影。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_RestrictedArea"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_Play_A_SFX_SteamFly"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Highheel",
          "450"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Emo_89BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_School_Base"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1147},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_11|长期接触池水，对身体可不太好，你不拦着她一些吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1121},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_12|我给了她基础的防护装置，何况身体的损伤我还有办法治疗，心理的损伤就没那么容易治疗了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_13|理性的教授叹了口气，探究地回过了头。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1121},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_14|你很少愿意来这里，这次你带来了什么？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1147,
          nil,
          "Smile1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_15|啊，一个恰好可以治愈她心灵的好消息。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Sad3"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_16|搭档，多亏你的壮举，最近世界范围内的融蚀裂隙都少了非常多。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolBlackPool"
        },
        BgTransition = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Sad3"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_17|学校的调查员们都变得清闲了起来，大家每天只用上课考试，弥萨格越来越像一所普通的大学了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_18|有人提议要为你建一座雕像，就放在华德校长的旁边，目前校方还在考虑。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_19|我递交了不支持的建议，你明明还在这里，为什么要和校长一样做成雕像。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_20|再说，等你回来的时候，看到巨大的自己站在校长旁边，一定会尴尬得说不出话。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Sad3"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_21|你的表情明明这样安宁，我不相信……你一定是在其他世界迷了路，忘记了怎么回来……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1147},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_22|你说得没错，{Male=他,Female=她}的确进入了其他的维度，一个很遥远的维度。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_23|听到身后突然出现的达芙黛尔的声音，拉蒙娜近乎失态地站了起来，险些没克制住去抓握店主的胳膊。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Turn_Jump"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_DeadEnd_Ver3_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_24|您说什么？您找到{Male=他,Female=她}了？维度……我记得您能够穿梭维度！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_25|怎样才能将{Male=他,Female=她}带回来？我可以付出任何代价！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_26|难掩激动地恳求后，拉蒙娜才注意到一旁朵尔并无笑意的面庞。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_27|……怎么？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1147},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_28|虽然你的决心很令人感动，但很遗憾，那是一个并未与这个世界相连的维度，况且，我也没有办法带守密人跨越未知的维度空间。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        PlayEnterAnim = 1,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1118,4)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1147},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_29|如果无法找到确定的航线，随意在维度乱流中穿梭，只有迷失一种结局。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1121},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_30|以弥萨格现有的技术，也无法做到这一点。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_31|什么意思……我们尝试了这么久，终于有了{Male=他,Female=她}的消息，难道就要让{Male=他,Female=她}一个人流落在外吗？！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1147},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118701_Content_32|穿梭维度的技巧，我或许还可以与朵尔教授一同商讨，就当是免费赠予老顾客的。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        RoleHide = {1118}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1147},
