        Content = "AvgDialog_118700_Content_9|一道虚无的身影，默默站立在祈祷的人群之后。那是深藏于她意识之中、只有她能够看见的身影。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1826,3,Serious)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Light_long"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118700_Content_10|周围的嘈杂消失。在脑海深处，拉蒙娜凝望着那个遥远的自己。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Sad3"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118700_Content_11|你的力量比我强大……或许，这次的任务应该由你去，才会更加稳妥……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118700_Content_12|感受到拉蒙娜内心所想，环行·拉蒙娜摇了摇头，抬起被遮罩的双眼静静望向那道深渊。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1826,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118700_Content_13|我只是来送行的，在这样遥远的维度旅途中，我与你并没有什么分别，更何况……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1826,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118700_Content_14|你才是{Male=他的,Female=她的}搭档，这是属于你们的命运，不属于我。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1826,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118700_Content_15|去吧，去带回{Male=他,Female=她}，「拉蒙娜」。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118700_Content_16|拉蒙娜握住玫瑰的手猛地攥紧，半晌，她郑重地点了点头，在另一个自己的目送下坐进了精神分离仪中。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1118,3,Serious)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118700_Content_17|肉体的双目紧闭，另一双眼缓缓睁开，一道凝实的灵魂脱离了身体，被波吕克斯「圣心」的光辉镀上一层朦胧如纱的白光。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_White"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Bolvkesi_Exalt",
          "300"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Light_Feather_Magic_B"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118700_Content_18|在数十道目光的注视下，拉蒙娜回过头，与战友们一一对视，背负上了那些沉重的希望。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1118,3,Serious)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118700_Content_19|在那些思念的指引下，她转过身，纵身跃入了巨大的漩涡之中。地狱之门一般的入口，转瞬吞没了单薄的灵魂。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Blacksun"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_BlackHole"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_LoJeiSi_Plaster_Ocean"
        }
      })
    })
  },
