        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118703_Content_13|好像……结束了？",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_New_World_Pain_45BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118703_Content_14|凄厉的叫声不知道从何时消失不见。你抬起头。脆弱的虚幻维度里，早已没有了那道令人战栗的恐怖气息。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Bizarre_GOD"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118703_Content_15|你胜利了。祂的潜意识与这里隔断，最后一颗巨大的眼瞳，已于维度之中消散。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118703_Content_16|你艰难稳住精疲力竭的精神，几乎是下意识地回过头去。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118703_Content_17|咔嚓",
        DialogType = 6,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Break_Diamond_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118703_Content_18|一声虚幻的晶体碎裂声传入你的耳畔，你看到的是如蛛网般裂开的维度隧道，与精神体开始像老旧电视一样闪烁的拉蒙娜。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Blacksun"
        },
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Time_Tunnel_Break"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Dreamy_Memories_109BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Time_Tunnel"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118703_Content_19|<Big:<Shake:拉蒙娜！！！>>",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Zoom_In"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118703_Content_20|早已疲惫不堪的身体似乎在一瞬间痊愈。你再也顾不上任何事，飞一般来到她的身边，颤抖着握住那双手。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thouch_Cloth"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118703_Content_21|我，没事……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118703_Content_22|你的搭档还是像往常一样笑着，她更紧地回握住你的手，仿佛什么也没发生一般继续着原本的安排。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118703_Content_23|你已经击败了祂，来，跟我走吧，我会带你回去。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118703_Content_24|她牵引着你，就像往常做任务时一样。\n只是，一道更加理性的声音近乎冷酷地响起。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1121},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118703_Content_25|拉蒙娜，维度隧道已经被祂击碎，你的精神体无法承受继续维持隧道的负荷，再这样下去，你只会走向脑死亡。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          1,
          "AvgVertical"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Brooches_Shine"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1121},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118703_Content_26|这次救援已经……失败了，你必须马上回来，我会启动分离仪的召回模式，让你的精神回归身体。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          1,
