        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1920,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_3|好累，身体好沉……这是……梦？",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1983,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_4|哥哥！卡斯托尔圣子阁下！又在发什么呆呢？快帮我把梯子往左挪一挪！",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"awake", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_ShipCornerLogo"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Recover_Remember"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Flirt_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Mist"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1982},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_5|哦，好，这边吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"awake", 2},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Slit_Wood"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1983},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_6|多了多了！再往回一点，我已经看到那本书了！嘿——",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_7|年少的波吕克斯站在仓库的木架之上，他踮着脚，尚且稚嫩的翅膀在背后不断扑腾着，终于用力一跳，将一本厚厚的硬壳书从架子上拽了下来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Wing_Flap_Small"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something",
          "650"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1983,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_8|拿到了！我就说肯定在这里……哎哎——",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_9|波吕克斯脸上得意的笑容还没有停留过两秒，就因失去了平衡从梯子上向后翻倒下来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Long_Skirt_03"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Wax_Fall_01",
          "500"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1982,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_10|波吕克斯！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_11|焦急的哥哥向前一步，努力伸着双手试图准确地接住他，然而少年低估了坠落的冲击，也高估了自己的臂力。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Sash"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_12|砰的一声，两个少年以乱七八糟的姿势一起砸倒在地，溅起仓库中薄薄的灰尘。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Long_Skirt_02"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Fall_Down",
          "450"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1983,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_13|哎哟，痛痛痛……那本书呢？有没有摔坏？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_14|波吕克斯捂着屁股，龇牙咧嘴地爬起来，立刻扑到了摔落一旁的书籍边仔细查看——还好，这是一本包装精美、质量过硬的好书。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1982,
          nil,
          "Sad2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_15|你怎么都不关心一下我有没有被你砸坏。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1983,2)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_16|眼神稚嫩的卡斯托尔扁着嘴，颇有些幽怨地凑了过来，两个孩子的脑袋聚在一起，完全被这本大书那用金丝勾勒着华丽纹路的封皮所吸引。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_cing"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1983,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_17|我知道你肯定最厉害啦，我的哥哥怎么会被这点小问题打倒呢……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_18|波吕克斯嘿嘿一笑，由于眼睛仍在一转不转地盯着书皮，往日诚恳的安慰也显得敷衍起来，但卡斯托尔此刻显然也顾不上在意这些。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1982,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_19|好美的花纹，这是用金子画的吗？这本书一定很珍贵吧。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1982},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_20|那个信徒献上供奉的时候说这个叫……手抄本？波吕克斯，你知道什么是手抄本吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1983},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_21|我们两个每天都在一起，我怎么会知道你不知道的东西！不过，打开看看不就知道了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1982},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_22|也是，教会规定我们只能看持灯者书库里的书，翻来覆去就是那些东西，每一本的内容都差不多……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_23|对于两个从未走出过提灯教会的孩子来说，这本外来的藏书只是静静躺在这里，就仿佛是孩童幻想中最神奇的魔法书一般，不断吸引着他们的心。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1983},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_24|啊……",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_StarrySky"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_OpenTheBook_01"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Starlight",
          "450"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Peaceful_Life_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1982,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_25|……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_26|星空、田野、大海、沙漠，雪原上也有盛开的花；国王、弄臣、骑士与公主，邪恶的怪物都会倒在正义之人的剑下……",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_27|这是一本包揽了中世纪种种记录与故事的百科全书，无数贵重颜料绘制的图画万花筒一般倒映在两人眼中，介绍着他们从未得知的世界样貌。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1982,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_28|波……嗯……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_ShipCornerLogo"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Mist"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_29|在惊讶的余韵中，两个少年久久没有说话。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_30|卡斯托尔张了张嘴，他有太多问题想要问，但又无从问起，他仿佛一下子变成了一个牙牙学语的婴儿，充满了对世界的无知与茫然。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1983},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_31|走，我们回去，这本书一定要藏好，这样厚的书，我们每天晚上看一些……用不了一个月就能看完了！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_32|厚重的书在依依不舍的视线中被啪地合上，兄弟两人对视一眼，都发觉了对方眼里兴奋的光芒。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_BookClose"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1307},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_33|下面，把经卷翻到第二十六页，今天我将教二位圣子学习如何发现罪孽、审判罪孽。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1982, 1983},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_LightBearerTemple"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Paper_Spread_out02"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_AfterWar_Ver4_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_LanternChurch"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_34|安静的教室中，阿尔比诺在黑板上书写经文释义的声音沙沙回响着。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Chalk_Blackboard_Write"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_35|表面乖顺称是的波吕克斯在阿尔比诺一转过头去时，就挤眉弄眼地侧过头，向卡斯托尔比划着两人秘密发明的暗语手势。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Sash"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1983},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_36|（今天还看骑士和公主的那篇故事怎么样，这次我演骑士，你来演怪物。）",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_pikeman_sarcasm_170BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1982},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_37|（啊，可是那篇故事都看过十二次了。）",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1983},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_38|（那你说看哪篇？哪一页我们不是最少看了八九遍，那一篇已经是最好看的了！）",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1982,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_39|（你说的也是……但我不想演怪物。）",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1983},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_40|（赖皮哥哥！算了，我也有点看腻了，不然……我们自己编一个故事怎么样？）",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1982},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_41|（怎么编故事啊？我想不出来……）",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1983},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_42|（笨，看了那么多骑士故事，我们模仿着写一次新的骑士冒险不就好了！）",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Paper_Spread_out02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_43|悄无声息的沟通于两人快速翻飞的手指间进行着，直到一片阴影忽然投到了没能及时收回手的卡斯托尔面前。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Bad_Misty_Once_02",
          "450"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Bad_Misty_Once_01"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1307},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_44|在干什么呢？两位圣子，好像没有在认真听讲呀？真是让这么认真上课的我有些伤心呢。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Strange_001_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1982,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_45|阿尔比诺先生，我……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1983},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_46|对不起先生，卡斯托尔的手好像扭到了，我正想帮他看看呢，我们错了，我们会好好听讲的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1307},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_47|……原来是这样啊，那确实情有可原呢。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_48|那道饱含笑意的目光在两人的面孔上轻飘飘扫过，便随意地放下了此事，好像刚刚那双蛇瞳中冰冷的影子都只是一瞬的玩笑。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1307},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_49|对了，圣子们，有一件事教主大人要我转告给你们，最近教会有了新的发现，需要你们在下课后去祭坛一趟。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_50|……",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_51|剧痛，无法想象的剧痛，连灵魂都要被撕裂的剧痛。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Blood"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Splash_Blood"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Tideng_Theme_66BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_52|波吕克斯在被教主大人郑重地选中，作为“圣心”的承载者时，还以为这是某种特殊的荣耀。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_53|然而当他被固定在祭坛上，眼睁睁看着自己的胸膛被剖开的时候，一旁教主大人那无动于衷又颇为满意的微笑，让他立刻明白了——",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Slice_Body_Blood"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_54|所谓的圣子，也不过只是随时可以用来祭祀给神的羔羊。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1983,
          nil,
          "Pain"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_55|<Shake:哈……哈……好痛……哥哥……>",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        RoleShake = {0},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SnowAltars"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1982,4,Surprised)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Turn_Jump"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_LanternChurch"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1982,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_56|波吕克斯！你的胸口……怎么会……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_57|浑身在疼痛中颤抖的波吕克斯狠狠抓紧了卡斯托尔搀扶的胳膊，他抬起头，露出了一个十足悲哀的惨笑。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thouch_Cloth_02"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Tight",
          "320"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1983,
          nil,
          "Pain"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_58|<Shake:这就是教主大人说的改造仪式……这就是，我们的命运。>",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_59|……",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1983},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_60|就送到这吧，哥哥，以后的改造仪式，我自己来就可以了……你来等我，也只是站在这里难过。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SnowAltars"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Bolvkesi_calm_120BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1982,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_61|我……我去问过教主大人，她说我的体质不如你更有灵性，不能代替你进行改造。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1982,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_62|我该怎么办呢，波吕克斯，我除了在这里等着你，什么都做不到了……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_63|回应卡斯托尔几乎要哭出来的目光的，只有长久的沉默。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1983},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_64|这样也好，哥哥，起码我们不用承受两份的痛苦。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1983,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_65|别难过，小时候我偷吃东西，偷偷在书上画画的时候，一直都是哥哥替我的任性顶罪受罚，这一次，就换我代替哥哥吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_66|三次，五次，十一次。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Flesh_Torn_Shattered"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_67|卡斯托尔已经有些记不清在祭坛门口进行了多少次漫长的等待，每周的改造仪式让那个总是想尽办法给两个人找乐子的弟弟也变得越来越沉默。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SnowAltars"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1983},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_68|……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_69|波吕克斯蹒跚的脚步声刚刚出现的时候，卡斯托尔就立刻迎了过去。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1983,2);SetRole(1982,4)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Fall_Leaves"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_70|你怎么样？很疼吧？我扶你回去。——这些没有意义的话最终被咽回了喉咙，只有沉默而凝固的空气包围着两人。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Heart_Beat_Loop_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1982,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_71|（我真是太没用了……连话都不会说……）",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_72|卡斯托尔感到有某种异常沉重的东西将两人压得越来越死，让他们已经喘不过气来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Tinnitus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1982,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_73|（不能再这样了，再这样下去……波吕克斯他一定会……）",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_74|波吕克斯静静坐在寝宫的床上，看着一旁欲言又止，仿佛比自己还要焦灼痛苦的哥哥。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_LightBearerTemple"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_ClothesFriction_01"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Bolvkesi_hope_70BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1983},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_75|坐一会吧，哥哥。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1982,4,Sad)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1982,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_76|我明天再去求一求教主大人，让我代替你进行改造吧。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1983},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_77|那又有什么区别？何况你已经求了她三次，上一次还被她狠狠罚过了，到现在你的后背还留着鞭刑的疤痕吧。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1982,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_78|可是，你……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1983,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_79|哥哥。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_80|波吕克斯制止了卡斯托尔继续说下去，他那空洞的目光悠悠地落在了床角中，落在了两人珍藏的那本手抄本上。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1983},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_81|你想要自由吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1982,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_82|什么是……自由？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1983},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_83|你想去……看看外面的世界吗？就像手抄本上说的那样。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_84|波吕克斯拿起手抄本，轻轻摩挲着老旧的书脊，他的目光仿佛注视着卡斯托尔，又仿佛凝望着极为遥远的地方。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Caress02",
          "500"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_85|卡斯托尔愣在原地，一瞬间明白了弟弟想说的全部。那是木讷、呆板、怯懦的自己永远无法想象的、惊世骇俗的狂言。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_86|他要背叛供养两人的教会，从他们诞生、成长的这片罪恶的温床中将血肉撕下，挣脱两人从小习以为常的一切。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_87|卡斯托尔吞咽了一下口水，坚定地握紧了拳头。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Tight"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1982,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90540_Content_88|如果那能让你不再痛苦……我想。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [90536] = {
    ID = 90536,
    CnID = "小型支线_波吕克斯_关卡2_前",
    BaseSortID = 2,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 2,
        Content = "AvgDialog_90536_Content_1|窄门外",
        Chapter = "Beyond the Skies;Outside the Narrow Gate;Part 8",
        DialogType = 4,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_UI_AVG_Chapter_Pop"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        },
        BanSpeedUp = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90536_Content_2|一场隐秘的冒险在两个少年的心中慢慢筹划、发芽。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_LightBearerTemple"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Debris_2_Crisis_49BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90536_Content_3|即便看了那么多遍骑士的冒险故事，卡斯托尔还是没能习惯这样出格的行为。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90536_Content_4|他小心、笨拙地跟随着波吕克斯的指示，一同在深夜中偷偷探索，充实着两人自由的地图。"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1983},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90536_Content_5|把今天晚上发现的这条水道也画在地图上吧，那地方偏得完全没有人去，但我们可以从那里游过去！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1982,4)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Paper"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pencil_Writing",
          "450"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1982,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90536_Content_6|好，不过……能不走还是不走这里吧，翅膀泡在水里的感觉好不舒服。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1983,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90536_Content_7|忍一忍就过去了！只有一小段而已，这可是关乎我们自由的大事！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1982,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90536_Content_8|好吧，你说得对，骑士是不会害怕冒险的艰辛的。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90536_Content_9|卡斯托尔有些不好意思地缩了缩翅膀，又点点头给两人打起气来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1982},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90536_Content_10|（每当这时候，波吕克斯就会又变得像从前一样了，真好。）",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90536_Content_11|两人用尽一切可能的机会，将这片从小生活的地方仔细地摸索清楚，又耐心谨慎地等待着，直到一个完美的时机出现。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SnowAltars"
        },
        BgTransition = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90536_Content_12|趁着于丽埃特离开教会、而所有教众都在为一场盛大的仪式忙碌时，两人终于沿着那些曲折的小路，悄无声息地离开了关锁他们的牢笼。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1983},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90536_Content_13|快，快点，马上就到了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        ScreenEffect = {
          "continueShake",
          1
        },
        BgID = {
          "SScene_GlacialRelics"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Zoom_In"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Run_Two",
          "350"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_RunRunRun_124BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1982,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90536_Content_14|这边的出口太高了，我还，我还不太会飞呢！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1983},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90536_Content_15|没时间换一条路了，害怕的话就抓紧我，我不会让你掉下去的，准备好——跳！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90536_Content_16|两对稚嫩的翅膀一瞬冲进了宁静的夜空，激烈鼓动的心跳淹没在耳畔呼啸的风中。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {
          "continueShake",
          2
        },
        BgID = {
          "SScene_StarrySky"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Turn_Jump"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_A_Gust_Of_Wind_Blows"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Wing_Flap_Small",
          "450"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90536_Content_17|圆月如盘，星河如洗，这个晴朗夏夜无数细微的风景都照进了两个少年的眼中。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Bolvkesi_night_sky_142BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1983},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90536_Content_18|原来从天上看，世界是这样的……",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Come_Down"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90536_Content_19|两个人睁大了眼，就这样呆呆地、不知疲倦地一直飞啊飞啊。",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Wing_Flap_Small"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1982,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90536_Content_20|啊……我们到哪里了？我们之后要去哪呢？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1983,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
