        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Yang_Solemn_110BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_White_Ocean"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1920},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_3|所以，我不会失败的，我不会允许那样的结局再次出现了……我想请求你，给予我绝对能够死去的办法。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_4|……你真的这样决定了吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1920},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_5|是，我相信你一定有那样的力量，不管于丽埃特想要利用圣子做什么，她都一定需要两个圣子同时存在。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1920},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_6|如果最终我们仍然不能逃离所谓的宿命，那么，就彻底毁掉它吧。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_7|哪怕牺牲你所有的未来？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1920},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_8|哪怕牺牲我所有的未来。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Sad2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_9|……一直以来，我都喜爱生命，厌恶死亡，我恐惧着那柄高悬在头顶的利剑，所以想尽办法逃离它。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Sad2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_10|但，我知道你并不害怕它，你比我要勇敢很多，小鸟儿。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Sad1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_11|如果你想要摘下那柄利剑作为武器，我会帮你，但我希望你不要有用到它的那一天。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_12|那一截你曾吞下的枝条只是在我的力量下沉睡了，当它再次生长时，它会把你的生命当做养分。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_13|我会教给你主动催发它的方法，你要想清楚，枝条一旦生长就无法再逆转了，你没有后悔的机会。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_14|保重了，小鸟儿。",
