        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Branch_Whoosh_Attack"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_23|那棵原本已经枯死的小树此刻忽然焕发了新的生机，其中沉睡的泰旖丝一同睁开了眼，正微笑注视着她。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_YANGMA_EYS"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1134},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_24|想过去吗？可没有那么容易哦，你的对手是我。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1821,
          nil,
          "Sad2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_25|啧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_26|……卡斯托尔？你怎么了？！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1821},
        RoleShake = {0},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_27|痛苦摇晃的波吕克斯回过头，这才发现卡斯托尔迅速衰败下去的异样，惊惶地奔向自己此时唯一的战友。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Run_Short"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Sad_80_8_6_Soft"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1920,
          nil,
          "Pain"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_28|用那把匕首……杀了我，快……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_29|我为什么要杀你！你不准死，卡斯托尔你这个懦夫！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_30|波吕克斯伸出手想要查看卡斯托尔的状况，却对着那满身自己刚刚刻下的、鲜血淋漓的伤口无所适从。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Carcass_blood"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1920,
          nil,
          "Pain"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_31|只要我死了，你就能活下来。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_32|我……我……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_33|卡斯托尔握住了波吕克斯那只抓着匕首的手，轻柔地将它引向自己的胸膛，却被波吕克斯狠狠打开。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleShake = {1920},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_iron_Sword_Ground"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_34|谁要你自作主张？谁允许你替我决定？你想丢下我一个人吗！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_35|总是莫名其妙地逞英雄，让我厌恶你，又让我亏欠你……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Angry2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_36|我不会感谢你的，我恨你！你听见了吗！我恨你！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1920,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_37|恨吗……呵呵，没关系，这一切很快就会结束了……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_38|卡斯托尔看向猛地丢开匕首的波吕克斯，从那别扭的大吼中感到了一丝不舍。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_SadStory_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_39|他欣慰地笑了笑，慢慢蜷缩起衰弱的身体，就像要回归诞生时的姿势一样。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1920,3,ShutEye)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1920,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_40|一会儿你要拼命地跑，跑得越远越好……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1920,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_41|你要去看一看雪山的花，去看看大海的颜色，去尝一尝，自由是什么味道……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_42|等等！我命令你，停下！不……",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_43|在断断续续的呢喃中，在波吕克斯慌乱的呼喊中，卡斯托尔的气息渐渐消失了。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1922}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_44|他的身体倏然沙一般坍塌，化作了点点荧光，飘散在了空中。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"starlight", 1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Soul_Twinkling_Small"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_45|在模糊视线的泪水中，波吕克斯徒劳地抓握着，拥抱着那些光点，感到有什么生命中最重要的东西在那一瞬间失去了。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_46|地上越来越亮的法阵仍然徒劳地运作着，却只是将那些荧光融入了波吕克斯的身体。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Runes_Steam"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_47|……！！！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        ScreenEffect = {"starlight", 2},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_48|汹涌的记忆一刹那淹没了波吕克斯，像是命运的闸门豁然打开，两个源于一体的灵魂就此重逢。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C07_020"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Bizarre_GOD"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Nostalgia_Ver2_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_49|那些整日颐指气使的生活像是虚假的泡沫一般倒退、消散了。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_50|他回忆起了他们寂寞的童年，回忆起了那本转折命运的手抄本，回忆起了他们出逃与失败。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Woods"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_Play_A_SFX_Memory_Confusion"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Tinnitus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_51|在那源自灵魂的纠缠中，他甚至从命运罅隙的幻影里一瞬窥到了他们的诞生——",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C07_020"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Ghost_ChildCry_X_03"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1821},
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_52|啧，又不是双生么？唉，直接处理掉吧，不要让他来到这污浊的世界上受苦了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SnowAltars"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_53|像是预知到了死亡的命运，那个原本即将被抛弃的失败实验品突然开始挣扎扭动着。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_54|随着一声细弱、阴郁的啼哭响起，原本孤单的血肉向外膨胀撕扯着，生长出了另一个生命。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Bone_kakaka",
          "350"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Expansion_Flesh",
          "350"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Ghost_ChildCry_X_04"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_55|他也回忆起了如何在教会的手段下，在那日复一日重复的神学课中，逐渐将卡斯托尔忘记的过去。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_LightBearerTemple"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_56|卡斯托尔进入罪潭的第7天",
        DialogType = 6,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_57|两人被分开后，波吕克斯并没有遭受同样的酷刑，在翅膀断裂的伤口愈合后，他便在于丽埃特亲自的教导下开始学习提灯的神学。",
