        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Long_Skirt_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Pain"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_62|把我们从出生起的所有，还有逃走的计划，那些一点点探索的路线，通通刻下来！想要夺走我的意志，你休想得逞！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Stone_Wood_Carve_A"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1922,
          nil,
          "Pain"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_63|等着我，哥哥，我一定会找到机会，再次带你逃走的……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_64|卡斯托尔进入罪潭的第@1天",
        DialogType = 6,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_65|日复一日不断重复的麻木修行中，波吕克斯已经习惯了在每天晚上准时醒来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_LightBearerTemple"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_66|这隐秘而执着的雕刻时间，是他在这样暗无天日的生活中唯一支撑下去的希望。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_90537_Content_67|他又一次在混乱的梦境中猛地坐起，急迫地要继续那未竟的事业。",
