      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139660_Content_8|慢点，一个一个问题来。",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139660_Content_9|根据我的经验，这里大概率是一座密境吧。",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Shaye_forget_Theme_130"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139660_Content_10|我确实不算普通人，我是来自弥萨格大学的调查员。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139660_Content_11|沙耶的眼神中写满了疑惑，显然这些名词对她而言都太过陌生。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139660_Content_12|如果展开来讲的话，就太过漫长了。我现在有更重要的事情需要解决。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolGraveyard"
        },
