        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_26|沙耶有不同的看法？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2346},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_27|嗯，在世界上总是存在着很多很多不同的人，不同的事物……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Serious2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_28|其中比较强大的那些，就会占有和掠夺更弱小的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2346},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_29|这也是无可奈何的事情吧？",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_30|不，不是这样的，这就是为什么弥萨格存在。",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Zhengjiu_reunion_0"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_31|我们想要从融蚀的侵蚀中，守护那些未必强大、但闪闪发光的生命与记忆。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_32|当然，也包括你，沙耶。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Smile3"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_33|……是吗。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_34|沙耶喃喃自语。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_35|那样的话……也许是吧……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_36|不知在重复的光景中行进了多久，你们终于见到了一丝不同的景象。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_RedWorld"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Meat_Four",
          "800"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Shaye_nervous_72"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Saya_World_Change",
          "Set_Amb_Saya_World_MutateWorld",
          "400"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_37|又一片蒲公英……？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_38|沙耶低着头，微微喘着气，你看不清她的表情。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_39|这里……就是我们出发的小屋，你看那边。",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_BadDandelion"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Saya_Dandelion_Mucus",
          "Stop_A_SFX_Amb_Saya_World_Change"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_40|你指向房间角落，早上被你从沙耶手腕扯下并抛掷在一旁的肉块。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Up_Mucus_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_41|我们……绕回来了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_42|密境之中除了荒芜，一无所有。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_zuoyou_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Smile3"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_43|也算是恰好吧，可以……休息一会儿了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_44|沙耶若无其事地微笑，尾音中却带着一丝无法抑制的颤抖。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_45|沙耶，你的身体……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Weak"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_46|我有点累呢……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cloth_Movement_Light_B"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_47|就在你的面前，沙耶的身体像被抽去了所有支撑，直直地坠倒下去。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Wax_Fall_01",
          "600"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise1.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_48|沙耶！",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_49|深夜，沙耶高烧不止。在她的指挥下，你用看不出是什么的东西生起了火堆。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_StarrySky"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Flame_Burning",
          "600"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Fire_Out",
          "300"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_50|如果我知道你病得这么重，就不会让你跟着我走一天路……",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Shaye_memory_00_difference"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Smile3"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_51|没关系，我觉得生病应该不是因为这种原因……\n比起这个……聊聊天好吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_52|没问题，你想聊些什么？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_53|你早上的时候说，你和弥萨格想要对抗融蚀，守护其他人，也守护我。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Shy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_54|这是真的吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_55|当然。在正式被授予银钥的那天，我就宣誓过了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_56|你的声音比自己预想的更笃定。话说出口的瞬间，授钥仪式的画面在脑海中倏然浮现——",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_57|银钥沉甸甸地落入掌心时的凉意，众人肃穆的注视，以及自己握紧钥匙时心底涌起的那股滚烫的决意。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "ShowItem(9533)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Brooches_Shine_Get"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_58|沙耶似乎沉默了一小会儿。火光将她小小的侧影镀上一层暖融融的橘色。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Flame_Burning"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_59|那么，如果有一天，你失去了作为守密人的力量，成为了一个普通人。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Serious2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_60|如果无法再完成对抗融蚀的使命了……你会怎么做？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_61|那个啊，我已经想好了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_62|你往后仰了仰身子，双手撑在身后的草地上，仰头望向头顶无垠的星空。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Meteor"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_02"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Meteor_Passing_By_01",
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Starlight"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_63|我会和我的爱人、我的朋友们一起，平平稳稳地过完普通的一生。",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Zhengjiu_reunion_0"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_64|等到老了，头发白了，跑不动了，我们就一起围坐在炉火边，翻来覆去地怀念年轻时候干过的那些糗事。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_65|拉蒙娜肯定还是会纠正德克斯特勋爵念错的每一位女士的名字；威廉还是那副不苟言笑的样子，端着书假装在看，其实耳朵早就竖起来了……",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1118,2);FadeDarkRole(1118,1);SetRole(1183,4);FadeDarkRole(1183,1)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_66|诃勒特老师照旧抱着她的伏特加，喝到尽兴处非要拉着所有人唱歌。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1183, 1118},
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1181,3);FadeDarkRole(1181,1)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_67|你转过头，发现沙耶正安安静静地看着你。火光映在她的眼底，明明灭灭，像是盛了两簇小小的星子。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1181}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Smile3"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_68|真美好。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Weak"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_69|但是……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_70|沙耶的声音哑了哑，她收回目光，黯淡的眼瞳凝视着阴暗角落的虚空。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Corrosion"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Weak"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_71|如果你和他们分散了，你的身边空无一人，那你要怎么办？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_72|他们是离开了，还是一开始就不存在？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_73|如果……是记忆中确实残留着相遇、共处的时光……",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "retro",
          1,
          "mucus",
          1
        },
        BgID = {
          "CG_SD_S_B15_04"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Saya_Dadelion_B"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_White_Ocean"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Serious2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_74|但时间过去太久，记忆支离破碎，你也不知是真是假……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_75|只要我还能记得，我就一定会去找他们。",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "retro",
          2,
          "mucus",
          2
        },
        BgID = {
          "SScene_StarrySky"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_76|无论天涯海角，无论有多少艰难险阻，我一定会找到他们。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_77|你望向沙耶的眼神没有一丝犹疑。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2346},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_78|假如……我是说假如——找不到呢？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_79|我也会一直寻找，走过每一条路，翻过每一座山，渡过每一片海。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SnowWind"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_White_Ocean"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_80|直到在不断寻找的旅程中，消耗完我这漫长的一生。",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SeasideDay"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_81|即使在合上眼的那个瞬间，我也依然是饱满而充实的。",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolGraveyard"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_82|因为我这一生既有珍贵的记忆，也有无论如何都要前往的地方。",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolDaytime"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_83|寻找本身，就已经是意义了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_84|话音落下，四周忽然安静得只剩下蒲公英在微风中摇曳的沙沙声。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Breath_of_Wild"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_New_World_Save_Sad_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_85|……沙耶？",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_86|沙耶合上了眼，她的面色苍白如薄纸。你的心狠狠地揪紧了。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Corridor"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2346,ShutEye,3);",
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Bedroom"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_87|沙耶……",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_88|你焦急地凑近，却发现沙耶的鼻息轻柔而平稳，胸口随着呼吸缓缓起伏，像湖面上最细微的涟漪。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_89|只是睡着了啊……",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_90|我也，有点，困了呢……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_91|突如其来的安心感下，奔忙一天的疲惫和满眼肉块的视觉压力终于占据了你。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139657_Content_92|在终结到来之前，这一夜也静悄悄地流逝了。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [139658] = {
    ID = 139658,
    CnID = "联动剧情_沙耶之歌_关卡5_前",
    BaseSortID = 6,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 6,
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_1|雨霁时",
        Chapter = "Forgotten Seed of Love;After the Rain;Part 5",
        DialogType = 4,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Play_UI_AVG_Chapter_Pop",
          "Stop_Avg_CG_Audio",
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        },
        BanSpeedUp = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_2|当你醒来的时候，光线已经变了。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Cloudy"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Shaye_memory_00"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_3|潮湿的空气里有了一种洗过之后的干净气味，门缝里挤进来的不是风，而是一束安静的光。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Sunlight",
          "600"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Weak"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_4|……外面好安静。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Weak"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_5|雨……停了吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_6|沙耶的眼睛是望向窗户的，可是那目光没有落点。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Sunny"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_7|阳光投进她的眼底，就像一颗石子投进水里，却没有荡开任何涟漪。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_8|雨停了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_9|你语调艰涩。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_10|真好啊，能感觉到太阳。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_11|沙耶笑着，伸出手触摸阳光落进来的方向，像一株植物迎向光。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2346},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_12|能扶我出去看看吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_13|你搀扶着沙耶在小屋旁倚着墙坐下。即使只是这一小段路，沙耶也难以掩饰地喘着气。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "CG_SD_S_B15_03"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cloth_Movement_Light_C"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Saya_Dadelion_C"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Shaye_impression_00_difference"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Saya_Dandelion_Mucus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_14|沙耶，你的身体……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Smile3"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_15|不必在意，我想是时间快到了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_16|你也能感觉到吧？阻碍我们链接的那堵壁障……正在消退。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_17|再过一会儿，一定会完全崩塌。\n到那时……应该就能建立你所说的「链接」了吧。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_18|可是……",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_BadDandelion"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_19|链接之后，沙耶或许就会消失。那堵壁障是她保护自己的围墙，才会因为她的虚弱而变得脆弱。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_20|请不必有所顾虑。这个时刻，能有你在身边陪伴、交流，我非常高兴哦。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_21|沙耶眯起眼睛，露出真诚而虚弱的笑意。你不忍直视，但还是努力将她的笑容印刻在记忆里。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_22|我会一直陪着你的。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_23|好啦，别露出那副忧郁的表情。让我们继续昨天的话题吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Smile2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_24|你说，即使无法对抗融蚀、即便身边空无一人，你也还要继续前进。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Smile2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_25|我很好奇，这是为什么呢？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_26|为什么呢？雨后的阳光有些刺眼，让你忍不住想要流泪。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Sunny"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_27|你深吸一口气。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_28|因为我爱着拉蒙娜，爱着弥萨格大学的所有同伴。\n同时，我确信他们也爱着我。",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C00_014"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_White_Ocean"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_29|可是你们相隔很远很远，不能触碰彼此，不能确认彼此的心意。",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_BadDandelion"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_30|何况你的世界存在名为「融蚀」的异常，你怎么能确定你思念的人没有遗忘你的存在呢？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_31|她的声音带着一股近乎梦呓的轻柔。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_32|融蚀或许会抹去存在，但银芯在潜意识的海洋中链接了我和拉蒙娜。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_33|你望向远方。雨后的天际线清晰得不可思议，云层被风撕开了一道口子，金色的光柱从缝隙中倾泻而下，落在远处的山脊上。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"starlight", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Cloudy"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shining_point_light"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Starlight"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_34|我能感觉到她的存在，即使现在这一时刻也是一样，即使我们被迫分散在不同世界也是一样。",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Shaye_bloom_prelude_128"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_35|何况……",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"starlight", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_BadDandelion"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_36|嗯？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_37|她微微偏过头来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_38|真正的爱人不需要在身边也能感知到彼此，也能确认彼此的爱。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_39|哪怕世界末日轮回不止，我也一定能找到拉蒙娜。她也一定会做出同样的选择。",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C00_012"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_White_Ocean"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_40|我有这种预感。我们在精神之海中相连的思念，永远不会断绝。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_41|沙耶沉默了很久，雨后的风穿过小屋，拂过她几乎没有血色的面颊。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_BadDandelion"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Breath_of_Wild"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_42|然后，她笑了。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_43|真是，强烈而坚定的信任，真是，伟大的爱啊……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_44|她说「爱」这个字的时候，声音里没有羡慕，没有哀伤，没有遗憾。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_45|只有温柔。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_46|像是一个在漫长冬夜里独自赶路的旅人，终于在地平线的尽头望见了第一缕晨曦——她不一定能走到那里，光只要存在，就已经足够。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_47|沙耶痴痴地笑着。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_48|然后，她朝你伸出手来。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2346,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_49|……握住我的手。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CG_SD_S_B15_12"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Saya_Link_Hand",
          "Play_A_SFX_Saya_Dadelion_C"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Shaye_bloom_128"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_50|那只手苍白、纤细、微微颤抖着，她看不见你，可她的手却准确无误地伸向了你所在的方向——",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_51|像是某种比视觉更古老、比语言更深沉的东西，在引导着她。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_52|你伸出手去，握住了她。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "keyWorkEffect",
          1
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cloth_Movement_Light_B"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Floodlight"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_53|就在你们的掌心相触的那个瞬间——",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgTransition = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Abstract_Finger_Touch_Silvery"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_54|眼眶一阵剧痛。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "keyWorkEffect",
          2,
          "redScreen",
          1
        },
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_L_O07_5"
        },
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Saya_Link_Transform"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_55|某种远比那更尖锐、更灼烈的东西，像一道闪电劈开了你的颅骨，直直地贯穿了你意识的最深处。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "redScreen",
          2,
          "redLoop",
          1
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thriller_03"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_56|视野剧烈地摇晃起来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "redScreen",
          2,
          "continueShake",
          1
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Tinnitus",
          "Play_Play_A_SFX_Memory_Confusion"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Heartbeat_Hard_NeedStop"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_57|你看见了阳光下湿漉漉的蒲公英、沙耶苍白而安详的侧脸、她干裂的唇角弯起的那抹笑——",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "CG_SD_S_B15_03"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_58|然后一切骤变成血肉的宇宙，天空是血红的，大地是血红的，就连眼前的沙耶也——",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Blood2"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Saya_Change_MutateWorld"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_59|不——",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 2},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_60|两种光景在你的视野中交替闪现、重叠、融合，两条本该平行的河流在某个不可能的交汇点猛然撞在了一起。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "keyWorkEffect",
          1,
          "keyWorkVideo",
          1
        },
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_L_O07_5"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Brooches_Launch_CG"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Saya_Link"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_A_SFX_Amb_Heartbeat_Hard_NeedStop"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_139658_Content_61|你和沙耶的链接，完成了。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "keyWorkVideo",
          2,
          "continueShake",
          2
        },
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_SilverCore_PlayerGet"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [139661] = {
    ID = 139661,
    CnID = "联动剧情_沙耶之歌_关卡6_前",
    BaseSortID = 7,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 7,
