      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_142892_Content_35|那些其他的，被抓住的狂信者会到哪里去？",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2350,
          nil,
          "Serious1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_142892_Content_36|祂们也在厄波扬斯。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2350,
          nil,
          "Serious1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_142892_Content_37|一个同样永恒，但不那么快乐的厄波扬斯。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2350},
        Content = "AvgDialog_142892_Content_38|在那里，什么都没有，连痛苦都能算作奖励。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_142892_Content_39|你似懂非懂，月色披被在你们身上，魇护卫着你们，这场奇妙的旅途走向尾声。",
