        Content = "AvgDialog_142892_Content_48|我亲爱的小朋友，当然不。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2350,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_142892_Content_49|留在厄波扬斯，你会过上你小时候看故事书所向往的，伟大而不凡的一生，你再也不会被消磨。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2350,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_142892_Content_50|我们会去探险，会从俗世里逃走，那些给我们的生活带来剧变和灾难的敌人，终将会被我们打击得永远不敢露头。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_142892_Content_51|你深吸了一口气。你又摸到了那只草蜢，拙劣、粗糙、有些扎手。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_02"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_142892_Content_52|是的，那些都很好。",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_142892_Content_53|但我要付出的代价是什么，庞托斯舅舅？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_142892_Content_54|他的眉头极缓慢地蹙起，带着一种令你陌生的，矜贵的傲慢。",
