      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2352},
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_12|庞托斯，结束了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2352},
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_13|还活着的人，如果留在厄波扬斯，要以遗忘厄波扬斯外的记忆为代价。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_AfterWarVer2_58BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2352},
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_14|而像我这种已经死去，被重塑为魇的人，最后所有的记忆都会被缓慢侵蚀。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2352},
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_15|雅格已经做出了他的选择，我也做出了我的……\n让我们离开吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_16|庞托斯的嘴唇抿成一条冷漠的线，腮帮绷紧。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2350,
          nil,
          "Serious1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_17|你应该还记得，你依托厄波扬斯而存在。离开厄波扬斯，你会死。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        Sequence = "SetRole(2352,4)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2352},
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_18|对，但我过去的记忆也会回来。我会作为一个人类死去，这是唯一的办法。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2352},
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_19|我已经……不记得你和雅格小时候的样子了，至少，在我完全忘记你们之前。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_20|庞托斯僵在了原地，第一次，你看到他脸上出现了如此悲伤的表情。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleShake = {2350},
        Sequence = "SetRole(2350,2,Sad)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2350,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_21|……我真希望我能说那股力量还在控制着我。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {2352}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_22|他闭上眼，仿佛想要从他不想面对的事情里躲开。最后，他露出了一个自嘲且颓然的笑。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2350,3,ShutEye)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2350,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_23|那样我就可以理直气壮地违背你们的意愿，对你们行恶。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_24|……",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
