        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2350,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_45|你们还太小，太蒙昧，误以为那种庸常就叫作幸福。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2350},
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_46|这次，我不会再犯把选择权交给你们自己的<Red:「错误」>了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_47|你们弄错了，他没有妥协，他不会，也绝不准备放手，他只是放下了一个饵。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_48|他早就发现了另一部分的「你」，他要找到「你」，他不容许再有任何意外。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_49|太轻易了，那场战斗，那场胜利。\n那是一个要钓出<Red:「你」>的陷阱。",
        DialogType = 7,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "redScreen",
          1,
          "disturb",
          1,
          "redLoop",
          1
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thriller_05",
          "Play_A_SFX_Thriller_04"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2350,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_50|无论要付出怎样的代价，无论要向怎样的存在宣誓效忠……",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2350},
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_51|我都会让厄波扬斯的狂欢永远持续下去。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_52|没有人知道，为什么他突然允许衰老在自己身上发生。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "mucus",
          1,
          "continueShake",
          1
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2351,3);FadeDarkRole(2351,1)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Black_Mist_Surges_01",
          "Play_A_SFX_Pangtuosi_Crawl_Dark_Vibe"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pangtuosi_Whistle_Blow_B_Simple"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Pangtuosi_unhappy_0"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_53|整个厄波扬斯都在和他一同摇晃，四周的所有介质与他胸口涌动出的海水，不分彼此地相互交融。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Black_Mist_Attack2",
          "Play_A_SFX_Black_Mist_Attack3",
          "Play_A_SFX_Black_Mist_Surges_02",
          "Play_A_SFX_Bizarre_GOD"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_54|或许有朋友，或许有敌人，无数只黑色的胳膊从他的胸膛探出，撕扯抚摸着他的皮肤。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_55|像是想逃离，又像是要永远和他相聚。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2351,
          nil,
          "Serious1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_56|我在一条早就没有办法回头的道路上，我也不需要回头。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2351},
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_57|那些未曾经历的时光根本无关紧要，在厄波扬斯，它们可控，温顺，不会带来伤害。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2351,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_142888_Content_58|真遗憾，我暂时还没有办法把你留下，我们的时间已经到了，<Red:%player%>。",
