        },
        BanSpeedUp = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1147,
          nil,
          "Scheme"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72009_Content_2|很遗憾，我也想为你找到重新转移回原维度的方法，但你所在的维度似乎并未与卡达斯的底层相连……",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_DollLab"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Dafudaier_Theme_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Private_Room"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1147,
          nil,
          "Scheme"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72009_Content_3|换句话说，那里并非托乎瓦波的万千梦境之一。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1147,
          nil,
          "Scheme"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72009_Content_4|即便是我，也不能轻易在两个世界间进行维度穿越。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72009_Content_5|既然如此……我至少需要一副能够在这里自由行动的躯体。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72009_Content_6|你无法在两个世界间进行穿越……但利用这个世界内侧的资源是可行的，对吧？",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1147,
          nil,
          "Resigned"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72009_Content_7|不愧是弥萨格最后的守密人，提出的要求还是这么刁难人。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72009_Content_8|办不到吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1147,
          nil,
          "Smile2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72009_Content_9|当然不会。达芙黛尔的小店必将实现你的心愿。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72009_Content_10|代价呢？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1147,
          nil,
          "Smile2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72009_Content_11|守密人在新世界的第一个要求，只能当成一份隆重的礼物赠送，怎么会要求代价呢？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1147},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72009_Content_12|只不过……如果你想表示感激的话……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
