      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_22|所以，詹金，你确实没见到第三个人吗？一个红色短发，一惊一乍的研究员……",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_ClockTower"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Fun_001_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Mist"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1914,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_23|我看恐怕是凶多吉少了，那句话怎么说来着，节哀顺变，愿她的灵魂安息？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_24|戴着兜帽的小老鼠耸了耸肩。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1914},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_25|把你们两个西区佬刨出来的地方，与其说是废墟，不如说是石块儿的小山。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1914},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_26|要不是布朗非扯着我说里面有东西，我才懒得去翻捡呢。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_27|然后……朵尔你已经完全不记得你的邪恶实验了？",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_28|虽然我觉得你的指控是纯粹的无稽之谈，但我不得不提醒你的是，以人类的善恶观衡量我的行动准则不具备丝毫恰当性。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1914},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_29|我不知道你们之间有什么恩怨，不过，喏，这里有面包。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1914},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_30|口渴的话那边有水，嗯，还有些红茶，和我认不出来的一堆高档玩意儿。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise2.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_31|你……发家致富了？",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_emmm"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Set_Avg_Mus_As_More"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1914,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_32|什么乱七八糟的！你不知道吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_OMG"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1914},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_33|那个做了一大堆怪梦的晚上过后，大部分人都不见了，外面全是怪物。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1914},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_34|好在因为人都不见了，所以到处都是免费面包。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_35|你……怎么会来这里？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_36|你环顾四周，小小的钟楼空间摆了五六个卧铺。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_zuoyou_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1914,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_37|我才不想来，小老鼠在街头活得好得很。就是晚上的时候，那些闹哄哄的家伙太烦人了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1914},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_38|我往高处躲的时候，就找到了这里，要爬个梯子，怪物上不来。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1914},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_39|可惜我发现得晚，已经被人占啦，大多数都是伤病员，或者疯疯癫癫的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1914,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_40|有个善心的大姐姐给我也准备了一张床铺，那句话怎么说来着，“何乐而不为”？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1025},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_41|詹金，有客人来吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1008,3,Surprised1);FadeDarkRole(1008,1)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Normal_Short"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_42|你的呼吸一滞。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1008,
          nil,
          "Smile1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_43|啊，不好意思，招待不周，我这就去给你们端茶来。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Sequence = "FadeDarkRole(1008,2)",
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Ersi_Sad_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1914,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_44|姐姐！他们有手有脚的，不需要你照顾。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1914,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_45|对了，这是我姐姐，梅森，她现在看起来有点怪，但你们要是敢把她当成怪物的话，我不会让你们有好果子吃！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_46|……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_47|你怎么回事？感天动地的姐弟情深，你第一次见？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1914,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_48|什么姐弟，你眼睛是不是有问题啊！？我是女的，女的！",
        DialogType = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Emm"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_49|一切都回来了，正如你第一次与她相见的时候。\n你拭了拭眼角。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_50|抱歉，我失态了，只是没想到会再见到你们……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1008,
          nil,
          "Surprised1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_51|再？这位%sirormadam%，我们以前认识吗？很抱歉接受治疗后我有很多记忆都混乱了……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_52|不，这不重要……知道你们还活着，就好了……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_53|……",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_54|…………",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1914},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_55|我不知道大姐姐用什么方法，总之我跟她说了说姐姐的事情，她就帮我把姐姐带了回来。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_ClockTower"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Mist"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1914,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_56|姐姐……虽然有时候会显得有点不安和崩溃，但她在好的状态下依然很温柔善良，对我和其他人都特别好……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_57|你说的那个大姐姐……她叫什么名字？",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1914,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_58|咦，我刚才没说吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1914,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_59|克莱门汀，她叫克莱门汀。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise2.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_60|！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_61|……",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_62|所以，如果她和罗杰斯的关系如我的预期一般……是克莱门汀将梅森从雕塑家协会处搭救回来的吗？",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_ClockTower"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Kelaimending_Talk_94BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Mist"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_63|雕塑家协会，那些苟且偷生的臭虫吗？\n和那些家伙混在一起的，就算不是床虱、蜱虫，也得是蚂蟥、牛虻一样的脏东西。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1189},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_64|您贸然做出如此发言，可就不太礼貌了，亲爱的小小姐。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_65|白衣的女人无声无息地飘然出现在你身后。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_66|一阵嗡鸣声钻入你的脑海，眼前的景象扭曲起来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Runes_Steam",
          "Play_A_SFX_Clock_Hypnotize",
          "300"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Pressure_001_95BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_NO_Thinking"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1189},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_67|你们二位还是我亲自从一片狼藉的废墟中翻出来，又辛辛苦苦扛到这钟楼之上，生怕你们一不小心就被那些冒着黑泥的怪物生吞活剥了……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1189,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_68|恩将仇报可不好啊，你们说对不对？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_69|你的内心警铃大作，旋身与她对峙，高扬的银钥闪烁召唤的银光。\n在你出手之前，小小的身影突然蹿出，挡在白衣女人身前。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Brooches_Launch",
          "800"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1914,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72011_Content_70|克莱门汀小姐是我和姐姐的恩人，不准你们伤害她！",
        DialogType = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Turn_Jump",
          "200"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
