        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_1|（目瞪口呆）",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"smoke", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CourtYard"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Strange_001_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Street_Fog"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1914,
          nil,
          "Scared"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_2|你把那些怪物全部干掉了？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_3|从今往后，你在济贫院里就可以行动自如了。",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_4|如果在外面发现了受伤的人，就让他们在这里休息吧。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_5|我去地下室看看。\n你先别过来。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_6|你站在地下室的门前，深吸了一口气。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"smoke", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Corridor"
        },
        BgTransition = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_7|往昔的回忆在你的眼前胶片轴般滚动闪现。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Set_Avg_Mus_As_More"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C01_002"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Ant"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {"CG_C01_004"},
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SubLab"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1169,3)",
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_11|你推开了门。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1169},
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Corridor"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Recover_Remember"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Open_Old_Door",
          "600"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Street_Fog"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_12|出现在你面前的是熟悉的地下室，但没有糖人，没有雕塑家，也没有实验台。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SubLab"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Audio = {
          "Set_Avg_Mus_As_More_And_More"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_13|有的只是一个蓬头垢面、骨瘦如柴的女人。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1025},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_14|……谁……",
        DialogType = 1,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1186,3,Surprised);FadeDarkRole(1186,1)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_15|沙哑的、虚弱的声音，像是忍受着剧烈的疼痛。\n枯瘦的手指在地面竭力攀行，拖拽着无力的身躯向你们凑近。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Tow_Away"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Pressure_001_95BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1186,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_16|是……人类吗……",
        DialogType = 1,
        Sequence = "FadeDarkRole(1186,2)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_17|莎拉！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1008,
          nil,
          "Smile1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_18|慢些喝，水还有很多，没关系的。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_ClockTower"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Afterwar_Silent_45BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1186,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_19|呼、呼。",
        DialogType = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Drink_Water"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_20|你在地下室躲了多久？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1186,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_21|算不清了……无论如何，应该超过二十天。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1186,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_22|有时候，我会听到一种古怪的呓语声，头会疼痛得无法忍受，甚至感觉它要从内部裂开来……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1186,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_23|醒来的时候，已经不知道昏迷了多久……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1186,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_24|没有食物，也没有水……我总觉得自己马上就要死去了。\n但是，一想到孩子们还在等着我……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_25|超过二十天不吃不喝还能活下来，你不会觉得自己是靠着对孩子们的爱活下来的吧？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1914,
          nil,
          "Scared"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_26|你在阴阳怪气些什么！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_27|恕我直言，朋友们，你们应该意识到……",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Sad_Talk_Danger_2_105BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_28|你们眼前的这位莎拉女士，早就已经不是普通的人类了……她是个半成品唤醒体。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_29|是的，她的诺斯指数反复震荡，不能维持在21以上。\n原理尚不明确，但显然并非稳定的唤醒体。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_30|并且，显而易见的，她的身体很快就要扛不住内侧银芯的震荡了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_31|很遗憾，但她恐怕见不到她的孩子们了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_72001_Content_32|熔毁·朵尔的笑意像一块沉重的巨石，牢牢地压在了你们的胸口。\n没有人接话，沉默在济贫院的空气中抽出一块绵长的空洞。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [71989] = {
    ID = 71989,
    CnID = "2.0主线剧情_关卡1_6_前",
    BaseSortID = 10,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 10,
        Content = "AvgDialog_71989_Content_1|有毒的苹果",
        Chapter = "Chapter 1;Poison Apple;Part 6",
        DialogType = 4,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_UI_AVG_Chapter_Pop"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_CG_Audio"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        },
        BanSpeedUp = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71989_Content_2|你独自在天台呼吸着新鲜的夜间空气。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_StarrySky"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_After_War_Tired_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Starlight"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71989_Content_3|尽管荒芜的城市被烟尘笼罩，高处天台上却依然能够看到闪烁的清亮星星，为你带来短暂的慰藉。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71989_Content_4|熔毁·朵尔……这个世界的你，为什么没有选择加入弥萨格大学？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71989_Content_5|你对这个世界存在误解，愚蠢的小东西。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71989_Content_6|星光落在朵尔的球形关节上，反射出非人型的金属异色。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Meteor_Passing_By_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71989_Content_7|你以为不同维度之间的差别仅在于融蚀的表征和个体的经历吗？那可就大错特错了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71989_Content_8|就我所知，这个维度中，根本不存在所谓的「弥萨格大学」。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71989_Content_9|……",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71989_Content_10|…………",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71989_Content_11|长久的沉默在你们之间久久回荡。你感觉自己喉咙发梗，不知如何接话。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_StarrySky"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_New_World_Wrong_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71989_Content_12|深呼吸",
        DialogType = 5
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71989_Content_13|与「弥萨格大学」最接近的，是另一所高等学府，同样以异种生物为主要研究对象。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71989_Content_14|只是他们的研究更加古朴和正统，调查员的工作内容以考古研究、实地勘察和神秘学文书编撰为主，战斗人员规模远不如弥萨格大学。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71989_Content_15|这所高等学府……名为「密斯卡托尼克大学」。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71989_Content_16|没有守密人，没有银芯，这个世界的「密斯卡托尼克大学」自然不具备招募朵尔的基础。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "ShutEye2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71989_Content_17|可惜，我并不记得詹金所说那次湮灭，只怕在那之后的全部记忆，都因为爆炸而遗失了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71989_Content_18|至于你想要回到原本的世界……我倒是有些想法。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71989_Content_19|达芙黛尔夫人曾经告诉你，这里并非托乎瓦波的梦境，那么知晓当前世界的真相多半有助于建构与其他维度世界的联系。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71989_Content_20|这是一条更漫长的路，并且多半有效——毕竟失忆前的我曾经顺利转移至多个维度，而我和我的思路应当能保持一致。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71989_Content_21|至于捷径，等我想想清楚再告诉你吧……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
