        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_16|那位莎拉女士的病，比我想象中更为复杂。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_17|找不出原因吗？",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Thinking_001_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_18|不，恰恰相反，我已经有些眉目。\n只是……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_19|我相信你们对「唤醒体」形成的原理都很熟悉，所以我就不详细讲解了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_20|这位莎拉女士体内的高位意志能量，与维持她灵魂的高位意志处于激烈的冲突之中。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_21|如果剥离莎拉女士头部植入的银芯，她的意识会随之消亡；如果不凭依来自梦境的力量，她的身体会和其他人一样化作灰烬。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1135},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_22|不幸的是，我确实无法以父神的力量治愈她。\n无论哪份高位意志最终胜出......莎拉女士的生命都很难维持。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_23|我听懂了，她必死无疑。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_24|要么放弃生命，要么在痛苦中活下去……没有第三种选择吗？",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_25|萨尔瓦多摇头，略显凌乱的白发擦过主教袍，发出簌簌声响。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1135,3)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_26|熔毁·朵尔望向你，眼底透露出不合时宜的胜利笑意，仿佛在耀武扬威地说“你看，我说的对吧？”",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1135},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1878,3)",
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1186,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_27|咳、咳……",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1878},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_28|猛烈的咳嗽声自幽暗处传来，莎拉饱受苦痛折磨的脸上，银白色裂痕又狰狞了几分。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_SadStory_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1186,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_29|我听见了……是%player%……%heorshe%在这里吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_30|她是……在叫我吗？",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_31|还能是谁？我们这里还有别人叫%player%吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_32|你凑近莎拉的床前，梅森将莎拉扶坐起。\n莎拉大口大口喘着粗气，许久才勉强稳住身体，抬头向你露出一个勉强的微笑。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1186,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_33|这位好心人……能拜托你一件事情吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_34|您请说。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1186,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_35|我能听出来，你是一个见多识广的人。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1186,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_36|既然如此，能请你将这些首饰想办法交给罗杰斯先生，用来充抵小艾继丝独立前的生活费用吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1186,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_37|我知道，我自己多半是见不到她长大的一天了……罗杰斯先生慷慨大方，或许也不缺这一星半点。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1186,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_38|但有了这些首饰，她至少不算是完全的寄人篱下……那孩子从小被她的母亲抛弃，我想让她知道，莎拉姐姐没有抛弃她……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1186,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_39|然后，再告诉她，等她长大了，每年记得给提尤格和小威利的坟墓前送一束花……那些孩子还那么小，一定会很怕寂寞的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_40|那你呢，莎拉？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1186,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_41|放心吧，我不会轻易放弃的。在那天到来之前，我都会挣扎着活下去。\n哪怕还有一线希望……我还想再见那些孩子一面。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_42|在荒无人烟的伦敦街头，你长长出了一口气。\n即使遍布烟尘的道路，也不及盘旋在莎拉身边的空气阴沉。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_LondonDaytime"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Two_Guys_Slow"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Dead_Night_Chp3_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_London_Night"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_43|熔毁·朵尔走在你的身侧，保持着和你相距半步的距离。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1878,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_44|朵尔。今天的我，可以回答你的问题了。",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_45|让我听听你的诡辩吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_46|你知道吗？在你的眼中，莎拉已经是将死之人了。她对这个世界的留恋本应毫无意义。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_47|但是事实并非如此。她仍旧惦记着那些被带走的孩子。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_48|这就是平凡的人类，和平凡的人类的牵挂。",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_DeadEnd_Ver3_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_49|你所催化的终结和死亡，不过是剥夺他们最后一丝希望罢了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_50|但希望只是飘渺的幻象，当下的苦痛才是真实的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_51|哪怕是在幻象中活下去，很多人还是愿意为了希望忍受眼下的痛苦。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_52|这便是人类的韧性。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_53|你说你不明白萨尔瓦多行动的宗旨，我却能够理解。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_54|萨尔瓦多的所作所为仅仅遵循一条原则，那就是平等地让每个人「活下去」。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_55|在他的眼中，生命并非权衡，也不是数字，他眼里看见的是一个又一个的渴求生存的人。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_56|只要「活下去」，就有未来，就有可能性。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_57|「可能性」吗？……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_58|熔毁·朵尔沉思片刻，随后仿佛想起什么似的，发出一声冷哼。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_59|哼，既然如此，跟我走吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_60|去哪儿？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_61|去亲眼目睹……去确认一个答案。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1874},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71990_Content_62|记得叫上那只小老鼠一起，我们有让她派上用场的时候。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [71996] = {
    ID = 71996,
    CnID = "2.0主线剧情_关卡1_12_前",
    BaseSortID = 21,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 21,
        Content = "AvgDialog_71996_Content_1|B-68",
        Chapter = "Chapter 1;B-68;Part 12",
        DialogType = 4,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_UI_AVG_Chapter_Pop"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_CG_Audio"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        },
        BanSpeedUp = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1914,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71996_Content_2|喂，西区佬，一大早的把我从美梦中拖出来，你们这是要把我带到哪儿去？",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_LondonDaytime"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Crowds_walk_by",
          "1200"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_EazyFight_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_London_Night"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1914,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71996_Content_3|我可睡得正香呢，梦见自己变成了一只小老鼠，走在独木桥上，周围都是油脂甜甜的香气，很快鼻尖就要碰到最美味的芝士了——",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1914,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71996_Content_4|哐啷一声，被你这家伙用枕头砸醒了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71996_Content_5|幸亏把你叫醒了。你梦到的那个是最常见的高效捕鼠陷阱之一。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71996_Content_6|独木桥的下方是高度超过一米的水箱，你闻到的香气是涂抹在透明的容器和脚下的独木桥上的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71996_Content_7|只要你一踩上，就会脚底打滑坠入万劫不复的深渊。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71996_Content_8|要想做只自由自在的老鼠，你还得再聪明点。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71996_Content_9|朵尔，我们此行的目的地是……？",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71996_Content_10|毫无疑问，是我的实验室。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71996_Content_11|还记得吗？我曾经告诉你，我们可以走「捷径」。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71996_Content_12|那条捷径，便是「窃取」。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71996_Content_13|窃取？",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71996_Content_14|窃取。\n窃取「我」的研究成果。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "ShutEye2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71996_Content_15|我不知道你引发的那场爆炸究竟是什么规模，但我有慎重储存关键研究成果的习惯。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71996_Content_16|只要这只小老鼠钻墙翻找的能力达到攻无不克的境地，就能从废墟中挖掘出记录，从而大幅缩短我的后续研究周期。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71996_Content_17|好了，少废话，扫清前往实验室废墟的障碍吧。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [72010] = {
    ID = 72010,
    CnID = "2.0主线剧情_关卡1_12_后",
    BaseSortID = 22,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 22,
        TalkRole = {
          1914,
          nil,
          "Scared"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72010_Content_1|喂，西区佬，我是不是眼花了？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_LondonDaytime"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_OMG"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Strange_001_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_London_Night"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72010_Content_2|不……没有。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_72010_Content_3|曾经坍塌为石堆的实验室保持着原本的形态出现在街道的转角，你反复揉了揉眼睛，确认这并非自身的幻觉。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72010_Content_4|我有一个猜想。小老鼠，你留在外面。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1914,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72010_Content_5|用得着我的时候就把我从床上拽起来，用不着我了就撵我走，哪有这种好事！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Ops"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_72010_Content_6|詹金，乖。你还要好好照顾梅森姐姐呢，我们过一会儿就出来。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72010_Content_7|可没有说得那么简单。\n总之，我们小心点潜入进去吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_72010_Content_8|距离你在这座实验室苏醒已过半月，但眼前的景象竟与你苏醒时别无二致。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_DollLab"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Lab_Rest_70BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Mist"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72010_Content_9|能够将彻底损毁的建筑完全还原，说明搭建者有两项关键能力。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72010_Content_10|第一，能够在短时间内完成建筑的设计和建造，搭建者工程能力可见一斑。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72010_Content_11|第二，搭建者必然熟知整体实验室的结构和设计细节，曾经长居于实验室内……",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72010_Content_12|如此推断，这个人应当是——",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1152,
          nil,
          "Nervous"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_72010_Content_13|咦、咦，%player%，你怎么回来了，快，趁她还没发现……",
        DialogType = 1,
        PlayEnterAnim = 1,
        RoleHide = {1878},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Run_Mid"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_72010_Content_14|从转角而来的温柯尔手中摆弄着算力仪器，面露惊愕之色地向你打招呼。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Precision_instrument_Assembly_A"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_72010_Content_15|随后她的目光落在了你身后的阴影中。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_72010_Content_16|她的瞳孔急剧收缩，神色转为惊恐，手中的仪器哐当掉落在地，金属零件四散飞溅，发出致人耳鸣的余响。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleShake = {1152, 1},
        AudioTalk = {
