      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_74373_Content_3|B-68，请你告诉我……这个世界到底发生了什么？你在那块石板上，究竟看见了什么？",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1876},
        Content = "AvgDialog_74373_Content_4|哈哈哈，哈哈哈哈！面对落败的敌人，你问出的居然是这个问题吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cloth_Bring_Here"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1876},
        Content = "AvgDialog_74373_Content_5|太过傲慢，近乎无耻！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Surprised1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74373_Content_6|别以为你们这就算最终胜利了！",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Double_Duoer_After_Fight_70BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Surprised1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74373_Content_7|无论是这个世界的密斯卡托尼克，还是你所在的弥萨格大学，他们所做的一切在那位「祂」的眼中都不过是蝼蚁的挣扎。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Surprised1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74373_Content_8|你们短暂的存续既非你个人牺牲的结果，也不是他一时的开恩，仅仅只是因为他对自己的碎片产生了一丝可有可无的好奇罢了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Surprised1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74373_Content_9|他屏息凝神，去看一眼自己的碎片，在那个刹那忘记了呼吸……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Surprised1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74373_Content_10|你们就以为危机结束了，故事完结了，王子和公主过上幸福的生活了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Surprised1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74373_Content_11|愚蠢可笑！愚蠢可笑！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Surprised2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74373_Content_12|你根本不明白我知道了什么！这一切都是——",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74373_Content_13|她的声音变成了恐惧的音符，扎根腐败的空气中。她的嘴唇张合，试图咆哮超越理解的真相，但每个音节都远超人类的知性。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Big_Memory_Confusion",
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_DevilWhisper",
          "700"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_NO_Thinking"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74373_Content_14|扭曲、扭曲，如同来自未知的呐喊。恐惧和绝望也像浓雾般弥漫开来，悄然填满了房间的每一寸角落。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Surprised2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74373_Content_15|是这样吗……世界在拒绝真相的传递……",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 2},
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Mist"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Surprised2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74373_Content_16|那么就让我看看，你可怜的希望到底能坚持多久。在这场终结的狂欢中，你能靠希望坚持多久！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "ShutEye2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74373_Content_17|你们可以杀死我。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Threat"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74373_Content_18|但毁灭必将降临。",
        DialogType = 1
