  [71992] = {
    ID = 71992,
    CnID = "2.0主线剧情_关卡1_14_前",
    BaseSortID = 29,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 29,
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_1|雨幕之中",
        Chapter = "Chapter 1;In the Rain;Part 14",
        DialogType = 4,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_UI_AVG_Chapter_Pop"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_CG_Audio"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        },
        BanSpeedUp = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_2|三天后",
        DialogType = 6,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_3|我检索了目前所有留存的笔记，很遗憾地告诉你两件事。\n首先，B-68所说的那块石板已经不知所踪了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_DollLab"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_After_War_Tired_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_4|其次，虽然我发现了当时的我跳跃至你的维度所用的方法，但它并不能通用于你。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_5|简单来说，义体之间的高度相似性让意识的转移得以成为可能，但在那个世界已经不存在足够契合你的躯体。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "ShutEye2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_6|还有一种方式是通过脑缸和再造躯体，但这需要你的意识的频谱数据，相应实验报告已经遗失了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_7|还有办法找回吗？",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_8|有，但同样有着不可接受的风险——我必须冒险将自己的思维与完整版本的熔毁·朵尔同调。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Thinking_002_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_9|换句话说，我会变成那个与你为敌的本源存在。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_10|她也不会将实验数据交给我。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_11|正是如此。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_12|你记不记得，我在最初的时候，并没有提供这条返回实验室的「捷径」给你？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_13|因为选择捷径，就必须付出选择捷径的代价。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "ShutEye2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_14|只要确认了这条「捷径」，我就必然踏上应循的道路，不得不变回追求毁灭的自己。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "ShutEye2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_15|和「自己」的对抗……如今听来依然很愚蠢，愚蠢得根本不符合孤注一掷的「天才」的名号。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_16|但如果，我先读过了这份报告，或许就不能那么坚定地站在你的身边了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_17|总之，这份手稿交给你。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_18|评估好自己的精神状态再进行阅读吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_19|你镇定心神，展开那份边缘泛黄的手稿。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C201_004"
        },
        AnimState = "CG/C201/Static/CG_C201_004.png",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Paper_Spread_out"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_20|《托乎瓦波的目光协同性运动研究》",
        DialogType = 7,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_21|实验目的：\n通过定量和定性的方式，观察和记录托乎瓦波对视野中高灵性目标的反应，验证它们的目光追踪移动的高灵性目标的规律。\n本实验旨在揭示托乎瓦波的视觉特征及其对特定灵性目标的反应机制。",
        DialogType = 7,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Paper_Crumple"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Strange_002_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_22|实验背景：\n根据历史文献及往期实验记录（见《融蚀现象的成因探究》）托乎瓦波的目光能够造成融蚀现象，但托乎瓦波捕捉目标的原理尚未解明。\n研究托乎瓦波的目光协同性运动原理，可以帮助我们更好地寻求当前世界的存续方式。",
        DialogType = 7,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Paper_Crumple"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_23|实验材料：\n1.7种强度的灵性材料各1份；\n2.维度穿越器材及燃料9份；\n3.实验数据记录表",
        DialogType = 7,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Paper_Crumple"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_24|实验方法：\n1、设定实验环境：筛选灵性数值波动相对稳定且接近的维度；\n2、实验程序：\n①轮流向各维度投放不同灵性数值的实验材料。\n②潜入当地融蚀对抗组织，通常为弥萨格大学，获取各维度的融蚀爆发频率资料。\n③以低灵性银芯为载体将数据传输至279号义体。\n④整理数据并进行分析。",
        DialogType = 7,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Paper_Spread_out02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_25|……",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C201_004"
        },
        AnimState = "CG/C201/Static/CG_C201_004.png"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_26|第二份报告中，轮流向各维度投放的实验材料变成了启动七个人工义体同时进行投放。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_27|第三份报告中，携带的灵性材料数值设定发生了变化。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_28|……",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_29|最后的手稿，字迹变得异常凌乱。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"mucus", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C201_005"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AnimState = "CG/C201/Static/CG_C201_005.png",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Up_Mucus_03"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thriller_Five_02"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Thriller"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_30|没有意义。\n我在探究的是毫无意义的结果。\n灵性生物本身就是祂的捕捉目标，诺斯指数大于21的生物就会招致祂的注视，并波及周遭的其他存在。\n这份报告的流出最终只会导致更恐怖的结局：诺斯指数的测定、筛选、诱捕和追杀。",
        DialogType = 7,
        ScreenEffect = {"mucus", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pick_UpPaper02"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Tuohuwabo_Waek_A_138BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_31|更可怕的是，能够检测出诺斯指数的并非只有人类——诸多海洋生物整个种群的诺斯指数都高于21。\n除非核平全部海域……但那同样是无人生还的结局。",
        DialogType = 7
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_32|一切解法都是虚妄，祂的目光永恒诞临。",
        DialogType = 7,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Tuohuwabo_Fight_120BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_33|没有人能够得到拯救。",
        DialogType = 7
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Surprised1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_34|你们短暂的存续既非你个人牺牲的结果，也不是他一时的开恩，仅仅只是因为他对自己的碎片产生了一丝可有可无的好奇罢了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_DollLab"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_White_Ocean"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Surprised1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_35|他屏息凝神，去看一眼自己的碎片，在那个刹那忘记了呼吸……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Surprised1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_36|你们就以为危机结束了，故事完结了，王子和公主过上幸福的生活了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Surprised1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_37|愚蠢可笑！愚蠢可笑！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Surprised2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_38|你根本不明白我知道了什么！这一切都是——",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_71992_Content_39|你从实验报告的阅读中惊醒，发觉自己已经冷汗涔涔。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
