        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_clock_kelaimen"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73796_Content_3|为什么我会梦到克莱门汀？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73796_Content_4|怎么，您不喜欢我出现在您的梦境里吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73796_Content_5|没关系，我理解您在治疗过程中出现的小情绪，只是讳疾忌医可不好哦。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73796_Content_6|现在，请您坐下，心理治疗要开始了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73796_Content_7|心理治疗？这完全搞错了。我是来找威廉的。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73796_Content_8|……我跟你说这些干什么，这是我的梦境。只要我想苏醒，就一定可以醒来。",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73796_Content_9|你闭上眼睛，集中精神让自己清醒。\n因此，你没听到那一声极轻的微笑。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73796_Content_10|虽然遗憾您拒绝了我的心理治疗，但我尊重您的决定。毕竟，让人安心是我们的宗旨。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73796_Content_11|不过，我们很快就会再见面的，我有预感。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73796_Content_12|希望那一天，您能够接受我的治疗。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73796_Content_13|随后，克莱门汀的声音彻底消失，你忍不住睁开了眼睛。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Fog_Disappear_re"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Bedroom"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise2.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73796_Content_14|这是……我的宿舍！？",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"awake", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_StudentDorm"
        },
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_AfterWarVer2_58BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73796_Content_15|你站起来，虽然脑海仍旧隐隐作痛，身体也并未痊愈，但此刻你顾不上这些。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73796_Content_16|熟悉的布局和家具，还有这满是课本的课桌……这里确实是我的宿舍。",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73796_Content_17|不知有多少次，我都是在这里，匆忙赶那怎么也做不完的作业。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1874},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73796_Content_18|可怜的小狗还没有从噩梦里清醒？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          2,
          "AvgVertical"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_No_Signal"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1874},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73796_Content_19|这个世界没有「你」，自然也不会有关于「你」的存在。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          2,
          "AvgVertical"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73796_Content_20|但是这确实……",
