        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pierce_Knife"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Thriller"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73796_Content_49|随后，失去控制的身体倒下，倒在另一个患者面前。而后者一动不动，似乎吓傻了。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Fall_Down"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73796_Content_50|很快，你就意识到那人不是被吓傻了，而是根本无法行动——\n他的头皮同后背皮肤彻底撕裂，血肉模糊的内在蜕皮成功，离体而出。",
