        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73799_Content_42|克莱门汀的诊室为什么会在这里？等等——",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Undergound_Main_104BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73799_Content_43|宿舍、舞台、诊室，每个房间都与所有者密切相关，且一旦所有者死亡，房间就会关闭。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73799_Content_44|那是不是可以理解为，这些<Yellow:房间其实是所有者心灵上的投射>？！",
