      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1307},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73799_Content_51|你应该能看到吧，那些记忆，那些真相。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73799_Content_52|记忆？你想到流淌在假人头颅的白色泪滴，不动声色。\n你要掌握谈话的主动权。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73799_Content_53|「那个小家伙」是谁，是巡逻队在找的外部人员？他现在在哪？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73799_Content_54|阿尔比诺保持着笑脸，但这笑容又有了些变化。\n那金色的竖瞳闪着冷光，仿佛进入兴奋状态。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1307,3,Excited)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Snake_Spitting_Letter_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1307,
          nil,
          "Excited"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73799_Content_55|这位客人，好像是我先提出了问题，应该由你先来回答。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73799_Content_56|你没回话。这是场心理博弈，先回答的人就是输家。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73799_Content_57|对峙的沉默中，熟悉的脚步声从走廊远处响起。\n那些巡逻队回来了。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_LeatherShoes_Walk"
