      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_29|站在这里，站在我面前，就是你对这个定义的最佳反击。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1307},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_30|……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_31|哎呀，你陷入了沉默，这说明了什么？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_32|我还以为像你我这样的人，不会被人类创造的可笑的道德所约束。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1307},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_33|但他们说得没错，我确实只是个不完整的实验产物。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1307},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_34|这是事实。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_35|……可怜的孩子，看来你的心理问题比我想得更加严重。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1307},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_36|注意你的措辞，克莱门汀，我不需要可怜和虚假的安慰。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_37|呵呵，毒蛇展露了它的毒牙，是因为我碰触到了它的内心吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_38|没关系，我原谅你的无礼，此时此刻，你还是我的客人。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_39|现在，我们继续刚才的话题——阿尔比诺，你完全将自己定为了被凝视的「他者」。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1307},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_40|他者？真是个精妙又恰当的词汇。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1307},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_41|人类是这个社会的主体，是这个社会的「自我」，而我们——",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_42|阿尔比诺微笑，嘴角的角度好似经过衡量般完美、固定。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1307},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_43|你我只是这个社会的异类，无论如何融入，也只是叛徒。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1307},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_44|不，应该说，我们生来就是叛徒。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_45|克莱门汀笑了笑，那种笑更类似于一种社交礼仪。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_46|我可以将这些，理解为你被外派到雕塑家协会产生的异常情绪吗？阿尔比诺。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_47|没关系，你的情绪我完全感同身受。被自己的创造者欺骗确实很痛苦。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1307},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_48|……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1307},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_49|这是正常的咨询流程？克莱门汀，你对那些前来寻求心理帮助的人类可温柔多了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_50|每个人的心理治疗方式都会因个体差异而不同。我只是选择了最适合你的疗法。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_51|因为你的身份认同和自我认识，都揭示了你的本质——冷血的蛇。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_52|一阵仿佛从灵魂深处敲响的警铃声，逼迫你退出了阿尔比诺的记忆。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"oldFilm", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C06_011"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_BlackHole"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Alarm_bells_Ringing"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_53|这是怎么回事……",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SnowAltars"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Pressure_001_95BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1307},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_54|让我猜猜。如果不是你被发现，就是那个小家伙被发现了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_55|很快，无处不在的广播给出了揭秘。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1906},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_56|外来人员身份已查明，身份为人类，姓名：威廉。",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Debug_Microphone"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1906},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_57|该人员目前在东区0208号房间，请巡逻队立刻前往清理。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_58|东区，0208，而我目前在……西区。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1307},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_59|嗯……你的表情似乎在说，我要一路从西区杀到东区。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1307},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_60|真是坚毅的决心，但决心这种东西，还是用在更关键的时刻比较好。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_61|阿尔比诺笑着，递给了你某样东西。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_62|疗养院的地图？你怎么……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_63|你的回答无疾而终。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Big_Memory_Confusion"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Old_Gate_Close"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_64|带着完美微笑的阿尔比诺关上了房门，而你，被拒之门外。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SanatoriumAisle"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_65|……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_66|第二次吃闭门羹，都已经快吃饱了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_67|无法理解阿尔比诺行为的你，忍不住打趣自己。\n但很快，你就明确了目标。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_68|<Yellow:东区，0208房间，威廉就在那里。>",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_69|听到门外的脚步声远去、消失，阿尔比诺抬了抬镜框，露出完美而固定的笑容。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SnowAltars"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Sound_Pushing_Glasses",
          "800"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Strange_001_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1307},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_70|记忆存在的目的，就是被回忆，被观看。就像「他者」。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Set_Avg_Mus_As_More_And_More"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1307},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_71|但这次，被凝视的不是我，而是……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_72|想到近距离观察猎物的场面，阿尔比诺的笑容不自觉加深。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_73|他知晓%player%的脖颈哪里最为脆弱，观察到了从哪个躯体部位开始品尝风味最佳，而这些，都会在时间的腌制中变得更加美味。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1307,
          nil,
          "Excited"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_74|逃吧，奔跑吧，这场狩猎还未终止。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1307,
          nil,
          "Excited"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_75|你的血肉将会在疲惫与恐惧中变得可口，变得美味，因为——",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73798_Content_76|<Red:当你凝视深渊时，深渊也在凝视你>",
        DialogType = 6,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
