      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_33|就在你即将摔倒之际，拐角处猛然窜出个身影，拉住你的手，带你前冲。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Turn_Jump"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Messy_multiple_people"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1888},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_34|跟紧我！",
        DialogType = 1,
        Sequence = "FadeDarkRole(1888,1)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_35|随着短暂的关门声，你看到那身影快速锁门，而那门锁，有足足27道。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"speedLine", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_PalaceHallDay"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Door_Lock_Mech"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1888},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_36|暂时、安全了……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise1.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_37|威……廉！？",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_38|看着面前虽然长得很像威廉，但年龄外貌都不符的少年，你迟疑了。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1888,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_39|威廉——我不确定这是不是我的名字。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_After_War_Tired_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1889},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_40|我<Yellow:失忆>了，不记得任何事情，任何人。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_41|失忆！？",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1889},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_42|但我记得这个，它对我似乎有什么特殊含义……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_43|他摸了摸你胸前的银钥，以及仿制的弥萨格徽章。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_44|……或许，我可以帮你确认自己的身份。但不是现在。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_45|躲起来终究不是办法，我们迟早会被——",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1888,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_46|我承认你很有勇气，你的行动也为我的计划提供了便利，但你太小瞧自己的救命恩人了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1888,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_47|在你边跑边大喊「威廉」、「威廉」的时候，我也没有闲着。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_48|你做了什么？",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_49|少年狡黠地笑，在他的笑容中，你听到门外传来一声巨响。\n显然，什么东西爆炸了。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Boom"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Ersi_Fun_Tegong_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1889,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_50|大量面粉、一盒火柴还有一根麻绳，这些东西在那些心灵房间里并不难找到。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1889,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_51|毕竟有的人内心深处就是渴望着暴食、毁灭和爆炸。那句话怎么说来着……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1889,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_52|哦，有些人就是想看着这个世界燃烧殆尽。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1889,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_53|嘿嘿，怎么样？现在那些医生可顾不上我们了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_54|酷似威廉的脸摆出这样可爱的模样，实在令你难以严肃。\n为了不笑场，你只能转移话题。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_55|但我们还是要想办法离开这里，我指这间疗养院。",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Thinking_001_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1889,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_56|可你不是还没找到威廉？看你的样子，没找到他是不会离开的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_57|你沉默，无法确定面前的人究竟是谁，是敌是友。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1889},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_58|放轻松。这样吧，你帮我确认身份，我帮你找威廉，在这个充满疯狂的地方，我们只能互帮互助。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_59|……也只能这样了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1889},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_60|所以我们该谈谈帮我确认身份这件事了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1889,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_61|开始吧，我已经迫不及待想知道自己是谁，有着怎样的过去……",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Thinking_002_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_62|在少年的应许下，你接触记忆，开始阅览少年的过去——",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1911,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_63|我们不一定要诉诸暴力手段，@3。",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"oldFilm", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_ExamineRoom"
        },
        BgTransition = 3,
        Sequence = "FadeDarkRole(1911,1)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1911,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_64|这里是心灵的疗养院，而非屠宰场，要使用更温和的处理手段。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1911,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_65|啊，当然，他是这里建成后第一个落入网中的小虫子，具有重要的研究意义。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1911,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_66|我迫不及待想看看他的过去与记忆了，但愿……会足够美味。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1029},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_67|没想到还有人能找到这里来……",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SanatoriumAisle"
        },
        BgTransition = 3,
        Sequence = "FadeDarkRole(1911,2);FadeDarkRole(1029,1)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1029},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_68|为了不影响我们的计划，只能请你「消失」一下了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise1.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_69|等等，这个声音好耳熟……疗养院的广播声？！",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_70|再多展示一下关于这个人的记忆！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        Sequence = "SetRole(1029,3);FadeDarkRole(1029,1)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_71|你向着意识深处呐喊，但很可惜，「观看」记忆的过程并不受你控制。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1891},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_72|他外祖父是邪恶巫师，妈妈是短命鬼女巫，他也是个小祸害，以后不知道要害死多少人呢！",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Woods"
        },
        BgTransition = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_After_War_Chp4_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1892},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_73|打死他，打死这个怪物怪胎！",
        DialogType = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Stone_People_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73797_Content_74|随着这一声声呐喊而来的，是坚硬的石子，打在你的头上、眼睛上，砸出鲜血。",
