  [73782] = {
    ID = 73782,
    CnID = "2.0主线剧情_关卡2_10_前",
    BaseSortID = 12,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 12,
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_1|你好，燃烧的世界",
        Chapter = "Chapter 2;Hello, Burning World;Part 10",
        DialogType = 4,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_UI_AVG_Chapter_Pop"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        },
        BanSpeedUp = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_2|好沉……",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SanatoriumAisle"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Two_Guys_Slow"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_After_War_Tired_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_3|小威廉一手扶着墙，一手扶着你，艰难向前迈进。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_4|坚持住，%player%，我们就快安全了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_5|不用安慰我……这间疗养院里，不会有安全的地方。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_6|……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_7|小威廉没有说话，只无声打开一扇门，和你躲了进去。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_PalaceHallDay"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Open_WoodDoor"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_8|他当然知道一扇木门挡不住掌控整个疗养院的克莱门汀，但除了进房间，他再没有其他更好的选择。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_9|<Shake:咳咳、咳……>",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_ClothesFriction_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_10|你忍不住咳嗽起来。通讯器爆炸的能量虽然为你和小威廉争取了时间逃生，却也对你们的精神与躯体造成了强大的冲击。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_11|而被跨越维度的联系榨取所有的你，根本无法承受。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_12|……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_13|你咳出了血……还有，你的身体也……一直在渗血……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_14|暂时还死不了，不用担心。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_15|我认真的。我的身体……和你们不一样，没那么容易毁坏。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_16|所以，这就是你在能量冲击时护住我的原因？知道自己死不了，尽情肆意妄为？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_17|……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_18|你不知道该如何回答。你的脑中不断闪回着一个画面。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_19|我、我只是……",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C07_011"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember",
          "Play_A_SFX_FearAAA",
          "500"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Mucus_analysis_reveals_CG"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Weilian_Death_Intro_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Art_DeathOfWilliam"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_20|——只是不想再看着你消失在我面前。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_21|但你的话没能说完。\n远处，再次响起了脚步声——那是克莱门汀们在找你和小威廉的声音。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_PalaceHallDay"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AnimState = "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Highheel,Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Highheel_Leave,100",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Highhee_Crowd",
          "500"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Recover_Remember"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_22|……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_23|你扶着墙站起来，走向门口。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1890},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_24|你去哪儿？出去为我引开那些怪物？",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_New_World_Farewell_130BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_25|这是最好的选择。趁这个时机，你找到出口，逃出这里。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_26|可是，这里根本没有出口。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_27|没有人可以逃出这里，没有人！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_28|而不愿意变成虫子的患者……只有、只有死亡这一种结局。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_29|小威廉说着握紧双拳，身体都开始颤抖。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Long_Skirt_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise1.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_30|！！！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_31|你猛然一惊，伸手摸向了小威廉的脑后。\n那里，黏糊湿热，似乎在酝酿着什么。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Caress"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_32|威廉，你……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1890},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_33|别那么吃惊，这是很正常的事情。每个被关到病房的患者，都会被转化。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1890},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_34|他们会被那些怪物植入虫子，然后……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1890},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_35|然后那些虫子就会在他们的脑部流窜、繁殖……最后彻底摧毁他们的灵魂。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_36|小威廉忍不住摸了下后脑勺，那里不断溢出的血液濡湿了他的手，让他觉得疼痛难忍。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Flowing_Mucus_02",
          "500"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Sash"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_37|好疼啊，%player%，我真的好疼啊……",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_38|……对不起，我应该……早点找到你的……我……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_39|小威廉摇摇头，碰了碰你胸前的银钥匙。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_40|就在刚才，能量冲击的时候，我想起了一些事情……在这些回忆里，你被我称为「守密人」。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_41|守密人%player%。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_42|你怎么会……！！！",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_43|另一个世界的称呼如惊雷，将你震在原地，而就在你出神的短暂片刻，小威廉跑出去，关上了房门。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Run_Mid"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_44|威廉，不要！我不需要……",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C202_001"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_New_World_Save_Move_130BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_45|我不会那么容易死的，真的，所以回来。我不想、不想再一次失去你……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_46|小威廉沉默，过了片刻，他才整理好情绪，再次开口。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1890},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_47|%player%，那次观看记忆你转移了话题，是因为我的过去不幸到你无法提起？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1890},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_48|没有关系，失去记忆也很好。我不是坐以待毙的人，从来都不懂「放弃」这两个字。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1890},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_49|如你所说，重要的是未来，我们所求的也是未来。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_50|那就回来。等我引开那些克莱门汀，我会回来找你，我们……",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_51|我们一起破解这里，一起离开这里，然后去创造未来，美好的未来。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1890},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_52|你在避重就轻，%player%。我们在克莱门汀的地盘，而且，她不会轻易放我们离开。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1890},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_53|我们的唯一选择就是出其不意，主动出击，而这，需要吸引克莱门汀们注意力的诱饵。还有……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_54|还有？",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_55|小威廉哽咽一瞬，用手臂挡住眼睛——那些一瞥的回忆，逐渐浮现在他眼前。",
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_56|这个世界在燃烧，%player%，而我，在那些仅剩的记忆里，亲眼看见它燃烧的样子。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_L_D06_7-4"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_57|小比尔，伦敦最脏最臭街道的清道夫，只要四分之一便士就可以让他不停歇地跑一公里，传一张信纸。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1890},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1016,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_58|妮莎·史密斯，浆洗女工的孩子，才11岁，为了补贴家用，除了做叫醒工外还会捡垃圾、卖火柴，做所有可能挣钱的活计。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1016},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1018,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_59|还有亨利，公共马车的小子，从凌晨4点工作到午夜，一次工作20小时，心愿只是圣诞节时能吃上完整的烤鹅。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1018},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1011,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_60|还有许多我说得上名字，记得面孔的人，他们……都消失了……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1011}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_61|但或许这里的人还有救。之前探索疗养院时，我看到许多才刚进入这里的患者，他们渴望离开这里，渴望活下去。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_62|这个世界在燃烧\n活生生的人，也只是薪柴，稍纵即逝",
        DialogType = 6,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Sequence = "SlowCaption"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_63|但世界不该是这样的——",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_64|那些微笑的人、愤怒的人、悲伤的人、满怀期待的人……\n全部凋亡，不复存在",
        DialogType = 6,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Sequence = "SlowCaption"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_65|那些人不该这么轻易的消失，他们的存在，不该这么轻易地被抹去……",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_66|不必恐惧，不必犹豫\n当世界燃烧时，总要有人去阻止",
        DialogType = 6,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Sequence = "SlowCaption"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_67|所以，我想去阻止，哪怕多救活一个人也好。因为——",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C202_001"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_68|虽然这个世界在燃烧，但它仍旧美丽，仍旧迷人，仍旧让人想要落泪、想要奋不顾身的守护，不是吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_69|身为守密人的你，应该最了解这一点。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_70|……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_71|你无法言语，只能闭上眼睛。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_72|那些消逝的同窗与前辈……",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C00_001"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_73|那些铭刻着你的姓名与无数「不存在之人」的墓碑……",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolGraveyard"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_74|那些因为融蚀而痛苦挣扎的灵魂……",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_ClockTower"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_75|那些一同悲伤欢笑、鲜活存在过的同伴……",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C09_011_F"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "ReplaceBg(Gender_Boy,SScene_CG_C09_011_M)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Meteor_Passing_By_01"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Starlight_Escape_02",
          "500"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_76|还有……\n被困在这间疗养院的又是谁？",
        DialogType = 6,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Sequence = "MiddleCaption"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_77|有着怎样的过去，渴望成为怎样的人？",
        DialogType = 6,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Sequence = "MiddleCaption"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_78|你的泪水在眼眶翻涌，带来酸涩与炙热，但你不敢眨眼。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_79|可是故事的最初，我只是想找到你……",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_80|但故事已经进行到了中段，%player%。",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_New_World_Save_Decision_150BPM",
          "300"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_81|你的泪终于落下，破碎。一同破碎的还有你的灵魂。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_82|不必恐惧，不必犹豫\n当世界燃烧时，总要有人去阻止",
        DialogType = 6,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Sequence = "SlowCaption"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_83|因为，这世界值得\n哪怕它即将燃烧，正在燃烧，未来亦或燃烧殆尽",
        DialogType = 6,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Sequence = "SlowCaption"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_84|我知道了。我们一起救出疗养院的所有人。",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_85|威廉，你去引开她们，我去找克莱门汀的房间，找到这座疗养院的核心，摧毁它。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_86|收到~",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1890,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_87|还有……谢谢你来找我。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_88|随后，传来的是脚步声，许多许多脚步声，那些脚步声在房门前经过，然后远去，最后彻底消失。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Crowds_walk_by"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_89|你用手捂住了脸，狠狠地、狠狠地揉了揉自己。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_ClothesFriction_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_90|是的，故事已经到了中段，伟大的冒险者集齐了同伴，向着幕后黑手的大本营进发，摧毁毁灭世界的邪恶计划，拯救所有人。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_91|这是冒险故事的后半段。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_92|你打开门，走向和威廉相反的方向，走向克莱门汀的房间，走向你身为守密人的责任。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SanatoriumAisle"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Open_WoodDoor"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Normal_Short_Leave",
          "600"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73782_Content_93|这个世界或许终将燃烧殆尽，但不是现在，不是今天。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [73776] = {
    ID = 73776,
    CnID = "2.0主线剧情_关卡2_11_前",
    BaseSortID = 13,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 13,
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_1|孤独的勇者",
        Chapter = "Chapter 2;The Lone Warrior;Part 11",
        DialogType = 4,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_UI_AVG_Chapter_Pop"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_CG_Audio"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        },
        BanSpeedUp = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_2|砰……",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SanatoriumAisle"
        },
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Boom"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_After_War_Chp4_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_3|又一声爆炸，足以吸引疗养院的所有生物，为你前往克莱门汀的房间铺平道路。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_4|威廉……我不会辜负你的牺牲。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_5|我一定会找到疗养院的核心，摧毁它。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_6|终于，你走到那扇门前——深呼一口气，你做好了面对疗养院幕后掌控者的准备。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_7|推开克莱门汀的房门",
        DialogType = 5
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_8|熟悉的心理咨询用沙发，办公桌，具有怪异美感的昆虫干制标本，以及带着微笑的克莱门汀。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_ExamineRoom"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1190,3,Happy)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Open_Old_Door"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_KeLai_Show_Talk_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_9|欢迎来到我的咨询室，%player%，我等你很久了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_10|请坐——",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_11|一个椅子凭空出现在你身后，载着你滑到克莱门汀的对面。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "avg_dialog_Amplification",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Zoom_In"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_12|你趁机快速扫视四周——沙发、办公桌、昆虫干制标本。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_zuoyou_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_13|沙发、办公桌，都太常见了，不太可能。心灵空间的核心必然会更特殊一点。那就只剩下……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_14|你的余光在偷瞄什么？嗯，昆虫标本。难道说，你也对昆虫感兴趣？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_15|……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_16|不想回答也没关系。我说过，我是个充满博爱精神的心理医生，能够包容患者的小缺点。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_17|当然，也不介意给患者一些贴心的提示，比如，你想找的东西并不在那些标本里。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_18|你将目光从昆虫标本上移开，正视克莱门汀。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1190,3,Happy)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_19|克莱门汀，你建造这间疗养院的目的是什么？那个需要许多祭品的重要实验，又是什么？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_20|这里，死了那么多人，造成了那么多的惨剧，你却说这里不是屠宰场，而是心灵的疗养院。那么它疗养的对象究竟是谁？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_21|这个问题很重要吗？我还以为直面过那伟大存在的你，不会关注这些小问题呢。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_22|这不是什么小问题。只要涉及到人命，就从来都不会是小问题！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_23|很显然，在这里获得救赎的不是患者，因为他们只是祭品。而排除掉错误的答案，剩下的就是正解。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_24|这间疗养院真正疗愈的，是你，克莱门汀，这间疗养院的主人。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_25|告诉我，什么样的心理创伤需要用这么多的人命去填补？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_26|克莱门汀露出疑惑的表情。她不明白也不理解你的愤怒从何而来，但很快，她就笑起来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1190,3,Surprised)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_27|如果这是你的请求，那么我同意了。直面过那伟大存在的你，有资格成为我的同类。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_28|你在说什么……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_29|只是，我们需要先来进行一个小测试。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_30|别担心，真的只是一个小测试而已，目的只是为了测评一下你的自我认知和人性存留。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_31|随着克莱门汀的话语，一个熟悉却无法再次相见的身影缓缓出现在你面前。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1190},
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 1},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1118,3);FadeDarkRole(1118,1)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_KeLai_Stand_170BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_NO_Thinking"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_32|拉蒙娜！！！",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_ExamineRoom"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_33|你的记忆里都是这个女孩的身影，所以我想，你应该很想见见她——",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1118}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73776_Content_34|不用谢我，请尽情享受这重聚时刻。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [80448] = {
    ID = 80448,
    CnID = "2.0主线剧情_关卡2_11_战斗前1",
    BaseSortID = 14,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 14,
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_80448_Content_1|这不是拉蒙娜。拉蒙娜不会……",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_ExamineRoom"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1118,3);FadeDarkRole(1118,1)",
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_KeLai_Stand_170BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_80448_Content_2|拉蒙娜绝对不会伤害我。",
        DialogType = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1118,3);FadeDarkRole(1118,1)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_80448_Content_3|当然不是。这只是我刚才翻阅你的记忆后幻化出来的投影。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_80448_Content_4|她的本质，我已经告诉你了，接下来，就看你如何选择——",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_80448_Content_5|理性，还是感性，%player%，告诉我你的答案。",
        DialogType = 1
      })
    })
  },
  [73775] = {
    ID = 73775,
    CnID = "2.0主线剧情_关卡2_11_后",
    BaseSortID = 15,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 15,
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_1|……拉蒙娜。",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_ExamineRoom"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1118,3);FadeDarkRole(1118,1)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_KeLai_Stand_170BPM"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_2|最终，你的攻击无形化解，只是深深地给了「拉蒙娜」一个拥抱。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_3|天花板和地板凭空出现类似虫足的尖刺，穿透你的臂膀、双腿，你却仍是紧紧拥抱着那道无法再见的身影。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pierce_Knife"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_4|我会回去的，一定会想尽办法回去的。等着我……",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_5|幻影沉默着虚化、最终消失——克莱门汀收回了投影。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C202_04"
        },
        AnimState = "CG/C202/Prefab/CGDynamic_C202_04.prefab",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Fog_Disappear_re"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_6|感性么……很有趣的选择。只是这个选择——值得吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_7|直面过祂的你有更好的选择——成为我的同族，成为属于宇宙的伟大存在。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_8|我见过许多人类，但从没有一个人，能让我产生这样的渴望——",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_9|你注定成为我的同族，你必须成为我的同族。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_10|同族？抱歉，我还不想改变自己的种族。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
