        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Swing_sword_fast"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1190},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_27|……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_28|哈哈哈，你为什么总是能给我这么多的惊喜？%player%，这简直、简直让我……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_29|兴奋得无以复加。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_30|克莱门汀笑着，而你终于看清了：你手中的尖刀，变成了一只虫蛹标本。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Wind_Magic"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_31|多么天真可爱的孩子，竟然认为眼中所见的一切都是真实的。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_KeLai_Stand_170BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_32|这里，是心灵的空间，我的心灵空间。这里，只贯彻着我的意愿，只展示着我想要展露的真实。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_33|……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_34|沉默是因为心理崩溃了吗？没关系，%player%，我们可以尝试崩溃疗法。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_35|那是真正的折磨，能够让所有患者老老实实将他们的痛苦从灵魂里榨取出来。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_36|这样的治疗方法，我还有很多、很多，多到足以击溃你身为人类的认知和理智，逐渐转化成真正的虫子。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_pendulum"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_clock_kelaimen"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_37|你将忘记身为人类的一切，甚至忘记「人类」这个词汇的意义。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_38|等到那时，我会给你痊愈的证明，带领你以@2虫族的身份，获得新生。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_39|恐怕你等不到那个时候了。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_ExamineRoom"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_40|低头，看看胸口。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_41|克莱门汀闻言低下头，见到一个充满棱角的东西抵在她的胸膛。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "ShowItem(9533)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cloth_Bring_Here"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_42|银钥匙？",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_KeLai_Peace_Crazy_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_43|是的，银钥匙。在观察和推理后，我认为，你才是这间疗养院的核心。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_44|你想强行链接我？作为守密人，你应该明白其中的危险性……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_45|我明白。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_46|说着，你忍不住笑起来。如果在那个世界，朵尔教授肯定会斥责你胡乱操作，拉蒙娜也会劝说你，和你共同寻找更好的选择。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_Coll_Entry_10"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Sound_Lock"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Brooches_Launch"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_47|但这里，只有我一个人。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_48|威廉……我没有食言，我会拯救这间疗养院的所有人。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_49|银钥的震动里，剧烈的白光从克莱门汀的白银之心上爆发开来，溢满整个房间——",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "keyWorkEffect",
          1
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Silver_Core_Shock_Wave_01"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Floodlight"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_50|随后，银钥匙掉落，你和克莱门汀双双倒地。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "keyWorkEffect",
          2
        },
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Wax_Fall_02",
          "900"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Key_Drop"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_51|想通过强行链接我而破解疗养院？真是疯狂的想法，但是，我喜欢。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_pendulum"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pendulum_Swings_A"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_clock_kelaimen"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_52|可惜这里是我的心灵空间，%player%，看来你注定要成为我的同族了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_53|接下来，是我为你特殊定制的深度治疗时刻。\n当然，为了确保疗效，我隐藏了你的小道具。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73775_Content_54|尽情向我展示你的痛苦，你的挣扎，即将蜕变的小虫子——",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
