        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73789_Content_31|最后，是我最喜欢的环节，虫群的共振……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73789_Content_32|啊，你已经迫不及待想要出去了吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_TownsST_Day"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Big_Memory_Confusion"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73789_Content_33|你趁机迈出的脚步一顿，丝毫没有被发现偷跑的尴尬。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73789_Content_34|既然是治疗，那么患者随便走走，了解治疗场所也是理所当然的。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73789_Content_35|你说得没错，我也很乐意陪你进行这一过程，只是我这边还有些小问题需要处理。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73789_Content_36|恐怕不只是小问题吧。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73789_Content_37|你敏锐戳穿克莱门汀的掩饰，想要趁此打探更多信息，可惜克莱门汀并没有上当。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73789_Content_38|参观治疗场所这件事情，只能麻烦伯克利了，希望你不要介意。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1894},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73789_Content_39|包在我身上，我会从我们小镇最热闹的地方开始带%heorshe%参观。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1894},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73789_Content_40|看到那些亮闪闪的矿石没有？那可是镇子的重要收入来源，咱们所有人都靠进山挖矿石，卖给商人维持生计。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_TownsST_Day"
