      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1822},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73783_Content_73|不要被另一个我的话术所干扰，%player%，关于你真正的本质，你的心里一直有着正确答案。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1822},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73783_Content_74|就像我的心，也一直在给我回答，正确的、唯一的回答。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1822},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73783_Content_75|认知和意识确实可以被环境、被行为、被他人影响和塑造出来，但我始终认为：自己，才是塑造自我的最终力量。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1822},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73783_Content_76|因为人类最可贵的，不就是自我教育、自我修正、自我成长，从而不断向前走，追寻向更好的未来的能力吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1822},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73783_Content_77|%player%，你不需要分清人类和虫子，你只需要坚持你想要坚持的东西。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1822},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73783_Content_78|比如，人类的自我认知和灵魂。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73783_Content_79|……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73783_Content_80|……你为什么要帮我？我是说，我们才刚见面，而且我的态度……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1822,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73783_Content_81|因为，我也在坚持我要坚持的东西。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "avg_dialog_Amplification",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Zoom_In"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1822},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73783_Content_82|这里只有我们两个人类，而我一直想要一个朋友。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1822},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73783_Content_83|人类虽然残酷，但也有真诚善良的一面，会互相帮助，互相扶持，一起渡过难关，迎接美好的黎明与未来。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1822},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73783_Content_84|而这个，就是见证——我们互帮互助，充满人性美德的见证。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
