      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_17|没错，就是银芯。我与这片心灵空间，同生共死。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_18|银芯是唤醒体的核心，这样的行为……太疯狂了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_19|疯狂？我倒是遇到过几个称得上「疯狂」的患者，但我从来不觉得自己疯狂。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_20|相信我，心理医师最有资格评价一个人的精神状态，因此我很冷静。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_21|哪怕她回来，带回了一些东西，也不会对我产生任何影响。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_KeLai_Suppress_170BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_22|她……另一个克莱门汀！？",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_23|当然是另一个我。我说过，那只是结束我们分裂状态的必要工作。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_24|我个人对于她……从来没有什么恶意。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_25|她在说谎，你看出来了。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_26|这是克莱门汀的心灵世界，一切事物都是她内心想法的表达。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_27|她分裂了自己，她杀了自己——她憎恶着自己。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_28|虽然你多次拒绝了我，但作为直面过祂的存在，作为我的患者，我愿意原谅你一次。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_29|只要以后你乖乖的……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_30|克莱门汀笑着走过来，伸出手慢慢抚上你的脸庞。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_31|多次使用银钥匙、透支身体很痛吧，没关系，这些痛苦很快就会消失了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Sequence = "AvgRoleScale",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Zoom_In"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_32|我会结束你的痛苦，为你带来新生。当然，这需要一点小小的付出。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_33|毕竟，在这个燃烧的世界，生存，总是伴随着代价。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_34|熟悉的虫鸣声，爬向你的耳道、挤入你的眼球，大脑似乎在摇晃，又似乎在癫狂，完全不受你的操控。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Mysterious_Bewitchment"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_DevilWhisper",
          "Play_A_SFX_BlackHole"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_bug_kelaimen"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_35|为了保持理智，也为了缓解血肉不断生长虫鳞的痛苦，你不得不说些什么。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_36|这些话，你也对那些患者说过，是不是？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_37|这个燃烧的世界焚毁了他们的理智，变成怪物，是他们自认为的最后救赎。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_38|最终，为了活下去，他们抛弃了一切，甚至抛弃了存在本身。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_39|这有什么问题？生物的本能就是活下去，我完全理解他们的选择。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Sequence = "AvgRoleScale"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_40|而且，相信我，痛苦和纠结只是一瞬间的事情。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_41|只要仪式完成，你会获得新生，他们会获得新生，所有人都会得偿所愿。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_42|……你说得没错，活下去是生物的本能，我也理解。但是……",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_43|我不接受。威廉，还有那些主动赴死的人，也没有接受。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_44|因为总有什么东西，要比活下去，更加重要。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_45|这一点，克莱门汀你应该亲身体验过，老约翰、奥利弗，还有……艾伦，他们以生命，告诉了你自己的选择。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_46|！！！",
        DialogType = 1,
