          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_85|告诉我，你听到了什么？一只虫子的鸣叫，还是，一个人类的心跳？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_86|不，什么都没有。这里是空的！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_87|不是空的。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_88|里面有一颗银芯。白银之心，也是一颗心。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_89|但这颗不同于人类与虫族的心脏，需要你自己去定义。就像真正的自己，需要你去选择，去塑造，去成为。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_90|人并非生来就明白自己是什么，这需要成长，需要理解和超越。这是你的原话。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1190},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_91|！！！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_92|克莱门汀怔怔望着你，望了许久。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_93|我到底是什么？",
        DialogType = 6,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Sequence = "SlowCaption"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_94|——本我。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1307,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_95|——超我。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1307},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1183,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_96|人类？还是虫族？",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1183},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1901,2);SetRole(1904,4)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_97|一滴泪从克莱门汀的眼中忽然落下。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1901, 1904},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C202_07"
        },
        AnimState = "CG/C202/Prefab/CGDynamic_C202_07.prefab",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Small_Water_Drop"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_98|这是一滴迟来的泪。\n这是一滴在心底酝酿许久的泪，久到它的主人，已经忘记了它的存在。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_99|她以为那些过去已经真正的「过去」，以为自己的生命迎来了新生。\n但原来，没有人可以剥离自己的过去。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_100|父亲，不必向我道歉\n成为你的女儿本身，已经足够幸福",
        DialogType = 6,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Sequence = "MiddleCaption",
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_101|轰轰——",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "continueShake",
          1
        },
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SanatoriumAisleInvaded"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_House_Shaking"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Boom"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_102|心灵空间的坍塌仍在继续，不断消散的克莱门汀擦去眼角的泪水，向你露出复杂的微笑。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Earthquake"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_103|真是场了不起的心理治疗。作为患者，我想我有必要袒露一切。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_104|与我融合时，她带回来了……被你们称为人性和爱的东西。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1190},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_105|她想要守护你，而这影响到了我。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Cry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_106|我可以杀死我自己，但我……无法真正伤害自己想要守护的人。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_107|<Shake:克莱门汀……>",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_108|你没有说完。克莱门汀忽然抱住了你，用力一推——",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Push"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_109|不需要道别。心理治疗结束后，患者就需要离开。",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "avg_dialog_Lessen",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Zoom_Out"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_110|空间破碎的声音在刹那间停止，一切都如幻梦般消失无踪。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {
          "continueShake",
          2
        },
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Energy_Barrier_Broken"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_111|在最后关头，你被克莱门汀推离了那彻底破碎消失的空间，回到了现实世界。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Woods"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_112|这是次成功的心理治疗……对我而言。",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_113|克莱门汀最后的声音在你的心中回响。\n那是拥抱的片刻，她在你耳边的低喃。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Cry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_114|在这宇宙，不止人类这一种社会性生物。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_115|……",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Woods"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_116|所以克莱门汀，在这场仪式的最初，你只是渴望着同族？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_117|没有回答，你也没有指望获得回答。\n将银钥匙紧紧攥在手中后，你努力向前走——",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73780_Content_118|你要去拯救其他人——或者说，同族。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [73777] = {
    ID = 73777,
    CnID = "2.0主线剧情_关卡2_18_前",
    BaseSortID = 27,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 27,
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_1|燃烧的世界，再见",
        Chapter = "Chapter 2;Goodbye, Burning World;Part 18",
        DialogType = 4,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_UI_AVG_Chapter_Pop"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_CG_Audio"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        },
        BanSpeedUp = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_2|……",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_DollLab"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_After_War_Tired_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_3|！！！",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_4|——",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1874},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_5|如果没什么事情能填充你的大脑，你可以再重新阅读一下@2虫族的报告。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_6|我现在很难看进去任何文字……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_7|熔毁·朵尔，克莱门汀的唤醒实验能够成功吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Threat"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_8|你在质疑一个天才的科研水平？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_9|当然不是，只是……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "ShutEye2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_10|只是克莱门汀的精神状态不太稳定，只是担心虚空会侵蚀克莱门汀的银芯，还是担心醒来的克莱门汀出现什么问题？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1874},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_11|你还不明白吗？当我们捕捉到克莱门汀意识碎片的时候，就已经代表了她的选择和意志。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_12|是的，我的意志和我的选择，都是你，%player%。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_13|克莱门汀！",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1874},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_14|感觉如何，是否需要我帮忙调试身躯？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_15|我想暂时还不需要。我现在很好，或许从来都没有这么好过。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Dreamy_Memories_109BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_16|……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_17|%player%，从你的微表情来看，你似乎有许多话想对我说。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_18|请畅所欲言，我是个专业的倾听者。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_19|那天的话，你是故意说给我听的吧？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_20|你是指「人性和爱」……当然，有一些故意的成分，但我也没有说谎。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_21|我最终没有痛下杀手，不是吗？作为守密人，你应该最明白唤醒体真正失控的可怕后果。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_22|我明白，也正是考虑到这一点，我才会选择尝试唤醒你。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_23|感谢你的选择，让我再一次获得新生。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_24|只是……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_25|我说过，请畅所欲言。对于你，这点耐心和包容，我还是有的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_26|……克莱门汀，如今你拥有了新的身份，你可以去看真正的世界，过自己想要的新的生活。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_27|你可以做任何你想要做的事情，但唯有一点——",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_28|不要伤害无辜者，我猜你是想说这个。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_29|在了解@2虫族的生活方式后，我觉得有必要强调这一点。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_30|当然，这并不是什么难事。一个充满博爱精神的心理医生，不会介意患者的身份。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_31|虐待狂、变态人格、悖德型人格……在这个病态的世界，有太多的病人需要医治，没有必要打扰无辜者的生活。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_32|最重要的，我想尝试做出一些改变。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_33|我想，你是指「成为真正的自己」这件事。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_34|是的，不是作为人类或是虫族，而是作为唤醒体，一个新生的我，去寻找自己。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_35|当然，这不代表我会忘记正事，审查会那边，我会持续关注的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1874},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_36|持续关注……你的潜在意思是，审查会的某些行为会影响到这个世界的存续？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_37|或许，但根据目前所观察到的，我还无法下定结论。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_38|如果你们不介意，我想回去继续潜伏，直到调查出结果。当然，这结果会与你们共享。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_39|那就麻烦你了。还有……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1190,
          nil,
          "Happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_40|威廉，是吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_41|是的。所有疗养院的受害者都已经处置妥当，但我没有找到威廉，他……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_42|关于威廉，也许我有一些线索。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_43|熔毁·朵尔拿出一本笔记本，尽管破损严重，你还是认出了一些字迹：葬骸墓地。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Paper_Spread_out02"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Thinking_001_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_44|这么说，威廉接下来的计划是前往这个葬骸墓地，为什么？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1874},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_45|这就是你需要去调查的原因。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_46|看来这次，我又要单独行动了。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_47|没问题，我现在就……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_48|熔毁·朵尔用目光阻止了你的话语。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1874,3,Serious)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_49|我说过，下次，我会在监视器上加载我知道的所有武器。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_50|现在是时候践行这句话了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_51|熔毁·朵尔以行动作为了回答。等你反应过来时，已经被拽离了房间。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Slow_Short",
          "900"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_52|克莱门汀望着你们离开的背影，无声微笑，随后她收敛笑容，望向那份关于虫族的报告。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1190,3,Happy)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_53|她没有说话，只是沉默着站了许久。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1190,3,Sad)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_73777_Content_54|当她离开时，一阵风吹来，翻开了放在桌上的@2虫族的报告。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
