  [89075] = {
    ID = 89075,
    CnID = "2.0主线剧情_关卡3_3_前",
    BaseSortID = 6,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 6,
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_1|月光、骸骨与舞",
        Chapter = "Chapter 3;Moonlit Skeleton Dance;Part 3",
        DialogType = 4,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_UI_AVG_Chapter_Pop"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_CG_Audio"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_2|惊醒你的是一道月光。明亮的上弦月穿过淡薄的云层跃入你的眼中，让你刚刚睁开的眼睛感到刺痛。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_StarrySky"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_After_War_Chp4_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_WastelandNight"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_3|你想要揉揉眼睛，但发现抬起的手被一道雾气禁锢住。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"blackSmoke", 1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Tight"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_4|晚上好，我的贵客。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_GraveyardNight"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Strange_001_118BPM"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_5|这个主宾座椅的材料来自四十位不同种族与阶层的身体，光是分解他们的皮肤与骨肉就花去了我不少时间。喜欢这种细腻的触感吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_6|一道华丽的长餐桌，明晃晃地出现在一个广阔的墓地上，却不令人产生任何违和感，似乎它从诞生的那一刻就属于这里。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_7|贵重的餐盘以恰到好处的间隔错落摆放在餐桌之上，在那些已经被打开的餐盘中，被精致烹调过的组织与体液飘散着你从未闻到过的奇异香味。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_8|肝脏，肋骨，心脏，眼球，手掌，脑垂体，半个头颅……只是略微扫了一眼餐盘中的东西，强烈的恶心感便袭向你的胃部。你赶紧挪开了双眼。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Heart_Beat_Loop_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_9|烹饪是一门艰深的学问，我个人信奉原生态主义。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_GraveyardNight"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_10|无论何种生物，都被以精妙的伟力所设计、创造。每一道弧线，每一种色泽，都蕴藏着我们难以更改的美。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_11|正因如此，只有保留这些部位本来的模样，才能完全地还原它们应有的风味。视觉与味觉的美，永远不应该被分割。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "1",
        NextChatID = {"2", "8"},
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_12|如果因此让你感到不适，还请见谅。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "2",
        NextChatID = {"3"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_13|让我不适的可不止这个",
        DialogType = 5
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "3",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_14|我想你搞错重点了，杜勒赛因先生。让我感到不适的可远远不止它们的样子而已……",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Set_Avg_Mus_As_More_And_More"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "4",
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_15|你看了眼禁锢住自己双手的黑雾，想着那一桌不堪入目的东西，翻了个白眼。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "5",
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_16|葬骸城的习俗和你所生活的地方有些许差别，这是你第一次造访，你的不适我非常理解。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "6",
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_17|请放松一些，%player%%sirormadam%。有时候适当地打开自己的心扉，不适也许就会变成享受。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "7",
        NextChatID = {"13"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_18|杜勒赛因狡黠地冲你笑了笑。片刻后，你感觉手上一松。禁锢住你的黑雾消失不见。你检查了一下，没有任何东西在限制你的行动。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"blackSmoke", 2},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Fog_Disappear_re"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Tinnitus",
          "500"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "8",
        NextChatID = {"9"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_19|我似乎没有不原谅的权力",
        DialogType = 5
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "9",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_20|我似乎没有不原谅的权力，杜勒赛因先生。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "10",
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_21|你看了眼禁锢住自己双手的黑雾，翻了个白眼。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "11",
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_22|你当然有。作为一位高贵的宾客，你一定会行使这项权力的，对吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "12",
        NextChatID = {"13"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_23|杜勒赛因狡黠地冲你笑了笑。片刻后，你感觉手上一松。禁锢住你的黑雾消失不见。你检查了一下，没有任何东西在限制你的行动。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"blackSmoke", 2},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Fog_Disappear_re"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "13",
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_24|你下意识摸了摸自己怀里的口袋。那里空空如也。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thouch_Cloth"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_25|在找这个？",
        DialogType = 1,
        Sequence = "ShowItem(9533)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Brooches_Shine"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_26|这个银芯制品的纯度实属罕见，制作它的工艺更是妙不可言。我从未听说过有这样优雅的工艺存在，一时看入了神，忘了还给你了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_27|他细长灰白的无名指按住银钥匙，推到你的面前。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thouch_Hand"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_28|把我囚禁起来，现在又给我松开禁制……你究竟想做什么？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Delicious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_29|天大的误会，%player%%sirormadam%。我可从没有想过要囚禁你。我只是在向你发出邀请，邀请你，享受这场美妙的晚宴。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_30|在你们交谈的时候，盛装的食尸鬼们陆续入场，在墓园的每一个角落，用他们嘶哑的嗓音谈论着最近的时局与今夜丰盛的晚宴。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_DevilWhisper"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Gubao_Opening_108BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Zombies_Crowd_Abstract"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_31|二十名侍从裹着不同生物的皮穿梭其间，将手里盛满粘稠血液的高脚杯送到每一个宾客手中。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_32|苔藓覆盖的管风琴自动演奏，轻柔的舞曲从喉骨制成的音栓里流淌而出。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1964},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_33|老爷，银月快要升至中天了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_34|啊，时间到了！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_35|杜勒赛因拍拍手站起身，月光落在他的礼服上，尸蜡的光泽隐约闪烁。整个墓园安静下来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_OnePerson_applaud"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_36|葬骸城的臣民，我亲爱的朋友们。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_37|弦月已升至中天，第十三道钟声已然奏响。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_38|我以食尸鬼之王、葬骸城之主的名义宣告：",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_39|今夜，诗人的喉管将为我们吟诵，母亲的双臂将拥我们入怀。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_40|今夜，我们以仇敌的颅骨啜饮仇恨，以爱人的肋骨丈量永恒。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Delicious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_41|现在，邀请你们的舞伴吧，我的臣民们——",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_42|随着杜勒赛因的话音落下，食尸鬼们贪婪地冲向身边的墓碑，伸出自己的手。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Zombie_Hoarse_Crowd"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Desert_Footsteps_Multiple_People",
          "250"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Dule_Dance_Waltz_160BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Desert_Footsteps_Run",
          "250"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Zombies_Crowd_Abstract"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_43|墓园里无数的坟墓开始蠕动，一双双腐坏的手穿过覆盖苔藓的泥土，搭上食尸鬼们的手心。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "continueShake",
          1
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Soil_Break"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Skeletons_Crawl_Out_A"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_44|棺材的盖板爆裂，尸体们踏着死亡舞曲的节奏破土而出，与食尸鬼们两两成对，来到墓园舞池的中央。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "continueShake",
          2
        },
        BgID = {
          "SScene_GraveyardNight"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Rock_Explo"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_45|杜勒赛因走入舞池，优雅地挽起一只尸体的手。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C203_008"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_46|一切繁文缛节都已随雾色消散。我亲爱的臣民们，欢呼吧，撕开汝等裹尸布下的伪善，露出那原始的饥渴之相！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C203_01"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AnimState = "CG/C203/Prefab/CGDynamic_C203_01.prefab",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Sea_of_flowers",
          "Play_A_SFX_Meteor_Passing_By_02"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_47|食尸鬼乐手们苍白的指节猛然拨动肠弦竖琴，空洞的腹腔传出管风琴般的轰鸣。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_48|那是你从未见过的舞蹈，是冰冷的探戈，荒蛮的华尔兹。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_NotGood_Dance"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_49|男士们裸露的指骨紧扣舞伴的脊椎，女士们腐烂的裙摆扫过墓碑青苔，整座墓园都在这盛大的舞会中震颤。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_50|杜勒赛因满意地看着这一切，呼吸变得有些急促起来。他强忍着兴奋，连声音也几乎颤抖起来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_51|将亡者吞噬吧，与亡者交融吧，我的臣民们……亡者的魂灵，将在我们的身体里，获得永恒！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C203_02"
        },
        AnimState = "CG/C203/Prefab/CGDynamic_C203_02.prefab",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Roses_Flying_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89075_Content_52|葬骸城，开宴——",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C203_001"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Crow_Crowd_A"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
