      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89068_Content_53|能做到这些事情的，只有一个人，守密人阁下。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89068_Content_54|走吧，我们回王邸。我要当面问问他，做出这一切，想要毁了葬骸城，究竟是为了什么。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [89074] = {
    ID = 89074,
    CnID = "2.0主线剧情_关卡3_6_前",
    BaseSortID = 13,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 13,
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_1|誓言",
        Chapter = "Chapter 3;An Oath;Part 6",
        DialogType = 4,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_UI_AVG_Chapter_Pop"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_CG_Audio"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_2|弗兰站在厨房的王座旁。他的服装依然那么熨帖，他的姿态依然那样恭谨。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CastleKitchen"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1964,3);",
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Strange_001_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Kitchen_Hall_Fire"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_3|他已经忘了自己是从什么时候开始追随杜勒赛因。对这里的一切，他与杜勒赛因一样熟悉。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_4|骷髅吊灯的光线洒下，让中央案台上的那具尸体带上一层神圣、安宁的面纱。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_5|弗兰的手抚过她早已腐败的脸，嘴角微微勾起，如同正在重温一段漫长的故事。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_6|脚步声在他身后响起。沉稳，冷漠，由远及近。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Bad_Misty_3"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1964},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_7|您来得比想象中要快，老爷。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Nervous_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_8|他站起身，向杜勒赛因行礼，仿佛这是漫长时光里的无比普通的一天。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_9|你觉得，你派去守在门口的那些士兵有勇气拦下我？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1964},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_10|我只是期盼盗墓者的谜团能多困扰您一阵。现在看来，这也是一种奢望。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_11|但你赢了，弗兰。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_12|杜勒赛因微微虚着眼睛，望向空气中那些由符印中散逸出的能量痕迹。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_13|溟梦之帷符印，是你与我一同维系的。知道它的位置，以及破坏的方法的，除我之外就只有你。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_14|我还记得，我想要把它存放在我的厨房时，你极力地反对，说那样是对葬骸城的不负责任。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_15|可现在……你费尽心机，骗皮克曼去偷窃尸体，杀害无辜的小女孩，将我引出古堡，就为了毁掉这个符印，毁掉这座你生活了一生的国度……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_16|我想知道，为什么，弗兰？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_17|其他的人或许无法理解，但其中的缘由，您再清楚不过，老爷。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Pressure_001_95BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_18|弗兰低着头，凝视着台上那具腐坏多年的尸体，声音带上了些许的哽咽。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_19|我已经忘记了，她是什么时候、因为什么原因死去。我也已经忘记，我央求过您多少次。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_20|我知道，您有办法让她重新睁开眼。我愿意为您献上一切，我的老爷，只要她能再睁开眼，再站在我的面前，再对我微笑……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_21|杜勒赛因老爷啊，可您从未回应过我。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_22|死亡是我们的信仰，弗兰。让亡者安息，吞噬他们的肉体，继承他们的记忆，带着他们的意志继续活下去，这才是我们对于死亡的尊重。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_23|你曾是我最忠诚的朋友，我又何尝不想看到你与妻子重聚。可我早已和你言明……让亡者复生，将付出极为惨痛的代价。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_24|那代价，是任何一个人都不愿意看到的。正因如此，复生之法才被列为禁忌。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_25|你是这个国度身份最为尊崇的食尸鬼之一。这些道理，你应该明白。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_26|明白与做到之间的距离，就像生与死般遥不可及。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_27|死亡是您的信仰，是这个国度的信仰。但我的信仰，唯有她而已。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_28|弗兰牵起那只永远停驻在年轻时代的腐烂的手，放在自己苍老的唇边，深深亲吻着。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_29|在这些年里，我寻找了很久。我想要盗取古堡中的复生之法，但我至今仍然没能找到。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_30|您的智慧令我惊叹，老爷。可月亮不会辜负诚心之人。我遇见了他们。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_31|那些朋友告诉我，他们有能够复活我妻子的方法。而我所需要做的，只是帮他们一个小忙。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_32|他们需要银芯。很多，很多的银芯。一个葬骸城那么多的银芯……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_33|为了复活你的妻子，你便愿意将你的整个家乡献给敌人？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_34|你知道，这世上有多少人觊觎着葬骸城的银芯。你知道，这样会死多少人。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1964},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_35|我不在乎，老爷。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_36|弗兰轻轻拍了拍那只腐烂的手，将它温柔地放在尸体旁。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_37|就算他们真的能复活你的妻子，你觉得，你能活到他们到来的那一刻？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_38|寒雾从杜勒赛因身上骤然升起，另一股更为压抑的黑雾，也在同一时刻，萦绕在弗兰身边。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {
          "whiteSmoke",
          1,
          "blackSmoke",
          1
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Black_Mist_Surges_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_39|一双巨大的裸翅撑破礼服，从这位年迈的食尸鬼背后撑开。他挡住腐坏的尸体，抬起双眼，直视着面前这位食尸鬼之王。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Turn_Jump",
          "350"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Smashed_into_pulp"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89074_Content_40|不试试，怎么知道呢？",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [89069] = {
    ID = 89069,
    CnID = "2.0主线剧情_关卡3_6_后",
    BaseSortID = 14,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 14,
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_1|咳咳……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CastleKitchen"
        },
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Pressure_001_95BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Kitchen_Hall_Fire"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_2|弗兰没有顾上嘴角流出的鲜血，仔细拂去溅在妻子尸体上的瓦砾与尘土，神色复杂地望向你们。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Caress03"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_3|从记忆中召唤生物作战的方式，我从未听闻。这位客人的能力，令人赞叹。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_4|杜勒赛因老爷，跟在您身边多年，我发现，我似乎从未了解你。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_5|您的力量，比我想象中更加强大。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_6|结束了，弗兰。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1964},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_7|这场战斗或许注定以我的失败作为结束……但这场战争，才刚刚开始。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_8|老管家挣扎着抬起头，直视着杜勒赛因的双眼。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1964},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_9|葬骸城已现于世，入侵的大军马上便要到来。您来不及修复符印。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Desolation_Terror_83BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1964},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_10|这里的消息，我已送了出去。很快，他们便能复活我的妻子了……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1964},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_11|您无论如何，也救不了葬骸城。是我赢了，杜勒赛因老爷。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_12|你现在已经没有反抗之力，你就不担心，我将你和你妻子的尸体，啃食殆尽？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_13|那样做，除了发泄愤怒以外，没有任何意义。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_14|您常说，愤怒是无能的表现，一位优雅的绅士，不应该让愤怒占据自己的头脑。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1964},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_15|您是我见过最为绅士的人，老爷。所以，您不会这样做。您会绅士地放我离去，绅士地迎接自己的失败，绅士地，看着我满足我唯一的期愿。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_16|弗兰向杜勒赛因微笑着。这么多年的相处，他相信，自己是最了解杜勒赛因的人，甚至比杜勒赛因自己都更了解。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_17|杜勒赛因身体微微颤动，深深叹了一口气。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_18|失去一个如此了解我的朋友，是一件令人惋惜的事。可你对我的了解还不够，弗兰。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_19|我的确不会把你怎么样。但很遗憾，你赢不了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1953},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_20|圣主！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Something_Flash"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Hurry001_Mid",
          "300"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_21|杜勒赛因朝士兵招了招手。士兵凑到杜勒赛因身边耳语了几句，他轻轻点了点头。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_22|我的士兵告诉我，祭灵节的集会正是最热闹的时候。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_23|走吧，守密人阁下。我想，我们现在有些时间，可以好好欣赏葬骸城的风光了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89069_Content_24|从那位老管家的身上，杜勒赛因收回了他怜悯的目光，转身向古堡外走去。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleExit = {1144},
        ExitDirection = {1},
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [89086] = {
    ID = 89086,
    CnID = "2.0主线剧情_关卡3_7_前",
    BaseSortID = 15,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 15,
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_1|婚纱与葬礼",
        Chapter = "Chapter 3;Funeral & Wedding Gown;Part 7",
        DialogType = 4,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_UI_AVG_Chapter_Pop"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_CG_Audio"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2018},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_2|喂！你看到了吗！遮住葬骸城的迷雾已经……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_LondonNight"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(2019,4)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Bustling_city_joyful_crowd"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_After_War_Chp4_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2019},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_3|我的眼睛还没有被吃掉呢。早就看到啦。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2018},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_4|那你还有心情在这里喝酒？！要是有入侵者偷偷溜进来……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2019},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_5|怎么，你还怕他们跟你抢吃的啊？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2019},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_6|天塌下来有咱们的王顶着呢。这祭灵节前的热闹，可不能错过……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_7|发生在葬骸城外围的这些波动并没有对市民们产生多大的影响。集市上依然人声鼎沸，仿佛永远不会有停下来的时候。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_8|被破坏的符印、突兀出现的墓园，也不过是为这里的市民们增添了一些谈资。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_9|杜勒赛因坐在记忆脑脊液饮品店的座椅上，一边品尝颅骨杯盏中恬淡的液体，一边兴致勃勃地看着舞台上的活体解剖剧场。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_10|解剖的手法虽然迅捷，但略显粗糙了，对连接处的厚度与形状没有控制好。大概能算是个二流的解剖者吧。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_11|你还真是有闲心……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_12|对一位君主来说，最好的娱乐，当然就是看着自己的臣民安居乐业。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_13|花些时间来欣赏他们的生活，就如同享受一道自己精心烹饪出的美味。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_14|你是不是忘了我们是来做什么的？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_15|当然没有。那些入侵者们，现在刚刚结束了他们的讨论。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Undergound_Main_104BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_16|一部分已经离开葬骸城，向他们的首领报信。而另一部分，现在已经在向我们靠近，准备要对我们动手了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_17|等待他们的时候，当然要找一些有趣的事情做，否则岂不是辜负了这夜色。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Delicious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_18|你刚来不久，正好可以趁这个时间好好在集市体验一下。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Delicious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_19|记忆罐头商店应该比较适合你。即使不是食尸鬼，只需要吃一点脑叶，也能体验到一段属于别人的记忆，最适合你这种游客。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_20|尸体游乐园设计得非常精彩，不过你年纪不小，恐怕不能入场了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Sweat.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_21|谢谢，不用了……",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_emmm"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_22|面对迫在眉睫的危险，你表现得似乎有点过于松弛了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Delicious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_23|啊，谢谢夸奖。松弛……像是在上好的橡木棺椁里沉睡三百年的尸体才能够拥有的珍贵品质。我喜欢这个词。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_24|入侵者的先遣小队还没有进入葬骸城就被你们监控到。在他们入城以后，所有的动作都在你们的掌控之中。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_25|看上去，就好像他们不是自己主动进来的，而是……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_26|「邀请」，对吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_27|杜勒赛因放下杯子，向你笑了笑。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cup_Bone_Put"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Gubo_Low_108BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_28|我不知道你想做什么，也不想知道。我留下来，不是为了参与葬骸城与其他势力的争斗的。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_29|我想你也能理解，对我来说，所有横生枝节的选择都是不明智的。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_30|如果方便的话，还请你履行你的承诺，将你知道的事情告知我。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_31|我当然会履行承诺，不过，不是现在。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_32|请不要用那种眼神看着我，守密人阁下。我承诺过的事情，自然是会做到。但现在我的确无能为力。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_33|因为你所想要知道的信息，并不在我的手上，而是在我们这次所要面对的敌人手里。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_34|你压制住心里的恼怒，深吸了一口气。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_35|既然如此，我可以等。但我话说在前面，不管你是在跟什么势力作对，这都是你们之间的事，与我无关……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_36|一道隐秘的精神力量波动没有逃过你的脑海。你警觉地停了下来，认真感知着。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Bizarre_GOD"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Desolation_Terror_83BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_37|十几个与食尸鬼明显不同的个体，正隐藏在集市的人群之后，从不同的方向向你们靠来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 2},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_zuoyou_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Push_Away_The_Crowd"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_38|杜勒赛因与你交换了一下眼神，用手指在桌上有节奏的敲击了数下。一旁的暗哨收到命令，悄然消失在街角。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1144,3)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_OldCall_Door"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_39|……我会安守一位客人的本分，等待你解决完你的问题，履行你的承诺。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_40|恐怕也不行，守密人阁下。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_41|因为他们，不是冲着我，而是冲着你来的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise2.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_42|冲着我？什么意思……",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Set_Avg_Mus_As_More_And_More"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_43|你的身份，弗兰已经报告给了这些入侵者。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_44|他们的目的，是葬骸城的银芯。如今符印已被破坏，你手里的那把银钥匙、还有你这个人本身，可比我这个食尸鬼之王更有吸引力。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_45|这个信息，是你故意告诉弗兰的？！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_46|你猛然抬头望向杜勒赛因。他微笑着放下杯盏。同一时刻，十几个身影从人群中窜出，拔出武器向你们冲来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {
          "continueShake",
          1
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Water_Multiplayer_Runnin",
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_Sea_Monster_Fight_03"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Draw_sword",
          "550"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_SeaMonster"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_47|掩盖不住的腥气、鱼类动物般的模样，将你带回索纳尼尔号上的那段记忆。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "continueShake",
          2
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_48|……蹈海者？！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1989},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_49|咕呜……！抓住那个人类！将%heorshe%献予吾主！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Delicious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_50|对葬骸城的客人，可不能如此无礼。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_51|寒雾汇成的手臂从地上钻出，如同荆棘般锁住了蹈海者们的腿。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"whiteSmoke", 1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Magic_Arm_Pop_Soil"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_52|不远处，十几名食尸鬼士兵全副武装，快速向这里合围过来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Armor_01"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Armor",
          "500"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1953},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_53|入侵者，你们被包围了！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1989},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_54|咕呜！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_Sea_Monster_Fight_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89086_Content_55|为首的蹈海者眼见没了退路，猛然挣扎，不顾荆棘刺伤的双腿，带领着十几个信徒孤注一掷地向你们冲了过来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [89083] = {
    ID = 89083,
    CnID = "2.0主线剧情_关卡3_7_后",
    BaseSortID = 16,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 16,
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_1|王邸的厨房里，悬挂的尸体在空中随风轻轻摆动。苍老的食尸鬼背对着门口，长久地望着面前典雅的案几。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CastleKitchen"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Underground_Mist_104BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Kitchen_Hall_Fire"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_2|就像弗兰对杜勒赛因的了解一样，杜勒赛因也了解弗兰。他没有将弗兰关押起来，只是象征性地对他的能力做出了限制。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_3|弗兰依然坐在妻子的尸体旁边，连手脚摆放的位置都没有变过，就像一位忠实的仆从，在漫长的时间里，等待一个遥远的答案。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1964,3);"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_4|他等来的，是一群蹈海者的俘虏。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_5|弗兰略带厌恶的目光越过那些来自深海的畸种，望向杜勒赛因。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1964},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_6|您治下的效率让我惊讶，老爷，但这改变不了什么。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1964},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_7|和那些觊觎葬骸城的欲望相比，您的国度实在太弱小了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_8|这些畸种既然已经被发现，杀死或是送入地牢便是，为什么要把它们带过来，玷污您的圣堂？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_9|有些话直接告诉你没有意义，所以，我要让你亲眼看看。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_10|杜勒赛因招了招手。食尸鬼的卫兵押着来自深海的俘虏们跪倒在地。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Armor_01"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Wax_Fall_01",
          "800"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_11|杜勒赛因来到一个蹈海者身后，伸出手。一道黑雾从他手上散出，汇成一道绳索，钻入它的脑海。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"blackSmoke", 1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Black_Mist_Attack"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1989},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_12|咕啊啊啊——！！",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_Sea_Monster_Fight_02"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Horror_Buzy_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_13|凄厉的叫声在房间内短暂地响起。很快，那个蹈海者瘫软着倒了下去，没了声息。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 2},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Wax_Fall_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_14|其他的几个蹈海者的五感都被黑雾屏蔽，毫无反应地跪在一旁。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_15|看到你皱了皱眉头，杜勒赛因轻轻拍了拍你的肩膀。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"blackSmoke", 2},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pat_Cloth"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_16|啊，抱歉，守密人阁下。请放心，纯粹的施虐行为现在除了宣泄情绪之外毫无用处，我并没有这种不雅的爱好。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_17|刚才这位蹈海者先生告诉了我不少事。他们用来传讯的设备在第三个俘虏的身上，卫兵，把它取出来吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1953},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_18|是。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_19|按照杜勒赛因的命令，食尸鬼士兵很快搜出了一个海螺状的微型设备。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Lock"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_20|弗兰皱着眉头望着眼前这一幕，琢磨着杜勒赛因的想法。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1964,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_21|这是特殊改造过的通讯设备。用这个蹈海者的手指，向他们的上级汇报。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1964}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_22|就说，他们已经成功在葬骸城潜伏，保护葬骸城的溟梦之帷符印，确认已经被杜勒赛因的管家破坏。加上祭灵节将至，葬骸城内部现在一片混乱。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_23|建议他们趁葬骸城还没有组织起防卫力量之前，尽快向目标靠近。在祭灵节这一天，向葬骸城发起总攻。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_24|意思是这样，注意语气。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise1.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_25|！！！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_26|老爷，您……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_27|怎么，你是觉得，我应该告诉他们葬骸城准备充分，让他们延缓进攻，争取一些时间？",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Gubo_High_108BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_28|……那样至少能够尽可能多的疏散葬骸城的居民，让他们活下来……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_29|即使已经背叛，你心里想到的依然是葬骸城啊，弗兰。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_30|无论做了什么，你的一生，注定无法逃脱食尸鬼王邸的管家这个身份。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_31|杜勒赛因有些欣慰与感慨地对弗兰笑了笑。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_32|你说的没错，如果葬骸城注定失败，最好的结果，就是用争取到的这些时间，组织居民避难。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_33|可你怎么知道，谁才是那位觅食者呢？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_34|老爷，您的勇气令人折服，可现在符印已经被破坏，就靠您的力量，无法……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_35|你真的觉得，符印被破坏了？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_36|杜勒赛因的语气依然轻松，但这句话就像落在砧板上的刀般掷地有声。整个房间安静下来，所有人的目光都望向杜勒赛因。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_37|不……这不可能……葬骸城，已经显露在……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_38|被你破坏掉的，是我提前放好的假符印。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_39|在你破坏掉它的时候，真正的符印，也被我暂时关闭了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_40|……为什么，老爷？",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_41|深海的人第一次接触你，是很多年前的事情了。那时候你沉浸在悲痛中，却依然坚决地拒绝了他们。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_After_War_Chp4_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_42|你的忠诚令我感到欣慰，弗兰。但你并未把他们的邀约上报于我。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_43|这让我感到担忧。我知道，你的心里，还残留着一丝念头，一线留给蹈海者的希望。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_44|这些年，我也劝了你很多次。我们出生于葬骸城，也将消亡于葬骸城。食尸鬼的一生都与死亡为伴，这世间没有比我们更理解死亡是何物的种族。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_45|正因如此，我们应当认真地接纳死亡。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_46|所以，当你第一次主动联络蹈海者的那天，我很失望……与其说失望，不如说，难过。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_47|在我的父亲想要杀害我时，是你第一个偷偷告知我。当我从祭坛归来时，是你第一个前来迎接我。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_48|当这座城邦的人还在为成为食尸鬼而犹豫，又是你第一个站出来，迎接新生……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_49|我感到难过，弗兰。我知道，从你接受蹈海者的提议那天开始，我便要失去我最后一个挚友了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_50|老爷……我做的这一切，您……一直都知道？……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_51|杜勒赛因抬起头，轻轻叹了口气。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_52|如你所言，觊觎葬骸城的人有很多，只靠我们，无法抵御这些人的欲望。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_53|你选择了背叛葬骸城，他们找到我们，只是时间问题。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_54|葬骸城想要活下去，必须要将主动权夺回自己手里。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_55|您是想将他们骗到葬骸城，再开启符印，将他们歼灭……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_56|这些年，即使是我，也没有在您身上察觉到半点端倪。我不如您，老爷。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_57|你的演技也毫无瑕疵。彼此彼此吧，弗兰。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_58|杜勒赛因闭上眼，深深叹了一口气。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_59|我与深海诸人的胜负，犹未可知。但你没有做到他们所要求的事，即使他们赢了，也不会兑现承诺，帮你复活妻子。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Gubo_Low_108BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_60|如你所言，我不会因为一个改变不了的结局去欺骗你。你知道我说的是真的。你的计划，注定失败。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_61|你输了，弗兰。彻彻底底。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_62|弗兰瘫靠在案台上，仿佛被抽走了这一生所有的力气。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1144},
        RoleShake = {1964},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1964,3,Sad)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_01"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_ClothesFriction_02",
          "400"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_63|你曾是我最信赖的人。我见证了你与妻子的死别，见证了你这些年的沉沦。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1964}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_64|你来找我，向我祈求复活你妻子的方法。有那么几次，我甚至动过帮助你的念头。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_65|我多么希望，做出这些事的人不是你。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_66|杜勒赛因抬起头，失落地望着窗外将满的月亮。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_FullMoon"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Big_Memory_Confusion"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_67|接下来的时间，我留给你们。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_68|吞下她的尸体吧，弗兰。去见见她，去面对她的痛苦，去目送她无声的消逝。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_69|这是我对你唯一的惩罚……这是我对你最后的恩赏。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_70|脚步声在他身后响起。沉稳，冷漠，由近及远。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Bad_Misty"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_71|杜勒赛因离开了。空荡荡的厨房里，只剩下弗兰与亡妻腐朽的尸体。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CastleKitchen"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1964,3,Sad)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_72|他凝视着尸体，比过往任何一次都要仔细。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Emo_89BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_73|他记得这具尸体每一处骨骼的凸起、每一处肌肤的纹路。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_74|但他已记不清她是一个怎样的人。他回忆着，她喜爱什么、讨厌什么、梦想着什么。但他什么也想不起来。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_75|月光落在尸体身上，美得如同婚礼那天，她身上随风翕动的纱幔。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_76|弗兰伸出自己苍老的手，拨开纱幔，吻上亡妻的嘴唇。随后，尖牙刺入肌肤，将亡者的嘴唇轻轻撕扯下来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Flesh_Eating_Gently"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_77|月光下的厨房如坟墓般寂静，只听得见温柔的撕扯与吞咽中，眼泪与鲜血一同落下的声音。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 2},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_WaterDrop_Once_Reverb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1967},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_78|这里是？……",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"smoke", 1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Sparkling"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_79|伊莱娜？！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Sad_80_8_6_Main"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_80|老管家猛然抬起头。一个年轻女性食尸鬼的灵魂如同雾气般出现在他的眼前。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1964,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_81|伊莱娜……是我……我在这里……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_82|年轻的魂灵茫然地望着他。那些弗兰为了复活她所进行的准备，那些保护尸体的邪术，早已将她的记忆侵蚀殆尽。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_83|眼前这个苍老的食尸鬼是谁？他为何衣衫破烂？他为何泪流满面？",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1964,3,Sad)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_84|他为何痛哭着，用最温和、最嘶哑的声音呼唤着那个叫做伊莱娜的名字？",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_85|她感到茫然，感到畏惧，感到亲切。她犹豫地伸出手。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_86|弗兰踉跄着站起身，奔向她，向她伸出手去。那只薄雾般的纤细手掌，从弗兰沟壑纵横的手上轻轻穿过。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleShake = {1964},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Getup_injured"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_87|她似乎想起了什么，似乎没有。她迟疑地，羞涩地，向眼前的老人微笑着。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_88|在这微笑中，她的身体如同薄雾般轻轻消散。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"smoke", 2},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_Play_A_SFX_SteamFly"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_89|月光照在弗兰的脸上，像是一道沉默的宣判。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_FullMoon"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_90|……",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_91|不知道，弗兰的妻子会和他说些什么？",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CastleCorridor"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Mist"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_92|她的尸体被弗兰用特殊的方式保存，灵魂中所记录的信息，已经所剩无几。她已经无法再和他说些什么了……",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_93|弗兰也明白这一点。吃掉她，只是在完成一场他早就应该完成的仪式罢了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_94|杜勒赛因的手背在身后，抬头望着那道正照耀着弗兰的月光，用平静的声音为一位老友做出最后的道别。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_95|看着向他跑来的士兵，他眼里些微的悲悯与哀伤消失得无影无踪，目光重新变得锋利起来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Armor"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1953},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_96|报告圣主……",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_97|入侵者有动静了？",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Strange_001_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1953},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_98|是。我们派出去的侦察兵发来了消息，在距离海岸70海里的地方发现一艘巨大的蹈海者的船只。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1953},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_99|根据我们所检测到的银芯能量密度……他们的人数，是我们的十倍以上……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          nil,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise1.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_100|十倍？！……",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_101|我想我们都没有听错，守密人阁下。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_102|杜勒赛因望着天上逐渐丰盈起来的月亮，笑了笑。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89083_Content_103|明天就是祭灵节了。把该做的准备做好。",
