        Content = "AvgDialog_89082_Content_13|咳咳……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        ScreenEffect = {"whiteSmoke", 2},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_ClothesFriction_02"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89082_Content_14|杜勒赛因！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89082_Content_15|你伸手扶住将要跌倒在地的杜勒赛因。他舔舐着嘴角的鲜血，抬起微虚的眼睛，望着那个长满肢体的巨怪。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89082_Content_16|这次交锋对腐潮之傀几乎没有任何影响。他挥舞着数十条肢体，红光绽开，海浪再次在他身后汇聚。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_L_O07_12"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Sea_Zombie_Monster_Roar_V2_03"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Big_flood",
          "350"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Dark_pustules",
          "150"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89082_Content_17|呵……无畏的献祭，魂灵的缝合……这是对死亡的玩弄。",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_GraveyardNight"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Dule_Hard_Strong_Sad_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89082_Content_18|食尸鬼信仰着死亡，对死亡怀有无上的敬畏。这种肮脏的怪物，我绝不会让他碰到葬骸城的任何……咳咳……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89082_Content_19|你的精神力量消耗太多……再这样下去你撑不住的。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89082_Content_20|你说的或许没错，守密人阁下。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89082_Content_21|可一位在庆典之日来到厨房的烹饪者，怎么能够倒在欢宴结束之前呢？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89082_Content_22|杜勒赛因舔舐着嘴角的鲜血。他的脸色已无比虚弱，但他的眼神让你想起在葬骸城王邸的华丽厨房里第一次见到他时的样子。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"bloodSmoke", 1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_Play_A_SFX_Memory_Confusion"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Tinnitus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89082_Content_23|冷静，欢愉，渴望，骄傲。那是一位美食家站在厨房时的眼神。那是一位君王站在臣民身前时的眼神。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89082_Content_24|还记得那支舞吗，守密人阁下？您知道，按照葬骸城的传统，在与尸体共舞之后，我们会将对方的尸体……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89082_Content_25|我记得，清清楚楚……都到这时候了，就别惦记你那祭灵节晚宴了，赶紧想办法吧……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89082_Content_26|祭灵节的圆月已经高悬。月光照拂之下，皆是祭灵晚宴的餐桌。我的方法，也在这餐桌之上。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89082_Content_27|餐桌之上……？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89082_Content_28|大地再次震颤。海水汇成的巨幕高高矗立，如同一头凶狠的海兽，凝视着眼前如玩具般的城池。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"bloodSmoke", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_L_O07_8"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Crashing_Waves"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Deepsea_Explo"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Cult_Reburn_Hard_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89082_Content_29|食尸鬼的残军已几乎无力再进行抵抗，在这遮天的巨幕之下，蹈海者的军队轻易撕破那道薄弱的防线，向城门涌来。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89082_Content_30|杜勒赛因，你现在……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89082_Content_31|请放心，守密人阁下。葬骸城的主人，绝不会允许这些肮脏的畸形种践踏这片领地！",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"blackSmoke", 1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thriller_Five_05"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89082_Content_32|黑雾腾空而起，杜勒赛因没有理会你的呼喊，再次向那潮水般的军队冲去——",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Black_Mist_Attack2"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Black_Mist_Surges_01"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
