  [89073] = {
    ID = 89073,
    CnID = "2.0主线剧情_关卡3_11_前",
    BaseSortID = 30,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 30,
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_1|远海之上",
        Chapter = "Chapter 3;Beyond the Tides;Part 11",
        DialogType = 4,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_UI_AVG_Chapter_Pop"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_CG_Audio"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_2|十二道钟声从遥远的地方传来，明亮的下弦月穿过淡薄的云层跃入你的双眼。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_GhoulCity"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Bell_Large_Hit"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Dule_Happy_Dance_140BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Ward"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_3|身着正装的食尸鬼们陆续走入王邸的舞池，用嘶哑的声音在每一个角落里交谈。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Delicious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_4|啊，这么多的宾客都在谈论我的功绩。本来想低调地处理这件事，现在看来是不行了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_PalaceHallNight"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_5|这些仆从，真是没有弗兰会办事。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_6|得了吧，你现在的神情，像是喝了蜜酒。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_7|对于一个君王来说，有什么比臣民的敬爱更香甜的呢？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Delicious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_8|恐怕，只有我为祭灵节所准备的盛宴了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_9|祭灵节不是早就过了……另外，你伤得那么严重，你的御医不是说不让你下厨了么？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_10|祭灵节的满月确实已经过去，但是这样重要的节日，怎么能因为人为的战争而错过？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_11|即使满月已经离去，只要我们与亡灵的连接还在，每一天便都能是祭灵节。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_12|至于伤嘛……御医的话，听一半就好。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_13|比起我的庇护，葬骸城的臣民更需要的，是我的烹饪艺术。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_14|杜勒赛因看着舞池里开始与亡灵共舞、分享着盘中尸体的食尸鬼们，露出满足的微笑。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_15|……你还真会夸自己。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Delicious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_16|可惜这次带着伤，不能完成全部的菜肴。不过，我费了很多工夫，准备了一道卓绝的主菜。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Delicious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_17|我一般不愿意自夸，但请相信我，守密人阁下，这一定是你此生从未见过的美味。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_18|杜勒赛因打开那道华丽的餐盘盖。一股浓郁的香气飘入你的鼻腔。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lid_Pick_On_Plate"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_Play_A_SFX_SteamFly",
          "350"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_19|蹈海者祭司的尸体安静地躺在餐盘中，周身被华丽的珊瑚装点，破碎的胸腔中摆放着精致的海生植物，让整个尸体显得端庄肃穆。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_20|不带立场地看，这是一位令人尊敬的对手，应当享有作为主菜的荣誉。",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_PalaceHallNight"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_21|你知道，他的尸体已经破碎不堪，为了复原他的姿态，我可是花费了不少的功夫。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Delicious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_22|比起陆生动物，深海人的肉质更软，这是他们最显著的特点，为了保留这种核心的风味，我用经香料特殊处理过的尸油将他文火慢煮。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_23|另外，也要感谢你的帮助。正如我之前所说，深海人的去腥尤为重要，这是我经过无数次实践所得出的宝贵经验。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_24|你的遗言我现在还记忆犹新……不管你说什么，我是不会吃尸体的。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_25|哎……总有一天，你会为你贫瘠的人生感到遗憾。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_26|杜勒赛因遗憾地摇了摇头。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          nil,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Sweat.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_27|赶紧享受你的节日吧。节日之后，别忘了你答应我的事。",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_emmm"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_28|请放心，守密人阁下，食尸鬼之王从不背弃誓言。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_29|这份主菜，正是为你、为这个承诺而准备的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_30|看着你疑惑的眼神，杜勒赛因从蹈海者祭司的尸体上切下一块，放入自己的餐盘中。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Slice_Body_Blood",
          "Play_A_SFX_Zhanjin_Fight_Sence_08"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Strange_001_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_31|你的那位朋友来过一次葬骸城，但他只是在外围观察了一阵，随后便没了踪迹。他没有做出什么伤害葬骸城的事，我便也解除了对他的监控。",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_32|弗兰的记忆中，有一段与蹈海者祭司谈论的场景，他们曾经聊到过这件事。而从那位蹈海者祭司的反应来看，他知道这个人。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_33|！！！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_34|他是怎么……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_35|这正是我为您准备这盘主菜的原因。您想知道的事情，便在这道餐盘之内。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_36|杜勒赛因将餐盘拿到自己面前，细长的手指捏住餐刀，刺入一块带着血的肉块。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C203_007"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Meat_Cut_Plate"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Delicious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_37|嗯……鱼腥味被处理得干干净净。香草与醋栗的香味，沁人心脾。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_38|敬我们即将解开的秘密，守密人阁下。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_39|他向你微微躬身致意，仰起头，将那块肉细细咀嚼、吞咽。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_40|……",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1972},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_41|禀报圣女……",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "smoke",
          1,
          "retro",
          1
        },
        BgID = {
          "SScene_StoneAltar"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_Sea_Monster_FightVo_01"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Mofei_Dream_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Snake"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1970},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_42|那个入侵者，有消息了？",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1972},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_43|他靠近岛屿的时候，我们的信徒便对他进行了监控。我们没有从他的船上搜到他的踪迹。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1972},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_44|据海岸附近的居民说，他们看到一个金发的男性人类，但具体位置不明。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1972},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_45|我猜测，他应该是在将要靠岸的时候，弃船逃走了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1972},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_46|这个人训练有素，不知道是从哪里来的……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1970},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_47|废物！一个人类都找不到！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1972},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_48|是……属下这就派人去搜，一定把他搜出来……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1970},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_49|回来！不用了，一个人类而已，影响不了什么。你身上还有更重要的任务。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1970},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_50|你那边准备得如何了？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1972},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_51|我们的舰船已经完工，所有的信众也已经聆听到了吾主的指引。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1970},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_52|很好……既然已经确认那个管家是可靠的，就做好出发的准备吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1970},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_53|这次任务，不惜一切代价，必须要成功。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1970},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_54|只有靠葬骸城的那些银芯，我们才能迎回吾主，迎回神王！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1972},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_55|属下明白！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_Sea_Monster_FightVo_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_56|果然在这里。原来，他们做这一切，是为了迎回什么「神王」。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Surprise"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_57|不过，这到底是个什么地方？似乎从未有过记载……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_58|杜勒赛因的意识在祭司的记忆里漫步，来到一幅地图前，看到了这座岛屿上方所标注的名字。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Bad_Misty"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Surprise"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_59|这个地图……和陆地上所标记的完全不同，难道……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1971},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_60|停止你的窥视，异乡人。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightning_Ball_02"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_New_World_Lalaiye"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_61|谁？！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_62|杜勒赛因猛然转身。他很明确地知道，这不是祭司记忆中的声音。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_63|这道声音，在直接与他对话。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Delicious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_64|有意思。我还从未遇见过这种情况……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_65|你究竟是何种高位的意志，能越过他人精神的维度，与我进行对话？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1971},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_66|余之身份，你无需知晓。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1971},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_67|将来，余之臣民会对你的城邦发动入侵。他们并非你的对手，但这样的行为，毕竟对你的领土与子民带去了伤害。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1971},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_68|于此，余提前向你致歉。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Delicious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_69|呵……来自异维的对话，来自过去的致歉。有趣，实在有趣。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_70|按理来说，我应当离开这道梦境。但这样有意思的事，实在难以遇见。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_71|我很想见见你。如果愿意的话，我也想请你品尝一下我的烹饪。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1971},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_72|我所等待之人，并非你……余将在此，等待%heorshe%的到来。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightning_Ball_03"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1971},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_73|该说的话，余已说完。离去吧，异乡人。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightning_Ball_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Surprise"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_74|请等等……",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_BlackHole"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Surprise"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_75|……",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "smoke",
          2,
          "retro",
          2
        },
        BgID = {
          "SScene_PalaceHallNight"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Big_Memory_Confusion"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Surprise"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_76|回来了？呵，真是有趣……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_77|怎么了？以前可从没见你这个样子……",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_After_War_Chp4_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_78|在这位祭司的回忆里，我遇到了一个不得了的家伙。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_79|你那位同伴的消息，我也找到了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_80|我的推算没有错。不知道他是否是调查到了什么，离开葬骸城以后，他便去到了蹈海者藏身的岛屿。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_81|那是一个我从未听闻之地……那个不知姓名的人，能隔着他人的记忆，与我进行对话，甚至连发生在此时此地的事情，也一清二楚。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_82|他说，他在等待一个人的到来。我想，他所等待之人，或许便是你。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_83|……那个岛屿，叫什么名字？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_84|杜勒赛因的手轻轻摩挲着下巴，认真地回忆着记忆里那幅怪异的地图，与地图上那些光是阅读便令他感觉有些恍惚的文字。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Caress02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_85|它叫……湮灭之国，「利莫里亚」。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_86|……",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_87|海岸线的尽头刚刚泛起白色，另一边的月亮正沉入哥特式楼宇绵延的缝隙之间。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Dock"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Dule_GoodBey_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Pier"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_88|脚步声在沙地上沙沙作响，惊起了桅杆上灰白的鸥群。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Desert_Footsteps_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_89|这么快就要走？我还想等到伤彻底好以后，给你好好做一顿盛宴呢。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_90|没有尝到过我的烹饪手艺，你会抱憾终身的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_91|人生嘛，总是要有点遗憾的。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_92|你叹了口气，收起笑意。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_93|威廉学长，还在等着我。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_94|这次，多亏你的帮助。过程里对你的那些利用，也是不得已而为之。希望守密人阁下见谅。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_95|我理解你的苦衷。关于威廉学长的事，你也帮了我很多忙……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_96|你看着手里那份标记着利莫里亚的地图，还有海面上刻印着食尸鬼标志的船只，以及船上那数十位忙碌的船员。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pick_UpPaper02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_97|你比你承诺的，做得更多。我们互不相欠。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_98|太见外了，守密人阁下。你救下葬骸城的恩情，我无论如何也无法偿清。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_99|你们后面，打算怎么办？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_100|世人都觊觎着葬骸城这无尽的银芯，这便是葬骸城生来的罪孽。与无尽的欲望对抗，不是一件容易的事。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "Gentle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_101|可我们仍然还活着，不是吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_102|杜勒赛因望着那道即将消失在楼宇间的月亮，轻松地笑了笑。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_103|溟梦之帷重新修复之后，葬骸城便会从这个世界上再次消失。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_104|我的国度属于另外一个维度，我会重新修改它与这个世界的锚点。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1144,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_105|无论如何，只要我还在，就不会让人能够毁掉它。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_106|他伸出手，在你肩头轻轻拍了拍。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pat_Cloth"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1144},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_107|等我把我的臣民安顿好，我会再想办法帮你。我想，我们一定还有机会再次并肩的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_108|那些遥远的事情，以后再说吧。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_109|有缘再会了，杜勒赛因。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_110|悠远的汽笛声在平静的海面鸣奏。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_DeckNight"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_WhistleSteam"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_111|船只逐渐远离海岸。葬骸城华丽的建筑在雾气中淡去，直到你某一次眨眼后彻底消失不见，仿佛从未出现过，只留下一个新立了无数墓碑的墓园。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_89073_Content_112|你转过身，站在甲板上，感受着迎面温暖潮湿的海风，感受着照亮脸庞的朝阳，向着那个你曾听闻无数次的失落国度驶去。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Gentle_Waves"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_SeagullVO",
          "500"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pigeons_Flying",
          "800"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
