      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_23|嗯？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_24|那是还在南极据点的时候了。我在山隘里发现了一座祭坛，上面有很多小巧的石雕。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SnowAltars"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Big_Memory_Confusion"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Mofei_Lovely_Sad_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_White_Ocean"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_25|我让妈妈……弥利亚姆给我一把小刀和一些木块，我想做一些木雕。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_26|隔了很久，她只给了我一把没开刃的小刀，说是担心「神母圣体有损」。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_27|我感觉我的身体好像并不属于我，当然也不属于她，我们好像都是那什么神国的一块石砖，闷在自己的位置上，动也不能动一下。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_28|我在你的床头看到了一些木雕。",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolKitchen"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_29|嗯，我偷偷拜托戈利亚，帮我找了块油石。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_30|我费了不少力气，勉强把刀刃打磨到可以切割木头的程度。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_31|我雕刻了很多天，努力地还原我想象中的细节。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2100},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_32|等到我终于觉得满意了，就把它送给了弥利亚姆……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_33|你知道她说什么吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2100,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_34|弥利亚姆……她说你雕得不好，亵渎神明？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_35|你努力揣摩着弥利亚姆的心态，小心翼翼地给出一个猜测。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_36|不。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_37|她看都没看一眼，只是说如果我喜欢这样的雕像，她可以下命令，请最好的工匠每天为我雕刻。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Mofei_Peace_Sad_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_38|墨菲癫狂地笑了起来，难以言述的痛苦与嘲讽顺着僵硬的笑溢了出来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_39|我是神明的孩子，也是神明的母体，想要什么，只要抬手就可以拥有。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Null"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_40|因为我已经拥有了一切，所以雕刻一个木雕这种小事，当然不足挂齿。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_41|她笑着，笑着，不知不觉，眼泪都呛了出来。毫无预兆的眼泪，沿着她因狂笑而扭曲的脸颊急速滑落。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_WaterDrop_Once_Reverb"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_42|我看过你在床头摆放的作品，你的手艺挺好的。",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_New_World_Found_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Cry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_43|好和不好，又有什么重要呢……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_44|墨菲，从今往后，你想要怎么雕刻，就怎么雕刻。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_45|然后我们一起去做小蛋糕，一起去研究花艺。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_46|我会找到返回我的世界的方法，我会介绍我认识的那个墨菲给你，你们可以一起自由地，去做一切自己想做的事情。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_47|墨菲掩面擦了擦泪痕，然后仰起头，给了你一个你从未见过的灿烂笑容。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Laugh1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_48|好啊，这都是你答应我的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Laugh1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_49|绝对，绝对不可以爽约哦。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_50|这是一个无关神母的故事。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118951_Content_51|但她好像这辈子都没有这么开心过。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [118947] = {
