        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_3|几十分钟后。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_4|你们盯着烤炉，被揉搓过的面团一点一点膨大起来，你期待的心也随着那蓬松的弧度一同轻盈地胀起。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_5|蛋奶的香味飘溢四散，唾液腺比大脑更早感知，馋虫让你的腹部咕咕作响。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_hungry"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_6|蹈海者畸形黏湿的焦急脚步声不时沿着木制地板传来，薄薄的门扉却隔绝了两个世界，这片小天地内充盈着有如幻觉般过分简单的幸福与暖意。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_Sea__MonsterFoot"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_7|看，表皮已经变色了，可以端出来了！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Tiny_Clock_Timer_Finish",
          "250"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_8|嗯！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_9|蛋奶香气喷薄而出。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_Play_A_SFX_SteamFly"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_10|你用铁夹将烤盘夹出，墨菲立刻急不可耐地伸手捧起一个散发着热气的小蛋糕。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Oven_Pan_Drag_Out"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_11|别急，烫烫烫烫烫！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Surprise"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_12|墨菲似乎完全舍不得放手，被烫得左手倒右手来回几次，终于等到蛋糕降到合适的温度。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Bread_Toss_In_Hands"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_13|尝一口吧……好像不用我说。",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_14|在你话音落地之前，墨菲已经一口咬了上去。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cake_Bite"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_15|怎么样，好吃吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_16|配方全凭你的记忆，为了照顾半夜饿得嗷嗷乱叫的大小姐，你曾经多次借用过弥萨格的后厨。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Touched"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_17|哼，食材太简陋了，跟弥利亚姆平时给我上供的没法比。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_18|墨菲小心咽下口中的残渣，正色说道。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Swallow_Light"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_19|不过，谁让本神母的烹饪天赋惊人，足以化腐朽为神奇呢。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_20|温热而柔软……这是我吃到过的、最美味的食物。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_21|我也来尝一块试试。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_22|威廉小心地用银色的小刀挑起一块，送入口中。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Scalpel_Put_B"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise1.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_23|学长，如果我没看错的话，你用来切蛋糕的，是不是之前解剖过努比亚的手术刀？",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_PullOut"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_24|已经充分消毒过了。水手用的粗制刀叉实在难以入口。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Sweat.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_25|早知道我应该在葬骸城问杜勒赛因要两套餐具……\n算了，仔细想想，杜勒赛因的餐具切过什么更不好说……",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_emmm"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_26|你们大快朵颐，笑着将奶油抹在彼此的脸上。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolKitchen"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cream_On_Face",
          "350"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_27|（如果这就是她最后的记忆……）",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_28|砰——",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "continueShake",
          1
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Mech_Metal_Creak_Explo_Huge"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AMB_Mech_Creak_Ocean_Wave"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_29|一声巨响打破了难得的平静，你们身处的后厨突然开始不可遏制地剧烈震动。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Ship_Mech_Large_Creak_B"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Horror_Buzy_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_30|什么情况？！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_31|戈利亚劫掠了动力室，弥利亚姆激烈反抗，动力室发生了爆炸。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_32|你淡然地回复。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_33|换句话说，船要沉了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_34|船要沉了，你一点反应都没有吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_35|墨菲，我有话要跟你说。\n这艘船是必须要沉没的。",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_36|我经历了五个轮回，每个轮回中，戈利亚都会布局劫船。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_37|这个过程会引发动力室爆炸，随后船会被某个漩涡吸入海底。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_38|所以呢？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_39|我一直在想方设法阻止这艘船的毁灭，那是我的思考产生了偏误。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_40|这艘船应该沉没……只有它沉没了，才能为你开辟出自由的通路。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_41|轰隆——",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {
          "continueShake",
          1
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Boom"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Hard_Crisis_130BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_42|船身如遭电击般痉挛震颤，仿佛一头巨兽在爆炸的剧痛中失控抽搐。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Ship_Mech_Large_Creak_A"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_43|好了，现在不需要解释那么多了，快跟我走吧。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_44|再晚一些，就什么都来不及了。",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "continueShake",
          2
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_45|你拉着墨菲，顺着威廉指点的小路而行。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Misty_two"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Touched"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_46|喂，你真的要让淑女爬梯子吗？在外人面前手脚并用也太狼狈了吧？！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_LadderFoot"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_47|你先下去等我，我绝对不低头看你。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_48|眼睛逐步适应了黑暗，在货舱的角落，孤零零地停着一艘小艇。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Apt_Bottom"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_AfterWarVer2_58BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_49|这是戈利亚为自己准备的逃跑路线，被我们找到了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_50|这个狡猾的家伙，发起叛乱之前，毁掉了几乎所有救生艇，保证只有他自己一个人能逃出去。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_51|给你，备用钥匙，我让威廉准备的。现在，上船。",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Sash"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Brooches_Pick_up"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Touched"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_52|等等，你在胡说八道什么，我根本没有答应过要和你一起逃出去——",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Benmo_Farewell_0"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_53|我也没有说我和你一起登船。这里有、且只有一艘救生艇。你一个人乘上它，然后登陆。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_54|！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_55|如果我们就这么离开，弥利亚姆不会善罢甘休。总有一天，来自蹈海者的阴影还会追上你。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_56|我必须留在这里，确保蹈海者和圣胎永远沉没在深海中。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_57|这也是他们乐见的，回归他们永恒的故土和神国，不是吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_58|扑哧——",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_59|墨菲含着泪笑出了声。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_60|出发之前，我就已经计划好了。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_61|如果能送你逃出去，那么这就是最好的结局。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_62|如果不能……至少，我已经努力为你还原了，我所认识的那个墨菲会喜欢的一天。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_63|认识的时间不长，对你的了解也不够深入。希望你也喜欢。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_64|墨菲踮起脚尖，给了你一个轻柔的拥抱。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_65|我记得你之前说，你会一遍一遍地经历轮回。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_66|这一次不会是结束。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Laugh2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_67|下一次，带我一起逃出去，好吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_68|<Red:没有下一次了。>\n酸涩感冲上你的鼻尖。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Tinnitus"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Heart_Beat_Loop_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_69|我答应你。我们一起逃出去。",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AMB_Mech_Creak_Ocean_Wave"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_70|阴云密布，船首像之下，弥利亚姆与戈利亚隔空对峙着。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"lightRain", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Apt_Deck"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Pre_Fight_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1166},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_71|交出那个小姑娘和象牙雕像，我可以如你曾经威胁的那样，赐予你尚存荣耀的死亡。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "Crazyangry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_72|少在这里胡言乱语，不正是你们劫走了神母，引发了这场暴乱吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_73|你们都不必争执了，墨菲已经不在这条船上了。\n她已经逃脱了魔爪，远离了旋涡。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_74|一股莫名的快慰涌上心头。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1166,
          nil,
          "Threat"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_75|是你这家伙把她送出去的？倒是有几分胆色。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1166},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_76|如果你们准备在这里大战一场，我倒是不介意坐收渔利。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "Null"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_77|居然是你这不名一文的外来之人……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "Null"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_78|以为有神母的庇护，就可以为所欲为了吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_79|弥利亚姆，我要和你谈谈。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "Crazy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_80|不是粗鲁妄为地直接宣战，而是从谈话开始吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "Crazy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_81|我也很好奇，你是何等不逞之徒，得蒙神母的宣召，尚能行无谋无畏之举至此。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "Crazyangry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_82|若你诚恳地向神之使徒请求答案，我未尝不会赐予你神的恩旨。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "Crazyangry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118947_Content_83|<Red:<Shake:但现在，先承受蹈海之人的怒火吧！>>",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [118945] = {
    ID = 118945,
    CnID = "主线_星辰章4_关卡11_后",
    BaseSortID = 23,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 23,
        TalkRole = {1166},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_1|小家伙，你在战斗里留手了啊。",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"lightRain", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Apt_Deck"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Pressure_001_95BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_SeaMonster_Zombie_War"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_2|对我而言，与弥利亚姆的这次交谈，比一场胜利要关键得多。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_3|只要你能让弥利亚姆产生一丝动摇，密境就会露出它的裂隙，它潜藏的「核」……",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_4|你们就有希望彻底终结这场顽固的人造之梦。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_5|请说明你的来意吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_6|我来，是带着一个问题来的。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_7|弥利亚姆，你为何要复兴神国？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_8|你提出了一个很有趣的问题。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_9|我在对抗融蚀的旅途中，认识了很多人。",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"lightRain", 2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_10|有些人手造恶业是为了在末路中谋求自身的生存。",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1180,3);"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_11|有些人以一己之念对他人进行筛选，是为了建设自己理想中的新世界。",
        DialogType = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1686,3);"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_12|也有些人纯粹为了取乐，便能引发天翻地覆，制造数不清的麻烦。",
        DialogType = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1574,3);",
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_13|你等待、你期待着她的答案。因为你曾在遥远的异梦中，见过她来时的路。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_S_O01_4"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Cult_Peace_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_14|如今疯狂的弥利亚姆，也曾是在天灾之中，为了守护仅有的家人，献身于祭司使命的那个少女。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1715,3);"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_15|弥利亚姆没有直接回复你的问题。她合拢双掌，向着遥远的海平线祈祷。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1168,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_16|「凡虔诚的，吾主将眷顾……」",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_17|「凡期愿的，吾主将应许。」",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_18|仿佛获得了大海的首肯，她半睁开失神的紫黑色眼眸。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1168,3,Crazyeyeopen)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Crashing_Waves"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "Crazyeyeopen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_19|我为复兴神国而来，为神明的荣光重现于世而来。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_20|那么，当利莫里亚重现于世，你又期望看到怎样的世界？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "Crazyeyeopen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_21|「在神明的长梦中，你我同享永恒的和平与安乐。」",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_22|利莫里亚的盛世再现，正如你生前被灌输的那样。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_23|你从未见过哪怕一天那样的盛世，你当真知晓如何去缔造它吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_24|「神的谕旨，将为虔信者指明通往利莫里亚的航路。」",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_25|这个世界的你，果然和我认知的分毫无差。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118945_Content_26|那么，在神明已经降生的此刻，你又为何牢牢将墨菲攥在手中呢？",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
