        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_White_Ocean"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_24|少女在奔跑。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Mofei_Dream_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_25|她不知道旅途的终点，也不知道能不能逃离教母的眼线。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_26|<Shake:哈、哈……>",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_27|前面没有人接应她，后方诡异得有些滑稽的脚蹼拍地声越来越密集。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Sea_Monster_Footstep_Crowd_Multi"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_28|圣女失踪的消息已经传开，蹈海者在集结队伍。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_29|该死，这些烦人的家伙。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_PV1_2_CG1"
        },
        BgTransition = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_30|在闪光的背后，那象征着她的失败的紫袍身影慢条斯理地现身……",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1168,3);"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_31|……",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_32|这个世界的墨菲没能逃出去。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_33|因为那个将她送进蹈海者，又幡然悔悟将她送出的人……",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1201,3);"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_34|已经在那场大爆发的融蚀灾难中永远消失了。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"mucus", 1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1166,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_35|这个小姑娘不是自愿成为神母的，就像我不是自愿成为你的奴隶。",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "lightRain",
          1,
          "mucus",
          2
        },
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Apt_Deck"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Recover_Remember"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_PressureHigh_80BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AMB_Mech_Creak_Ocean_Wave"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1166,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_36|我们都是为了……我们自己想要的东西。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Null"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_37|<Shake:不，我没有想要的东西。>我……什么都不想要。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1166},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_38|你什么都不想要？不，你想要的东西多了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1166},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_39|你既想享受神母优渥的生活，又不想承担身为引导者的义务。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1166},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_40|你害怕被人抛弃，所以你把其他人当成你生命里的傀儡，是你的茶会过家家玩具。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1166},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_41|每隔一段时间，你就清除船上所有人的记忆，然后开启新的轮回。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1166,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_42|小姑娘，让我告诉你吧：不要自作聪明，这世上一切所得皆有代价。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1166},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_43|你是不是以为永远不会有人发现你的小伎俩？以为有了那个象牙雕像，你就无所不能了？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_44|墨菲攥紧了手中的象牙雕像。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1166},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_45|别傻了，蠢孩子。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1166},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_46|你觉得我对你的举动一无所知？我只是还没做好和你正面对抗的准备。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1166,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_47|每一个轮回，我都在尝试改变劫船的方法。威胁你、威胁弥利亚姆、爆破动力室……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1166,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_48|后来我发现，只要那该死的象牙雕像还在，我就没有与你对抗的余地。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_49|戈利亚的嗤笑声回荡在甲板上。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1166},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_50|直到几个月之前，那次被面前这个小东西破坏的葬骸城行动。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1166},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_51|没能缴获足够的银芯，象牙雕像的神力流失，船上的唤醒体的记忆早就松动了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_New_World_Wrong_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_52|你记得所有事情……他们记得所有事情？……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_53|所以，威廉不记得所有的事情，是因为他来自另一个世界。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_54|其他具备灵性的人，和我没有区别……他们知道天地倒转，时空回流。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Cry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_55|<Small:<Shake:你说的所有人……包括……她吗？>>",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_56|墨菲垂下了头，她的声音轻得几近飘忽，她的眼神游移不定，每每飘向身侧的女人，可尚未触及她的目光就立即收回。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1168,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1166,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_57|你这愚蠢至极的小姑娘，我说所有唤醒体。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1166,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_58|这当中，自然也包括弥利亚姆那个蠢女人。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_59|你的意思是……",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1166},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_60|弥利亚姆记得每次轮回发生的事情，她在一而再再而三地等待你。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_New_World_Pain_45BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1166},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_61|我能连通那边那家伙的梦境，我见证过那个世界的结局。我猜，弥利亚姆也一样可以。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1166},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_62|但在我已知的所有轮回里，她没有做任何尝试，只是被动地等待。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_63|戈利亚扬了扬下巴，指向一旁沉默不语的弥利亚姆。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1166,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_64|你以为你亲手打造的这座围城，她是心甘情愿被困在其中的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_65|弥利亚姆以沉默回应戈利亚的揣测。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1168,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_66|<Shake:为什么？我不明白为什么？>",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_67|对你而言，我不是应该是一个失败品，一个淘汰的工具吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118961_Content_68|你不是应该像放弃她们那样放弃我吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [118952] = {
    ID = 118952,
    CnID = "主线_星辰章4_关卡13_前",
    BaseSortID = 25,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 25,
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_1|神诞七日",
        Chapter = "Chapter 4;Seven Days;Part 13",
        DialogType = 4,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_UI_AVG_Chapter_Pop"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        },
        BanSpeedUp = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_2|神诞生的第一天",
        DialogType = 7,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Benmo_god_0"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_3|神的胚胎诞生于灰化的躯壳之中。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_4|我因被抽干的灵性疲惫万分，但所有人的脸上都洋溢着狂热的喜悦。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "retro",
          1,
          "redScreen",
          1
        },
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_L_O07_10"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cocoon_Wrapped02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_5|<color=#F7F7F7>神诞生的第二天</color>",
        DialogType = 7,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "retro",
          2,
          "redScreen",
          2
        },
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_6|我为圣胎施洗。祂合着眼，在襁褓中安睡。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C06_007"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Heart_Beat"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_7|<color=#F2F2F2>神诞生的第三天</color>",
        DialogType = 7,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_8|圣胎仍未睁开眼睛。明明我能感知到他的心跳，就像他在我胸膛前的搏动一样。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C05_002"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_GODBABY"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_9|<color=#F0F0F0>神诞生的第四天</color>",
        DialogType = 7,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_10|我向神祈求答案。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_S_O01_4"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Mirror_Evil_Light_03"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_11|我询问神国的未来，询问祂与我的联系，询问我想知晓的一切和弥利亚姆试图探问的一切。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_12|神沉默不语。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_13|<color=#E6E6E6>神诞生的第五天</color>",
        DialogType = 7,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_14|弥利亚姆询问我面见神的结果。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C06_006"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Snake"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Snake_LiftsHigh"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_15|情急之下，我编造了神的答复，「神国即将上浮」。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_16|她又反复追问时间，我只得回应「星辰正位之刻」。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_17|弥利亚姆欣喜若狂，那是我从未见过狂喜神情，我送她木雕的时候没有，我孕育圣胎的时候也没有。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_18|<color=#E1E1E1>神诞生的第六天。</color>",
        DialogType = 7,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_19|弥利亚姆询问利莫里亚的所在，我只能胡乱应对，她的神色半信半疑。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_MirageOfRlyeh"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_MOLIYAMU_VO"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_20|她曾见过尚未死去的神，我的谎言未必奏效。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_21|<Shake:神啊，请救救我，哪怕一句，回应我的祈祷吧。>",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_22|<Red:神诞生的第七天>",
        DialogType = 7,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "redScreen",
          1,
          "redLoop",
          1
        },
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Flesh_Torn_Shattered"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_23|神已经死去。神从未诞生。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_L_O07_5"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Bizarre_GOD"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_24|躺在我胸口的只是虚伪的造像，一团僵死的、被误称为<Yellow:「神」>的血肉团块。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_L_O07_9"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Postpartum_Baby"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_25|弥利亚姆没有爱过任何人。没有在乎过任何人。",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"redLoop", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Apt_Deck"
        },
        BgTransition = 5,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Benmo_god_weiba_0"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AMB_Mech_Creak_Ocean_Wave"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_26|在掌握神母的权柄之后，我阅读过蹈海者的全部记录。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2100},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_27|几千年的时间里，每隔六十年，就会迎来一次星辰正位之刻。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_28|被献祭的母体，我不是第一个，也不是最后一个。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Null"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_29|想要存活下来，想要留存下来……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_30|就必须杀死那个……",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1199,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118952_Content_31|软弱天真的我……",
        DialogType = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1199,3,Smile)",
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [118959] = {
    ID = 118959,
    CnID = "主线_星辰章4_关卡13_后",
    BaseSortID = 26,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 26,
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118959_Content_1|我杀死了我，捧起了王冠。除了自由外，我得到了我渴望的一切。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Apt_Deck"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Benmo_aria_prelude_74"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AMB_Mech_Creak_Ocean_Wave"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118959_Content_2|但诞下圣婴的我，却没能得到神谕的恩宠，没能指引前往利莫里亚的道路……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118959_Content_3|所以你制造了这个永不结束的梦境……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118959_Content_4|如果我不这么做，她一定会亲手掏出我的心脏……",
