      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_13|无数黑袍的蹈海者横七竖八地睡倒在她身边，而她安静地倚在祭坛上，手中捧着一团猩红发臭的腐肉。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2100,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_14|墨菲……",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2100},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_15|正如你答应的那样，你来了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_16|梦域的主人，是你。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2100},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_17|是啊，这艘船上的一切，都是一个梦。包括你现在看到的一切，也只是「梦中的现实」。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_18|为什么？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2100},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_19|为什么要制造这样的梦域？还是为什么要成为现在的我？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_20|那是很遥远以前的一天。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Xinshijie_lonely_0"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_21|小小的身影跋涉在雪地中。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SnowWind"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Storm_Snow"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "Serious1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_22|呼、呼……",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Snow_Cloth_Footstep_Slow_A"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Snow_Cloth_Footstep_Slow_B",
          "1200"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_23|自从来到南极，墨菲就拥有了一种荒诞的自由。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_24|她可以独自去任何地方。但无论前往哪里，放眼望去都只有苍白一片的雪原。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_25|别说人了，连人类曾经存在的痕迹都没有。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "Avoid"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_26|我这是……迷路了吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_WeeklyRuins02"
        },
        BgTransition = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_27|女孩回望自己来时的足印。茫茫雪原里，一条近似直线的脚步通往不可知的某处。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_28|不管了，只要继续往前走，总能走到某个地方去的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_29|女孩清点了随身的干粮，确认自己接下来一段时间省吃俭用能够抵达的最远的距离。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_30|加油吧，墨菲。这可是奔向自由的旅途，饿饿肚子没什么大不了的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_31|……",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SnowWind"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Snow_Cloth_Footstep_Slow_A"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_32|…………",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgTransition = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Snow_Cloth_Footstep_Slow_C"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "Avoid"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_33|不行，在这样的风雪里，根本分辨不出道路。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "Avoid"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_34|干粮就着雪水，真的很难吃。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_35|有时候她栖身在雪洞里，还能听见野兽的呼号。她从未见过，只知道那是一种白色的狼。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1199,3,Surprised)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Wolf_Roar_Far_RVB"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "Scared"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_36|救命！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleExit = {1199},
        ExitDirection = {1},
        RoleShake = {0},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_37|墨菲慌不择路，逃出了山洞。那双绿莹莹的眼睛停留在山洞里，没有追上她的脚步。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Running_barefoot"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2100},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_38|在这样的绝境中，我见到了一行脚印。",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_WeeklyRuins02"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_39|是人的脚印……！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2100},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_40|只要有人，就有希望。我毫不犹豫地跟了上去。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_41|……",
        DialogType = 3,
        ExitDirection = {1},
        BgTransition = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Snow_Cloth_Footstep_Slow_A"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_42|不久之后，脚印变成了两行。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgTransition = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Snow_Cloth_Footstep_Slow_B",
          "600"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_43|三行。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgTransition = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Snow_Cloth_Footstep_Slow_C",
          "1400"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_44|脚印越来越多，但脚印的主人始终不见踪影。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Benmo_bitter_0"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_45|太过疲累的我，终于昏倒了过去。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Human_Fall_Down_Snow_Hard"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Tinnitus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2100},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_46|后来我才知道，由于左右脚的长短不同，每个人在无法判断方向的步行时，都会轻微地朝某个方向偏移。",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Apt_Deck"
        },
        BgTransition = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_47|换句话说……那时候，我的步行轨迹，是一个圆环。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2100},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_48|我看到的名为希望的足迹，来自过往的我自己，通往永无终点的循环。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_49|因为一点点的、近乎微不足道的偏斜……\n我的人生一直在被一个怪圈束缚。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2100},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_50|那个圆环的圆心，叫做命运。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_51|这就是我所构筑的，困住我自己的循环。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_52|也就是说……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2100},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_53|从戈利亚第一次准备叛乱开始，时间就停滞了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2100},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_54|所有人都沉入了梦中，开始循环往复的梦。\n梦的循环，从圣胎诞生开始，到游轮沉没结束。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_55|只要戈利亚尚未发动叛乱，一切就可以安好如初。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_56|可是我曾经在葬骸城见过戈利亚……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2100},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_57|为了维持梦域，每隔一段时间，我会派一群人外出，替象牙雕像收集能量。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2100},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_58|只要回到梦域之中，他们又会遗忘这段经历，成为梦域的子民。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_59|可惜，自从那次你阻挠了我们从葬骸城吸收能量，梦域就越来越不稳定。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_60|你为什么要让我见到你？",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_61|我原本召唤你来，是希望消灭所有不安定因素，将你绞杀在这片梦域中……",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Benmo_deny_0"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2100},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_62|只是在那之前，我的银芯似乎和你的银钥产生了共鸣，我连通了你的梦境，你的记忆。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_63|在梦中见到了另一种可能性……另一个我自己。",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1199,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_64|我看见她在雕塑课和同学们比赛；",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolOffice"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(2151,3,Smile)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_65|我看到她在喷泉下和流浪猫打架；",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolGround"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(2049,3,Angry)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_66|我看见她被朋友们哄着穿上小恶魔的裙子，提着南瓜灯挨家挨户派发糖果……",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolNight"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(7777001,3,Serious)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_67|在圣胎没有诞生的世界里，她真是……太幸福了。",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1199,3,Smile)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_68|令人羡慕，令人嫉妒。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_69|也令人想要成为。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_70|<Yellow:%player%>，直到遇见你，我才知道世界上还存在这样简单快乐的生活方式……",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Apt_Deck"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Benmo_dream_0"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Cry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_71|不需要神母的虚荣冠冕，不需要万众景仰的尊荣，不需要日复一日面对着教徒们令人生厌的脸……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Delicious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_72|什么责任，什么传承，为什么这么多人要为了一滩烂肉献上自己的一生？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_73|你维持沉默，你只能沉默。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_74|墨菲在否认过往的她自己。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_75|我还有最后一个问题要问你。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2100},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_76|在你的世界里，你也是这么带她做小蛋糕的吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_77|在那个世界里……不止是我，会有很多人愿意帮助你，陪你做任何你想做的、任性的事情。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_78|墨菲，因为你是爱着世界、爱着所有人的。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_79|因为你，剖开了自己的心，所有人都亲眼目睹。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C06_017"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_80|那颗跃动的心脏。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C06_007"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Heart_Beat_Loop_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_81|墨菲笑了，笑得如同你往昔的记忆一般灿烂。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Apt_Deck"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(2100,3,Smile)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_82|你知道吗？这艘船是一个梦。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_83|我曾以为它是一个美梦……\n我是崇高的神之母，而那团蠕动的肉块是所谓的神明。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_84|日日夜夜，我怀抱着恐惧生活，担惊受怕，备受折磨。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_85|原来这场梦并非美梦，而是我自己都不曾意识到的，深陷恐慌的噩梦。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118955_Content_86|所以，现在，揭穿谎言的帷幕，让梦醒过来吧。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
