      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2100},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118957_Content_32|不能说知道，但只要知晓这个世界的本质，自然就能通晓世界联通的节点。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2100},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118957_Content_33|这艘船是一个梦境，可是当谎言的帷幕揭开……",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Benmo_Final_Farewell_0"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118957_Content_34|整个世界同样是某人的梦境，只是这场梦更大，更虚幻，也更遥远……",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_DeepSeaThrone"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118957_Content_35|连日月星辰都源于祂的虚构，唯有与他的灵纠缠的生灵才能……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118957_Content_36|日月星辰……",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118957_Content_37|黑纱颤抖，绵延成一条通往天际的蜿蜒纱路。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "Sscene_CG_SD_S_C06_11"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Meteor_Passing_By_02"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Galaxy"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118957_Content_38|去吧，回去吧，回到属于你的世界里去！不必留恋这个已经死去的世界。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_118957_Content_39|那你呢，墨菲？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118957_Content_40|你忍住立刻踏上纱路的冲动，回头询问静默的墨菲。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118957_Content_41|谁知道呢？这个世界是业已毁灭的世界。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Apt_Deck"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118957_Content_42|收下它吧。也许某一天，你可以在那个世界感应到我的银芯。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118957_Content_43|一枚血珠凝成的宝石落在你的掌心，来自洞穿她胸口那道怪诞的伤痕。",
        DialogType = 7,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Runes_Steam"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118957_Content_44|那时候的你召唤出的，不知道会是哪个时期的「我」。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Apt_Deck"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118957_Content_45|但请你呼唤我的时候，记得现在的我的模样……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118957_Content_46|祂的降诞已是虚妄……捏塑幻梦皆为虚妄……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2100,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_118957_Content_47|就叫我……「<Yellow:诞妄·墨菲>」吧！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_118957_Content_48|你沿着纱路徐行，无数思绪在脑内飞掠而过。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "Sscene_CG_SD_S_C06_11"
