        Content = "AvgDialog_131213_Content_40|以……@2之名……@3信徒……",
        DialogType = 1,
        Sequence = "DarkRole(2315,1)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2287,
          nil,
          "Excited"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_131213_Content_41|说吧，使徒……你想告诉我什么？是你的渴望？还是那位神明的话语？！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2287,
          nil,
          "Excited"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_131213_Content_42|祂有何谕令传达给这个世界？想让这些舞台破碎？还是想让这些人偶们，共同迎接祂的降临？！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2287,
          nil,
          "Excited"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_131213_Content_43|告诉我吧，亲爱的使徒！你是一头多么危险又可爱的野兽，除了撕咬与毁灭，一无所知……告诉我，你想要的……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2315},
        Content = "AvgDialog_131213_Content_44|诵念@2……吾之名讳……唤醒@2……@3原初……",
        DialogType = 1,
        Sequence = "DarkRole(2315,1)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2287,
          nil,
          "Excited"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_131213_Content_45|啊，你的名讳，没错……我将诵念你的名讳！我会将你想要啃食的一切，都送到你的嘴边。我将为你，打开这座牢笼……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2315},
        Content = "AvgDialog_131213_Content_46|吾名……@2……",
