        Content = "AvgDialog_131211_Content_77|她要将这里的一切，连同我们在内，都变成她的木偶。她想要成为那位神明。她……想要成为命运本身。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131211_Content_78|阿拉克涅平静的语气仿佛属于一位从未入戏的观众。那些被重新收回的维度余烬如轻沙般萦绕在她指尖，绵延不绝。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131211_Content_79|她的纺轮艰难地旋转着，勉力维系着那些正被涅芙蕾亚破坏的命运，阻止着那些黑色的丝线汇入涅芙蕾亚手中。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Black_Mist_Surges_01",
          "Play_A_SFX_Metal_Spinning_Wheel_Abstract_B"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2319,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_131211_Content_80|维度的余烬已经收回，如今我已无需再有顾忌。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2319,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_131211_Content_81|请帮助我，尽量靠近她。涅芙蕾亚的纺轮将停止转动，这段错误的命运，我将与您一起修正。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2319,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_131211_Content_82|请帮助我……为这些被遗弃的命运，带来解脱。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [131223] = {
    ID = 131223,
    CnID = "2.0主线剧情_关卡5_15_战斗前1",
    BaseSortID = 30,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 30,
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_1|命运。荒蛮，虚无，可悲的命运。被抛弃的命运们不知道自己来自何处，去向何方。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"mucus", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_OperahouseFate2"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Alakelie_prepare_120"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_2|他们被丝线牵引着，涌向你，在你的银光中化作一滩滩黑色的黏液。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pus_Spurt_Explo"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_3|黏液荒蛮，虚无，可悲，如同他们的命运本身。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_4|涅芙蕾亚没有理会这一切，眼前的场景在她的眼前上演了无数年，她对此早已习惯。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2287},
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_5|我看清了。你所看见的那些画面，你所看见的一切，我终于看清了……",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"mucus", 2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_6|碎片带来的痛楚早已麻木，她微笑着望向剧院中那些混乱的空洞。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_7|高傲的、怜悯的、淡漠的微笑，有一个瞬间，你几乎没有分清她与阿拉克涅。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2319,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_8|只有身处囚笼之中的人，才能真正打开囚笼。你看见的混乱与毁灭，不是真实的命运，涅芙蕾亚……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {1},
        RoleHide = {2287}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2287,
          nil,
          "Excited"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_9|呵呵呵呵！……这么多年里，你就是这样欺骗自己的吗，阿拉克涅？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {5}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_10|涅芙蕾亚的声音陡然尖利起来。晦暗的光芒亮起，猩红的丝线将她死死束缚，提灯的余焰炙烤着她的身躯。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 1},
        BgTransition = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Neph_Boss_Vo_Attack_B",
          "Play_A_SFX_DevilWhisper"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Whisper",
          "500"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_11|巨大的螯足在空中翕动，一双巨大的流淌着黑色粘液的复眼，带着笑意望向你们。猩红的丝线缠绕在她的身体上，在命运的漩涡中飘荡着。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 2},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Giant_Footstep_Smash_Flesh",
          "400"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Holy_ChildExpansion"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_DevilWhisper",
          "700"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_12|她身侧，那个汇集了丝线的破碎纺轮缓慢而无可阻挡地转动着，绞杀着所有的舞台，绞杀着涅芙蕾亚自己。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Neph_Metal_Wheel_Spin"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_13|唔——",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock",
          "Play_A_SFX_Bizarre_GOD"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_Play_A_SFX_Memory_Confusion",
          "Play_A_SFX_Tinnitus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_14|你痛苦地捂住头。在纺轮的转动下，你的精神世界开始汹涌起来。你大口喘着气，平息着那剧烈的痛楚。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_15|在涅芙蕾亚身侧，那些维度通道的碎片已经所剩无几。你们身上的丝线、那些木偶般的纹理，愈发清晰。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_16|维度通道的力量……她已经快要彻底吸收了！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_17|淡紫色的余烬源源不断地从阿拉克涅体内涌出，如同飞蛾般扑向那张几乎已经彻底破碎的命运之网。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Silver_Silk_Magic_Multi_Cast",
          "Play_A_SFX_Black_Mist_Surges_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_18|阿拉克涅颤抖的双手以亘古不变的频率，转动着手中的纺轮。她的声音，依然如你第一次见她时那般平静。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Metal_Spinning_Wheel_Abstract_B"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2319,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_19|你已经看见了。这是命运的交点，涅芙蕾亚。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2319,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_20|一切的错误，将在这里终结。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2287},
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_21|多么自信的宣言啊，囚徒女士。那就让我看看，你要靠什么来阻止神明，来阻止命运本身吧……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {5}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_22|疯狂的笑意在涅芙蕾亚脸上绽放。束缚着她的丝线将她提起，破碎的舞台上，她是那道唯一的光。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Silver_Silk_Thread_Tighten"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Holy_ChildExpansion",
          "800"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2287,
          nil,
          "Excited"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_23|「来啊，世间匍匐的信众！向我俯首叩拜！」",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgTransition = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Neph_Boss_Vo_Attack_A"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2287,
          nil,
          "Excited"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_24|「至高者已从天座降下，不可违逆的结局，已在此间显露！」",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2287,
          nil,
          "Excited"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_131223_Content_25|「那虚伪的命运，让我们一起，迎接它的终结！」",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "redScreen",
          1,
          "redLoop",
          1
        },
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thriller_05"
        }
      })
    })
  },
