        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131214_Content_3|痛苦的嘶吼与崩毁的震荡声响彻破碎的剧院。猩红的丝线寸寸断裂，那个陪伴了涅芙蕾亚一生的纺轮坠落在她身前。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "redScreen",
          1,
          "redLoop",
          1
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131214_Content_4|她如同落水的婴儿般紧紧抓住纺轮。在她手中，晦暗的纺轮无可阻挡地崩解，化为维度的余烬，汇入阿拉克涅身侧的流沙之中。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "redScreen",
          2,
          "continueShake",
          2
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131214_Content_5|涅芙蕾亚怔怔地望着这流逝的希冀，忽然吃吃笑起来。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131214_Content_6|她的笑声越来越大，几乎没有力气直起身子。鲜血从她颤动的身体中滴落，染红了纺轮暗淡的碎片。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Carcass_blood"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2287,
          nil,
          "Bored"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_131214_Content_7|结局，结局果然是没有办法改变的……这就是命运啊……",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"redLoop", 2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2287,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_131214_Content_8|这悲惨的胜利，你早就看到了，对吧，阿拉克涅？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2319,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_131214_Content_9|刚刚，你也短暂地窥视到了这一切。既然已经知道了最后的结局，何必还要执着于此？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2287,
          nil,
          "Null"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_131214_Content_10|因为……我们的复仇，还没有结束，永远也不会结束……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131214_Content_11|你下意识往后退了一步。但涅芙蕾亚的身上没有任何危险的波动出现。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "avg_dialog_Lessen",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Zoom_Out"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Stop_Running",
          "300"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131214_Content_12|她只是摆动螯足，扯落遮掩在她身侧的幕布，露出了帷幕之后的图景。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_BIG_WhooshCloth"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_131214_Content_13|这是……！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131214_Content_14|猩红的丝线，连接着剧院中的数个舞台、连接着剧院所在的这座宏伟城市、连接着城市中无数的木偶，汇入涅芙蕾亚千疮百孔的身体。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"redLoop", 1},
        BgTransition = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2287,3,Sad);SetRole(2269,1);SetRole(2271,5);",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thriller_05"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_131214_Content_15|你……没有把丝线连在纺轮上？！",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2319,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_131214_Content_16|她已看见结局。她看见了自己的失败。在她还拥有力量的时候，她将这些命运与自己绑定在了一起，就像……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2287},
        Content = "AvgDialog_131214_Content_17|就像你第一次杀死我时那样。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {5}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131214_Content_18|涅芙蕾亚微笑着，在自己的身前拈起一根十分隐秘的丝线。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"redLoop", 2},
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_131214_Content_19|那根猩红的丝线自她的后脑延伸，经过小心翼翼的漫长跋涉，隐秘地汇入阿拉克涅的体内。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Alakelie_antiphonal_singing_0"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2287},
        Content = "AvgDialog_131214_Content_20|我们很久没有离得那样近了，姐姐。直到刚才，我才找到机会，将这道丝线还给你。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {5},
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Alakelie_antiphonal_singing_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
