        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145520_Content_66|卡斯托尔审慎地点头。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1149,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145520_Content_67|很巧呢，我也在寻找我的孪生姐妹。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1149,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145520_Content_68|我和菲茵特，是很不一样的人。姐姐虽然身体抱恙，但其实是勇敢而坚强的人。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145520_Content_69|提及孪生姐妹，原本总在飘渺神游的汀克特也像是活过来一样，露出浅淡的微笑。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1149},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145520_Content_70|那位波吕克斯呢？他是什么样的人？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2419,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145520_Content_71|<Shake:波吕克斯……>",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2419},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145520_Content_72|和我也不太一样。他聪敏，锐气，悟性强，从小到大，教主和老师总是更喜欢他的……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1149,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145520_Content_73|别担心。你也有你的优点，例如，你刚才不是说你成功摆脱教会追踪了吗？这也很厉害呢。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145520_Content_74|卡斯托尔面色一红，轻咳一声，将话题转移回汀克特身上。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2419,
          nil,
          "Shy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145520_Content_75|你和你的姐姐，又是为什么分开了呢？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1149,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145520_Content_76|在逃生的时刻，她把最后一张船票留给了我。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145520_Content_77|她的声音很轻，仿佛稍一用力，那段记忆便会被风雪吹散。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1149,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145520_Content_78|但愿最后，我们都能和他们再会。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145520_Content_79|卡斯托尔沉默了片刻，目光越过她，落向洞外翻涌不止的白色风暴。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145520_Content_80|在闲谈间，时间一分一秒过去。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
