      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Crazy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145525_Content_10|只是这山里还有女神之外的某种存在，正在图谋夺走你们的愿望。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2414},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145525_Content_11|别再吓唬大家了，卡拉布。",
