      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1149,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145518_Content_6|不，不，没有，什么都没有……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145518_Content_7|汀克特恍然回过神来，她看起来欲言又止。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {2414},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1149,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145518_Content_8|半晌，她才转向你，小声地说道。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1149,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145518_Content_9|抱歉，不知道为什么，对您，我总有一种非常熟悉的感觉。所以，能请您听我说说话吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145518_Content_10|你欣然应允。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Tingkete_calm_to_tense_130"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1149,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145518_Content_11|我知道这很难置信，不过我来自一个很远很远的地方。漂泊了太久太久，我只记得，在最后的时光里，我们称它为<Blue:荒星>。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1149,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145518_Content_12|我经历了久到无法计数的时间，才来到这里。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145518_Content_13|我相信你。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1149,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145518_Content_14|我想表达的是……荒星太过遥远，远到连想象和描述都很困难。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1149,
          nil,
          "Angry2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145518_Content_15|但我刚才，好像在湖水里……看见了我的姐姐，菲茵特。",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 1},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1143,3);FadeDarkRole(1143)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_Play_A_SFX_Memory_Confusion"
