        Content = "AvgDialog_145511_Content_18|温迪戈那张要合下来的嘴，咬在了他的右翼上，羽毛被连根扯下了一片。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
