        Content = "AvgDialog_145512_Content_12|很遗憾，<BigShake:你——被——骗——了——呐——>",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        ShakeDirection = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Hate2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145512_Content_13|棋子永远都只是棋子，在必要的时候，还会成为弃子。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145512_Content_14|当你能贡献的价值被压榨殆尽，当你心生不满……就到了你献出头颅的时候了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145512_Content_15|作为祭坛上的七枚祭品之一，你还有什么遗言想要发表吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1244,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145512_Content_16|不该……不该相信任何人的……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        RoleHide = {1145}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1244,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145512_Content_17|从最初，相信那位夫人的垂青……后来……渴望同族的复仇……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1244,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145512_Content_18|再到此刻，被某人的许诺驱使着……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Cute"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145512_Content_19|好了好了，给你发表遗言的时间只是礼貌而已，没人真的关心你那可怜的失败的人生。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1244}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Hate2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145512_Content_20|自己赢不来的东西，就去偷去骗去抢啊，光是等着别人施舍有什么用。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Hate2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145512_Content_21|这点时间来不及了，剩下的反思，就等到下辈子再继续吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145512_Content_22|卡拉布抬手轻轻抛掷，那枚眼球没入了希洛的身躯。",
        DialogType = 3,
