      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Smile2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_4|我究竟是什么人？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Smile2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_5|不是从最初，我就告诉你们了吗？我是雪山女神，仙女教母，是雪山意志的化身。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Cute"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_6|是现在要把你们喂给祂的，最最重要、最最可爱的引路人卡拉布呀。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_7|卡拉布……你骗了我们。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Penitentes"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1145,4,Smile)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_8|骗过了一路上对你照顾有加的伊芙琳，骗过了在争执中为你争取留下机会的%player%。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_9|这就是你追求的结果吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Crazy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_10|骗？骗又如何，谁没有在骗呢？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Crazy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_11|%player%，你也能听出来的，对吧？谎言的味道。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {2414}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2419,
          nil,
          "Shy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_12|<Yellow:好在我藏身顺利，摆脱了他们的追踪。>",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1145},
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SnowAltars"
        },
        BgTransition = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1149,
          nil,
          "Angry2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_13|<Yellow:<Big:不……！我不累！我不会撤退的！>>",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_IceLake"
        },
        BgTransition = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1183,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_14|<Yellow:我在这个世界的其他使命，已经暂时结束了。>",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_FireCave"
        },
        BgTransition = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Crazy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_15|汀克特明明已经撑不过去那个夜晚了，但她选择了隐瞒病情，她难道不是骗子吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Penitentes"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Crazy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_16|卡斯托尔，他从和我们相见开始，就隐瞒了他背负羽翼的事实，他难道不是骗子吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Crazy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_17|威廉明明藏着某种愿望，却不愿意告诉大家，他难道不是骗子吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Crazy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_18|所有人都在骗，所有人都是骗子，为什么偏偏指责我一个？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        RoleShake = {0},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2414},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_19|但汀克特隐瞒病情只是想多走一步，卡斯托尔的羽翼和威廉的愿望本就是他们的私事。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1145,4,Smile)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2414},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_20|他们没有说出实话，但同样没有想要伤害任何人。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Smile2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_21|你怎么还是不明白，人呢，活在这个世界上，渴求的东西，力量也好，心愿也好，就像这个苹果——",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CG_C206_013"
        },
        Sequence = "ShowItem"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Smile2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_22|每个人都想要，每个人都苦苦追寻……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_23|卡拉布随手将苹果抛远，作势去追，然后造作地噗通一下扑倒雪堆里。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Sash"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Snow_Run_Single",
          "300"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Wax_Fall_Snow",
          "2100"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_24|但是呢……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CG_C206_005"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1145},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_25|永远、永远，只有有限的人能拿到它。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1145},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_26|而我，要做它永恒的、唯一的主人。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_27|可你实现这一目的的手段，是谎言。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1145},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_28|是啊，谎言不足够吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1145},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_29|牵引你们来的，不是命运啊神王啊之类的宏大或者伟岸的东西，只是谎言，一个谎言罢了！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1145},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_30|你们把供奉献给山，山根据心情回应你们的愿望。这和人间的神明并无什么不同。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Crazy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_31|只是这一次，山要你们献出的，是<Red:「一切」>。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145535_Content_32|别想得逞……！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Brooches_Launch"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
