      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_10|山巅自中央豁然撕裂，越张越阔，化作一道竖贯天地的血盆巨口；腥红的涎液顺着层层獠牙奔涌倾泻，砸落如雨。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_L_O07_5"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Mud_Once_A",
          "600"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Mud_Roll_A",
          "800"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Mountain_Worm_Open_Mouth"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_11|巨口骤然合拢——",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Sea_Monster_Large_Mouth_Shut"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_12|众人尚未及发出第一声呼喊，已被吞入它深不见底的腹中。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_BIG_WhooshCloth"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_BlackHole",
          "400"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_13|大地停止了震颤，扑簌的积雪中，竖起一个小小的尖顶帽。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "continueShake",
          2,
          "mucus",
          1
        },
        BgID = {
          "CG_C206_004"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_14|卡拉布抖落满身积雪，满意地巡视着她的战果——",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"mucus", 2},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cloth_Snow_Patting_Mvment"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_15|为什么？为什么你还在这里？",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Penitentes"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_16|不应存在的，孤零零的，另一个人影。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2414},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_17|我也想知道，为什么我还在这里。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2414,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_18|你刚才说，来访者将愿望献给山，而山回应祈求者的愿望。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2414,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_19|可能是因为，与各位相比，我没有什么愿望，太普通，太平凡了，不够好吃吧？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_20|不，不会的。你没有想要交给山的愿望吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_21|卡拉布瞪大了眼睛，她的质问中暗含着一丝不可思议与恼怒。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2414},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_22|没有。我此行唯一的愿望，已经实现了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2414,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_23|在最后一道山崖下，我找到了他的残骸。运气太好了，他卡在岩缝里，没有被积雪掩埋。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2414,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_24|肉体已经腐朽，但铭牌还在。我还能认出他，还能确认他的存在。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Shout"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_25|怎么可能，怎么可能如此轻易就得到满足！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2414},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_26|事实就是如此。凡人的心愿，本就不应是需要借助神力来完成的东西。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2414,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_27|还有更多好消息呢。根据身上的装备推测，他们是在下山的途中遭遇了不测。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2414,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_28|所以，他在生前已经完成了登顶最高峰的心愿。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2414,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_29|尽管相隔一段时间，不过就在这里，我们都会在圆满中死去。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Cry2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_30|<Shake:不，你在欺骗自己……那不是真的，你不可能甘心就这样……>",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_31|卡拉布的声调愈发尖利，泪水从眼角沁出。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_32|伊芙琳只是用怜悯的目光望着她。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_33|雪一直下。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_34|良久，伊芙琳走上前，拍了拍卡拉布肩上的落雪。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pat_Cloth",
          "300"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2414,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_35|你再好好想想吧。我要去陪我的丈夫了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_36|说完这句话，她轻声哼着什么，一步一步朝着山崖下走去。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Snow_Walk_Single"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_37|没有固定安全绳，她不畏惧坠落。那岩底的冰缝，就是她的目的地所在。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Cry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_38|<Shake:别走，伊芙琳，别走——>",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_39|拒绝她的，并非伊芙琳。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_40|挽留她的，也并非伊芙琳之外的某人。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_41|为什么……",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "continueShake",
          1
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Snow_Moutain_Tremble_B"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_42|为什么……山在震颤？……",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_43|……",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_44|山间寄居着至为恐怖之物。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SnowWind"
        },
        BgTransition = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_45|祂绵延千里，盘踞一方。祂贪食人心，吞噬妄念。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Moutain_Worm_Voc_Laugh_Vibe"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_46|现在，祂来捕获祂的猎物了。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Mountain_Worm_Crawling"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2406},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_47|<Change>愿望……愿望……强烈的愿望……",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Moutain_Worm_Voc_Calm_A"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_48|不！我为你把他们都骗来了，你约好了不能吃我！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2406},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_49|<Change>谁会遵循……骗子……的约定……",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Moutain_Worm_Voc_Sinister_Smile_A"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_50|苹果上的蠕虫，也挑起嗓子，尖笑起来。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2407},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_51|再说了，难道不是从最开始，你就知道祭品之一，是「金苹果」吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_52|不，我是雪山女神，金苹果是我的法器，我不会是祭品！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2407},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_53|你忘记你是谁了吗？让我来提醒你吧，卡拉布，你谁也不是。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2407},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_54|你不是神、不是公主、不是仙女。\n你只是一个诞生于战场的残骸、连父母的容貌都遗忘了的流民。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2407},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_55|你早该知道了……你为自己捏造的那些身份、你靠欺骗得来的那些殊荣……有朝一日都会狠狠地、加倍地还回去。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2407},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_56|今天，就是时候了。",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Moutain_Worm_Voc_Sinister_Smile_B"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_57|山张开血盆大口。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Mud_Once_A",
          "600"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Mud_Roll_A",
          "800"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Mountain_Worm_Open_Mouth"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2406},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_58|<Change>进入……腹中……成为……我的力量吧……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_59|……",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"snow", 1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Moutain_Worm_Voc_Laugh_Vibe"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_60|缓坡骤然变得陡峭，距离冰缝仅数十米之遥的伊芙琳舍弃了一切累赘。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SnowMountaintop"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2414,2,High)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_61|她扯开氧气瓶的挂扣，褪去沉重的冰爪靴，然后毫不迟疑地割断了身上唯一的主绳。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2414,3,High)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_ClothesFriction_02",
          "600"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cut_Rope",
          "1000"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Mech_Small_Mvment_A",
          "Play_A_SFX_Air_Thin_Burst_Out"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_62|再也没有什么能拖住她了。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(2414,4,High)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_63|她只是轻盈地，几乎是欢快地，向着沉睡于冰缝的爱人扑去。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Kneel_Down_On_The_Beach"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cloth_Bring_Here",
          "450"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Zoom_In",
          "700"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          2414,
          nil,
          "High"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_64|亲爱的，我来接你了。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_65|在新一轮的震动中，伊芙琳温柔地，拥抱爱人的尸骨。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Snow_Moutain_Tremble_C"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_66|在坠落的视野中，雪山正张开庞然巨口，将那宛如樱桃奶油蛋糕的小小身影。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_L_O07_5"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1145,3,ShutEye)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Mud_Once_A",
          "250"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Mud_Roll_A",
          "600"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145534_Content_67|一口吞入群山的腹中。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {
          "continueShake",
          2
        },
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
