      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_2|那是一座巨大的、仿佛与整条山脉同岁的祭坛。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Penitentes"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Howling_Wind_Top_Crazy_Lv4"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_3|环形的石阶层层向上，尽头矗立着七座空置的基座，围成一个圆。基座与基座之间，某种古老的沟槽里，凝着早已干涸的、暗金色的光。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_4|这里就是山之蠕虫以愿望为诱饵，将无数登山者引来的终点。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_5|从来没有人能够活着从这里离开。所有的攀登者，他们都在我们的脚下，在山的腹中。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2406},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_6|少说废话。开始解读法阵。",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Moutain_Worm_Voc_Angry_A"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_7|山之蠕虫的声音从脚下传来。这一次，它的语气里不再只有戏谑，还藏着某种压抑了漫长岁月的急切。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_8|所有人的目光，都聚向了祭坛上密密麻麻的神秘文字。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1183,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_9|等等……这些纹路……",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cloth_Movement_Light_A"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_10|威廉缓缓蹲下身，指尖拂过基座之间那些繁复的、你原本只当作装饰的刻痕。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1183,
          nil,
          "Struggle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_11|不可能……怎么会……祭坛纹路旁边的、这些独特的记号……我认得。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Abstract_Finger_Touch_Silvery"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_12|这是芬戈尔的手笔。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_13|芬戈尔？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_14|你知道那个名字。威廉的搭档，在他之前从「那个世界」消失的调查员。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1183,
          nil,
          "Think"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_15|原来如此，所罗门之钥……蠕虫无法启动仪式的理由……还有芬戈尔来到这个世界的目的……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2000},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_16|哈哈哈，原来如此，有趣，有趣，真是有趣！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2000},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_17|那位劳碌命的织者让我来带你们登顶，原来是为了给我看这个乐子！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2406},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_18|什么意思？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_19|N耸了耸肩。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2000},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_20|翻译官是他，又不是我。虽然他的交易也把我放出来了，不过看我像是知恩图报的人吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Black_Mist_Surges_03"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_21|我来解释吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_22|《所罗门之钥》其实不是钥匙，而是一本魔典。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_23|而魔典中记载的最关键的内容，是所罗门七十二柱魔神的召唤方法。换句话说，是联通世界的方法。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_24|他抬起头，望向那七座基座正中央——一道几乎要与阴影融为一体的、狭窄的锁孔。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1183,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_25|这些记号，是只有他和我才读得懂的暗语。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_26|威廉一个字、一个字地辨认着地上的刻痕，那些无声的文字，逐渐在他的脑海中拼成了一个熟悉的声音。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2411},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_27|是威廉吗？我就知道你能走到这里。\n\n此地篆刻的法阵，包含三种古早的语言文字，我猜我们这圈人里只有你这个好学生能一气呵成读完。\n它们是召唤与封印咒语。你应该明白这两个单词的含义。",
        DialogType = 7,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2411},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_28|「门」的开启与关闭。",
        DialogType = 7
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2411},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_29|简而言之，这一法阵以「王冠」为媒介，链接了这个世界的原点。所以，仅限在这个世界上，它确实能实现任何愿望。\n\n你是不是好奇过你为什么会来到这个陌生的世界？\n\n现在，我可以回答你了。\n\n你就是那个愿望。",
        DialogType = 7
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2411},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_30|只可惜，我付出的力量还不够多，只能勉强为你的银芯撑开一条缝隙。\n\n我没能抵达的那个终点，需要你来替我抵达。\n\n毕竟，你是传奇调查员威廉，不是吗？",
        DialogType = 7
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2411},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_31|话不多说，希望你已经回收了我的银钥匙。\n\n用它启动法阵吧，然后许下愿望，祂会带你，前往应许之地。\n\n接下来的路，就交给你自己走了。\n\n你真诚的，芬戈尔。",
        DialogType = 7
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_32|威廉的手指停了下来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Penitentes"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Howling_Wind_Top_Crazy_Lv4"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_33|他沉默了很久很久。你从未见过他这样的神情。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1183,
          nil,
          "Null"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_34|%player%。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_35|我在。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1183,
          nil,
          "Null"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_36|你那时候不是问我，为什么是在温迪戈的呼唤下，第一个醒过来的人吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1183,
          nil,
          "Null"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_37|因为我是我们当中唯一一个见过他的尸骨的人。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1183,
          nil,
          "Null"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_38|他浑身朽烂，根本无法分辨身份。但我认得他身上那半把银钥匙。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1183,
          nil,
          "Null"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_39|编号I-1021，属于芬戈尔的数字。每当一个数字从记录中消失，我们就知道又有一位前辈被世界遗忘了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Sequence = "ShowItem(148481)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_SilverCore_PlayerGet"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1183,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_40|从那以后，我一直贴身带着这把银钥匙。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_41|他闭了闭眼。再睁开时，那双碧色的眼睛里，只剩下了一种沉静的、不容动摇的东西。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1183,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_42|……芬戈尔，谢谢你给的信任。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_43|山之蠕虫，我将为你解读法阵的启动方法。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_44|将愿望献给山之人，他们所具有的力量会化为法阵的源泉，以此连接世界的「原点」。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2406},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_45|世界的「原点」？",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Moutain_Worm_Voc_Calm_A"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_46|如果我的猜想没错的话，那即是天空中的「黑日」。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C201_010"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_White_Ocean"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1183,
          nil,
          "Think"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_47|黑日的存在与弥萨格的「黑池」极为相似，包罗万象，是过往与未来所有消亡之物悬于融蚀潮水的残骸。",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolBlackPool"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1183,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_48|实现愿望的规模，就取决于许愿者想从「黑日」中取出多少潮水。",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Corrosion"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2406},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_49|小家伙，帮我盯着这家伙的眼睛看。确认他没有说谎。",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Penitentes"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_50|卡拉布不情不愿地上前，仰视威廉的双眸。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1183,2);SetRole(1145,4,Sad)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_51|<Shake:！！>",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        RoleShake = {0},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_52|威廉合眼，温和地摇了摇头。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1183,2,ShutEye);SetRole(1145,4,Sad)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_53|他说的每个字都是实话。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2406},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_54|<Shake:少骗我！你动摇了，你这小骗子！>",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Moutain_Worm_Voc_Angry_A"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1145,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_55|我说的话是真是假，你比我更清楚。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_56|山之蠕虫发出一声冷笑，积雪随之震落。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Moutain_Worm_Voc_Sinister_Smile_B"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Snow_Moutain_Tremble_C",
          "300"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2406},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_57|哼，现在的重点是仪式。等诸事终结，我再来惩戒你这叛徒。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_58|告诉我吧，山之蠕虫，你想要实现什么规模的愿望？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1145}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2406},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_59|嘻嘻嘻，那还用说吗？那当然是越多越好，越多越好！我要让整个世界都纳入我的腹中，取之不尽，用之不竭！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Moutain_Worm_Voc_Sinister_Smile_A"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2000},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_60|真是贪心的蠢货啊，或许学会适可而止会更好哦？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2406},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_61|你这等混沌之物怎会明白，若是循规蹈矩，我根本就走不到今天。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2000},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_62|你骄傲万分说出的今天是指，趴在山上，当一只又肥又大的虫子吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2000},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_63|唉……算了，就没几个听得进N的好言相劝的家伙。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_64|我明白了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_65|威廉点了点头。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_66|要想实现最高规模的愿望，需要献上全部的祭品。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2406},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_67|<BigShake:拿去吧！>它们就是为了这一刻而存在的。",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Moutain_Worm_Voc_Sinister_Smile_B"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_68|%player%，把祭品给我。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_69|你打开手提箱。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Suitcast_Open_Mech"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_70|金苹果、八咫镜、玛阿特之羽、巴罗尔之眼、摩伊赖之线、阿里阿德涅之冠……以及那把银钥本身。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_71|七枚祭品与基座一一嵌合，古老的沟槽里，暗金色的光重新流淌、奔涌，连成了一个完整的环。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Mirror_Evil_Light_03"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2406},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_72|<Shake:哈哈哈哈！终于……终于！>",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Moutain_Worm_Voc_Angry_A"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_73|山将享受祂的盛宴，山将倾尽祂的收藏。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_L_O07_5"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Snow_Moutain_Tremble_A"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_74|山已渴盼良久。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_75|威廉握着那把独一无二的钥匙，将它探入锁孔。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_SilverKey_Insert_KeyHole"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_76|以芬戈尔之名——",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Penitentes"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1183,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_77|<Red:启动。>",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_78|咔哒。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_SilverKey_Lock_Open_Magic_Burst"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_79|一声轻响，七枚祭品同时迸发出刺目的光华。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_S_C06_4"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Sparkling"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Magic_Array_Shine"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_80|第一重光环自祭坛上方升起。然后是第二重、第三重。沉睡在七件法器中的愿望彼此呼应，如同七条流向同一片海洋的河流。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_SD_S_C06_4"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Treassure_Magic_Array_Generate_1"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_81|若山有双手，祂定会向高空中的圆环伸出渴求之手吧。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {2406},
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_82|<Shake:终于等到这一天了！>",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Moutain_Worm_Voc_Angry_B"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_145523_Content_83|然后，祂将摘下那悬于天际的圆环，紧紧、紧紧抱在怀中，直到埋入祂鼓胀的躯体，直到所有的力量被祂吞吃殆尽。",
