      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1799},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_43|咦，你也收到了和我一样的信件？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_44|什么人？！",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_YardRedMoon"
        },
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        Sequence = "SetRole(1799,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1799},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_45|抱歉，你刚才似乎太专注了。我叫了你好几声……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1800},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_46|你不记得我了吗？我是艾尔莎，我们一起上过朵尔小姐的融蚀导论。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_47|艾尔莎……我想起来了，经常找拉蒙娜借笔记的那个。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1800},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_48|抱歉，因为我总是挂科……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_49|艾尔莎低下头，沮丧地抱紧了胸前的心形抱枕。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_50|别难过，艾尔莎小姐，在朵尔小姐的课上挂科是大部分调查员的必经之路。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_51|对了，刚才你说自己收到了一样的信件，那你也能看到那个吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_52|你指了指高悬圆月之上的硕大闹钟。艾尔莎顺着你的视线向上望去，她轻轻点了点头。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_S_C01EX_14"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1800},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_53|能看到的。可我迷路了，怎么也找不到正确的方位，现在我只剩下1分钟不到了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_YardRedMoon"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_54|奇怪，我的倒计时还剩1个小时。难道是因为你先进来这个世界？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1800},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_55|我不知道。这只是个恶作剧吧，%player%%siormadam%？我还没出过外勤，对异常事件还没有经验……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_56|说实话，我也是第1次遇到这种情况。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_57|距离倒计时结束：<Red:3>秒",
        DialogType = 6,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_58|你轻轻握住艾尔莎的手。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_YardRedMoon"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1800,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_59|现在就算是虫洞也来不及把你送去法兰德公馆了，不过别害怕。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_60|距离倒计时结束：<Red:0>秒",
        DialogType = 6
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_61|不管接下来遭遇什么，我都会保护——",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_62|你的……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_63|艾尔莎的头炸成了一滩温暖的脑浆。粘稠的液体飞溅到脸上，鼻尖嗅到铁锈的腥味。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Blood"
        },
        Sequence = "FadeDarkRole(1800,1)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1800},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_64|%player%@2，救@3……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_65|脖颈断裂处不断溢出漆黑的粘液，迅速生成另一张惨白陌生的脸。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1799},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_66|<Change>救我，救救我……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        RoleHide = {1},
        Sequence = "PlayVideo(Blade_Flash1.mp4)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_68|兽刃划破空气，“艾尔莎”身体立刻断成两截，黑色的融蚀浆鲜血般涌出。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_YardRedMoon"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1125},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_69|没用的，她早就失去理智了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_70|莱克先生？！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_71|莱克收起兽爪，步伐轻快地朝你走了过来。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1125},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_72|怎么一副快哭的表情？别担心，这地方估计是某个家伙的密境。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_73|密境……？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1125},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_74|嗯。也就是说，在现实中这位艾尔莎大概率还活得好好的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_75|不愧是侦探先生，一眼就能识破密境。依据是？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1125},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_76|我和艾尔莎第一次见面的时候，也是在这样的夜晚。那时候她被一群融蚀怪追得很死，我刚从酒馆出来，给她指了条路，顺便把追上来的怪物杀了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1125},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_77|刚才我们又碰见了，一样的时间，一样的地点，我却给她指了一条错误的路，害她脑袋开花。也就是说——",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_78|也就是说？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1125},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_79|我的好运消失了！这是绝不可能发生的事，因此我合理推断这不是现实。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1125},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_80|或者你来扇我两巴掌，我们确认一下这是不是在梦里？刚才我已经扇过自己好几回了，没什么用。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_81|……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_82|我只知道不管是在密境还是现实，我都不想看着自己的脑袋开花。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1125},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_83|那你急需我的帮助！我在路上碰到不少像艾尔莎一样迟到的倒霉蛋，咱们最好走空路。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_84|莱克说着，指了指附近建筑的屋顶。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_85|很遗憾，我只是个平平无奇的守密人，没法陪你一起飞檐走壁——",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_86|下一秒，莱克将你扔在背上，腾空而起。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_S_C05_6"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1125},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_87|抓紧了，守密人%player%%sirormadam%！",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_88|<Shake:呜哇啊啊啊！！>",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_89|你吓得紧紧抓住莱克的衣领。匍匐弓背的侦探敏捷地越过大大小小的房檐，穿梭在伦蒂尼恩鳞次栉比的建筑中。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_90|一人一狼奔袭在安静的月下。耳畔只听见干净的风声，你低下身子，将自己靠向身下柔软的绒毛中。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1125},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_91|怎么样，好玩吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_92|想不到你还有这种本事……减速，申请减速！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_93|莱克哈哈大笑，胸腔不断震颤，仿佛全身上下每一个细胞都在欢呼雀跃。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1125},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_94|这才是一匹狼该干的事！我只是做回了老本行，明白吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_95|我说了，<BigShake:减速！！>",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1125},
        Content = "AvgDialog_58894_Content_96|轻点，别乱抓我的毛！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {0}
      })
    })
  },
