      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_3|匕首以一种奇特的弧度弯曲，上面刻画着和祷文同样的复杂象形符号。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_L_O07_3"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_4|在匕首旁边的石盆中，与神明同源的鲜血微微泛起涟漪，烛火映照，反射出诡异的红绿色光泽。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Carcass_blood"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_5|严重的谵妄，让伊诺斯失去了绝大部分的意识。他睁着眼，好奇地看着弥利亚姆，就像一个刚出世的婴儿，看着眼前新奇的世界。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_StoneTemple"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1719},
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_6|弥利亚姆，你现在是祭司了……你有问过王吗？王有没有告诉你，神国什么时候能在利莫里亚降临呢？",
        DialogType = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1168,3,null)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "null"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_7|我问过了，父亲……王说，很快，很快……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_8|泪水之间，出现了一抹惨淡的笑容。她来到伊诺斯身边，俯下身，抚摸他的脸。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "null"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_9|我不会让你失望的，父亲。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "null"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_10|神国就要降临了，父亲。很快，我们一家人，就会重逢……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_11|噗——",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Splash_Blood"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_12|匕首狠狠插入伊诺斯的胸膛，伊诺斯发出痛苦的嚎叫。鲜血喷溅，染红了弥利亚姆的右半脸。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_S_O06_3"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_13|弥利亚姆睁大双眼，认真地看着匕首与肉体之间的切口，就像在看着一幅旷世的画作。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_14|匕首游走，滑动，切开皮肤与骨肉。伊诺斯痛苦地哭嚎，像是一头正在被肢解的野兽。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_SD_L_O07_3"
        },
        AnimState = "CG/CG_SD/Prefab/CGDynamic_SD_L_O07_3.prefab",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Carcass_blood"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_15|嘶吼与鲜血在仪式间内奔涌，像密密麻麻的尖刺，穿透弥利亚姆的面孔与肌肤，刺入她的心脏肺腑。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_L_O07_4"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Sequence = "PlayVideo(CG_SD/Video_SD_L_O07_2.mp4)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_17|“吾主之信徒，敞开你的心怀，接纳吾主……”",
        DialogType = 6,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_L_O07_5"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_18|血与泪冲刷着弥利亚姆狰狞扭曲的面容。她念诵着祷文，手上的动作越来越快、越来越快。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Blood_Surges"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_19|匕首停下。伊诺斯的身体上，以他自己的骨肉与鲜血，描绘出那些象征着幸福与希冀的符号。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_20|“凡虔诚的，吾主将眷顾……”",
        DialogType = 6,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_21|<Big:“凡期愿的，吾主将应许……”>",
        DialogType = 6,
        RoleHide = {1},
        Sequence = "SlowCaption"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_22|她捧起神血，灌入伊诺斯身上那些符号般的伤口。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Washing_Cloth"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_23|神血接触到那些符号的那一刻，如同感知到猎物热源的蛇，变得鲜活、兴奋起来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C06_01"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AnimState = "CG/C06/Prefab/CGDynamic_C06_01.prefab",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Runes_Water"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_24|不需要弥利亚姆的指引，它们遵循着热源的指引，从那些伤口钻入伊诺斯体内。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 2},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Mucus_Peristalsis"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_25|随着神血的汇入，伊诺斯的惨叫声愈发剧烈。他身上的伤口，以肉眼可见的速度愈合着。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Joint_Samll"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_26|与此同时，他的五官开始退化，双眼变得巨大而外翻，嘴唇变得黏腻，头颅的形状也变得扁而狭长。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Physical_Deformation"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_27|一道鳃状的器官出现在他的脖颈上，鳞片取代了毛发，从他身体的各处生长出来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_TurnInto_Fish"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_28|他仍然发出痛苦的声音，从人类成年男性的嚎叫，逐渐变成带着深海潮湿污秽气息的嘶鸣……",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_Sea_Monster_Fight_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_29|我成功了，父亲……我没有让您失望，对吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_StoneTemple"
        },
        BgTransition = 5
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_30|嘶鸣声停止了。智识消失，那只半鱼半人的怪物瞪着那双巨大泛白的眼睛，茫然地打量着她。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_31|弥利亚姆走到石案旁边，抚摸着那只怪物，感知着空气中浓烈的鱼腥味，以及手上传来的黏腻触感。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Touch_Mucus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_32|这腥味与触感曾经让她觉得恶心，但现在，她觉得它们无比温暖。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_33|我很喜欢鱼，等我们在神国重逢，我每天都会吃你做的鱼……",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_34|请等着我吧，父亲。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52005_Content_35|她俯下身，亲吻它滑腻潮湿的脸。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_02",
          "Play_A_SFX_Touch_Mucus"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [52004] = {
    ID = 52004,
    CnID = "测试剧情_大型支线_弥利亚姆_上篇_关卡7",
    BaseSortID = 74,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 74,
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_1|只要信仰王，王便会回应你的信仰……",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SeasideNight"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1168,3,null)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_2|所以，告诉我，你信仰王吗？你愿意将你的一切，献予王吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1737},
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_3|我信仰王，主祭大人！我愿意将一切都献予王！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1736},
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_4|我是王最忠实的追随者！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1736},
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_5|我愿意！主祭大人，我愿意！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_6|那么现在，和我一起颂念王的名字——",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_7|她环视着广场上的每个人。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_8|狂风暴雨里，所有人都跪了下去，张开双臂，望向神殿里王座的方向。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_9|在星辉苍穹之下，深海孤岛之上，为吾主虔诚祷告：",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_10|愿您的慧眼洞察灾祸，\n愿您的智慧引领子民。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1734},
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_11|“愿您的慧眼洞察灾祸，\n愿您的智慧引领子民。！”",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_12|风暴静伏，水波不兴；\n地震平息，大地安宁。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_13|灾祸在您的宁静梦境中化为虚无。\n在您的庇护中，我们迎来神的国度。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1734},
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_14|“灾祸在您的宁静梦境中化为虚无！”",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1734},
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_15|“在您的庇护中，\n我们迎来神的国度……”",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_16|轰……",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_L_O07_12"
        },
        BgTransition = 6,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Earth_Splits"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_17|轰鸣声中，数根巨大的触手从神殿下方破土而出。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1734},
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_18|是王！王的神迹现身了！！！",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_19|信徒们张开双臂，疯狂地欢呼着。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_20|触手在风雨中微微摆动着，利莫里亚的所有人都毫不怀疑，这些利莫里亚的伟大神祇，拥有能够抵御一切灾厄的力量。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_21|吾主，图鲁——",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          1,
          "AvgHorizontal"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1734},
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_22|吾主，图鲁！！图鲁！！！",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_23|她转过身，望着神殿内部的方向，跪倒在地。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_L_O07_6"
        },
        BgTransition = 6,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Kneel_Down_On_The_Beach"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_24|在无人能看到的眼里，没有任何主祭的期冀与威严，只剩下迷茫。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_25|请聆听您信徒的呼唤。请为我们，带来神国。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1734},
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_26|请为我们，带来神国！",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_SD_L_O07_4"
        },
        AnimState = "CG/CG_SD/Prefab/CGDynamic_SD_L_O07_4.prefab"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1734},
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_27|吾主！神国！哈哈哈……神国就要降临了！",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_L_O07_7"
        },
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_28|伴随着疯狂的呼喊声，触手开始舞动。深海的静谧气息从触手上传来，传入每个利莫里亚人的感官里。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_29|轰——",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_SD_L_O07_5"
        },
        AnimState = "CG/CG_SD/Prefab/CGDynamic_SD_L_O07_5.prefab"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_30|滚滚雷声里，欢呼声平息。闪电从天空亮起，照耀着利莫里亚孤单的土地。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_L_O07_8"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_31|在这狂欢的一刻，信徒们的动作停了下来，停在对王至高的颂念与信仰里，停在对未来无限的畅想与希冀中。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_52004_Content_32|暴雨之下，利莫里亚的子民们酣然入梦。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
