      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_38|门内力量的反噬，让双子像轰然震动。神像上传来的危险气息明显变得淡薄了起来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_BigStone_FitMove01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_39|向中央靠拢的石像，停下了它的动作。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_40|那个熟悉的面孔，从阴影中走出，重新出现在你的视野里。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1796},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_41|时机已至。最后的演出，即将开始。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C08_003"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_42|他轻轻挥动指挥棒。一道轻柔的乐声传入你的精神世界。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C08_009"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_43|那些沉重的枷锁与痛苦忽然消失不见，你重新沐浴在温泉之中，脑中重新充盈着比之前更加磅礴的精神力量。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Soul_Twinkling_Small"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_44|你……你没有破坏我的精神链接……",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1796,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1796},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_45|之前暂时切断了你的链接能力。一个用来迷惑于丽埃特的手段。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1796},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_46|你的限制解除了。现在，门已开启，所有的准备，均已就绪。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_47|他站在你的面前，冷静的眼睛里，燃烧着狂热的火焰。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_48|他将指挥棒背在身后，向你躬身行礼。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1796},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_49|无目之瞳，无上意志的代行者。我将协助你，拿回属于你的权柄。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_50|你……说什么？",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1796},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_51|无上意志的降临不可避免，唯有你可以与之对抗。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1796},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_52|让双子现世，门扉开启，你才能重新获得与祂对抗的能力。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1796},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_53|事急从权，请原谅我先前的失礼。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1821,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_54|哈姆林！你……你这是在做什么？！！",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1796},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_55|做我应该做的事。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1821,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_56|他只是一块碎片！只有用我的方式，才能让真正的无上意志苏醒……",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_EmptyBlackPool"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1821,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_57|你不是想要从无上意志那里聆听到至高的乐声吗？哈姆林，你背叛了你所信奉之物！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1796,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_58|神明不一定比其碎片更伟大。这也不是我所在意的事，于丽埃特女士。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1796,
          nil,
          "Confident"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_59|我曾经也以为，无上意志的安魂曲是这宇宙中最伟大的乐声，后来我终于明白了。真正至高的艺术，将超越其本身。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_60|他抬起头，那双燃烧着凶猛火焰的双眼，静静地望向于丽埃特。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1796,
          nil,
          "Confident"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_61|它将于抗争中鸣响——人类与神明的对抗。碎片与原初的对抗。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1796,
          nil,
          "Confident"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_62|与无上意志对抗，与无上意志合奏……这将是比无上意志的安魂曲，更加崇高的乐声！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1821,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_63|你是从什么时候……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1796,
          nil,
          "Confident"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_64|阿库特之春，我们目睹了那场爆炸。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1796,
          nil,
          "Confident"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_65|那一天，我听见了它……我所追寻的，比那安魂曲更为永恒的，于抗争中鸣响的乐声。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1796,
          nil,
          "Confident"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_66|那时候，我只听到了它的前奏。今天，它将完整地响彻这个世界。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_67|哈姆林冷静的声音不可抑制地颤抖着。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1821,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_68|所以，你从那一天开始，就在计划着背叛……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1796,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_69|神明已经将祂的音乐遗忘了。祂只是一个无意识的混沌体，一场宏大的灾难。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1796,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_70|祂所有的美，都在祂的碎片身上。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1796},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_71|我忠于音乐，我从未背叛过，于丽埃特。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_72|他平静地望着于丽埃特、巨像，以及巨像身后的门。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_73|他站在你身旁。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_74|为什么……如果你从一开始就帮我，拉蒙娜就不会……",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1796},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_75|守密人%player%，无上意志的降临无法阻止。让于丽埃特召唤出门，让你顺利回收权柄，是唯一的路。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C08_010"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1796},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_76|你我所追寻之物不同，但无论是至高的乐声，还是世界的存续，机会都只有这一次。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1796},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_77|在这场演出里，你，我，拉蒙娜小姐，这里的所有人，都只是乐手。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1796,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_78|拉蒙娜小姐会理解的。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_79|你知道，哈姆林说的没错。拉蒙娜一定会理解。为了世界的存续，她从不介意牺牲自己。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_80|德克斯特已经消失，但这世上，总还是有人会介意的。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_81|——至少，她现在还活着。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_82|感受着体内越发汹涌的精神力量，你抬起头，望向那个黑白的雕塑。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_83|走吧，守密人%player%。去击碎那道石像，救出你的同伴。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1796},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60890_Content_84|去向这个世界展现你的权柄……去重新想起，关于无上意志的一切。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [60897] = {
    ID = 60897,
    CnID = "测试剧情_关卡8_13_后",
    BaseSortID = 88,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 88,
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_1|守密人……我们成功了！",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_EmptyBlackPool"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_2|拉蒙娜的脸上，绽放出笑容。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_3|守密人，我们现在可以……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_4|？！！！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_5|守密人？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_6|拉蒙娜疑惑地看着你。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleExit = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_7|在这喜悦的时刻，她看到了从未在你脸上看到过的表情——",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_8|那是一个人在面对宏伟宇宙的崩塌时……",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C07_012"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_9|所展露出的寒冷、恐惧、绝望、孱弱。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_10|她回过头，望向你正望着的方向——",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_11|在那敞开的门扉之后，无数泡沫同时破裂。时光、空间与知识，碎裂成一个个碎片，如同凌乱的油污，将这片维度染上繁复肮脏的色彩。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C08_012"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Ghost"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_12|在那些象征着万物的碎片之后，一只眼睛缓缓睁开，如同刚刚出世的婴儿，好奇地打量着这个世界。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_13|目光所到之处，无数原本存在于世的物体，尽皆化为融蚀液，汇入黑池之中。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Flowing_Mucus_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_14|那目光移动着，最后，锁定在了你的身上。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Up_Mucus_03"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1025},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_15|苏醒……@3……苏醒！……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_16|祂的瞳孔猛地放大，整个宇宙似乎都随着祂而震动了一瞬。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_17|你与祂对视。这种对视无疑是一种亵渎。世间的一切，从你的意识中消失。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_18|恐惧。最原初、最纯粹的恐惧，无从想象、无从违逆的恐惧，灌满了你的全身。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Sequence = "PlayVideo(C08/Video_C08_03.mp4)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1574},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_20|呵呵呵呵……哈哈哈哈！",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1574},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_21|我没看错你，%player%。我没看错你！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_22|N的声音从黑池的阴影处传来。眼前的画面让祂完全忘记了维持自己的优雅。祂疯狂地笑着，狂热地望向门内。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1574},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_23|祂醒了。祂醒了！哈！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1574},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_24|那么，%player%，碎片，冒牌货……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_25|祂回过头来，邪恶的嘴高高咧开，那张没有眼睛、纯黑色的脸，玩味地望向你。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1574},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60897_Content_26|告诉我……现在，你能做到什么呢？",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [64033] = {
    ID = 64033,
    CnID = "测试剧情_小型支线_本源朵尔_关卡2",
    BaseSortID = 89,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 89,
        Content = "AvgDialog_64033_Content_1|从升降机里走出来的那一刻，倒三角形的黑色空洞赫然悬吊在几步外的矿洞石壁上。裂隙突兀地撕裂了空间，四周的空气都因其存在而战栗。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Elevator"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_64033_Content_2|而身穿校服的女学生正背对着你，跪坐在裂隙前。她的右手小臂深入现实的伤口之中，仿佛正在被裂隙所吞噬。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_S_C02EX_1"
        },
        BgTransition = 5
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_64033_Content_3|艾玛·吉兰？艾玛！",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_64033_Content_4|你的声音在逼仄的矿井中回荡，然而，她没有回应你。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_64033_Content_5|心跳骤然加快，当你终于来到她身边，伸手轻轻触碰她的肩膀时，只能感到一种冰冷的绝望从指尖传来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thouch_Hand"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_64033_Content_6|……朵尔，我找到失联的调查员了，裂隙也在这里。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_64033_Content_7|她已经没有呼吸了。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_64033_Content_8|很正常，在你重新打开矿井通道前，这里的氧气含量已经降到了标准值以下。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          2,
          "AvgVertical"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_64033_Content_9|关闭裂隙，回收银钥匙，然后原路返回吧。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          2,
          "AvgVertical"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_64033_Content_10|不……不该如此。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_64033_Content_12|一种隐约的怪异盘踞在你的胸腔，但你说不上来自己究竟注意到了什么——是裂隙？是吉兰？还是……",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_L_O07_5"
        },
        BgTransition = 5
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_64033_Content_13|你在艾玛·吉兰的遗体旁蹲下，看见她仍睁着浑浊的眼。那空洞的双眼死死盯着裂隙，凝视着某个你无法看到的远方，透露出一丝未解的恐怖。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_64033_Content_14|艾玛·吉兰……",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_64033_Content_15|你伸手阖上了她的双眼。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thouch_Hand"
