  [74269] = {
    ID = 74269,
    CnID = "测试剧情_2.0关卡1_13_前",
    BaseSortID = 99,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 99,
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_1|「我」的义体的重启模式是，一旦任何一枚义体与中央大脑失去联系超过24小时，就会自动启动下一具备用义体。",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_DollLab"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_2|因此，在实验室事故后，我陷入昏迷，新的义体B-68已经启动。\n而这具损失了部分记忆的躯体，是一枚本应投入垃圾站的废弃品。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_3|换句话说，我们面前的「熔毁·朵尔」才是更完整的「我」。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1876},
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_4|你很聪明，不愧是「我」，B-67号。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1876},
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_5|已经报废的赝品带着这只逃跑的小狗一同回到这具实验室，总不会是来找我叙旧的吧？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_6|如果我说我的编号在你之前，所以这座实验室应该归我所有，你肯定不会承认。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_7|但我们之间未必不能达成和谈。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1876},
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_8|那么，你要来加入我吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_9|取决于你这段时间在做些什么了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_10|在做些什么？当然是继续你的伟业，我们的伟业，催化终结的伟业！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_11|来吧，亲爱的，与我分享喜悦吧！\n在你离开期间，我已经为整整令六个维度的卡达斯送去了终焉！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_12|你和身边的朵尔对望一眼。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_13|看来我们是做不了朋友了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1876},
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_14|遗憾，遗憾啊！连我自己都无法再理解自我的愿望！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_15|刚才仍在歌剧舞台张扬的她猝然凑近，直至与你身边的熔毁·朵尔紧贴。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1876},
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_16|想必，你已经忘记石板上的一切了吧？",
        DialogType = 2,
        Sequence = "AvgRoleScale"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_17|你们的无言正是对狂妄之人提问的作答。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Surprised1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_18|果然，果然！那便正好，就当作是一次预演，为终将揭幕的熔毁末路！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Surprised2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_19|你知道吗？我的内心燃烧着一种渴望。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Surprised2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_20|我渴望将石板传授于我的一切告知世人，我渴望让他们知晓自己所求所追逐的荒诞。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Surprised2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_21|无人知晓自己因何得到一切，也无人关注世界注定的命运。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Surprised1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_22|世界的毁灭近在咫尺，每个人的生命都可能在明天终结，他们的存在将被漆黑吞噬，而庸碌之人居然视而不见听而不闻！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Surprised1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_23|而我看见了！我看见了！",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleShake = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_24|她的神色愈发癫狂，粗壮的螯足砸在地面上，击穿木制地板的瘆人踩踏声令人毛骨悚然。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_ImpactWood"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Threat"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_25|所以，以死亡的形式，我将同等的荒诞赐予麻木的庸人，赐予他们醒觉的特权。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Threat"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_26|我授予他们足以抵抗火焰和电力的装甲，然后用尖锐锋利的螯足将他们胸膛刺穿；",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Threat"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_27|我将数以千计的地震采矿机随意赠予路人，贪婪之人争夺开采领域，共振诱发的地震竟比我亲手引爆的更多。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Threat"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_28|我将你们这些吠叫的家伙装入大脑收容筒，让你们只能枯坐着目睹噩梦的降临。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_29|这便是「我」的选择吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_30|真是孱弱啊。本以为链接本源的存在能够通晓更多智慧，没想到科学的陷阱竟将你引向了荒诞的末路。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_31|你知道生物装甲的价值吗？无论是火焰还是电力都无法击穿，穿着它足够我们迈入岩浆层探索地底的奥秘。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_32|地震采矿机……可以深入地层，并通过高速震荡挖掘和分离银芯。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_33|至于大脑收容筒……那是用来保存一些无价的大脑与其中容纳的知识和思考的，并非任性妄为随意收容渣滓的产物。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_34|将他们仅作乐趣之用，简直和那个叫N的家伙一样，无知且暴殄天物。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_35|你陷在另一种疯狂里太久了，另一个「我」。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_36|人类本就在求索中开辟通往未来的道路，你却武断地斩断了所有可能性和希望。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Threat"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_37|不存在可能性，也不存在希望！",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleShake = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Threat"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_38|所有答案都被永恒的黑色淹没，所有相似或不同的维度只会走向唯一的结局！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Threat"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_39|%player%。希望只会是让人更加痛苦的毒药。只有在彻底、迅速的毁灭中，所有人才能获得真正的解脱。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_40|闪着寒光的螯足高高举起，下一秒就要刺穿你的头颅。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Threat"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_41|既然你不愿意放弃那粗陋的希望……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1876,
          nil,
          "Threat"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74269_Content_42|那就准备迎接我赐予你们的完美高效的死亡吧！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [74374] = {
    ID = 74374,
    CnID = "测试剧情_2.0主线剧情_关卡1_7_后",
    BaseSortID = 100,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 100,
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_1|经你提醒我才意识到，这里的某些融蚀怪物，和我所在的维度中的，似乎有所不同。",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_LondonDaytime"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_2|嗯，他们是那次毁灭来临后才出现的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_3|我曾经大量采样并进行检测，起初毫无头绪，经过复杂的流程改良才得出结论。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_4|结论是？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_5|这些融蚀异变体中，含有不止来自一位生命体的银芯。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_6|通常的银芯提炼流程不会进行刻意区分，低灵性的银芯作为燃料精炼时就更是如此。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_7|你触摸那枚银芯，纷扰的梦境如冰冷的潮水淹溺了你。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Runes_Water"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_8|两只手臂的残肢，相互融合，绞缠。\n他们曾经如此相爱，因此将彼此交托给彼此。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Whisper"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_9|交托骨血，灵肉，撕扯乱发。\n忠于欲望，忠于渴求，忠于对分离的恐慌和痛苦。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_10|他们呼喊：\n拥抱我。",
        DialogType = 6,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_DevilWhisper"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_11|他们呼喊：\n杀死我。",
        DialogType = 6
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_12|他们呼喊：\n让我成为你，让你成为我。",
        DialogType = 6
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_13|让我们微末的灵性涌作万古的幽暗海潮，以禁忌而癫狂的姿态融合纠葛，并永不分离。",
        DialogType = 6
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_14|啊啊，啊啊——",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_15|你咆哮着跪伏在地，不由自主地向前探出手。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Wax_Fall_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_16|谁——",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_17|谁来——",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1154,
          nil,
          "Scared"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_18|喂，西区佬，你疯了吗？！",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleShake = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_19|%heorshe%听见了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1154,
          nil,
          "Scared"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_20|听见什么了，你们这些西区佬有一个能把话说清楚吗？",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_21|%heorshe%听见了，和那些异变体听见的一样的声音。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_22|你静下心，去捕捉它。那些银芯中的灵性太过微弱，仪器无法检测其波动。这是只有你能做到的事情。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_23|来自遥远不明之地模糊不清的手鼓声，眼前浮现不见天日的密径，污秽淤泥与雕花岩石在偏光的迷瘴中变化莫测，歪曲的投影仿若不可知的鬼魅。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"disturb", 1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_24|咚咚、咚咚。",
        DialogType = 6
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_25|手鼓声愈发急促，你低头看去，乌黑的水面已经浸透你的脚踝，催促着你踏上前往黑暗梦境旅途。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C201_01"
        },
        AnimState = "CG/C201/Prefab/CGDynamic_C201_01.prefab"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_26|你深呼吸，清空晕眩的头脑，勉强维系肢体的平衡，在黏稠的深水中轻轻抬起脚步，慢慢向前踱去……",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_27|你的口舌干涩，似被灰烬填满。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_28|他们诞生于灰烬之中，相互拥抱和融合……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_29|呼吸之间，永无止境的烟尘将你深深掩埋，你竭力睁眼，和万千生灵一道抬头望穿这无尽的尘霾。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_30|他们向往着……",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C201_02"
        },
        AnimState = "CG/C201/Prefab/CGDynamic_C201_02.prefab"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74374_Content_31|远方苍白的天空中，高悬着一轮模糊的太阳。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [74779] = {
    ID = 74779,
    CnID = "测试剧情_2.0主线剧情_关卡1_12_后",
    BaseSortID = 101,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 101,
        TalkRole = {
          1154,
          nil,
          "Scared"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74779_Content_1|喂，西区佬，我是不是眼花了？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_LondonDaytime"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_74779_Content_2|不……没有。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74779_Content_3|曾经坍塌为石堆的实验室保持着原本的形态出现在街道的转角，你反复揉了揉眼睛，确认这并非自身的幻觉。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74779_Content_4|我有一个猜想。小老鼠，你留在外面。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1154,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74779_Content_5|用得着我的时候就把我从床上拽起来，用不着我了就撵我走，哪有这种好事！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_74779_Content_6|詹金，乖。你还要好好照顾梅森姐姐呢，我们过一会儿就出来。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74779_Content_7|可没有说得那么简单。\n总之，我们小心点潜入进去吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74779_Content_8|距离你在这座实验室苏醒已过半月，但眼前的景象竟与你苏醒时别无二致。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_DollLab"
        },
        BgTransition = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74779_Content_9|能够将彻底损毁的建筑完全还原，说明搭建者有两项关键能力。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74779_Content_10|第一，能够在短时间内完成建筑的设计和建造，搭建者工程能力可见一斑。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74779_Content_11|第二，搭建者必然熟知整体实验室的结构和设计细节，曾经长居于实验室内……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74779_Content_12|如此推断，这个人应当是——",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1152,
          nil,
          "Nervous"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74779_Content_13|咦、咦，%player%，你怎么回来了，快，趁她还没发现……",
        DialogType = 1,
        PlayEnterAnim = 1,
        RoleHide = {1878}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74779_Content_14|从转角而来的温柯尔手中摆弄着算力仪器，面露惊愕之色地向你打招呼。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74779_Content_15|随后她的目光落在了你身后的阴影中。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74779_Content_16|她的瞳孔急剧收缩，神色转为惊恐，手中的仪器哐当掉落在地，金属零件四散飞溅，发出致人耳鸣的余响。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleShake = {1152, 1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_iron_Sword_Ground"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1152,
          nil,
          "Nervous"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74779_Content_17|对不起对不起对不起对不起！！朵尔，我不知道你在，我没有想……对不起对不起对不起！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74779_Content_18|还有一件必须提醒你的事情——",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 10
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74779_Content_19|这名搭建者掌握着我的实验室中为数巨大的全部毁灭性装置。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1878,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74779_Content_20|并且拥有和我对等的权限——",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_74779_Content_21|你说对吧？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74779_Content_22|走廊的尽头，缓缓步出一个一模一样的身影。\n两人隔着整个实验室对望着，仿佛望向巨大玻璃镜面里的自己的倒影。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C201_003"
        },
        BgTransition = 7,
        AnimState = "CG/C201/Static/CG_C201_003.png",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Step_Duoer"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1878},
        Content = "AvgDialog_74779_Content_23|熔毁·朵尔。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [74778] = {
    ID = 74778,
    CnID = "测试剧情_2.0主线剧情_关卡1_14_前",
    BaseSortID = 102,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 102,
        Content = "AvgDialog_74778_Content_1|雨幕之中",
        Chapter = "Chapter 1;In the Rain;Part 14",
        DialogType = 4,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_UI_AVG_Chapter_Pop"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_CG_Audio"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_74778_Content_2|三天后",
        DialogType = 6,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74778_Content_3|我检索了目前所有留存的笔记，很遗憾地告诉你两件事。\n首先，B-68所说的那块石板已经不知所踪了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_DollLab"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74778_Content_4|其次，虽然我发现了当时的我跳跃至你的维度所用的方法，但它并不能通用于你。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74778_Content_5|简单来说，义体之间的高度相似性让意识的转移得以成为可能，但在那个世界已经不存在足够契合你的躯体。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "ShutEye2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74778_Content_6|还有一种方式是通过脑缸和再造躯体，但这需要你的意识的频谱数据，相应实验报告已经遗失了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_74778_Content_7|还有办法找回吗？",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74778_Content_8|有，但同样有着不可接受的风险——我必须冒险将自己的思维与完整版本的熔毁·朵尔同调。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74778_Content_9|换句话说，我会变成那个与你为敌的本源存在。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_74778_Content_10|她也不会将实验数据交给我。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74778_Content_11|正是如此。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_74778_Content_12|你记不记得，我在最初的时候，并没有提供这条返回实验室的「捷径」给你？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1874,
