      readonly({
        ChatID = "17",
        TalkRole = {1187},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18873_Content_17|米勒博士。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        RoleHide = {
          1136,
          1154,
          1013
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Luojiesi_Theme",
          "1000"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "18",
        TalkRole = {1187},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18873_Content_18|今天就先到这里吧，以后再、再说也不迟。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "19",
        TalkRole = {1013},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18873_Content_19|……你确定么，罗杰斯先生。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "20",
        TalkRole = {1187},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18873_Content_20|我是这么认为的。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "21",
        TalkRole = {1013},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18873_Content_21|好吧，我想，一周不检查也没什么影响。\n既然如此，我就先告辞了。再见，莎拉小姐，罗杰斯先生，艾什%lordorlady%。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "22",
        Content = "AvgDialog_18873_Content_22|米勒博士朝你们鞠了一躬，和几名研究员一起离开了。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "23",
        Content = "AvgDialog_18873_Content_23|你直觉不该放走他们，但——目前的一切都只是猜测。你不知道他们究竟是否来自雕塑家协会，也不知道他们还有多少人，据点在哪。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "24",
        Content = "AvgDialog_18873_Content_24|你看向拉蒙娜，对方面色阴沉，显然和你有相似的顾虑：\n如果现在将他们扣下，会不会只是打草惊蛇？",
        DialogType = 3,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "25",
        TalkRole = {1187},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18873_Content_25|我、我也准备要离开了，莎拉小姐。下、下个月再见。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        RoleExit = {1187},
        ExitDirection = {"1187:1"},
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "26",
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18873_Content_26|那我就带先带小艾继丝和詹金去休息了。\n莎拉小姐，一会儿就在你办公室见，如何？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "27",
        TalkRole = {
          1186,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18873_Content_27|诶？可，艾继丝她——",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "28",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18873_Content_28|她看上去受到了不小惊吓，我希望能陪她一阵子，让她冷静下来。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "29",
        TalkRole = {
          1186,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18873_Content_29|那……好吧。麻烦你们了，艾什%lordorlady%。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
