        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_31|你会说的。所以我建议我们跳过不必要的试探，直接坦诚相待。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "32",
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_32|你应该是来调查济贫院附近的<Yellow:失踪案>的吧？\n我们也是，帮你一起调查不过是举手之劳。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Thinking_003_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "33",
        TalkRole = {1154},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_33|你……你是怎么知道的？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "34",
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_34|很简单。你有一双灵巧的双手，和一批配合默契的固定伙伴，能够获得稳定但是非法的收入。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "35",
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_35|拉蒙娜一边说着，一边习惯性地在院内踱步。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Slow_Short"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "36",
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_36|你们有一个完整的模式：你负责主要工作，他们负责给你打掩护，确保你能顺利逃走。作为报酬，你会给他们分一杯羹。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        RoleHide = {1154}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "37",
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_37|你在街头可以过着更舒适且自由的生活，完全没有必要到济贫院讨生活。况且，你未经许可进入济贫院，被发现后很可能会摊上大麻烦。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "38",
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_38|为什么呢？是什么东西驱使你，让你冒着被罚款甚至被收监的风险，也要留在济贫院？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "39",
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_39|这，加上附近最近频发的失踪案，共同导向一个猜想：\n你的亲人或者朋友失踪了，而你怀疑他们的失踪与济贫院有关。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "40",
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_40|女孩愣愣地望着拉蒙娜，好一会儿才反应过来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1154,2,scared);SetRole(1118,4)"
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "41",
        TalkRole = {
          1154,
          nil,
          "scared"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_41|我、我们之间可还没说够十句话，你却搞得像跟踪了我十天……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thouch_Cloth"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "42",
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_42|算上你借用奥吉尔钱包的那会儿，你一共和我们说了十六句话。\n加上对现实的观察，这些话已经足够分析、推理出你的生平了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "43",
        TalkRole = {
          1154,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_43|……你们确实很厉害。既然如此，布朗。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "44",
        TalkRole = {1196},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_44|吱！",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Bulang_Feedback_One"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "45",
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_45|被称作布朗的小老鼠吱吱叫着，衔着钱包从大树上跃下，将它抛在奥吉尔的怀中。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Sash",
          "1200"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Bulang_Feedback_Two"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "46",
        TalkRole = {1154},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_46|我会带你们去见病疯子们，也会把知道的事儿都告诉你们，作为交换——",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        RoleHide = {1118}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "47",
        TalkRole = {1154},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_47|你们要帮我打败济贫院的幽灵，救出我的姐姐，<Blue:梅森>。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "48",
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_48|你们跟着詹金，在济贫院的走廊中穿行。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Corridor"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Two_Guys_Slow"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Charity_Inside_Normal"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "49",
        TalkRole = {1154},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_49|姐姐每周四都会来济贫院收衣服，带回家浆洗。可能是那些衣服也不干净，姐姐染上了近期流行的怪病，叫什么“<Yellow:歇斯底里症>”。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "50",
        TalkRole = {1154},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_50|正好济贫院请了医生，她就顺道过来检查。\n前段时间，她说要来接受治疗，然后再也没有回家。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "51",
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_51|詹金显得很焦虑。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "52",
        TalkRole = {
          1154,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_52|不知道为什么，我最近渐渐想不起姐姐长什么样子了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Fog_001_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "53",
        TalkRole = {
          1154,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_53|有时候，看到一点姐姐留下的东西，就能短暂地回想起来，但很快又忘记了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "54",
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_54|拉蒙娜突然停步，朝你点了点头。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Stand"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "55",
        TalkRole = {1154},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_55|怎么不走了？不去看病疯子了？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "56",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_56|关于你姐姐生的病……我们可能有些眉目。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "57",
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_57|……",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 5,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Brooches_Shine",
          "800"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "58",
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_58|通过通讯递交信息披露申请报告后，拉蒙娜缓缓转向詹金，开始解释融蚀相关的信息。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Corridor"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1154,2);SetRole(1118,4,serious)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "59",
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_59|詹金，你的姐姐被一种名为融蚀特殊现象影响了。这种现象，会让人的存在渐渐被人遗忘。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "60",
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_60|肉体、身份、履历、社会关系……都会在悄无声息中消失得一干二净。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "61",
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_61|你说的那些病疯子的情况，很像是<Yellow:融蚀的早期症状>。你的姐姐更是发展到了存在开始被抹消的地步，只怕她……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        Audio = {
          "Set_Avg_Mus_As_More"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "62",
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_62|詹金，梅森她……失踪多久了？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "63",
        TalkRole = {1154},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_63|二十七天。从那之后，我每天数着日子。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "64",
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_64|见拉蒙娜面露为难之色，詹金吸了吸鼻子。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "65",
        TalkRole = {
          1154,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_65|我知道，这么长时间了，你们肯定觉得没希望了。\n但我觉得姐姐肯定还活着……街头孩子的直觉很准的。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "66",
        TalkRole = {
          1154,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_66|所以…必须得快点找到姐姐。不然就会彻底忘掉她的脸，就连面对面也认不出来了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "67",
        TalkRole = {
          1123,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_67|别难过，我们会帮你找到姐姐的，只要能见她一面，你不就想起来了吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "68",
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_68|拉蒙娜没有接话。\n你在她略显忧郁的注视下，回忆起朵尔在课堂上讲述的内容。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "69",
        Content = "AvgDialog_18891_Content_69|<Yellow:“存在消除是融蚀的末期症状，而融蚀的历程是不可逆转的。”>",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1118, 1154},
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1120,3)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
