      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1154},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_11|你还记得我们遇见那天的事情吗？",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1136,
          nil,
          "shy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_12|嗯，我永远也不会忘记的。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_13|10日前，伦蒂尼恩东区\n莉莉安济贫院",
        DialogType = 6,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_14|夜半时分，东区一片晦暗。不论是街灯还是月光，都被弥漫的浓雾吞吃殆尽，只留几个模糊的虚影在空中晃动。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_LondonFog"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Something_Flash",
          "1500"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Aijisi_Sad_3_80BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_White_Ocean"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_15|白色少女怀抱着罪恶与恐惧，在昏暗空旷的济贫院前院中奔跑。\n直至撞上阴影中潜藏的陌生之物，才疼痛得惊呼出声。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CourtYard"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Stop_Running"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Be_Hit_Normal",
          "1500"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1154},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_16|哎哟！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        RoleShake = {0},
        Sequence = "SetRole(？？,4,Nervous)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Stop_Running"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1010,
          nil,
          "Nervous"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_17|疼！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        RoleShake = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1010,
          nil,
          "Nervous"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_18|你、你不是小麦克，也不是小露西！你到底是谁……！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1154,
          nil,
          "angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_19|我还要问你是什么人呢！大半夜的不睡觉在外面晃荡，吓了我一跳。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1010,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_20|对、对不起，我以为遇上了……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1154},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_21|遇上什么？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1010,
          nil,
          "Nervous"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_22|遇上了…幽灵……没错，我还以为遇上了<Red:济贫院幽灵>……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1154},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_23|幽灵？什么乱七八糟的。我老实和你说了吧，我确实不是这破地方的人。\n我叫詹金，这是布朗。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1196},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_24|吱！",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Bulang_Feedback_One"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1154},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_25|我进来是为了找我姐姐的。她叫<Blue:梅森>，两个星期前在这附近失踪了。\n你们这儿最近有多出个叫梅森的人吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1010,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_26|济贫院最近有很多新人，我还没认全大家的脸……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1154},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_27|你好好想想，她有这么高，长长的头发，<Yellow:绑着漂亮的红色缎带>，缎带末尾连着一个方扣，上面雕刻了字母M。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1154},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_28|她偶尔会来这边看病，上次来了之后就没回家，不知道是不是被你们扣下做工了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1010,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_29|<Shake:病、病人？>\n抱、抱歉…我也没见过年轻的女病人……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1154},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_30|啧，不管了，我也没觉得能幸运到直接撞上知情人。\n不过你差点害我被发现了，这责任得你来负。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1010,
          nil,
          "Nervous"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_31|那、那我带你去我的秘密基地吧！院长小姐从来不进钟楼，藏在那里她一定发现不了你。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        RoleShake = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Sash"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1154,
          nil,
          "happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_32|说实话，那天撞到的人是艾继丝你，真是太幸运了。\n不然我肯定得被揪着兜帽丢出去。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_ClockTower"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1136,4,Nervous)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Recover_Remember"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Aijisi_Sad_Theme_001"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1136,
          nil,
          "Nervous"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_33|你别这么说，济贫院里的大家都是很好很好的人。只是最近发生了太多坏事，所以大家的情绪有些糟糕……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1154},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_34|艾继丝。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1136,
          nil,
          "Nervous"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_35|嗯？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1154},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_36|我知道济贫院的大家对你来说很重要…但我一直是把你当朋友的，所以，你有没有把我当朋友？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1136,
          nil,
          "happy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_37|当然了！我非常、非常喜欢和詹金你待在一起，像这样吃着糖聊着天。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1154},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_38|既然你把我当朋友，那为什么不肯跟我说出真相呢？\n艾继丝，不要对我撒谎了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1136,4,Nervous)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1136},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_39|我、我不明白你在说什么……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1154,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_40|我在臭女人的办公室翻到了<Blue:账本>，还有%player%在找的人的<Blue:学生证>。我知道她在把你们卖给那伙怪医生做实验！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1154,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_41|那女人最喜欢你了，甚至信任你去照顾那些病人。艾继丝，你一定知道什么的，告诉我好吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1136,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_42|我、我、<Small:我不知道……>",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_43|女孩嗫嚅着，声音逐渐减小。\n她面色苍白，看上去像是经受着莫大的痛苦。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1396},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_44|弥萨格大学最擅长挖掘秘密，他们很快就会知道真相。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {0},
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember",
          "Play_A_SFX_Whisper"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1396},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_45|你没有办法永远带着枷锁生活。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1136,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_46|詹金，如果失去的一切已经无法再挽回…所谓的真相，真的还那么重要吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_ClockTower"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1154,2)",
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Clock_Tower"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1154,
          nil,
          "angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_47|当然重要！对我来说，没有什么比找到姐姐更重要。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1154,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_48|我知道你害怕那个臭女人，但你为什么一直在袒护她？她不仅把工人卖给了医生 ，还窝藏着<Yellow:济贫院幽灵>。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1136,
          nil,
          "Nervous"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_49|济、济贫院幽灵？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        RoleShake = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thouch_Cloth"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1154},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_50|是啊，就是你跟我说的的那个传说。\n<Yellow:起雾的晚上不能到处乱走，会被拿着刀徘徊的幽灵抓走>。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1136,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_51|那、那只是我编出来的……夜里太危险了，我不想让你到处跑。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1154,
          nil,
          "angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_52|别替莎拉开脱了！我已经找到<Yellow:藏着幽灵的地下室>了，还听到了<Yellow:刀的声音>。\n我的姐姐是不是就在里面？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_53|随着地下室这个词语从詹金口中蹦出，艾继丝的脸上最后一丝血色也消退殆尽。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1396},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_54|别害怕，艾继丝。内心的孔洞会让祂趁虚而入。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {0},
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Whisper"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1396},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_55|跟随银的引导，光辉会为你指路。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1136,
          nil,
          "Nervous"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_56|詹金，对不起，我不能……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_ClockTower"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1154,2)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_18908_Content_57|艾继丝眼中含泪地看了一眼詹金，转身爬回钟楼冲下楼梯，动作没有一丝犹豫。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleExit = {1136},
