      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "6",
        TalkRole = {1025},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18913_Content_5|<Italic:老查理有一只他很爱很爱的虎斑猫……>",
        DialogType = 6
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "7",
        Content = "AvgDialog_18913_Content_6|疼痛感从体表传来，最初像是蚂蚁的噬咬，然后渐渐剧烈，像是无数根针同时刺入你的每一寸皮肤——",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "9",
        Content = "AvgDialog_18913_Content_7|链接剧烈地绷断了。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgTransition = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Brooches_NO"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "10",
        Content = "AvgDialog_18913_Content_8|你忍受着剧痛，左手扶着银钥匙，颤抖着再次将右手搭上艾继丝的胳膊。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_ClockTower"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thouch_Cloth"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "12",
        TalkRole = {
          1136,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18913_Content_9|来不及的……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "13",
        TalkRole = {
          1123,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18913_Content_10|不会的，不会的，艾继丝，你相信我们，弥萨格大学遇到过比这还要危险得多的情况……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "14",
        TalkRole = {
          1136,
          nil,
          "Nervous"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18913_Content_11|真的吗？奥吉尔……你看他们的身体。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "15",
        Content = "AvgDialog_18913_Content_12|奥吉尔扭头看向仍在坚持的守密人和拉蒙娜。\n他们的体表，正在渗出异色的汗水——那不是汗水，是细密的糖浆。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Set_Avg_Mus_As_More_And_More"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "16",
        TalkRole = {
          1136,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18913_Content_13|安德森先生的声音消失后，我眼睛里的颜色、我的身体都在逐渐失控。即使我不用眼睛去注视，身边的人也会渐渐变成不能动的石头。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "17",
        TalkRole = {
          1136,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18913_Content_14|我还能坚持多久？一年、一个月、一天、一小时？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "18",
        TalkRole = {
          1136,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18913_Content_15|难道我要永远躲在大家身后，等到残存的一切都无法挽回的时候，再采取行动吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "19",
        TalkRole = {
          1136,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18913_Content_16|这一次，我想要像提尤格、像詹金、像你一样勇敢。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "20",
        TalkRole = {
          1136,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18913_Content_17|奥吉尔，你不是骑士吗？那你应该明白的。\n即使我留下来，也注定是被骑士审判的罪人。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "21",
        Content = "AvgDialog_18913_Content_18|奥吉尔怔住了。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "22",
        TalkRole = {1136},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18913_Content_19|奥吉尔，你说过……能否得到救赎，取决于我自己。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "23",
        TalkRole = {
          1136,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18913_Content_20|现在…能请你看着我吗，看着我的灵魂……是否能被救赎。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "24",
        Content = "AvgDialog_18913_Content_21|奥吉尔注视着艾继丝那唯一的一只正常的瞳孔，犹豫片刻后，郑重地松开了手。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thouch_Cloth"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Set_Avg_Mus_Coda"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "25",
        Content = "AvgDialog_18913_Content_22|随着他的动作，艾继丝脱离了你的链接控制。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
