        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "2",
        TalkRole = {1070},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18897_Content_2|其实，每个人长大以后都会发现，世界就是这个样子，无论你如何努力、挣扎、反抗，都无法从包围你的环境之中脱身。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "3",
        TalkRole = {1070},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18897_Content_3|你还只是个孩子，不过我不介意提前告诉你这个道理。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "4",
        TalkRole = {
          1136,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18897_Content_4|不，不是这样的……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "5",
        TalkRole = {1136},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18897_Content_5|因为我……已经不是一个人了……\n我会……相信他们！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "6",
        TalkRole = {1136},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18897_Content_6|%player%%brotherorsister1%、拉蒙娜姐姐、奥吉尔……\n他们和济贫院里的人不一样，他们很强大，一定可以消灭……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "7",
        Content = "AvgDialog_18897_Content_7|声音急不可耐地以冷笑打断了她的话语。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "8",
        TalkRole = {1070},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18897_Content_8|消灭我……？他们连我在那里都找不到吧？\n毕竟，连你都不知道我的所在。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "9",
        TalkRole = {
          1136,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18897_Content_9|不，不是这样的……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "10",
        TalkRole = {
          1136,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18897_Content_10|我相信他们，一定可以消灭……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "11",
        TalkRole = {1136},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18897_Content_11|<Red:我>。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "12",
        TalkRole = {
          1136,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18897_Content_12|我都听到了，你们很难很难找到一个合适被做实验的孩子。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "13",
        TalkRole = {
          1136,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18897_Content_13|你做的坏事已经被揭穿了。接下来，只要我不在了，他们一定都可以安安全全的，对吧？",
