          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "70",
        TalkRole = {
          1129,
          nil,
          "Null"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18944_Content_66|打破这三条规则的后果，可比打翻你老祖母的胭脂盒还要严重一百倍，不，是一千倍。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "71",
        TalkRole = {1154},
        Content = "AvgDialog_18944_Content_67|嘁，装神弄鬼。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "72",
        TalkRole = {
          1129,
          nil,
          "smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_18944_Content_68|顺便一提，本馆可是没有导览服务的哦。\n如果甜心们发生了什么意外的话……",
