        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Up_Mucus_03"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Strange_Shock_001_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19019_Content_21|数十只死去的禽类倒在地上，喉管朝向天际的姿态昭显出垂死的痛苦。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19019_Content_22|我想，作为灾厄的地狱犬，应该不会把几只鸡当作目标吧？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        ScreenEffect = {"snow", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_TownsST_Day"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1124,
          nil,
          "angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19019_Content_23|地狱犬？路边的野狗都比它文明一些。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1004},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19019_Content_24|又来了，又来了……父神在上，我的小丽莎…你千万不要有事……",
