      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19016_Content_82|……",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Avalanche"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19016_Content_83|雪崩是在一瞬间发生的。\n在所有人反应过来之前，天摇地动，世界陷入令人恐惧的绝对纯白。",
        DialogType = 7,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Boom"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19016_Content_84|不知过了多久，全身上下的冰冷和疼痛将你唤醒。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Small_Snowstorm"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
