        TalkRole = {
          1120,
          nil,
          "Thinking"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19079_Content_5|一切生命形态都无法逃脱融蚀，你所钻研之物只会留下满地狼藉。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "6",
        Content = "AvgDialog_19079_Content_6|朵尔不满地扫了一眼那些被称为“狼藉”的扭曲生体。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "7",
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19079_Content_7|你的审美还是那么不堪入目，我不记得弥萨格给你带来过这样的熏陶。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "8",
        TalkRole = {1180},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19079_Content_8|看来我离开后，阿利斯泰尔做主把我留下的伟大研究都抹除了。说起来——他的身体还健康吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "9",
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19079_Content_9|你还惦记着他？他恐怕会因此感到羞愧。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "10",
        TalkRole = {1180},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19079_Content_10|别这么说，我在弥萨格“毕业生”里，难道不算学有所成的吗？\n毕竟没几个人能从这所学校活着毕业。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "11",
        TalkRole = {1180},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19079_Content_11|我还不时为他祈祷祝福，希望他能早日像常人一样站起来呢。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "12",
        TalkRole = {
          1120,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19079_Content_12|借你吉言，至少阿利斯泰尔比你的另一位老师活得久些。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "13",
        TalkRole = {1180},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19079_Content_13|阿利斯泰尔老师吉人天相，肯定能见证世界的终结。\n很可惜，你应该看不到那一天了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "14",
        TalkRole = {1180},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19079_Content_14|在这些家伙的包围下，你又能支撑多久呢？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        Audio = {
          "Set_Avg_Mus_As_More"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "15",
        TalkRole = {
          1120,
          nil,
          "smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19079_Content_15|不试试怎么知道？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "16",
        TalkRole = {1180},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19079_Content_16|你不会真觉得，凭你一个，就能解决这么多实验体吧？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SanatoriumAisleInvaded"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "17",
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19079_Content_17|不要把我想得和你一样愚蠢，赫伯特。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "18",
        TalkRole = {1180},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19079_Content_18|你的发声器官还是如此惹人生厌，朵尔。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "19",
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19079_Content_19|它至少比你那原始人的头脑更有价值。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "20",
        TalkRole = {1180},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19079_Content_20|只怕你的同僚们都未必认同你的结论。\n要是有个按钮能把你的嘴封上，他们大概毫不犹豫就会按下。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "21",
        TalkRole = {
          1120,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19079_Content_21|那你可就低估了弥萨格的包容心和我的个人价值了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "22",
        TalkRole = {1180},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19079_Content_22|是小人见识浅薄了，再有力的大脑，面对把你团团包围的怪物，也是束手无策吧？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
