  [19075] = {
    ID = 19075,
    CnID = "主线剧情_关卡4_11_前",
    BaseSortID = 31,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 31,
        ChatID = "1",
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_1|房间",
        Chapter = "Chapter 4;the Room;Part 11",
        DialogType = 4,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_UI_AVG_Chapter_Pop"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_2|就是这个房间，莉莉和弗朗西斯……应该就在里面。",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SanatoriumAisleInvaded"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Two_Guys_Slow"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Mist"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_3|我们已经离开维度通道了，你现在感觉如何，还会有头晕或者想吐的感觉吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_4|好多了，就算再有突然的不适，我也会尽力抵抗的。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "2",
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_5|深呼吸一口气，你推开滴落着浓稠黏液的门扉，抵达了最终之所。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "3",
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_6|映入眼帘的，是永恒不坠的夕阳，和散发着温馨感的女孩子的房间。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SanatoriumOperatingRoom"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Open_Old_Door",
          "Play_A_SFX_Flowing_Mucus_03"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Lily_Room_Express_Chp4_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Mist"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "4",
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_7|床头的洋娃娃，衣架上的粉色裙子，带有花边的床幔……\n全都与阴冷的疗养院格格不入。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "5",
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_8|中央的手术床上躺着你们熟知的小小身影，胸口被开了一个大洞，安静得仿佛已经死去。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_9|莉莉！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "6",
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_10|弗朗西斯背着手站在窗前，眺望着远方。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1198,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "7",
        TalkRole = {1198},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_11|你们辜负了莉莉的好意。\n在赫伯特介入之前，我们本可以就此分道扬镳的。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "8",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_12|我们不会对你的暴行坐视不理。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1198},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_13|暴行…你们就是如此看待我的吗？\n一个怪胎，一个疯子，一个罪犯？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "9",
        TalkRole = {1198},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_14|我和赫伯特不一样，我从未主动伤害过任何人。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "10",
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_15|在你的视角里或许如此，但那些异化了的人类……或许还有愿意接纳他们、关心他们的人在。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "11",
        TalkRole = {1198},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_16|我知道你们都是善良且正义的人，但你们还太年轻了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1198},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_17|我曾接诊过刑满释放的重案犯，他们身边的人在知晓他的案底后，无不避而远之……即便他已经真诚悔过。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "12",
        TalkRole = {1198},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_18|人是由经历塑造的生物。\n在某些经历过后，他们就不是人了，也不应当享有人类的待遇。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1198},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_19|这不是我的一家之言，发生改变的，是世界对他们的认知。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "13",
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_20|就算你不将融蚀受害者视为人类，可那些将他们送来疗养院的亲朋呢？",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "14",
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_21|他们无一不受到了地狱犬的吞噬，是你动的手脚吧。\n他们可是百分之百，绝对纯粹的人类啊。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "15",
        TalkRole = {1198},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_22|那些人仅仅因为对方生病，或者年老体衰，就把自己的亲人抛弃在这个荒僻的疗养院里，他们不该受到惩罚吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "16",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_23|这也罪不至死，你没有资格审判他们。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "17",
        TalkRole = {1198},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_24|我没有资格审判他们……\n那你们就有资格审判我吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "18",
        TalkRole = {1198},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_25|你知道这里是哪里吗？这里是我女儿的房间。\n这里的时间，永远停留在她消失那天的黄昏。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "19",
        TalkRole = {1198},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_26|我用尽了一切办法想留下她，就算将灵魂卖给魔鬼也在所不惜。\n可是…连魔鬼都没有出现，她还是离我而去了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "20",
        TalkRole = {1198},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_27|我把女儿的名字给了<Blue:莉莉>，但她终究不是我的女儿。\n她只是一个和我的女儿年龄相仿的怪物。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "21",
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_28|手术台上，莉莉胸口的大洞正在缓缓愈合，空茫的眼睛也逐渐恢复色彩。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1198},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1130,3,Crazy)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Up_Mucus_03"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "22",
        TalkRole = {1197},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_29|她是完美的实验体，无论制造出多少伤口都会不断愈合，手术也不会因为疼痛反应而被迫中止。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "23",
        TalkRole = {
          1197,
          nil,
          "cry2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_30|可是我想要的只是我的女儿！一个会哭、会笑、会因为疼而找我撒娇的普通女孩！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx"
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "24",
        TalkRole = {1197},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_31|那些家伙……那些连还守在身边的亲人都能抛弃的家伙……早就已经失去人性了！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "25",
        TalkRole = {
          1197,
          nil,
          "smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_32|失去人性的人，还能被称为人类吗？\n已经是怪物的家伙们就这么成为地狱犬的饵食，难道不应该吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "26",
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "threat"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_33|不可理喻。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "27",
        TalkRole = {
          1124,
          nil,
          "Scorn"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_34|难得我们意见一致。",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Set_Avg_Mus_As_More"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "28",
        Content = "AvgDialog_19075_Content_35|弗朗西斯上前，轻柔地爱抚着莉莉白皙稚嫩的脸颊，那种柔情与她放出的狠戾话语形成了鲜明的对比。",
