      readonly({
        ChatID = "39",
        Content = "AvgDialog_19144_Content_39|你怎么也在这？",
        DialogType = 5
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "40",
        Content = "AvgDialog_19144_Content_40|少年唤醒体颇为意外地抬了抬眉，用审视的目光来回打量了你几番。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "41",
        TalkRole = {
          1159,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19144_Content_41|还有开玩笑的余力，看来你并无大碍。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "42",
        Content = "AvgDialog_19144_Content_42|和萝坦、奥吉尔等人一样，图鲁是受<Yellow:弥萨格>监管的诸多唤醒体之一。\n但在弥萨格受训的一年中，你见到图鲁的次数单手就能数清。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "43",
        Content = "AvgDialog_19144_Content_43|据说大部分时间，图鲁都处于沉睡当中，醒来的次数屈指可数。因此，图鲁自然而然被排除在了外勤唤醒体名单外。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "44",
        Content = "AvgDialog_19144_Content_44|但此时，你们被无形的<Yellow:链接>紧紧捆绑，你能感觉到图鲁如风暴般磅礴的精神能量。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "45",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19144_Content_45|我……和你之间有链接？！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "46",
        TalkRole = {
          1159,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19144_Content_46|愚问。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "47",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19144_Content_47|等等，你知道拉蒙娜在哪里吗？我们是一起离开学校的。",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "48",
        TalkRole = {
          1159,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19144_Content_48|现在不是你开玩笑的时候，剩下的时间已经不多了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "49",
        TalkRole = {1159},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19144_Content_49|<Yellow:降神仪式>还没有结束，群星正在向应去之处升起。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "50",
        Content = "AvgDialog_19144_Content_50|「降神仪式」？",
        DialogType = 5
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "51",
        Content = "AvgDialog_19144_Content_51|问题甫一出口，你与图鲁间的气氛陡然凝滞，空气沉重到让人开始怀疑自己是否有资格向他提问。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "52",
        Content = "AvgDialog_19144_Content_52|但，<Yellow:「降神」>对于弥萨格守密人来说，实在是太过敏感而重要的关键词。",
