          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19107_Content_2|别松懈，我们快要靠近北门出口了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19107_Content_3|经过一路的战斗，还挡在你们面前的敌人已经所剩无几。\n前方等待你们击退的，只剩杂鱼三两只。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19107_Content_4|这些敌人……会和我们所调查的东西有关吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19107_Content_5|不能否认这个可能性。根据朵尔放在赫伯特那的间谍设备传来的情报，包括雕塑家协会在内，提灯教会有相当多的关联组织。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19107_Content_6|不过，我们在拉伊小镇遇到的提灯教会成员，可比它们优雅多了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19107_Content_7|围攻你们的是真正的“杂鱼”——佝偻着类人的身体，破旧兜帽下露出鱼类的头颅。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19107_Content_8|每每它们攻上来，你都能闻到生命衰败的腐臭。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_Sea_Monster_FightVo_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19107_Content_9|也不能排除雕塑家协会的嫌疑，赫伯特是个以永生之名玩弄生命的混球。",
        DialogType = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1118,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19107_Content_10|我同意你对赫伯特的看法，不过别忘了，融蚀也能引发这样的群体变异。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19107_Content_11|希望这次不会是<Yellow:灾厄>带来的影响……",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
