      readonly({
        ChatID = "25",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19084_Content_24|威廉前辈！你知道这艘船吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "26",
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19084_Content_25|洪积288年，索纳尼尔号在一场风暴中沉没，数年后，北海沿岸开始陆续出现<Blue:“幽灵船”>目击记录。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          1,
          "AvgVertical"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "27",
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19084_Content_26|曾有弥萨格调查员登上过索纳尼尔号，但没有带回任何可用情报。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          1,
          "AvgVertical"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "28",
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19084_Content_27|没有带回可用情报……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "29",
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19084_Content_28|但这意味着，那位调查员平安返校了，对吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "30",
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19084_Content_29|是的，尽管丧失了部分记忆，但登船没有对他的身体带来其他异常。\n短暂修养后，他就再次回到了调查的最前线。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          1,
          "AvgVertical"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "31",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19084_Content_30|能让那位前辈接入通讯吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "32",
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19084_Content_31|很可惜，早在你加入弥萨格之前，他在一次任务中牺牲了。",
