          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19094_Content_33|您的身体……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1201,4);"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1201},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19094_Content_34|我没事，老毛病了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1201},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19094_Content_35|说起来怎么只有你一个人？我可明明看见了两个学生——\n希莱斯特，你能感觉到另一个学生在哪吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19094_Content_36|被叫到名字的少女视线停留在自己指间，没有立刻回应船长的话。\n过了好一会儿，希莱斯特才抬头看向拉蒙娜。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1170},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19094_Content_37|……没有了。\n除了埃尔顿、墨菲和……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1170,
          nil,
          "Avoid"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19094_Content_38|和你……以外，没有其他人了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Scared"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19094_Content_39|怎么可能？！我们分开才不过半个小时。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        RoleShake = {1118},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Fog_001_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Steam_PowerRoom",
          "800"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19094_Content_40|而且我能感受到和守密人之间的联系，%heorshe%一定还在船上。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1201},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19094_Content_41|别急，女学生。船到桥头自然直。\n如果你那位同学和你一样优秀的话，%heorshe%会没事的。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1118,2,serious)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1159},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19094_Content_42|别忘了鞋印。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19094_Content_43|鞋印……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19094_Content_44|对了！守密人可能在和一个孩子一起行动。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1201},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19094_Content_45|孩子？我知道了……\n那是<Blue:墨菲>，这艘船唯一的乘客。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        AudioManageEvent = {
