      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19135_Content_5|别吵！打扰到我思考了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        RoleShake = {1199},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Ops"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19135_Content_6|对于“打扰到墨菲思考”这件事，你不置可否。\n但你知道，一定要阻止她继续“思考”下去。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "CH1",
        NextChatID = {"A1", "A2"},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19135_Content_7|因为你们已经在船舱中来来回回，上上下下很久了。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "A1",
        Content = "AvgDialog_19135_Content_8|你是不是迷路了？",
        DialogType = 5
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "A1_TO",
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19135_Content_9|没有！我不可能迷路！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {1199},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19135_Content_10|我在这船上生活了好几个月，哪里有通风管哪里有老鼠洞，我知道得一清二楚。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19135_Content_11|可我们甚至没有在爬通风管，只是在船舱来回打转而已。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        NextChatID = {"CH1_END"},
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "shy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19135_Content_12|我……我只是很少一个人下来而已，平常我都和船长他们待在一块儿。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "A2",
        Content = "AvgDialog_19135_Content_13|墙上有平面图。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "A2_TO",
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19135_Content_14|你什么意思？是不相信我的记忆力吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {1199}
      }),
      readonly({
        NextChatID = {"CH1_END"},
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19135_Content_15|我说能找到就是能找到，船长他们一定在这边！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "CH1_END",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19135_Content_16|可是，这是我们第五次路过这个楼梯口了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Speechless.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19135_Content_17|我的搭档在等着和我们会合，她现在一定很着急。\n求你了，墨菲大人，看看平面图吧。",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_OMG"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "shy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19135_Content_18|……哼！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {1199},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
