        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_79|是的，圣女。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "Avoid"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_80|……她不是我妈妈，从来都不是。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        RoleHide = {1168, 1111},
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SnowCage"
        },
        BgTransition = 5,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1166,2)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Recover_Remember"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_The_Fire_Snow"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "serious2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_81|只有提灯教会上面的家伙知道我的来历，我也没有妈妈，我只是他们送给弥利亚姆的礼物。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1166},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_82|哦？她居然连这事都告诉你了？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "serious2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_83|对一个死期已经定下的囚犯来说，知道多少秘密都无所谓了，反正所有东西都会被我带进坟墓里。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1166,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_84|这也是那女人对你的补偿吧。要知道，把神明移植于你的那天，我们的主祭大人可伤心得彻夜未眠。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_85|伤心？开什么玩笑，她不会有这种情感。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1166},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_86|真绝情啊，小公主。\n女孩子太冷酷，可是会惹妈妈伤心的哦。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_87|你烦不烦！都说了她不是我妈妈了！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        RoleShake = {1199},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_ClothesFriction_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1166},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_88|这可不一定，你想听故事吗。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_89|<BigShake:不想听，我也不想见到你！>\n如果是特意来讥讽我的，你可以离开了！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        RoleShake = {1199},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_ClothesFriction_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1166,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_90|不，你想听。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_91|戈利亚的语气陡然深沉，带着久经战场的威仪，墨菲体内的两颗心脏都险些因此停跳。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1199,4,Scared)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_92|她突然意识到——巨人从来就不是她可以随意把弄的玩具。\n自己只是仗着身份得寸进尺，而对方也乐于看笑话罢了。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "Scared"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_93|是……是的，请说吧。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1166,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_94|有一个神秘教会，为了血统的绝对纯净，一切婚嫁都由教首指定。那些和外面的人成婚生子的家伙，最后都会遭到清算。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1166,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_95|在上一次清算中，执行者带回了一名婴儿——能够看见精神存在的女婴。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "Avoid"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_96|女婴……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1166,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_97|她在母亲身体下的暗格待了太久，被教徒找到时，她险些被亲生母亲的血呛死。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1166,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_98|那个碌碌无为的普通女人，这辈子最大的成就，就是生下了一个素质优秀的女儿，并试图不让她被教会带走。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1166},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_99|——多么美妙的母女情谊啊，我都快要为之落泪了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "Serious2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_100|戈利亚…你……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "Serious2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_101|为什么……为什么要告诉我这些？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1166,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_102|郁郁寡欢可不是什么好事，要知道，你的状态可决定了「神」的生长。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1166,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_103|下一个星辰正位之时在二十五年后。我估计，弥利亚姆这两天就要来让你沉睡了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1166,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_104|做点什么你喜欢的事吧，搞破坏，对蹈海者抽鞭子，折腾你的女仆……随便什么都行。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_105|戈利亚单方面中止了这场对话，毫无温情可言地拍了拍她的发顶。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Sash"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23856_Content_106|离开时，他看了一眼被墨菲扔到墙角的木雕。少女的手艺非常差，那木质底座上端坐着的形状肥大而诡异，让人只看一眼就心生厌烦。",
