        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_6|抱歉……只是，这一切都太让人匪夷所思了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_7|墨菲，能让我看看那个……“神明”吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_8|你还说你没有不相信！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_9|我、我只是……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1159},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_10|还有多久？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1199,4,surprised)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_11|什么还有多久？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1159},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_12|神明。距离祂诞生，还有多久？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "serious2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_13|……我不知道。不如你自己确认吧，反正从你对弥利亚姆和戈利亚的态度来看，你也早就牵扯其中了吧。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_14|墨菲没多忸怩，干脆地动手解起了衣服。\n随着前襟最后一颗纽扣的解开，你们看见了少女体内的「神」。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C00M_02WhiteOut"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something",
          "1500"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Mofei_ShowEgg_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_15|她前襟下的躯体赫然是透明的，透明肌理拉扯着周遭的皮肤与肌肉，让整块胸腹腔都呈现着灰败衰退的白色。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C05_002"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_GODBABY"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_16|透明异象让胸腔中的器官一览无余，你看见了一颗薄红色的年轻心脏，以及一颗乳色的「卵」。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_17|数不尽的细丝从「卵」中伸出，紧密地与墨菲的血管缠绕着，相互依存。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_18|若非其存在已经挤压到了墨菲的心脏，祂看起来甚至与透明胸腔浑然一体，不似外物。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_19|祂混沌而安静，刻印其上的倒三角黑纹也一同凝固，如同一尊诡异的艺术品。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Up_Mucus_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_20|融蚀……这个东西已经被融蚀了。",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Phantom_Strange_Chp5_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_21|看够了没？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_22|抱歉……请快把衣服整理好吧。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_23|墨菲低着头，一边整理着衣服一边看向你。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_DeckIllusion"
        },
        BgTransition = 7,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Light"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "Serious2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_24|你刚刚一直提到“融蚀”，指的就是祂上面那个黑色的伤口吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "Serious2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_25|前任容器……也就是真正孕育了这个东西的那家伙，身上就全是这样的痕迹。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "Avoid"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_26|如果不是这“融蚀”让前任容器日渐虚弱，我也不会被……",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_27|墨菲声音渐渐低了下去。\n她咽下了未说完的话，抬手按着自己胸口，神色晦暗。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_28|图鲁，你也看到了那个神明的样子。\n距离祂生长完成，还有多久？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1159},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_29|相当康健，甚至只差最后一步了……\n只差用群星指引祂，指引祂撕开容器的身体。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        PlayEnterAnim = 1,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1199,4,avoid)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1159},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_30|余很惊讶，事到如今你居然还能自如行动。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "Avoid"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_31|是吗…居然已经到了这个时候……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "Avoid"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_32|我之所以还没失去意识，是因为<Blue:希莱斯特>帮了我。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_33|希莱斯特是？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_34|墨菲看向回转着奇异流光的天空。\n飞鸟在光幕下盘旋，光线扭曲而柔和，隔绝了外部可能的狂风暴雨。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_LightOpen_01"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_SeagullVO",
          "500"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "serious2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_35|蹈海者教团的笔记中，反复强调着<Blue:星辰正位>的重要性，降生仪式也必须在特定的时间进行，这就是那女人让我沉睡的原因。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "serious2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_36|船长推测，祂的成长也许与天体运转的规则有关。\n所以希莱斯特就以船为中心，制造出了这个与世隔绝的密境。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        Audio = {
          "Set_Avg_Mus_As_More"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "serious2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_37|我们猜对了，自从离开了真正的天空，祂就沉寂了下来。只要在船上躲过这一次的「星辰正位之时」，也许祂就会永远休眠下去。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_38|正是这位希莱斯特构筑出了这个密境，也是她控制着本该沉没的索纳尼尔号航行。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_39|听起来，她也是一名唤醒体。\n等等……她就是你口中“能帮忙找到拉蒙娜”的人？",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Set_Avg_Mus_As_More_And_More"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "serious2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_40|没错，这艘船上什么东西都逃不过她的眼睛。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "serious2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_41|她肯定带着船长躲开了蹈海者，只要我们找到她，找到你同伴的位置就是小菜一碟。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1159},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_42|换句话说，无论我们选择先帮你，还是先去救拉蒙娜，这位希莱斯特都是关键。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_43|图鲁不再说话，只歪过头看着你，等待你做决定。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_44|没错。不管是让这艘船回到陆地，阻止降神仪式，还是救出拉蒙娜，现在唯一的出路都是找到「希莱斯特」。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_23857_Content_45|墨菲，带路吧。\n去找船长，去找希莱斯特。",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
