      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_14|拉蒙娜环视一圈众人，除了早在校内就有所交集的图鲁和一同逃出来的希莱斯特外，还有两张陌生的面孔。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1118, 1159},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1199,2,serious2);SetRole(1201,4,serious)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_15|他们……就是墨菲和索纳尼尔号的船长，是守密人愿意用以身犯险保护的人。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_16|拉蒙娜·德克斯特，可以叫我拉蒙娜。\n寒暄的话就免了，我现在需要知道这艘船上发生的一切，简短，尽快。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1199, 1201}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_17|你们是谁，蹈海者为什么追捕你们，以及弥利亚姆所狂热执着的「仪式」……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_18|我、我是……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        RoleHide = {1118},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1201,4,serious)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_19|埃尔顿拦住了想要急急开口的墨菲，他知道这个孩子没法在重压之下全须全尾地描述全貌。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_20|我是埃尔顿，那是我的搭档希莱斯特，是这艘索纳尼尔号货轮唯二的船员。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_21|在我的青年时代，弥利亚姆帮助我唤醒了希莱斯特。作为回报，我们驾驶着索纳尼尔号，往返大陆与极地，为蹈海者教团运送物资。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_22|最后，我们因为帮助了墨菲逃离教团，而遭到了弥利亚姆的追捕。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_23|墨菲体内寄生着弥利亚姆意图召唤的伪神，我不知道那是否是真正的神明，但仪式举行，墨菲难逃一劫。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_24|墨菲也讲述了一些，她的身体，她与弥利亚姆，她在教团中的过去……",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_25|居然发生了这么多事……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_26|我会让希莱斯特全速向陆地返航，但是否能救出%player%，我无法对你做出保证。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_27|埃尔顿话音未落，所有人都因惯性而踉跄了两步——正如他所说，希莱斯特提高了船速。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Stop_Running",
          "400"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_WhistleSteam"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_28|咳、咳咳……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        RoleShake = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_29|船长！开这么快的船，对你的负担太大了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_30|……都是小事。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_31|与教团沆瀣一气，对你的苦难熟视无睹，我的罪孽已经够深重了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_32|我的……苦难？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Mofei_Comfort_Chp5_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_33|把你送到弥利亚姆手上的人，就是我。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "avoid"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_34|……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_35|你是我加入教团后运输过的，最宝贵的“货物”。利用那次完美的航行，我才得到了弥利亚姆的青睐。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "avoid"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_36|所以，所以在教团驻地的时候，你才毫不犹豫就答应了我的求助……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_37|足够靠近海岸时，我会让希莱斯特和你一起下船，你们离大海越远越好。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_38|好像在回应船长似的，希莱斯特摇动了手中的罗盘。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1199, 1201},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1170,3)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Carry_lamp",
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_LightOpen_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_39|你的意思是让希莱斯特和我一起走吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        RoleHide = {1170},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1201,4,serious)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_40|拉蒙娜先一步理解了船长的意思。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_41|我和守密人能联络交通工具，只要让希莱斯特把我们的汽车也变成密境……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_42|没错，这样就能为你争取到足够的时间。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_43|别开玩笑了！你以为凭你能拖住那些怪物吗？你连蹈海者都不是，你只是纯粹的人类啊！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        RoleShake = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_44|不，这件事交给我们。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_45|阻止异教仪式，从未知中守护世界……\n这是弥萨格大学每个人应尽的职责。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_46|你也疯了吗？你甚至都不知道我们是不是在撒谎骗你！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        RoleShake = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_47|守密人选择了对你付出信任，所以我也会相信你。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_48|船长踉跄着站稳身体，随即对墨菲伸出了手——\n他狠狠揉了一把墨菲的发顶。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleShake = {1201},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Caress",
          "300"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Sash"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_49|<Small:干嘛！别摸这么用力啊！头发都翘起来了！>",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1201},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_50|我希望你能从这一切中脱身，就当这是我最后的愿望。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "smlie"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_51|最坏的结果不就是葬身大海吗？我早就该与索纳尼尔号一起沉入海底了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_52|墨菲死死抓着船长的大衣下摆，倔强地不肯松手。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_53|拉蒙娜掌心握了又握，终于下定什么决心一般，将手中紧握的物件递给了墨菲——赫然是弥萨格大学的通讯器。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        Sequence = "ShowItem(9920)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Brooches_Shine"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_54|遗、遗产？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_55|这是一枚通讯器，虽然在密境中暂时失灵了，但校方肯定一直在试图联系我们。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_56|如果你真的能以肉眼看见融蚀，那么你一定有足够精神力使用它。\n在胸针亮起时集中注意力，你就能与对面的人取得联系。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_57|就算我和守密人没能回来找你们，我们的同僚也一定会帮助你。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_58|墨菲接过胸针，她看着上面精美的金属雕花，眼睛倏地一下通红。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1199,3,avoid)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "avoid"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_59|搞什么啊……作出一副慷慨赴死的样子。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_60|图鲁无意参与这场争执，他在门外静静感受着力量的涌动，准备向动力室动身。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1199, 1118},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Cabin"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1159,3,ShutEye)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_61|——等等！你要去哪里！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {0},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Run_Short_Leave"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_62|少女撞开了舱门，伸手拉住了一根触肢。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        Sequence = "SetRole(1199,4,serious2);SetRole(1159,2,surprised)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Be_Hit_Normal",
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_BigMetealDoor_Close"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "serious2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_63|你要去救%heorshe%吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1159},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_64|余之所为，不容外人置喙。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_65|我也要去。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_66|墨菲！别任性。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_67|你留在这里，我和图鲁去帮助守密人脱困。\n如果你落到弥利亚姆手里，我们的努力就都白费了。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "avoid"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_68|我知道。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Mofei_Decision_Chp5_124BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "avoid"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_69|可是……我做不到……\n我不想死，可是……如果、如果你们没能回来呢？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "avoid"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_70|我…不想……那样的事……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "serious2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_71|……我不能永远呆在密境里，如果想要真正脱身，我就、我就需要你们引荐。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_72|我不能直接找上学校，告诉校长，他们的学生为了帮我而牺牲。\n我需要你们的引荐，你们俩一个都不准死。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1159},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_73|余不会分神保护你。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_74|不用你保护，蹈海者的弱点在哪我清楚得很，我能照顾好自己。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1159,
          nil,
          "smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_75|好，若你执意如此。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_76|你这是什么眼神？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1159},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_77|余原本以为，你不值得他们付出如此牺牲。\n如今看来，余先入为主了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_78|你在说什么谜语？快走快走！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Normal_Short_Leave"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_79|墨菲一手推着图鲁，一手拉着拉蒙娜，很快消失在了船舱幽深的通道中。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleExit = {1199, 1159},
        ExitDirection = {"1199:1", "1159:1"}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_80|这孩子……罢了，如果这是她的选择的话。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24093_Content_81|希莱斯特，维持全速前进。",
        DialogType = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_WhistleSteam"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [24096] = {
    ID = 24096,
    CnID = "新主线剧情_关卡5_14_前",
    BaseSortID = 37,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 37,
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_1|失落之光",
        Chapter = "Chapter 5;Fallen Hope;Part 14",
        DialogType = 4,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_UI_AVG_Chapter_Pop"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_2|外海货轮·索纳尼尔号\n动力室",
        DialogType = 6
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_3|弥利亚姆双目微阖，好整以暇地伫立房间中央，宛若一尊圣像。哪怕是戈利亚粗鲁地将你扔到面前，她也只是轻轻抬眸瞥了你一眼。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_EngineRoom"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1168,3)",
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Cult_BeSuppress_Chp5_124BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Steam_PowerRoom"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_4|那眼神像毒蛇一般阴冷，透露着冷酷与残忍，却将你完全排除在外——你不是她的对手，也不是她食物链的一部分。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1168,3,EyeOpen)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_5|其他人呢？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1166},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_6|我不是说过吗？弥萨格的小老鼠擅长到处打洞，能留住这一个已经很不容易了。",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1166},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_7|不过其他人已经不重要了，不是吗？\n看起来，你已经为「神明」筑好圣坛了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_8|弥利亚姆缓缓转过身，蛇形虚影随着她的动作消散，让她沐浴在紫色辉光中，像极了正在受洗的信徒。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C00M_02WhiteOut"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_BigSnakeSteam_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_9|她身后的祭坛逐渐显出真容，动力室的昏暗灯光在她脸上投出了诡异的光影。祭坛中央，两具无法辨认原型的躯体静静躺着。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CrimeScene"
        },
        BgTransition = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_10|四肢扭曲着，那仅存的下半脸上的表情定格在了死亡瞬间，流淌的鲜血凝固成不可理解的符文，让空气中充斥着死亡的狂热。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Carcass_blood"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1166},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_11|你的「神明」，应该不会喜欢这么悚然的献祭吧？\n他们的使节在我们这里失踪，你准备怎么向提灯教会的人解释？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_12|戈利亚话音未落，颈间的疤痕猛烈收缩，攥紧了他的肌肉。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Twist_Muscle"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_13|将你的头颅用利莫里亚之血捏合，不是为了让你对我的神明口出狂言的，戈利亚。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1168},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_14|我伟大的、全能的主，祂能从我的祷言中得到力量，也能从我的献祭中识得我的虔诚。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_15|至于这两名提灯使节……失礼、愚蠢、无关紧要的渣滓，如果提灯对此有怨言，那么我也没有再与之同行的必要。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_16|弥利亚姆擦去指间的血污，终于转头看向你。她的身上萦绕着挥之不散的腐败气息，每靠近一寸，都是对你神智的折磨。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_EngineRoom"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1168,3,EyeOpen)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Sash"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_17|你把他们…怎么了？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_18|你和他们不一样。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Set_Avg_Mus_As_More"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_19|弥利亚姆没有回答你的问题，她看着你，眼睛像一片难以激起波澜的深潭，藏着踏过千年历史的尸骸。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_20|你拥有我成为唤醒体后，所见过的最与众不同的灵魂……比你那名同伴，更加璀璨，也更加黯淡。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_21|弥萨格大学的守密人……对能人，我向来抱有怜惜，我由衷希望，你能沐浴在吾主神光之下。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_22|聪颖之人，不应埋没于俗世。神之国土虽由血脉交织纵横而起，却也不吝于接纳外来血液。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_23|尔等希望救世界于黑秽，与<Blue:神国再临>并非两相冲突。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_24|为我等效力，加入神国的再临与复兴，极尽荣光……如此，你我皆能行走于极乐之土。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_25|如果你口中的再临与复兴 ，指的是以活人为祭品，以无辜者作为怪物的载体……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_26|抱歉，我做不到。\n你的仪式野蛮、残忍，我从中无法看见半分理性与文明的存在痕迹。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "threat"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_27|能作为神明重生前的载体，能作为神国再临的基石，理应感到荣耀！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_28|这次是我看走了眼，与愚人无需多费口舌……这场闹剧该结束了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_29|力量在阴影中爆发，影影绰绰的能量体凝结成巨大而坚实的蛇形。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_BigSnakeSteam_03"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Set_Avg_Mus_As_More_And_More"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_SeaMonster"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_30|巨蛇在空间中胡乱冲撞，蛇瞳最后锁定在了你身上——巨蛇缠绕在你的腰间，不费吹灰之力将你高高举起。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Joint_Twist_one",
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_BigSnakeSteam_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1025},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_31|住手，弥利亚姆。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "scared"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_32|什么人！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_33|熟悉无比的声音跃过历史的沟壑，离岸风般轻微，却掀起了心中的巨浪。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleShake = {1168},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1168,3,scared)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1159},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_34|弥利亚姆，余说，放开那个学生。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1159},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_35|这场闹剧，确实该结束了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_36|我不记得你的脸，但你的身上……有吾主存在的痕迹。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_37|弥利亚姆的脸上出现了一丝悲悯，她的眼眸如被荒诞骤雨摧残过的花朵，带着无尽的哀伤与痛苦。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1168,3,sad)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_38|冰凉湿滑的蛇鳞在你身上滑动，像绞杀猎物那样，巨蛇的身体在逐渐收紧。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cloth_Bring_Here"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_BigSnakeSteam_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_39|泪水在她脸上刻下了无法磨灭的痕迹，她的眼睛死死盯着图鲁，仿佛要看穿他的灵魂，看穿他们万年前的历史。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_40|<Blue:吾主>……我尊贵的<Blue:王>……\n您怎么会…有唤醒体的气息？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_41|是谁玷污了你的圣髑？是谁……玷污了我们的约定？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_42|你被巨蛇倒举半空，全身的血液都流向了大脑，眼前阵阵发黑。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Joint_Twist_one",
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_BigSnakeSteam_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_43|但恍惚之中，你还是瞥见了两个少女……她们被蹈海者包围了，为什么越来越靠近了？",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1118,2,serious);SetRole(1199,4)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_44|拉蒙娜！现在！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Sash"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_45|拉蒙娜深吸一口气，单腿微曲，借着在脚底汇聚的能量高高跳起——",
        DialogType = 3,
        RolePos = {3},
        ExitDirection = {1118},
        RoleShake = {"1118:1"},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Wind_Magic"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Something_Flash",
          "1500"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        RoleHide = {1},
        Sequence = "PlayVideo(Blade_Flash2.mp4)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pierce_Knife"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_47|细剑尖端破开蛇鳞形能量体，刺入巨蛇的七寸。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_48|诶诶！人要掉下来了！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        RoleShake = {1199},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_49|你也在巨蛇的咆哮中下落。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_BigSnakeSteam_03"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_50|——然后落入一个颤抖着的温暖怀抱。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thouch_Cloth"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_51|……你还好吗，%player%。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        ScreenEffect = {
          "awake",
          1,
          1
        },
        BgID = {
          "SScene_EngineRoom"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_52|拉蒙娜……我……",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"awake", 2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_53|抱歉，现在可不是个叙旧的好时候。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_54|拉蒙娜抱着你，头也不回地向远离弥利亚姆的方向冲去。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"speedLine", 1},
        AnimState = "avg_dialog_Amplification",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Something_Flash"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Run_Short"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_55|你回头看向弥利亚姆，蛇形再次凝结，而她的眼神也落在了你和拉蒙娜身上。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_BigSnakeSteam_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_56|那如同毒蛇盯上猎物般的眼神。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24096_Content_57|图鲁！不要和她纠缠，优先保护墨菲离开。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [24094] = {
    ID = 24094,
    CnID = "新主线剧情_关卡5_14_立绘剧情1",
    BaseSortID = 38,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 38,
        Content = "AvgDialog_24094_Content_1|伴随着弥利亚姆心智的动荡，蹈海者的集群也变得不再稳定，混乱无序悄然蔓延开来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_SeaMonster"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24094_Content_2|蹈海者们认出了“孕育”着神明的墨菲，近乎本能地在她靠近时纷纷退下，你们就这么小跑着穿过了怪物的包围。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [24095] = {
    ID = 24095,
    CnID = "新主线剧情_关卡5_14_战斗后1",
    BaseSortID = 39,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 39,
        Content = "AvgDialog_24095_Content_1|触手抽飞了围上来的蹈海者，图鲁行在队伍的最后，为你们扫着尾。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_EngineRoom"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1159,3)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_TentacleImpact"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Hard_Crisis_124BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_SeaMonster"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24095_Content_2|蹈海者们虽然低智，但事到如今，竟突然变得彷徨起来。\n集群中开始窃窃私语，那语言古老而晦涩，但图鲁却因此紧皱起了眉。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1159,
          nil,
          "angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24095_Content_3|这些蹈海者的猜忌，只会激怒弥利亚姆。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24095_Content_4|猜忌？你能听明白他们的话吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24095_Content_5|没有给图鲁解释的时间，弥利亚姆用行动将这古老的语言完完全全翻译了出来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1168,3,null)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24095_Content_6|匕首划过数名蹈海者的咽喉，她沐浴着喷溅的灰蓝色血液，穿过蹈海者的集群。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Splash_Blood"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_SharpBlade"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "null"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24095_Content_7|神王再世？不……\n祂只会在星辰正位之刻，经由仪式的牵引而降生于世！",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"redScreen", 2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24095_Content_8|只有我的仪式能让神王重生，让神国再临！只有我！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24095_Content_9|蹈海者……让这些亵渎了吾主之名的恶徒，见证神国血脉的威仪！",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [24091] = {
    ID = 24091,
    CnID = "新主线剧情_关卡5_14_战斗前1",
    BaseSortID = 40,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 40,
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24091_Content_1|蹈海者都不太怕痛的，我小时候经常踩到他们尾巴，没多少人有反应。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_EngineRoom"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Pre_Fight_118BPM"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24091_Content_2|这意味着蹈海者会源源不断地爬起来……我们没法保证每一次都能彻底杀死他们，这么打下去不是办法。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24091_Content_3|能战斗的只有我、图鲁和守密人三人，提升战斗力的空间也很有限……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24091_Content_4|话说到一半，拉蒙娜眼睛突然亮了一下。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1118,3,surprised)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24091_Content_5|图鲁和守密人……还没有链接，对吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24091_Content_6|确实没有。你的意思是让我和图鲁……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24091_Content_7|链接不仅是为了压制梳理唤醒体天然癫狂的灵知，更使调查员们能够引导狂气流动，从而引导唤醒体在战斗中的表现。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24091_Content_8|简单而言，链接多少能够加强唤醒体的战斗能力。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1159},
        Content = "AvgDialog_24091_Content_9|……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1159,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_24091_Content_10|仅此一次，回校后自行断开。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_24091_Content_11|你点点头，握紧手中银钥。凝神闭眼，沉入了黑暗。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
