      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_2|A.F.2@1年 初秋\n雷欧王国南部",
        DialogType = 6
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_3|你怎么可能没听过那个小镇！？",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_TownST_Night"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Town_Chp3_90BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Small_Snow"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_4|@2河的入海口，背靠@3山……那可是我们俩从小长大的地方！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1635},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_5|出海这些年，你不会遇上塞壬把脑子丢了吧？\n你说的那地方我知道，从洪积元年起就是一片沼泽了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_6|沼泽？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1635},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_7|是啊！据说那里原本有个矿井，大洪水时河流改道给冲垮了。前两年才有个爵爷买下了那块地，听说要建什么公园。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_8|可是…我的家……",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1635},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_9|一到离开孤儿之家的年纪你就出海了，虽然十几年没回来，但也不至于忘得这么干净吧？是不是生病了？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_10|孤儿之家……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_11|不，不会的。家人……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1635},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_12|不会真失忆了吧？我们可是在这条街上从小玩到大的。\n我还翻墙进孤儿之家给你送吃的，被修女追了三条街，全忘记了？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_13|……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1201},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_14|抱歉了伙计，可能是离船症犯了，最近老把梦当成真的。\n咱们这么多年没见，今天去老地方喝几杯？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1635},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_15|嘿嘿，老约翰去年捣鼓出了新口味的威士忌，味道一流！\n咱们今天也老样子，不醉不归！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1201},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_16|好……不醉不归。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_17|我不知道什么矿井，没去过什么孤儿之家，也不认识什么老地方的老约翰。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_18|我只知道，有关那个小镇的一切，都在远去。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_19|我的童年，我的父母，我的手足，都被人当做一场荒诞无稽的梦。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_20|就连我自己，都快要信以为真。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_21|可是，世界上哪有这么令人难以遗忘的梦？",
        DialogType = 6,
        Sequence = "SlowCaption"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_22|A.F.2@2年 深冬\n「蹈海者」教团，艾尔沃斯圣所",
        DialogType = 6,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Heathen_Theme_Chp4_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_23|这次的货物是日常补给以及……失败实验体十九具，由…教会提供。",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_IceLake"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Storm_Snow"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_24|供给方的信息被海水打湿看不清了，你们还要确认收取吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1107},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_25|确认…无误……",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_Sea_Monster_Fight_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_26|话音未落，身前佝偻着身体的接头人就忙不迭夺走了我手上的货单。\n他似乎并不在意我所说的话，只含糊不清地重复着“确认”。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_ClothesFriction_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_27|极地狂风吹下了接头者的兜帽，露出一颗丑陋至极的头颅。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Mask_Lifted"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_A_Gust_Of_Wind_Blows"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_28|眼球巨大而外凸，眼皮无法闭合，腮状组织连接着下巴与锁骨，活生生一副鱼类模样。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_29|强行压下心中的排斥与反胃感，我不得不向对方脱帽致意。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_IceLake"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1201,3,serious)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_30|如果没有其他事，今晚索纳尼尔号就会返航，下次补给会在约114天后抵达艾尔沃斯。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1107},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_31|@1…请您，祝您……一帆风顺……",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleExit = {1201},
        ExitDirection = {"1201:1"}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1639},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_32|……等等。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {0},
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_33|在将要回到船上时，略显陌生的女声叫住了我。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_34|那是一个身披黑纱成年女性，她穿得太轻薄了，甚至还赤着脚。\n在这星球的极寒之地艾尔沃斯，显得尤为格格不入。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1639,3);FadeDarkRole(1639,1)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Walking_Barefoot_01"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Cult_Peace_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1107},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_35|主祭，主祭……",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_Sea_Monster_Fight_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_36|接头的蹈海者猛地匍匐下去，身体撞在冷硬的黑岩石上，听得让人耳朵一酸。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Kowtow",
          "600"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Wax_Fall_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_37|出海十年，我凭着努力、运气和一些不光彩的活计，拥有了属于自己的船，成为了一名船长。但船长身份在这个隐秘的教团中，一文不值。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_38|即使我从未见过教团高层，但凭身边蹈海者的反应，我也知道来人的身份是何其高贵。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_39|于是我学着他的样子跪了下去，毫不犹豫。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_40|主祭大人。",
        DialogType = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1168,3,EyeOpen);FadeDarkRole(1168,1)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Fall_Down"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_41|你的身边，围绕着逸散之灵。\n船夫，你随身携带着亡者遗物？",
        DialogType = 1,
        Sequence = "FadeDarkRole(1168,2)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_42|亡者遗物……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_43|在主祭的提示下，我按开了怀表盖子，本该是表盘的部分被一团流动的银质所覆盖。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Sash"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Open_Lock_01",
          "400"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_44|没错，虽然其中蕴含的灵知很微弱……但毫无疑问，这是银芯。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_45|每份银芯中，都蕴藏着一份被遗忘的回忆……你，想要唤醒这份银芯吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_46|被遗忘的回忆……",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_47|我的过去被所有人否认，这份从<Yellow:曾为故乡的沼泽>中捞出的银质流体，可能是我最后的线索。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Corrosion"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Up_Mucus_03"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_BlackLiquid_room"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_48|我想……！请主祭不吝赐教。",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_IceLake"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1168,3,EyeOpen)",
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_49|完成下一次航运任务……如此，我会将唤醒银芯的方法交予你。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1168,
          nil,
          "EyeOpen"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_50|将我的<Yellow:希望>，带到我身边。",
        DialogType = 6,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Sequence = "SlowCaption"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_51|蹈海者主祭弥利亚姆派给了我新的任务。\n那次航程所运输的货物，变成了一个<Yellow:女婴>。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Cloudy"
        },
        BgTransition = 5,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Baby_Girl_Crying"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_OutDoor"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_52|在此之前，我只在“梦中”拥抱过年幼的弟妹。\n可惜那些幸福平静的回忆，也已经随着梦醒而消失。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_53|航程被西风拉长，在海上的最后一周，所有淡水都喂给了这个小不点。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_54|她不在意我打结的胡子，躺在我怀里笑。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_BabyGirl_Happily",
          "400"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_55|我将她交给了主祭。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_56|A.F.3@1年 夏至\n阿特拉斯洋",
        DialogType = 6,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1636},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_57|船长！所有罗盘都失灵了，方向舵也被海浪冲坏了！",
        DialogType = 2,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_ShipCornerLogo"
        },
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        Sequence = "SetRole(1201,3,serious)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Push"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Stop_Running",
          "300"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Pressure_Ver3_108BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Steam_PowerRoom"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1637},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_58|锅、锅炉进水了！我们失去动力了！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {0},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1636},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_59|你怎么搞的？！这下好了，没法转向，洋流在把我们往雷暴里推！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_60|都别吵！现在不是互相指责的时候！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_61|大副，你带着水手去放救生船。\n一艘船多坐点人，尽全力在被卷入涡流前划走。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1636},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_62|船长呢？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_63|……你们尽快撤离。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_64|@2年过去，我遵循主祭传授的秘法尝试了无数次，都没能让那份银芯焕发光彩。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Phantom_Peace_Chp5_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_65|长久的失败与现实的忙碌，已经让我几乎放弃了找回真相……找回故乡消失的真相。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_66|我把大多数船员都送上了救生船，然后怀着对过去的思念，与索纳尼尔号一起沉没。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_67|在不断的下沉中，风吹在了我的脸上。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_S_C01EX_8"
        },
        BgTransition = 5,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_A_Gust_Of_Wind_Blows"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Thunderstorm"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_68|风挤走了灌满肺腑的海水，吹走了腐蚀伤口的盐粒，于深海之中托举起了沉没的梦乡。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_LightOpen_01"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_69|然后，我看到了那名被清风与白鸟簇拥着的少女。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_SeagullVO",
          "400"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_LightOpen_03"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Light"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_70|“我的名字是希莱斯特，只要你还需要我，我就会存在于此。”",
        DialogType = 7,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_71|她是故土曾经存在的痕迹，是我幼时从老人口中听来的童话。\n她让我知道，我魂牵梦绕的过去是真实存在的。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_ConsciousSpacewhiteship"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1170,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_72|她的到来，终于证明了我不是一个没有出身的疯子。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_73|三个月前\n「蹈海者」教团，艾尔沃斯圣所",
        DialogType = 6,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1163},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_74|新雷欧分部提供的补给135箱，协会提供的祭品12具，合恩岛采购的食物120箱……确认无误。",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_IceLake"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Snow_Theme_Chp3_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Storm_Snow"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_75|咳、咳咳……",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleShake = {0},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_ClothesFriction_02"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1163},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_76|您是教团重要的一份子，请保重身体。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1163},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_77|对了，教团提前完成了新一批<Blue:稳定药剂>的炼制，已经交到我手上了。我先把您这个季度的份额交给——",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1201},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_78|嘘——留到我们约定的时间再交给我吧，还是老地方，<Yellow:布里尔珀特第三码头港口北二泊位>。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1201},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_79|我和希莱斯特会在那里等你。这次我们打算去陆间海载些特色食材，不如在港口见面时，你上船来尝尝我的手艺？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1163,
          nil,
          "shy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_80|荣、荣幸之至。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1163,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_81|听闻弥利亚姆大人已于今日将<Blue:神母大人>从沉睡中唤醒，以迎接下一个星辰正位之时，迎接吾主重生。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1163,
          nil,
          "smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_82|接下来的三个月，教团内外恐怕会非常忙碌。不过，我一定会赴您的约。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "Smlie"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_83|那就这么说定了，三个月后，不见不散。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_84|那个曾留着蹈海者之血，却已为魔像之身的少年腼腆地笑了笑——于我而言，凯刻斯确实是个孩子。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_85|很像那曾存在于我记忆中的手足，那也是个腼腆敏感的少年。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1163},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_86|威尔德海很快就要起风了，我建议您尽快返航，就不留您过夜了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1201},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_87|是的，我可不想顶着冰风暴离港。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_88|与凯刻斯告别，我与最后一具被搬出的“货物”擦肩而过，踩着廊桥向船上走去。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_89|那东西仍有呼吸，白布微弱地起伏着。伴随着漆黑黏液的滴落，什么东西也正逐渐消散着。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_WaterDrop",
          "700"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Up_Mucus_03"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_90|控制住好奇心，埃尔顿！\n不要去<Red:看>。\n不要去<Red:想>。\n<Big:不要去><RedBig:面对>。",
        DialogType = 7
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_91|希莱斯特，我回来了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Cabin"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Stand"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1170},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_92|……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_BaiChuan_Talk_Chp5_140BPM",
          "300"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1201},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_93|该返航了，回老地方去。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1170},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_94|……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1201},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_95|希莱斯特？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1170},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_96|好的，向亚格罗共和国……启航。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_97|不不不，目的地是<Blue:陆间海>，我们这次去取些当地食材。\n你怎么心不在焉的，船上出什么事了吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1170},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_98|……嗯，陆间海，启航。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_99|希莱斯特！看着我！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1638},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_100|凶什么凶！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        RoleHide = {1170, 1201},
        RoleShake = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Ops"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Mofei_Sad_Memory_100BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_101|希莱斯特的裙下爬出了一名少女，吓得我差点摔倒。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_102|她看起来……真眼熟，我发誓，我一定在什么地方见过她。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_103|希莱斯特，是你放任这粗鲁丫头上船的？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1638},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_104|都让你别叫了！成心想让那些蹈海者听见吗！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1638},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_105|而且谁是粗鲁丫头啊！本小姐的名字是墨菲，墨菲！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Emm"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_106|我想起来了，在记忆深处的一场仪式上，我见过她。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_107|「神母」被融蚀侵扰后，弥利亚姆为神明胚胎选择了新的「母体」，然后让「母体」陷入了长达二十余年的深眠。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1638},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SnowAltars"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1168,3);FadeDarkRole(1168,1)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_108|随着星辰正位渐进，主祭将她从沉睡中唤醒。这次所运的物资，便是为「神降仪式」而做的准备。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_109|在风暴中被我抱着喂水的那个婴儿，将被永远剥夺长大成人的资格。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "serious2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_110|我知道你们，你们不是蹈海者，只是运货的合作者……只要你能把我从这里送走，送得越远越好——这些财宝就都是你的。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Cabin"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_111|变戏法似的，她从包里掏出好几尊塑像——那些看一眼就让人感到头晕的拙劣木雕，深受蹈海者崇拜，但在外人眼中一文不值。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1170},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_112|墨菲……要和我们走。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1170},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_113|她…融蚀……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_114|……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_115|旧时代的牺牲品，野蛮习俗的受害者，我的祖辈远亲，“故乡”曾存的唯一证明。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_116|希莱斯特的“自我”被生前的经历封闭在了灵魂深处，我没有理由拒绝她向我提出的第一个请求。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_117|更何况……",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_118|起航吧，希莱斯特。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_119|你、你同意带我走了吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_120|既然希莱斯特希望如此，那我就会尽可能把你送得远远的。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_121|哇……这么溺爱她？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1201},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_122|没礼貌的小鬼。你要知道，我可是能随时改变主意，把你扔进冰海里的。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "serious2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_123|小气鬼……本小姐不问还不行了嘛……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_124|更何况……是我亲手将墨菲送上这条路的。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_125|一条融蚀遍布，通向毁灭与被遗忘的路。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34978_Content_126|我需要为此赎罪。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [34980] = {
    ID = 34980,
    CnID = "主线剧情_关卡6_5_前",
    BaseSortID = 14,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 14,
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_1|危机之月",
        Chapter = "Chapter 6;Fringe of Crisis;Part 5",
        DialogType = 4,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_UI_AVG_Chapter_Pop"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_2|埃尔顿的自白让你和拉蒙娜失去了声音，你哑然地看着拉蒙娜，从互相的眼中读出了相同的惊讶。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Pilothouse"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1118,3)",
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Mofei_Very_Sad_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Cabin"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_3|因融蚀而消失的故乡，世界上唯一能够证明其存在过的希莱斯特……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_4|因为亲手把墨菲送给了教团而愧疚着……这是你决心背叛蹈海者的原因吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_5|埃尔顿蹲在墨菲身边，为她捋开了被冷汗贴在前额的碎发。\n查看过她的状态后，他长叹了一口气，最后才起身重新看向你们。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1201,3,serious)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Caress",
          "750"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_6|如果我没有把她送给弥利亚姆，她就不会被那什么神明所寄生，也不会像现在这样躺在这里，生命垂危。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_7|是不是感觉像听了个笑话？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_8|人类不是最擅长书写历史吗，就连数千年前的运动会都能留下史料。怎么会有一个城镇会凭空消失，消失到一丝痕迹都找不到呢？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_9|把这些胡话忘了吧，就当做是我编的一个糟糕睡前故事。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_10|我们相信你。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_11|学生……",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Mofei_Confident_130BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_12|数百年来，弥萨格大学从未停止与融蚀现象的抗争，难以计数的调查员为此付出了生命。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_13|这之中不乏因融蚀而牺牲的人…世人对他们的记忆日渐淡薄，就连他们留下的书信，也难以避免出现融蚀痕。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_14|你们两个不害怕吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_15|怕……当然害怕。谁会不害怕自己彻底消失在世界上呢？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1201,4,serious)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_16|但，总要人鼓起勇气去面对这些，不是吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_17|如果连我们都退缩了，那我们在调查中牺牲的前辈，那些因融蚀而消失的人们……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_18|如果连我们都退缩了，那么他们的存在，就真的会变得毫无意义。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_19|为了我们的未来，也为了那些已经消失的存在，无论是怎么荒谬的猜想，我们都会当成事实去调查。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_20|呵……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "Smlie"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_21|看来这世界上，还是疯子占了大多数。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_22|呜————",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {
          "continueShake",
          1
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Boom",
          "800"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_WhistleSteam"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Hard_Crisis_130BPM",
          "1000"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_23|汽笛轰鸣在耳边炸开，所有人都被吓了一跳。\n埃尔顿率先反应过来扑向了控制台，试图手动拉停汽笛。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "continueShake",
          2
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Run_Mid"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Open_Lock_01",
          "800"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_24|糟了！汽笛的控制线路被那些珊瑚顶坏了！\n这么大动静，那些家伙很快就能反应过来驾驶室有人了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_25|拉蒙娜跑到驾驶室外，你也跟着跑出去，和她同时撑着船舷边缘向下看——",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Run_Two"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_26|游荡在下层甲板的蹈海者纷纷引颈抬头，一双双无神的鱼眼对上了你们的视线。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_Sea__MonsterFoot"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_SeaMonster"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_27|怎么样，蹈海者没注意到我们吧？",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Pilothouse"
        },
        BgTransition = 4,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_28|……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_29|船长，请专注驾驶吧。",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34980_Content_30|至于那些外部干扰……我会和守密人想办法。",
