          "AvgVertical"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1118,3,serious)",
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Soft_Thinking_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34968_Content_77|拉蒙娜向朵尔简单描述了船上发生的一切：有关降神仪式，有关蹈海者教团，有关墨菲，有关守密人的昏迷……",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34968_Content_78|需要弗朗西斯的实验成果，用于停止「神明」的发育……我明白了。\n把那女孩带回学校，我和温柯尔会把房间准备好。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          1,
          "AvgVertical"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34968_Content_79|温柯尔，我们还有两小时强化防犬措施。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          1,
          "AvgVertical"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1152,
          nil,
          "nervous"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34968_Content_80|实验还不稳定，还不稳定的……要做点什么，现在立刻马上！不然会失控的，要失控了！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          3,
          "AvgVertical"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Brooches_Shine"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34968_Content_81|艾瑞卡，把温柯尔拉下去。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          1,
          "AvgVertical"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34968_Content_82|……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1152}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34968_Content_83|艾瑞卡在资料库中找到了蹈海者的资料，不要抱太多希望，只有一点点。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          1,
          "AvgVertical"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34968_Content_84|大洪水发生时，新大陆曾传出目击报告。\n一批「貌丑，似鱼」的难民蹈海而过，消失在洪水中。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          1,
          "AvgVertical"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34968_Content_85|据传，他们自称为古代文明的传承者，身上流着「神明」赐予的血。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          1,
          "AvgVertical"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34968_Content_86|这些人出生时都是人类模样，是神血导致他们逐步异变成你们所看到的样子。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          1,
          "AvgVertical"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34968_Content_87|所以那个少年最后也会变成鱼人的模样……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1120}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34968_Content_88|你在说凯刻斯吗？如果想知道他的事，我可以告诉你。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1118,2,surprised)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34968_Content_89|拉蒙娜点点头，示意船长继续说下去。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1118,2,serious)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34968_Content_90|说起凯刻斯……那孩子也是魔像，用你们的话来说，是唤醒体。\n大概是链接着弥利亚姆的吧。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus",
          "800"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34968_Content_91|链接着弥利亚姆？！居然能以唤醒体之身再链接唤醒体，我闻所未闻……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        RoleShake = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Fog_Thinking_001_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1201},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34968_Content_92|哈，那女人可是当之无愧的怪物。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34968_Content_93|为了牵制我，教团会定期给我稳定心神的药物。上一任接头者完全失去理智后，凯刻斯就成了新的送药人。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34968_Content_94|这些年里我们每个季度都会见面……教他喝酒钓鱼，带他在夏天里辨认启明星，帮他拔掉冬天里干硬的鳞片……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1201},
        Content = "AvgDialog_34968_Content_95|哈哈……我还以为我们已经是朋友了。所以他传信说，可以最后一次给我药物时，我没有犹豫过。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34968_Content_96|但……也正是他将索纳尼尔号的行踪告诉了教团。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34968_Content_97|没有人教过他什么是正确的，他也没有找到自己在蹈海者之外的存在意义。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_34968_Content_98|如果在他看来，交出我能换取他在教团中的地位……我不会因此怨恨他。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_34968_Content_99|金属碰撞的声音突兀响起，拉蒙娜迅速摆出迎战姿态，护在船长和墨菲身前。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1201},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1118,3,serious)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_C_IronSheetFalling"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
