      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_32|没有发现骨折，但如果有血肿或其他感染……必须要回学校，让朵尔检查过后才能下诊断。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_33|当务之急还是要回到陆地，赶回学校。\n这对你、对墨菲而言都至关重要……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_34|墨菲一言不发地看着你，过了许久，才面无表情地摇了摇头。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "serious2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_35|%player%都成这个样子了，就别逞英雄了。\n你们走吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "serious2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_36|你们去坐救生船，划船也好漂流也好，有图鲁和拉蒙娜在，你们回到岸上根本不是什么难事。只要，只要……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "Null"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_37|<Small:只要没有我的拖累……>",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1159},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_38|在解决你体内的寄生物前，余不会离开。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1199,2,surprised)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_39|墨菲跺跺脚，指了指你和拉蒙娜，又指了指船长二人。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1199,2,Serious1)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Stop_Running"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_40|那他们怎么办？\n万一这个「神明」孵出来时非常大，大到把船都弄沉了怎么办？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        RoleShake = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_41|我们也不会走。",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Peace_Talk_Worry_120BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_42|喂！？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        RoleShake = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_43|在正式成为调查员的那一天，我们以自身存在之名，立下了为抵抗融蚀现象付出一切的誓言。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_44|我们已经做好了余生将与死亡和疯狂为伴的准备，即使等待在前方的是自己的死亡……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_45|就凭你们？别闹了，这是白白送命！\n这寄生物是怪物，是神明啊！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        RoleShake = {1199},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Stop_Running"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_46|如果这是生命中最后一个小时，我不会把时间浪费在祈祷上。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_47|我相信你也不会，对吗？不然，你为什么会费尽心思地逃离教团？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "avoid"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_48|我……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_49|这可不仅仅是为了你，要知道，我们可也等着下船呢。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_50|你体内的寄生物如今成为了融蚀灾厄的核心，意味着，你现在也是弥萨格调查员的职责之一。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_51|我答应过不会放弃你……我不会食言。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "avoid"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_52|……疯子，全都是疯子。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_53|墨菲抽了抽鼻子，吞掉了语气中的哭腔。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "serious2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_54|那、那现在我们怎么办？戈利亚他们占住了驾驶室，这样子我们可没法开船。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_55|希莱斯特，还有多久能靠岸？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        RoleHide = {1199, 1118}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1170},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_56|空载，东北风，速度15节。\n……卡达斯标准计时，60分钟。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_57|现在距离正位之时……还剩多久？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_58|来得及。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_59|希莱斯特怔怔地看着船长，似乎在确定着什么。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_60|她的形体已经缥缈于现实之外，船长本想伸手拍拍她的头，最后也只是在她头顶虚虚抚过。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Caress03"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_61|希莱斯特，加速。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_62|船长！你们要干什么！？你和希莱斯特的状态这么差，不能再用超能力开船了！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Hit_Jump_Shock"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35533_Content_63|唤醒体微微颔首，高举双手。手中罗盘无风自动，飘散出点点荧光。",
        DialogType = 3,
