      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35828_Content_3|说什么傻话，本小姐当然知道这里是陆地！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_emmm"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35828_Content_4|别太激动了。要是血压上升了，寄生物的活动也会变得更频繁。\n我猜你也不想半路就被开膛破肚吧。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35828_Content_5|守密人，别逗她了。\n放心吧，希莱斯特小姐为你争取了时间，我们会平安回到伦蒂尼恩的。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2},
        PlayEnterAnim = 1,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1199,4)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "avoid"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35828_Content_6|谢谢你，拉蒙娜……和你说话真的感觉很让人安心。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "serious2"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35828_Content_7|哼，怎么有的人不能向你学点好的。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35828_Content_8|墨菲回身看向码头，埃尔顿和希莱斯特还停在船边，远远看着她。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1201,2);SetRole(1170,4)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1199,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35828_Content_9|希莱斯特，船长？你们不一起吗？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35828_Content_10|埃尔顿‘哈哈’笑了两声，向着已经快要走出码头范围的众人挥了挥手。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Sash",
          "200"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "smlie"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35828_Content_11|小鬼头就不要管大人的事了，不管是我永远都找不到消失的家乡，还是希莱斯特会渐渐消失。如果这就是我们的结局，我会接受的。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1201},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35828_Content_12|和他们走吧，小鬼，别太想我们了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1199},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35828_Content_13|谁是小鬼啊！",
        DialogType = 2,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1201},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35828_Content_14|走吧，别再回头了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3},
        RoleHide = {1170}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1201},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35828_Content_15|去你想去的地方，做你想做的事。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {3}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35828_Content_16|总感觉哪里不对劲，是船长的态度太松弛了吗？",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Two_Guys_Slow"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35828_Content_17|为了找到消失的过往，他用半辈子的自由换来了希莱斯特。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35828_Content_18|他会这么轻松写意地放下吗？",
