      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35829_Content_4|祂散发着一股难以言喻的邪恶气息，让你和拉蒙娜不由对视了一眼——这个生物或许同样能号令深海，但祂绝非图鲁的力量本源。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35829_Content_5|这样的生物……只凭我们，真的有胜算吗？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          2,
          "AvgHorizontal"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35829_Content_6|我不知道。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35829_Content_7|你拉住了拉蒙娜的手，抽动僵硬疲惫的肌肉，对她露出一个难看的笑容。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thouch_Cloth"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35829_Content_8|对不起……我不知道这一次，我们还能不能回弥萨格。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35829_Content_9|拉蒙娜反握住了你，毫不犹豫。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thouch_Hand"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35829_Content_10|不要向我道歉，这不是你的错……不是我们任何人的错。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Egg_Crazy_2_118BPM_Coda"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35829_Content_11|相反的，我们反而是最后的，能够阻止这东西进入人类社会的屏障。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35829_Content_12|放心吧，伦蒂尼恩的空气污染那么严重，这家伙肯定找不着进城的路。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35829_Content_13|嘴里说着缓和紧张情绪的玩笑话，你和拉蒙娜最后一次交换目光，迈出坚定的一步——",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35829_Content_14|距离正位之时\n还剩：0分钟",
        DialogType = 6,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [35825] = {
    ID = 35825,
    CnID = "主线剧情_关卡6_14_战斗中1",
    BaseSortID = 45,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 45,
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35825_Content_1|真难缠，我希望我还是个孩子的时候，不像祂一样讨人厌。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35825_Content_2|能随地陷入沉睡的守密人，小时候一定特别乖巧。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35825_Content_3|拉蒙娜开玩笑似地回答。她挥剑的手已经止不住地颤抖，显然已经到了体能的临界值。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shake_sword"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35825_Content_4|但在「圣婴」的触腕再次挥下时，拉蒙娜依旧坚定地迎头而上，打偏了挥舞的触腕。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Knife_Block_Mucus",
          "500"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_TentacleImpact"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35825_Content_5|巨大的作用力冲击了右手，武器险些被打落。但她只是深呼吸了一口气，再次握紧了细剑。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cloth_Bring_Here"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35825_Content_6|一定要在靠岸前处理掉祂。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35825_Content_7|视线的角落，不同寻常的寒冷正在蔓延。当你意识到那是另一条触腕时，它已经滑动到了你们身后——",
        DialogType = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_Broadsword_Whoosh"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        DialogType = 3,
        DialogAnim = 0,
        Sequence = "PlayVideo(C06/Video_C06_10.mp4)",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_SFX_Ft_Hurt_Shield_Break_Player02",
          "1000"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1025},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35825_Content_9|这家伙折磨了我那么久……你们要偷偷处理掉祂？本小姐第一个不答应！",
        DialogType = 1,
        DialogAnim = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35825_Content_10|淡粉的屏障在抽击中破碎，轻灵的脚步声由远及近靠了过来。那声音甚至穿透了你闷闷的耳膜，前所未有的清晰。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {0}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1160},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35825_Content_11|要惩罚爱哭鬼，怎么能少得了祂伟大的「母亲」？",
        DialogType = 1,
        PlayEnterAnim = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Highheel"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35825_Content_12|墨菲！你的<Yellow:唤醒体塑造>……果然成功了！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1160},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35825_Content_13|哼……我之后再来找你的麻烦。现在，我要和这家伙做个了结！",
        DialogType = 1
      })
    })
  },
  [36276] = {
    ID = 36276,
    CnID = "主线剧情_关卡6_14_战斗中2",
    BaseSortID = 46,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 46,
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Scared"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_36276_Content_1|外层的部分……居然不是祂的本体吗？！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_36276_Content_2|这就是弥利亚姆所追求的东西。她所渴望的，能为她带来旧日复苏的「神明」……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1160,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_36276_Content_3|接下来不能大意，一点心都不能分！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1160,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_36276_Content_4|这个丑东西彻底醒了……我能感觉到。",
        DialogType = 2
      })
    })
  },
  [36277] = {
    ID = 36277,
    CnID = "主线剧情_关卡6_14_战斗中3",
    BaseSortID = 47,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 47,
        TalkRole = {
          1159,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_36277_Content_1|守密人！",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_36277_Content_2|图鲁！你终于来了。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1159,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_36277_Content_3|处理埃尔顿那边的敌人花了一些时间……<Small:等等，墨菲？>",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_36277_Content_4|图鲁的眼睛从「圣婴」身上滑过，最终落在了墨菲身上。拥有了唤醒体之身的她，裙摆上的触手正胡乱地凭空摇摆着。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1160,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1159,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_36277_Content_5|……祂的力量与余同源，意味着，祂也是余的子民。虽无法直接号令祂，但余之王权曾受利莫里亚万千臣民膜拜，绝非神明赝作可抵抗。",
        DialogType = 2,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1159,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_36277_Content_6|机会只此一次，利用余螺湮之主的权能……对祂降下天罚！",
        DialogType = 2
      })
    })
  },
  [35821] = {
    ID = 35821,
    CnID = "主线剧情_关卡6_14_后",
    BaseSortID = 48,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 48,
        Content = "AvgDialog_35821_Content_1|神明赝作在啼哭中崩溃、解体，灰蓝烟尘铺天盖地，簌簌落下。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_ShipBow"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Postpartum_Baby"
        },
        Audio = {
