        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Broken_plywood"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35821_Content_2|小心，不要吸入这尘埃。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35821_Content_3|话音未落，脚下的甲板开始了剧烈的震动。船身发出尖锐的嘎吱声，仿佛落水者发出的最后一声呼救。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_AvgDialogBg_doudong_vx",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_SplintShock"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_Meteal_Friction",
          "1000"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1160,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35821_Content_4|呀？！船、船是不是要沉了？！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        RoleShake = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Shit"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35821_Content_5|船身无序地摇摆，大家扶着船舷也无济于事。世界天崩地裂，而铺天盖地落下的粉尘，将你们的视线也完全遮蔽。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {
          "continueShake",
          1
        },
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        },
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Psychedelic_Mist",
          "600"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Ship_Rocking"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35821_Content_6|不再看得清月亮，不再能看见海面，也难以看清身边的同伴。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "continueShake",
          2
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35821_Content_7|在赝作齑粉吞没一切的前一秒，眼前的世界变得格外清明。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Dock"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_AVG_LightOpen_01",
          "400"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Big_Memory_Confusion"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Mofei_All_Clear_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Pier",
          "1200"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35821_Content_8|不绝于耳的海浪平静了下来，在晴朗的夜晚里，月色也格外温柔平静。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1160,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35821_Content_9|这里是……港口？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35821_Content_10|布里尔珀特镇的港口，我和守密人登船的地方。我们……回来了？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35821_Content_11|我们回来了",
        DialogType = 5,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35821_Content_12|守密人，图鲁，埃尔顿船长，希莱斯特，凯刻斯……以及墨菲。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35821_Content_13|还有威廉·德拉普尔。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1118, 1160},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Slow_Short"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1001,
          "UI_Story_D_Image_Face_Surprise2.png"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35821_Content_14|威、威廉前辈……",
        DialogType = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_OMG"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_35821_Content_15|你们离开学校时，可只是一个两人队伍。现在看来，我准备的车是载不下所有人了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35821_Content_16|威廉锐利的目光扫视了一圈港口，最终，他长长地叹了一口气，露出一个微笑。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1183,
          nil,
          "smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_35821_Content_17|欢迎回来，守密人。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35821_Content_18|威廉迎了上来，你扯扯嘴角想对他说些什么，但刹那间，你的眼神不受控制地迷离了起来。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_35821_Content_19|所有疲惫、困惑、痛苦都消弭于虚空，同伴向你着急跑来的身影成了记忆中最后一个画幅，紧随其后的，是一阵黑暗的宁静……",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
  [19170] = {
    ID = 19170,
    CnID = "主线剧情_关卡6_15",
    BaseSortID = 49,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 49,
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_1|未知的星轨",
        Chapter = "Chapter 6;Trajectory Unknown;Part 15",
        DialogType = 4,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_UI_AVG_Chapter_Pop"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_2|三日后·弥萨格大学",
        DialogType = 6
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_3|你今天倒是起得很早，怎么一脸忧心忡忡的？你露出这个表情时，看起来很像威廉。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_StudentDorm"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Peace_Talk_Ver1_118BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Bedroom"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_4|我还在想海上发生的那些事……那些蹈海者，那个变成尘埃后消失海上的「伪神」……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1120,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_5|以「伪神」消散之地为原点，附近的密境世界变得天翻地覆。这是过去消灭「灾厄」后，从未出现过的情况。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_6|天翻地覆？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_7|环境更危险，异变体更强，银芯科技乃至唤醒体的能力在那里都处处受限……先遣队给这种情况起了个名字，叫<Yellow:「融灾」>。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_8|好消息是，融灾目前是局域性的；坏消息是，我们目前无法控制融灾的出现与转移，它就像油里的鲶鱼一样滑。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_9|总之，那片海域已经被审查会划定为了融灾禁区。我想，它会永远从雷欧王国本就贫瘠的物产地图上消失。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_10|至于那些蹈海者的去向……等我们赶到海上时，索纳尼尔号已经完全沉没了，我们一无所获。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_11|戈利亚的下落也？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_12|不清楚，可能变成真正的鱼了，可能淹死了，可能坐救生艇跑了。顺便一提，我们在尝试打捞弥利亚姆的银芯，不过暂时还没有收获。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1120,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_13|不聊这些了，我是来向你解读检查报告的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_14|朵尔把一叠纸质报告放在了书桌上，示意你自己去翻阅。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Paper"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_15|但经过整整三天的身体检查，你有些身心俱疲，只想迫切得到一个答案。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_16|有什么坏消息就说吧，我能承受得住。",
        DialogType = 2,
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_17|你的身体……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_18|非常健康，除了贫血外，没有任何异常。",
        DialogType = 1,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_PeaceTalk_Comfort_118BPM",
          "800"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_19|朵尔顿了顿，继续说。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_20|至于贫血的原因……初步推测，是在这三天的检查中，抽取了过多血液。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_21|非常健康……怎么会？我明明……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_22|根据拉蒙娜和其他人的报告，你在船上受的伤，足够一个普通人死上九次了。就算是猫的怪物，也经不起这种折腾。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1120,
          nil,
          "thinking"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_23|我几乎快要开始怀疑，你是不是有巨怪的血统了。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_24|你的心脏几乎提到了嗓子眼，紧张感让你浑身的肌肉都紧绷着。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1120,
          nil,
          "smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_25|开玩笑的，这个世界上不存在巨怪，至少人类已知的世界范围内不存在。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1120},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_26|你的禁足令解除了，如果你想和索纳尼尔号上经历生死的伙伴们聊聊天，他们正在在学校中庭为船长送行。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_27|送行？！",
        DialogType = 2,
        AnimState = "UI_Story_Panel_Group_Dialog_doudong_vx",
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_OMG"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1120,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_28|是的，虽然弥萨格大学并不缺一席落脚之地，但埃尔顿本人显然不愿意一直停留在原地。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_29|你连忙抓起外套翻身下床，向朵尔点头示意。但在你即将离开宿舍房间时，朵尔叫住了你。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Run_Mid",
          "800"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Show_Something"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1120,
          nil,
          "shy"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_30|……你能全须全尾地回来，我很开心。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1120,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_31|好了，快去吧。他们在等你。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_32|守密人，我们在这儿。",
        DialogType = 1,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolDaytime"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Run_Mid"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Campus_Corner"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_33|所有人都站在校园中庭，三日不见，大家的状态看起来都恢复了不少。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_34|——除了希莱斯特。她仍保持着半透明的姿态，缥缈得像能被一阵风吹散的美好幻影。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1170,3)",
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Peace_Talk_Ver2_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_35|在击败圣婴，索纳尼尔号迎来解体的那一刻，熟悉的白风包围了你们。希莱斯特发动了一次远距离传送，将所有人都送回了陆地。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_36|作为代价，埃尔顿船长的精神严重受损。即使经过弥萨格大学的治疗，他和希莱斯特间的链接也难以再次修复。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1201},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_37|那个研究员小姑娘终于放你出来了，我还以为我没法在离开前再见你一面了，正在发愁呢。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_38|船长……",
        DialogType = 2,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1201},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_39|长话短说。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_40|船长走到你身边，向着身体透明到只剩一丝轮廓的希莱斯特招了招手。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Footstep_Slow_Short"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_41|唤醒体和你一样不明所以，但也安静地飘动到了你身边——",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1170,4);SetRole(1201,2,serious)",
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_42|学生，伸手。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_43|（伸手）",
        DialogType = 5
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_44|埃尔顿执起她透明的手，放在了你摊开的手上。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Lightly_Clothes_Rub_01"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_Mus_Baichuan_Bye_118BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_45|不管你用什么办法，让她留下来。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_46|她生前已经经受过足够的苦难，没必要再让她为我的愿望而活。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1170},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_47|……这也是，你的愿望吗?",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_48|船长因唤醒体的话而怔住了，但不过几秒，他就开朗地放声笑了出来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1201,2,surprised)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1201,
          nil,
          "smlie"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_49|希莱斯特接下来的“航程”，就拜托你了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_50|……好。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_51|与希莱斯特链接上的瞬间，脆弱而磅礴的意识冲刷着你的大脑。\n明明站在陆地上，胸腔却仍传来阵阵溺水般的窒息。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ScreenEffect = {
          "keyWorkEffect",
          1
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Brooches_Launch_CG"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Floodlight"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_52|希莱斯特的形体不再虚幻缥缈，她切切实实地存在于这个世界上。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {
          "keyWorkEffect",
          2
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1170,3)",
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_53|埃尔顿挥挥手最后一次告别，你们目送着他踏上了寻找失落故乡的新旅途。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_54|说起来，凯刻斯呢？他和船长关系应该是最好的，怎么不来送送他？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_55|拉蒙娜指了指不远处的景观树，躲在树荫中的少年正是凯刻斯。他的目光紧紧追随着启动的汽车，直到它彻底消失在弥萨格的迷雾密境里。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1163,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_56|凯刻斯的心情……一直不太好。在船上的这段时间，他的生活也发生了翻天覆地的变化。让他一个人静静吧。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_57|或许，你想去见见墨菲吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_58|弥萨格大学\n唤醒体宿舍外",
        DialogType = 6,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_59|墨菲，是我。",
        DialogType = 2,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SchoolDaytime"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_OldCall_Door"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1160,
          nil,
          "idle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_60|进来吧。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {0},
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Mofei_Ending_110BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_61|后勤处为墨菲准备了最豪华的宿舍，你推门进来时，墨菲正坐在柔软的羊毛床垫上喝茶，茶盘毫不讲究地被放在了床上。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_StudentDorm"
        },
        BgTransition = 1,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1160,3)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cup_Lid",
          "500"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Wood_Door_Pure"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Bedroom"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_62|你……感觉怎么样？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1160,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_63|什么怎么样？你是在说弥萨格大学寡淡的甜点？在说我们终于摆脱了蹈海者？还是说我变成了唤醒体这件事？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_64|我、我……抱歉，我没有经过你的同意就……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1160,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_65|就把我变成了唤醒体，是吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_66|对不起，我知道这可能并不是你想要得到的结果……但我只是……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_67|我只是……不想再……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1160,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_68|……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1160,
          nil,
          "idle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_69|我感觉很解脱。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1160,
          nil,
          "idle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_70|心脏不再跳动的感觉，很陌生，很恐怖。但……",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1160,
          nil,
          "smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_71|我确实是感觉到了前所未有的解脱。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_72|墨菲表情惬意，不似作假。依你对她的了解，她也的确不是擅长说谎的人。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_73|真的吗？刚刚和船长道别时你没来，我还以为……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1160,
          nil,
          "surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_74|以为什么？以为我蒙在被子里偷偷掉眼泪？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1160,
          nil,
          "idle"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_75|有什么好伤心的，他没告诉你吗？他说每年银霜夜都会来看我和凯刻斯那小子的。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1160,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_76|而且船长还拉我喝了一早的茶，说了半天什么希望我自由，希望我不要受唤醒体的身份束缚……哼，这还要他来告诉本小姐？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1160,
          nil,
          "relax"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_77|对了，要不要尝尝茶点？厨房今天的布朗尼味道还不错——",
        DialogType = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Cup_Lid"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_78|刚刚是谁在说大学的甜点寡淡了……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_79|叉子已经递到了嘴边，你咬下了一口蛋糕。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Knife_ForkCollision"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_80|巧克力的酸、甜、苦同时在嘴里化开，坚果的油脂又很巧妙地将多种味觉融合在了一起，让布朗尼在你的味蕾上跳起了舞。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_19170_Content_81|你和墨菲坐在床边，有一搭没一搭地说着话，将五人份的下午茶甜品分食殆尽。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_All_Avg_Sound",
          "Resume_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice",
          "1"
        }
      })
    })
  },
