      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "7",
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_43805_Content_8|昨天的……仪式，那不是梦，对吧？",
        DialogType = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1125,3,Sharp)"
      }),
      readonly({
        ChatID = "8",
        TalkRole = {
          1125,
          nil,
          "Sharp"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_43805_Content_9|为保持伦蒂尼恩绅士的风度，我本不该随意指摘他人的生活作风，但这些原始人的仪式，还是太过火了。",
