      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_45430_Content_36|所以，对你而言，她还不曾完全消失。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_45430_Content_37|若再过上百年千年，亚兰人多半连母树的存在都会遗忘。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_45430_Content_38|而亚兰的仪式，或许能捕捉到母树残留的那丝微弱的存在。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "Surprised"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_45430_Content_39|就像唤醒仪式？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1183},
        Content = "AvgDialog_45430_Content_40|是的，唤醒仪式本来就是借用调查员的精神力令银芯中的精神存在重现于世，母树的「重生」应该与之类似。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1118},
        Content = "AvgDialog_45430_Content_41|%player%，你看到的母树是什么样的？",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_45430_Content_42|嗯……怎么说呢，像是生长在贫瘠土壤上的光秃秃树干……跟丰穰这个词毫不相干。",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1001},
        Content = "AvgDialog_45430_Content_43|就像是……母树临终的形态。",
