  [45444] = {
    ID = 45444,
    CnID = "主线剧情_关卡7_18_剧情节点3",
    BaseSortID = 44,
    data_list = readonly({
      readonly({
        BaseSortID = 44,
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_1|母树之下，无力的艾尔瓦流泪跪伏。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C07_017"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Kneel_Down_On_The_Beach"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Tideng_Hard_Crisis_90BPM"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Howling_like_crazy"
        },
        AudioManageEvent = {
          "Stop_Mus",
          "Pause_Ingame_Fight_SFXandVoice"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1131,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_2|女王大人……我……对不起……亚兰……",
        DialogType = 2
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Sad1"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_3|不必担心。你的心声，我已经听见了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {
          2,
          "AvgHorizontal"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_4|因为，没有人比我更懂不被听见的痛苦。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_5|我跟随亚兰的队伍，迁徙了数百年。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_DesertRiverDay"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_The_Remember"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Aierwa_Talk_1_D_122BPM"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_6|没有人看得见我，没有人听得见我。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_7|我曾是晚宴中最美的舞姬，也曾是亚兰族最受拥戴的女王。\n但此刻，我的舞姿无人可见，我的律令无人可闻。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_SScene_TentFireDay"
        },
        BgTransition = 4
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_8|融蚀之内，是另一个世界。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_9|漆黑、死寂、绝望。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_10|只在狭小的缝隙之间，可以窥视另一个世界外的光明。",
        DialogType = 3,
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Aierwa_Comeon_122BPM",
          "800"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_11|就在那瞬息的罅隙中，我跟着亚兰族的队伍四处流亡迁徙。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_12|我见证了艾尔瓦在群龙无首时主动扛下大任的坚决。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_DesertTown"
        },
        Sequence = "SetRole(1131,3)"
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_13|我见证了艾尔瓦废止篝火仪式时的决意，培养的继承人夭折时的痛苦，重启篝火仪式时的无奈。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_SD_S_O06_4"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_14|见证了艾尔瓦率队寻找饮水物资的奔忙，也见证了她为对抗努比亚主动出战的艰辛。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Sunny"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_15|艾尔瓦，你已经做得很好了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        ScreenEffect = {"retro", 2},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C07_017"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Recover_Remember"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Howling_like_crazy"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_16|即使是我留在这里，也不能做得比你更好。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_17|所以，接下来的事情，就交给我吧。",
        DialogType = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Caress03"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_18|泰旖丝抚摸艾尔瓦的头颅，然后转身迎向万千失神的亚兰士卒。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_GetUp"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_19|我是大地的母亲、欲之质体的化身。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_20|我名为泰旖丝，圣名<Yellow:提芙蕾·耶索德>。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_21|我以亚兰唯一的女王之名，讨伐你这吞噬生灵、传播死亡的，虚伪的丰穰母树。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_22|我将自你体内，解救亚兰的子民，为他们求取存续之路。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_23|亚兰的子民啊，若你们尚能听见我的声音，就请醒来吧！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleShake = {0},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_YANGMA_EYS"
        },
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_24|世界陷入瞬息的静止。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_25|然而，不过数秒之后，亚兰的队伍又如同不知疲倦不知回头的旅鼠般坠入圣河。",
        DialogType = 3,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Amb_Howling_like_crazy"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1686},
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_26|没用的，你和丰穰母树同根同源，都已经被那位大人的意志侵染，以你现在的力量，根本无法撼动被侵蚀的母树意志。",
        DialogType = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1134,3,serious)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_27|我当然知道。",
        DialogType = 1,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Stop_Avg_Mus"
        },
        Audio = {
          "Play_A_MUS_Aierwa_ComeonBaby_122BPM",
          "800"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_28|若非如此，又何须这数百年跋涉？",
        DialogType = 1,
        AudioAmbient = {
          "Stop_Avg_Amb_Long_Fideout"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_29|我以圣河隐藏母树之躯，以肉身承受融蚀隐匿母树之种，不正是为了等待此刻吗？",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_30|决战之刻已至！",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_31|我以欲之质体提芙蕾·耶索德的名义，向<Yellow:塔薇>提出请求，请回应我们千年前的约定——",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_32|当异乡的使者降临，以你的化身为引，为我暂时驱散笼罩勒姆瓦希的阴翳。",
        DialogType = 1
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_33|天空中响起嘹亮的悲鸣。",
        DialogType = 6,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Bird_Howling_Bird"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_34|泰旖丝打开棺椁，其中翻身而出的，竟是烧得满面通红的拉蒙娜。",
        DialogType = 3,
        BgID = {
          "SScene_CG_C07_017"
        },
        BgTransition = 2,
        Sequence = "SetRole(1118,3,serious)",
        AudioTalk = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Turn_Jump",
          "1200"
        },
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Slate_Mobile_A"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "serious"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_35|终于……需要我了吗……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4},
        Sequence = "SetRole(1134,2,smile)"
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_36|藏在这里面跟来，也真亏你想得出来，小姑娘。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_37|也还好你跟来了，不然回去接你的每分钟，都要消耗不知道多少生命。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1118,
          nil,
          "sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_45444_Content_38|脑子里的那个声音……她告诉我……我一定要坚持……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
