      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_45417_Content_39|即便长夜难明，即便光芒微弱，他们永不言弃的精神，才真正能改变那个被注定的未来。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_45417_Content_40|现在，我已经有了新的答案了。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1134,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_45417_Content_41|所以，你也要大方一点，把你的传承者借给我哦？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_45417_Content_42|我愿意信任眼前这个人，将火种托付予%heorshe%。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_45417_Content_43|这枚种子终有一天会生根发芽，长出参天大树，",
