      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60107_Content_5|日暮时分，氤氲的光线越过创立人的雕像，照在萝坦的脸上。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1124,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60107_Content_6|难得的天气。奥吉尔，来陪我练练剑吧。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1123,
          nil,
          "Sad"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60107_Content_7|萝坦女士，我们的巡逻还没有结束呢。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1124,
          nil,
          "Angry"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60107_Content_8|你这家伙什么都好，就是太认真了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1124},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60107_Content_9|这么难得的闲暇时间，不找点娱乐活动，也太无趣了。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60107_Content_10|萝坦靠在长椅上，仰头活动着自己的关节。",
        DialogType = 3
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1124,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60107_Content_11|自从钥冢仪式之后，弥萨格就接连遇到麻烦事。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1124},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60107_Content_12|能遇见有趣的对手是件好事，不过，能有些休息的时间，倒也不赖。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60107_Content_13|奥吉尔放下长枪，站在一旁，眉头微微皱了起来。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Knife_Friction"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1123},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60107_Content_14|说起这个……萝坦女士，您有没有觉得，最近我们遇到的事情太频繁了一点？",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1123},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60107_Content_15|从济贫院、蜡像馆，到拉伊、索纳尼尔号，再到勒姆瓦希的圣河沙丘……",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1123},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60107_Content_16|自从主君继任守密人以后，这些事情就凑到了一块。这怎么看都不像是巧合。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1124,
          nil,
          "ShutEye"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60107_Content_17|朵尔也和我聊起过这件事，不过，我不太感兴趣。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1124},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60107_Content_18|动脑子的事情，就留给朵尔他们吧。我们的任务，不是这个。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60107_Content_19|萝坦熟练地把手搭在矗立身旁的巨剑上。",
        DialogType = 3,
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Thouch_Hand"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {1124},
        Content = "AvgDialog_60107_Content_20|守密人带着弥萨格走在正确的道路上，我要做的，只是在%heorshe%需要的时候，带着我的剑出现在%heorshe%面前。",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {2}
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1123,
          nil,
          "Smile"
        },
        Content = "AvgDialog_60107_Content_21|说的没错，萝坦女士！我相信，主君一定会带着我们找到战胜融蚀的办法的，弥萨格的平静，就是最好的证明！",
        DialogType = 1,
        RolePos = {4}
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_60107_Content_22|奥吉尔望了望身后悠然的校园，满怀期待地重新提起长枪。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        ShortAudioEffect = {
          "Play_A_SFX_Pick_Uppike"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        TalkRole = {
          1123,
          nil,
          "Smile2"
