      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_62208_Content_29|拉蒙娜疑惑地看着你。",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleExit = {1},
        BgID = {
          "CGDynamic_C01_012"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_62208_Content_30|在这喜悦的时刻，她看到了从未在你脸上看到过的表情——",
        DialogType = 3,
        RoleHide = {1},
        BgID = {
          "SScene_Black"
        }
      }),
      readonly({
        Content = "AvgDialog_62208_Content_31|那是一个人在面对宏伟宇宙的崩塌时……",
